	quest.000390A9EC30E123.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFFire Upgrade Orb&r is an upgrade material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Applied at the &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r, it gives &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFFire Spell Power&r." "Craft it from 1 &#00D9FFEmpty Upgrade Orb&r and 8 &#00D9FFFire Runes&r. An applicable item can normally receive up to 3 upgrades."]
	quest.000390A9EC30E123.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fire Upgrade Orb"
	quest.0005C3D91F8DD316.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFTeleporter Portal&r is a multi-block structure that allows the player to teleport between &#00D9FFTeleporters&r on the same frequency."]
	quest.0005C3D91F8DD316.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Teleporter and 9x Teleporter Frame"
	quest.0008532839A6DBC3.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFNeptune's Bounty&r comes from &#FFA500Aquaculture&r 2. It is a rare fishing loot item that holds ocean-themed rewards, and you can find it while fishing."]
	quest.0008532839A6DBC3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunes Bounty"
	quest.000D896537822FF3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFFluidic Plenisher&r lets you fill empty spaces with any fluid you provide. Feed it a fluid and it will replace open spaces beneath it, allowing you to create entire lakes, reservoirs, or even seas of virtually any fluid. Connect it to your &#00D9FFMechanical Pipe&r network and let it do the work for you. Perfect for large-scale fluid projects - or simply making an absolutely massive pool of something that probably shouldn't be swimming in."]
	quest.000D896537822FF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluidic Plenisher"
	quest.000D896537822FF3.title: "Fluidic Plenisher"
	quest.001240F3EF282471.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMusic Disc Far&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.001240F3EF282471.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Far"
	quest.0017A61AF0AB3F9E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHeadless Ratman&r steals the heads of mobs killed near it. It, then, provides you with a damage bonus against that mob type."]
	quest.0017A61AF0AB3F9E.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Headless"
	quest.001CED1FF4A8E30D.quest_desc: ["Find &#00D9FFthe Ancient Factory&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r, a forgotten structure deep underground." "It holds dangerous machinery, valuable treasure and powerful enemies, so prepare before exploring."]
	quest.001CED1FF4A8E30D.title: "Ancient Factory"
	quest.002DBF2D8ACD2762.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Resonarium Hoe&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFDiamond Hoe&r, &#00D9FFSturdy Sheets&r, a &#00D9FFResonarium Plate&r and a &#00D9FFResonarium Upgrade Template&r." "The template can be found in &#00D9FFAncient Cities&r, &#00D9FFTrial Chambers and Strongholds&r."]
	quest.002DBF2D8ACD2762.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Hoe"
	quest.00329231C5A44EB8.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPlagued Coat&r is the chestpiece of the &#00D9FFPlagued Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+8&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFNature Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Craft it from 8 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFNature Rune&r, or combine &#00D9FFWizard Robes&r, a &#00D9FFNature Rune and Arcane Essence&r."]
	quest.00329231C5A44EB8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plagued Chestplate"
	quest.004DACCD4C920845.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFHv Diesel Generator&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.004DACCD4C920845.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hv Diesel Generator"
	quest.004DACCD4C920845.title: "Fast and Furious 2: Revenge"
	quest.0051D432EBB727E4.quest_desc: ["Smithing templates in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r are used at the smithing table to upgrade &#00D9FFMalarite&r-tier weapons." "You can find them as structure loot in the dimension."]
	quest.0051D432EBB727E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pungency Fruit Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.0051D432EBB727E4.title: "Malarite Smithing Template"
	quest.0060AB9E6885BAC9.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFHydra&r meat is overpowered, so save it for when you are hungry."]
	quest.0060AB9E6885BAC9.quest_subtitle: "Eat Hydra meat on an empty food bar"
	quest.0062DB7D59ABA882.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFBlack Steel Ingots&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r are used to craft strong weapons, armor and equipment." "You can find them in loot from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r structures and from defeated enemies."]
	quest.0062DB7D59ABA882.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Steel Ingot"
	quest.0062DB7D59ABA882.title: "Black Steel Ingot"
	quest.0064749A347982CC.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPriest Mask&r is the headpiece of the &#00D9FFPriest Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFHoly Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Make it with the upgrade recipe using 1 &#00D9FFHoly Rune&r, 1 &#00D9FFWizard Helmet&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r."]
	quest.0064749A347982CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Priest Helmet"
	quest.006A684E67B965F5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFTuna&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.006A684E67B965F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tuna"
	quest.0071D679CDB2BD57.quest_desc: ["This unit provides radiation shielding to any type of &#00D9FFMekaSuit Armor&r that it is added to."]
	quest.0071D679CDB2BD57.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Module Radiation Shielding Unit"
	quest.007BAD376131FFB9.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFluix Glass Cable&r carries channels and power between ME devices. Make it from &#00D9FFQuartz Fiber and Fluix&r, then use it to connect your network."]
	quest.007BAD376131FFB9.title: "Connect with Fluix Glass Cable"
	quest.0084C7098005FAA9.quest_desc: ["Made with &#00D9FFRedstone and Diesel&r, used for the &#00D9FFSpeed Upgrade&r."]
	quest.0084C7098005FAA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lubricant Bucket"
	quest.0084C7098005FAA9.title: "Lubricant"
	quest.0085099CD93A5E68.quest_desc: ["Once you have a stockpile of this &#00D9FFSuper Powered Coal&r, you can start diverting away from you bronze machines. They're slow and such a bright orange; blinding to the eyes. &#00D9FFMaking Coal Coke&r is just heating &#00D9FFCoal&r with the absence of oxygen. It doesn't allow it to burn and thus puts it through a destructive distillation process. Once you have it though, you'll be able to start working on &#00D9FFSteel&r and steel machines speeding up processing times at the cost of more steam being used. You'll be aiming for the creation of a &#00D9FFQuarry&r soon so that it can dig for you. Imagine never needing to go mining for ores ever again!"]
	quest.0085099CD93A5E68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coke Dust and Coke"
	quest.0085099CD93A5E68.title: "Coke"
	quest.0098FA2F00CE1EF7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0098FA2F00CE1EF7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.009DA7C16D6DDDF3.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFElectric Quarry&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.009DA7C16D6DDDF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Quarry"
	quest.009DA7C16D6DDDF3.title: "Resource Goes BRRR!!!"
	quest.00AFF61D1187C309.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAnvil Upgrade&r adds full anvil functions to your backpack. You can repair, rename and combine items without placing an anvil." "It is handy for quick repairs on the road."]
	quest.00AFF61D1187C309.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Anvil Upgrade"
	quest.00C0D036F47A20A3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFTurbine Blade&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.00C0D036F47A20A3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Turbine Blade"
	quest.00C57AB8BDBF52E5.quest_desc: ["Some quests reward a T2 &#00D9FFCodex&r (&#00D9FFLost Codex Entry&r). T2 &#00D9FFCodexes&r do not spawn naturally."]
	quest.00C57AB8BDBF52E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Aoe, Glyph Accelerate, Glyph Dampen and 25 more items"
	quest.00C57AB8BDBF52E5.title: "Tier 2 Glyphs"
	quest.00CFCAE410123AA1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPapaya Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.00CFCAE410123AA1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Papaya Sapling"
	quest.00D7D74B97BC4DD9.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFThermo Generator Hardened&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.00D7D74B97BC4DD9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermo Generator Hardened"
	quest.00DCC771ACBC2D58.quest_desc: ["Bring Toasts into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.00DCC771ACBC2D58.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Toasts"
	quest.00DE07E191E60A98.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.00DE07E191E60A98.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.00DED7DF03993708.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRed Banana Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.00DED7DF03993708.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Red Banana Sapling"
	quest.00E86A9C26ABA360.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCod Roll&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.00E86A9C26ABA360.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cod Roll"
	quest.00ECBBFDDF81560E.quest_desc: ["Find &#00D9FFthe Necklace&r of the &#00D9FFDesert&r inside &#FFA500Cataclysm&r's Cursed Pyramid." "You need it to awaken the &#00D9FFAncient Remnant&r, the guardian buried deep beneath the sands."]
	quest.00ECBBFDDF81560E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Necklace of the Desert"
	quest.00ECBBFDDF81560E.title: "Necklace Of The Desert"
	quest.00F8D168196F446D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCooldown Upgrade Orb&r is an upgrade material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Applied at the &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r, it gives &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFCooldown Reduction&r, up to 3 times on compatible equipment." "Craft it from 1 &#00D9FFEmpty Upgrade Orb&r and 8 &#00D9FFCooldown Runes&r."]
	quest.00F8D168196F446D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cooldown Upgrade Orb"
	quest.010841FCF11E807B.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSupremium Essence&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.010841FCF11E807B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Essence"
	quest.0126B80792E5B621.quest_desc: ["Load it with cages and it catches any bee that flies over it. Put a flower or feeding slab on top to attract bees."]
	quest.0126B80792E5B621.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Catcher"
	quest.013F2C38CB78D203.quest_desc: ["A powered-up version of the basic spawner rune, required for some of the strongest spawner upgrades."]
	quest.013F2C38CB78D203.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Infused Spawner Rune"
	quest.013F2C38CB78D203.title: "Infused Spawner Rune"
	quest.0159ABE3AFFFEC33.quest_desc: ["Mobs spawned by the spawner are set on fire."]
	quest.0159ABE3AFFFEC33.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Burning Spawner Rune"
	quest.0159ABE3AFFFEC33.title: "Burning Spawner Rune"
	quest.01600A67092DAC0D.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFPackage Filter&r from &#FFA500Create&r. Introduced in &#FFA500Create&r 6.0, it sorts &#00D9FFCardboard Packages&r by matching addresses or using &#FFA500Create&r's simplified pattern system to control routing." "It is crafted from 2 &#00D9FFZinc Nuggets&r and 1 &#00D9FFWool&r."]
	quest.01600A67092DAC0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Package Filter"
	quest.016B64D15DB848A4.quest_desc: ["Bottles honey and other fluids. Pipe honey into the side, or place it next to a centrifuge to fill automatically. With a piston, it can also bottle bees."]
	quest.016B64D15DB848A4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bottler"
	quest.0174310DDAFEE123.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9AA2x&r &#00D9FFCapacitor Blazing&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.0174310DDAFEE123.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Capacitor Blazing"
	quest.0174310DDAFEE123.title: "Blazing Capacitor"
	quest.017668074C954596.quest_desc: ["Find a &#00D9FFBastion&r that generates underground."]
	quest.017668074C954596.quest_subtitle: "Enter an underground Bastion"
	quest.0179FF90C0CFCB28.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFShepherds Pie Block&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.0179FF90C0CFCB28.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shepherds Pie Block"
	quest.017DEB45BBF95EF7.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Experiment 115 115."]
	quest.017DEB45BBF95EF7.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Experiment 115 115"
	quest.017F85DF6DA4CBFA.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFWater Wonder Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.017F85DF6DA4CBFA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Water Wonder Sapling"
	quest.017FFAD4A08AE858.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to strike attackers with lightning."]
	quest.017FFAD4A08AE858.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shock Pendant"
	quest.01815C80D8764A47.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Ignitium Leggings&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r using &#00D9FFIgnitium&r." "They give great protection and are needed to complete the &#00D9FFIgnitium Armor Set&r."]
	quest.01815C80D8764A47.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignitium Leggings"
	quest.0185011AC000CAEE.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFFlowglaze Bow&r is a ranged weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r in the &#00D9FFFlowglaze&r tier." "In newer versions, crafting it requires smithing templates."]
	quest.0185011AC000CAEE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowglaze Bow"
	quest.01936EF64C8E165E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMetallurgic Infuser&r is the first step in the &#FFA500Mekanism&r tech tree. It's a machine used in the production of &#00D9FFSteel Ingots&r, &#00D9FFBronze Ingot&r, &#00D9FFEnriched Alloy&r, and &#00D9FFObsidian Ingots&r."]
	quest.01936EF64C8E165E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Metallurgic Infuser"
	quest.019FE14F7C0A53C5.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.01B1EAA9A1F29B47.quest_desc: ["Compacts items into their compressed variants. 2x2 and 3x3 recipes."]
	quest.01B1EAA9A1F29B47.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Compacting Upgrade"
	quest.01BD8DF9B938ECA4.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.01BD8DF9B938ECA4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Phantom Block"
	quest.01CE35D4A147F2A0.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFWhite Ipe Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.01CE35D4A147F2A0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Ipe Sapling"
	quest.01D320AE46439965.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPriest Leggings&r are part of the &#00D9FFPriest Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+6&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFHoly Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft them from 7 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFHoly Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Leggings&r with 1 &#00D9FFHoly Rune&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r."]
	quest.01D320AE46439965.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Priest Leggings"
	quest.01D4383E529DE476.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFFerricore Helmet&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.01D4383E529DE476.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Helmet"
	quest.01DCFB1AEDFDED3A.quest_desc: ["Craft it from &#00D9FFPolished Andesite&r and books." "It gives &#00D9AA-7.5&r &#00D9FFArcana&r and &#00D9AA-3&r &#00D9FFEterna&r. It helps fine-tune your stats when an &#00D9FFInfusion&r needs an exact range."]
	quest.01DCFB1AEDFDED3A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stoneshelf"
	quest.01E03C6ADEAAE17C.quest_desc: ["You may want to automate its production."]
	quest.01E03C6ADEAAE17C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sal Ammoniac Bucket"
	quest.01E03C6ADEAAE17C.title: "Solvent"
	quest.01E045927323FC31.quest_desc: ["The Dragon bolsters your experience gain."]
	quest.01E045927323FC31.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Dragon"
	quest.01E797963F849393.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSweet Berry Cheesecake Slice&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.01E797963F849393.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sweet Berry Cheesecake Slice"
	quest.01E95662DCCE792B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFArrau Turtle&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.01E95662DCCE792B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arrau Turtle"
	quest.01FA083161D7DBD7.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAlteration Table&r upgrades armor with threads. To add a thread, place the armor piece on the table, right-click the glyph on the paper part, then take the armor out. To remove threads, place the armor on the table, right-click the paper part and take the armor out."]
	quest.01FA083161D7DBD7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alteration Table"
	quest.01FC26245E5C4176.quest_desc: ["Deposits source to jars not linked within &#00D9AA5 blocks&r."]
	quest.01FC26245E5C4176.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Relay Deposit"
	quest.020B0381BBA405E7.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMana Ring&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.020B0381BBA405E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mana Ring"
	quest.021FC1E140F7F9FA.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBreeze Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.021FC1E140F7F9FA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Breeze Seeds"
	quest.02212DBD7C402385.quest_desc: ["Fluoride can only be obtained by mining it underground, or using &#FFA500Mystical Agriculture&r. You will need to combined it with the &#00D9FFSulfuric Acid&r made earlier to make &#00D9FFHydrofluoric Acid&r."]
	quest.02212DBD7C402385.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluorite Gem"
	quest.02246742726A7152.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGold Drill&r produces ores and building blocks that you'd expect to find in the confines of the &#00D9FFNether Region&r."]
	quest.02246742726A7152.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Gold Drill"
	quest.02246742726A7152.title: "Gold Drill"
	quest.02262D9884D5488A.quest_desc: ["Bring Thunderbrand into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.02262D9884D5488A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thunderbrand"
	quest.02378152AD6064CF.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFThread Whirlisprig&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.02378152AD6064CF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Whirlisprig"
	quest.023E73E84E04E568.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSpawn Egg Configurable Bee&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
