	quest.1BD9B2B42C2A76A1.title: "The Ascent"
	quest.1BE1EF2602228D48.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.1BE1EF2602228D48.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Pickup"
	quest.1BE3DA30FCCB988C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFHot Wings&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1BE3DA30FCCB988C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hot Wings"
	quest.1BE408131D41E509.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMulti Processing Array&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1BE408131D41E509.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Multi Processing Array"
	quest.1BFBBAAD6B587649.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSpatial IO Port&r is the core of the &#00D9FFSpatial Digitizing&r system. It's placed at the vertex where all 3 pylon edges meet. It's where you place the &#00D9FFSpatial Drive&r and allow it to capture a build or release it. This is also the block to power when charging the system. You can also interact with the &#00D9FFSpatial IO Port&r with hoppers or other piping methods to automate the process if you so desire. A redstone signal is all the &#00D9FFSpatial IO Port&r needs to activate. Be careful!"]
	quest.1BFBBAAD6B587649.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spatial Io Port"
	quest.1BFBBAAD6B587649.title: "Spatial IO Port"
	quest.1C009CF9C42CA222.quest_desc: ["The redstone makes the block replenish itself."]
	quest.1C009CF9C42CA222.quest_subtitle: "Place a full block of Experiment 115 with Redstone"
	quest.1C215B42BE451EAD.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBerserker Soul Amulet&r is a rare &#FFA500Cataclysm&r accessory found in chests inside the &#00D9FFAbandoned Spire&r structure." "When equipped, it grants &#00D9AA+15%&r &#00D9FFAttack Damage&r, which suits melee-focused players."]
	quest.1C215B42BE451EAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Berserker Soul Amulet"
	quest.1C215B42BE451EAD.title: "Berserker Soul Amulet"
	quest.1C5D2A82B44E8B9C.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFOil Drilling Rig&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1C5D2A82B44E8B9C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Oil Drilling Rig"
	quest.1C5D2A82B44E8B9C.title: "Bringing Freedom To Your Country"
	quest.1C631EB898F5D67C.quest_desc: ["Craft a full set of iron armor: helmet, chestplate, leggings and boots. It helps you face tougher enemies with more confidence."]
	quest.1C631EB898F5D67C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Helmet, Iron Chestplate, Iron Leggings and Iron Boots"
	quest.1C631EB898F5D67C.title: "Iron Armor"
	quest.1C92CA042AEB8D7A.quest_desc: ["An &#00D9FFEnergy Cube&r is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems. An upgraded version of the &#00D9FFAdvanced Energy Cube&r."]
	quest.1C92CA042AEB8D7A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Energy Cube"
	quest.1C9565B31D0A689A.quest_desc: ["Performs archaeology on normal sand and gravel within &#00D9AA3 blocks&r of its storage block. Bind it with the &#00D9FFDominion Wand&r. It needs source, and it consumes the blocks, so you have to place new sand or gravel."]
	quest.1C9565B31D0A689A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alakarkinos Charm"
	quest.1C97351EB6462785.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCast Time Ring&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1C97351EB6462785.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cast Time Ring"
	quest.1C997257614D2222.quest_desc: ["Halves the cook time of blasting recipes, but the furnace can only process blasting recipes."]
	quest.1C997257614D2222.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Augment Blasting"
	quest.1C9EBDFB533404A0.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: End, &#00D9FFNether and Ocean&r."]
	quest.1C9EBDFB533404A0.quest_subtitle: "Find all 3 Ancient City variants"
	quest.1CAE6CEB81632ECF.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPrudentium Sword&r, &#00D9FFPrudentium Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFPrudentium Shovel&r and 2 more items. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1CAE6CEB81632ECF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Sword, Prudentium Pickaxe, Prudentium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.1CAE6CEB81632ECF.title: "Prudentium Tools and Weaponry"
	quest.1CB7870C4167A8BF.quest_desc: ["Wondering about automatic &#00D9FFWater&r pumping are you? Good thing you can do nearly anything you want! A &#00D9FFWater Pump&r will automatically collect &#00D9FFWater&r and transfer it to adjacent blocks. Make sure to place water sources surrounding the pump horizontally, give it &#00D9FFSteam&r, and it will start producing &#00D9FFWater&r for 1 EU/t. The &#00D9FFBronze Water Pump&r will produce 125mb of &#00D9FFWater&r for every adjacent water source every &#00D9AA5 seconds&r, allowing for a maximum output of 1000mb every &#00D9AA5 seconds&r."]
	quest.1CB7870C4167A8BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Water Pump"
	quest.1CB7870C4167A8BF.title: "Bronze Water Pump"
	quest.1CB78DEDF28FFEBD.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSpider Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1CB78DEDF28FFEBD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spider Seeds"
	quest.1CE9C0DAE7FC637E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMusic Disc Otherside&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1CE9C0DAE7FC637E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Otherside"
	quest.1CFC95E7F862D959.quest_desc: ["The Seashelf is the ocean counterpart of the &#00D9FFHellshelf&r. Craft it from &#00D9FFPrismarine Bricks&r, a &#00D9FFPufferfish&r, a potion and a bookshelf." "It gives &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFEterna&r (up to 45) and &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArcana&r, which leans toward rarer enchantments."]
	quest.1CFC95E7F862D959.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Seashelf"
	quest.1D12464C569BFCC2.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFHeated Centrifuge&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1D12464C569BFCC2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heated Centrifuge"
	quest.1D12464C569BFCC2.title: "Better, faster, stronger"
	quest.1D41B4C39F37739C.quest_desc: ["A stronger tier of spawner upgrade, with bigger improvements than the &#00D9FFFrontier&r rune."]
	quest.1D41B4C39F37739C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ascent Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.1D41B4C39F37739C.title: "Ascent Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.1D53EC19A2C4598D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMuskellunge&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1D53EC19A2C4598D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Muskellunge"
	quest.1D5501CAEAF15FC5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBattery Basic&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1D5501CAEAF15FC5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Battery Basic"
	quest.1D5B3CAA6D3A5FB7.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFArchevoker Boots&r are part of the &#00D9FFArchevoker Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFEvocation Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Make them from 1 &#00D9FFWizard Boots&r, 1 &#00D9FFEvocation Rune&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r."]
	quest.1D5B3CAA6D3A5FB7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Archevoker Boots"
	quest.1D6719170DB0E21E.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFIcy Fang&r is a crafting material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r, dropped by the &#00D9FFIce Spider&r. It can be processed into &#00D9FFMithril Scrap&r." "It is a step toward mithril equipment and other advanced magical crafting."]
	quest.1D6719170DB0E21E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Icy Fang"
	quest.1D7CF9865A661477.quest_desc: ["Used for conversion and output of potions."]
	quest.1D7CF9865A661477.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Potion Melder"
	quest.1D93ADE9E77AA71B.quest_desc: ["The energy upgrade upgrade allows you to increase the power storage capacity of a &#FFA500Mekanism&r machine which has an upgrade slot, as well as reduce its power consumption."]
	quest.1D93ADE9E77AA71B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Energy"
	quest.1DA176B61FC02FF5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCapacitor&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1DA176B61FC02FF5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor"
	quest.1DA83C71DF20DB0D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFNeptunium Sword&r, &#00D9FFNeptunium Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFNeptunium Shovel&r and 2 more items. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1DA83C71DF20DB0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Sword, Neptunium Pickaxe, Neptunium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.1DA83C71DF20DB0D.title: "Neptunium Gear"
	quest.1DAA172754E4E1C3.quest_desc: ["Craft it like the &#00D9FFCelestigem Paxel&r using &#00D9FFEclipse Alloy&r tools, or upgrade a &#00D9FFCelestigem Paxel&r with the matching template."]
	quest.1DAA172754E4E1C3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Paxel"
	quest.1DB25C56BA9B49D7.quest_desc: ["Crafted in the &#00D9FFInscriber&r, the &#00D9FFAccumulation Press&r is used with &#00D9FFSky Stone Ingots&r to produce &#00D9FFAccumulation Circuits&r."]
	quest.1DB25C56BA9B49D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Accumulation Processor Press"
	quest.1DBB999D5D5A9586.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFSculk Centipedes&r crawl through the caves of the &#00D9FFOtherside&r. Defeat one." "They move fast, so keep your shield up."]
	quest.1DBB999D5D5A9586.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Sculk Centipede"
	quest.1DBB999D5D5A9586.title: "Sculk Centipede"
	quest.1DC3EA1F37C08EEC.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFScroll&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1DC3EA1F37C08EEC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scroll"
	quest.1DFD2E515F4BCE51.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFThread Feather&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1DFD2E515F4BCE51.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Feather"
	quest.1DFF153A2738BFE1.quest_desc: ["Found in &#00D9FFHollow Hill&r treasure chests. Point it at the ground or a wall, charge it up and release. It pulls about &#00D9AA24 blocks&r of ore up to the surface."]
	quest.1DFF153A2738BFE1.quest_subtitle: "Find an Ore Magnet"
	quest.1E047CA7374468C8.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFLegendary Ink&r is the highest tier of magical ink in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It is found very rarely in magic structures or obtained from powerful magical creatures." "Use it in the &#00D9FFScroll Forge&r to make &#00D9FFLegendary Scrolls&r."]
	quest.1E047CA7374468C8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Legendary Ink"
	quest.1E047CA7374468C8.title: "Legendary Ink"
	quest.1E0F421B41CDBB46.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThermoelectric Boiler&r is a multiblock structure that is used to make steam. Heat can be transfered into from outside."]
	quest.1E0F421B41CDBB46.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Boiler Casing"
	quest.1E11E931FC1C2087.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSpawn Egg Configurable Bee&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1E11E931FC1C2087.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Egg Configurable Bee"
	quest.1E1B7C72826AE953.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFArcane Rune&r is a crafting ingredient in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It is the rune of the &#00D9FFArcane&r school and is used in magical crafting." "Runestones are made by infusing a &#00D9FFBlank Runestone&r with 8 &#00D9FFFocuses&r of the chosen school."]
	quest.1E1B7C72826AE953.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Rune"
	quest.1E2168776C2D6561.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFIllusionists Mantle&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1E2168776C2D6561.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Illusionists Mantle"
	quest.1E2896C1D8BCAD87.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFArctic&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.1E2CCB2E0D3633D2.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBumble Bee Nest&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1E2CCB2E0D3633D2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bumble Bee Nest"
	quest.1E3A2AFD59BBAED5.quest_desc: ["This special pickaxe, while very brittle, will allow you to harvest &#00D9FFOtherworld&r materials, such as &#00D9FFIesnium&r, more effectively."]
	quest.1E3A2AFD59BBAED5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Infused Pickaxe"
	quest.1E3FC9FC0023F9A6.quest_desc: ["Use &#00D9FFthe Scroll Forge&r and a &#00D9FFBottle O' Lightning&r to craft a lightning &#00D9FFScrolls&r."]
	quest.1E3FC9FC0023F9A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scroll"
	quest.1E4CB1835FA3CE58.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFInferium Ingot&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1E4CB1835FA3CE58.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inferium Ingot"
	quest.1E570B6A61BC574A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGlacite Scythe&r is crafted from &#00D9FFGlacite Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It makes wide melee attacks and slows enemies, which helps control crowds in cold biomes."]
	quest.1E570B6A61BC574A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Scythe"
	quest.1E5766EA0B9E55D3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSnow Queen&r waits at the top of the &#00D9FFAurora Palace&r, surrounded by living ice, and guards what lies beyond." "She fights in the air across several phases, summoning floating ice shields, dropping icicles and firing blasts of frozen magic. Adapt to each phase to win. Defeating her opens the path to the deepest secrets of the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r."]
	quest.1E5766EA0B9E55D3.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Snow Queen"
	quest.1E5766EA0B9E55D3.title: "SnowQueen"
	quest.1E5F687D7F621301.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFree Runners&r are an item that allows players to ascend 1-block inclines automatically (like the &#00D9FFHorse&r), as well as preventing fall damage as long as they are charged. A fall will reduce the item's charge, depending on how far the fall was."]
	quest.1E5F687D7F621301.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Free Runners Armored"
	quest.1E656655600FBCEA.quest_desc: ["Wrap a furnace up as a gift for a friend."]
	quest.1E656655600FBCEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Xmas"
	quest.1E6D0C7597FC5060.quest_desc: ["Allows storages to work as a configurable hopper."]
	quest.1E6D0C7597FC5060.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hopper Upgrade"
	quest.1E756592BDE0C97B.quest_desc: ["Flux Storage keeps excess energy and only fills once every &#00D9FFFlux Point&r has received enough. Stored energy can only leave through a &#00D9FFFlux Point&r. This tier has a transfer limit of 1,440,000. Networks do not need storage to work."]
	quest.1E756592BDE0C97B.quest_subtitle: "The largest energy buffer for your network"
	quest.1E7FEB231735D129.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHydra&r is a huge, many-headed beast that rules the &#00D9FFFire Swamp&r of the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r." "Each head can attack with fire or powerful bites, and the fight gets harder as it goes, so stay alert and adapt. Beating it grants valuable treasure and brings you closer to the dimension's deepest secrets."]
	quest.1E7FEB231735D129.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Hydra"
	quest.1E7FEB231735D129.title: "Hydra"
	quest.1E86061C29212C13.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAlpha Yeti&r rules the icy &#00D9FFGlacier&r of the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r and defends its frozen cave. It is much larger than ordinary &#00D9FFYetis&r." "It throws large blocks of ice, creates freezing shockwaves and hits hard. Bring strong gear, position carefully and prepare for the cold. Beating it opens the way to further challenges."]
	quest.1E86061C29212C13.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Alpha Yeti"
	quest.1E86061C29212C13.title: "AlphaYeti"
	quest.1E8FD73A62415312.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBlood Upgrade Orb&r is an upgrade material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Applied at the &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r, it gives &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFBlood Spell Power&r." "Craft it from 1 &#00D9FFEmpty Upgrade Orb&r and 8 &#00D9FFBlood Runes&r. Upgrade Orbs can be applied to compatible equipment to raise its magical power."]
	quest.1E8FD73A62415312.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blood Upgrade Orb"
	quest.1E917C10CA1C7C20.quest_desc: ["Look for an &#00D9FFEnd City&r, a tall purpur and end stone brick structure on the outer End islands." "Shulkers guard it, and its loot is among the best in the dimension, including &#00D9FFElytra and Shulker Shells&r."]
	quest.1E917C10CA1C7C20.title: "End City"
	quest.1E99E55742762FD6.quest_desc: ["Reduces the time it takes to drink and eat."]
	quest.1E99E55742762FD6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Novelty Drinking Hat"
	quest.1EAE47F9C0288679.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSteel Brewery&r can automatically brew four potions at a time at a considerably quicker rate than a regular brewing stand. Remember it needs &#00D9FFBlazing Essence&r in place of &#00D9FFBlaze Powder&r."]
	quest.1EAE47F9C0288679.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Brewery"
	quest.1EB22FA1F8CCCE6C.quest_desc: ["Another upgrade in speed and fuel efficiency."]
	quest.1EB22FA1F8CCCE6C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Furnace"
	quest.1EB49A6611387393.quest_desc: ["Up there with &#00D9FFAd Astra&r’s."]
	quest.1EB49A6611387393.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Train Door"
	quest.1ECBEA78F8E62FAF.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium Sword&r, &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium Shovel&r and 2 more items. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1ECBEA78F8E62FAF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Sword, Awakened Supremium Pickaxe, Awakened Supremium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.1ECBEA78F8E62FAF.title: "Awakened Supremium Tools"
	quest.1ED2AA4068C17DA4.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Adventurer Skills&r adds character progression through skills. Review the available choices and build toward the bonuses that support your preferred playstyle."]
	quest.1ED2AA4068C17DA4.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.1ED3465F0C3B958C.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFSteel Machine Casing&r."]
	quest.1ED3465F0C3B958C.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Steel Machine Casing"
	quest.1ED4EC6096D38FF5.quest_desc: ["Transfers source for an infinite distance between relays, but it has a chance to lose source after &#00D9AA30 blocks&r."]
	quest.1ED4EC6096D38FF5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Relay Warp"
	quest.1EDF214FFEE5173D.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEclipsealloy Axe&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1EDF214FFEE5173D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Axe"
	quest.1EF3F77676A93FE7.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFIcewhisper&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1EF3F77676A93FE7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Icewhisper"
	quest.1F12C2ADC89B8584.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFThermal Compressor&r uses temperature differences on opposite sides of the block to compress air. To operate it, place a high-temperature block on one side and a low-temperature block on the opposite side. Note: North-&#00D9FFSouth&r faces are thermally connected to each other, as are the &#00D9FFEast&r-&#00D9FFWest&r faces, but there is no thermal connection between the &#00D9FFNorth&r-&#00D9FFSouth and East&r-&#00D9FFWest&r sides. The thermally connected sides will try to equalize their temperatures, so it's important to maintain a significant temperature differential for effective operation."]
	quest.1F12C2ADC89B8584.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Compressor"
	quest.1F2BCDA26D310572.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFHeat Generators&r create power using heat. Lava or other burnables can be used as it's heat source."]
	quest.1F2BCDA26D310572.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heat Generator"
	quest.1F2E8A17A11EA9D1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBeech Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1F2E8A17A11EA9D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Beech Sapling"
	quest.1F3FAF8151DD596D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFInsanium Essence&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1F3FAF8151DD596D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Insanium Essence"
	quest.1F428A4E81D19351.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFJellyfish Bucket&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1F428A4E81D19351.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jellyfish Bucket"
	quest.1F486D8E2EC696A1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMagma Cake Block&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1F486D8E2EC696A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magma Cake Block"
	quest.1F4DB18F49025B83.quest_desc: ["This Ring can store an occult familiar inside, providing some of its benefits without it needing to be by your side."]
	quest.1F4DB18F49025B83.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Familiar Ring"
	quest.1F51BCEA863D8050.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMusic Disc Stal&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.1F51BCEA863D8050.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Stal"
	quest.1F599AED12C40EB7.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSilver Lime Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1F599AED12C40EB7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Silver Lime Sapling"
	quest.1F671291375277C6.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.1F671291375277C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Blink"
	quest.1F6E1D72B79DB31C.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnder Cell Hardened&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1F6E1D72B79DB31C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Cell Hardened"
	quest.1F93468FAB015372.quest_desc: ["A sleek bronze casing with a vicious spinning blade inside will give you even better cutting ratios than you ever experienced using your &#00D9FFForge Hammer&r. Time for extra bolts, gears, rings, and rods! Just remember that you can't cut for free. This machine runs off &#00D9FFSteam&r and uses &#00D9FFLubricant&r to make clean cuts without overheating. &#00D9FFLubricant&r can be produced inside of the &#00D9FFMixer&r, using &#00D9FFRedstone&r and one of the various hydrocarbons. You may find something to mix with &#00D9FFRedstone&r!"]
	quest.1F93468FAB015372.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Cutting Machine"
	quest.1F93468FAB015372.title: "Bronze Cutting Machine"
	quest.1F96B7A6858E5DD1.quest_desc: ["You probably met this unassuming little guy while pressing your first plates in &#FFA500Create&r. The Depot holds items in place for many other &#FFA500Create&r things to interact with them."]
	quest.1F96B7A6858E5DD1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Depot"
	quest.1F997447CADA740E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9AA4x&r &#00D9FFCapacitor Basic&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1F997447CADA740E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Capacitor Basic"
	quest.1F997447CADA740E.title: "Basic Capacitor"
	quest.1FA6F802D3054074.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFGreenheart Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.1FA6F802D3054074.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Greenheart Sapling"
	quest.1FB09C79472857DE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFImmaterial Disperser&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1FB09C79472857DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Immaterial Disperser"
	quest.1FB2EAFEA9A787AC.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFVacuum Freezer&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.1FB2EAFEA9A787AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vacuum Freezer"
	quest.1FB2EAFEA9A787AC.title: "Enslaved Winter"
	quest.1FBA503950AAE24A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPortable Storage Interface&r moves items between a moving &#00D9FFContraption&r and stationary storage. Place two &#00D9FFInterfaces&r facing each other with 1 to &#00D9AA2 blocks&r between them, one on the &#00D9FFContraption&r and one fixed." "When they connect, the &#00D9FFContraption&r briefly stops and its inventory becomes reachable. Use Funnels, &#00D9FFChutes&r or other transport components to insert or extract items. A Redstone signal breaks the connection immediately."]
	quest.1FBA503950AAE24A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portable Storage Interface"
	quest.1FC180C359003B6E.quest_desc: ["Automates the smoker using items from the backpack."]
	quest.1FC180C359003B6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Auto Smoking Upgrade"
	quest.1FD78504D48D3F65.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Applied Energistics 2&r (AE2) introduces a unique approach to inventory management and automation. Its futuristic sci-fi theme centers around the concept of converting matter into energy and vice versa for instantaneous resource transportation."]
	quest.1FD78504D48D3F65.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.1FD8A7EE98DCF88B.quest_desc: ["Makes the spawner operate without its usual sound."]
	quest.1FD8A7EE98DCF88B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Silent Spawner Rune"
	quest.1FD8A7EE98DCF88B.title: "Silent Spawner Rune"
	quest.200715E62F6ACBCC.quest_desc: ["You'll need &#00D9FFTallow&r to make proper occultist candles. Killing larger animals with any knife will harvest some."]
	quest.200715E62F6ACBCC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.200715E62F6ACBCC.title: "Knives"
	quest.20071FDDBB407198.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFire Clay&r is a mixture of plain river &#00D9FFClay and Brick Dust&r as a tempering agent, then re-fired to harden it to make it withstand extreme temperatures. To make the &#00D9FFBrick Dust&r you can use your good ol' &#00D9FFForge Hammer&r and use it to crush plain &#00D9FFBricks&r. You can also use other machines like the &#00D9FFMacerator&r to make this process more efficient."]
	quest.20071FDDBB407198.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 12x Fire Clay Brick"
	quest.20071FDDBB407198.title: "Fire Clay"
	quest.2016B1C6E0384703.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFRippling Willow Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2016B1C6E0384703.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rippling Willow Sapling"
	quest.2019219F3CEB6F63.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSmallmouth Bass&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2019219F3CEB6F63.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smallmouth Bass"
	quest.201D00F8522691C6.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.201D00F8522691C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Smelting Factory"
	quest.202FA9A77132A3EF.quest_desc: ["Use it to make fish fillets. The amount you get depends on the type of fish."]
	quest.202FA9A77132A3EF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Fillet Knife"
	quest.20324E3BEF8CB578.quest_desc: ["The terminal in &#FFA500Create&r’s new build-your-own-storage-system kit. It can link to multiple inventories, via &#00D9FFStock Links&r, and is operated by the mob of your choice."]
	quest.20324E3BEF8CB578.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stock Ticker"
	quest.203DA9BF80552E06.quest_desc: ["Trees in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r are infused with lunar energy, and their logs are called &#00D9FFLunar Logs&r." "Collect enough of them for tools and building, since they are a basic resource in the dimension."]
	quest.203DA9BF80552E06.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 10x Lunar Log"
	quest.203DA9BF80552E06.title: "Lunar Wood"
	quest.20407B9AFD424A64.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Eternal Nether&r adds further content and exploration to the &#00D9FFNether&r. Look for its distinctive additions as you travel through the dimension."]
	quest.20407B9AFD424A64.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.2044F95AC6BABC17.quest_desc: ["Relays rotating motion along a straight path: job done."]
	quest.2044F95AC6BABC17.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shaft"
	quest.20625F9DB16F2E8F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFChorus Staff&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.20625F9DB16F2E8F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chorus Staff"
	quest.207255FA441FE0A6.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFNature Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.207255FA441FE0A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nature Seeds"
	quest.20774E8A3CCC88ED.quest_desc: ["Multiplies the number of stacks that can fit in a slot by 4."]
	quest.20774E8A3CCC88ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Tier 2"
	quest.2079134F80E404E3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSculk Shrieker&r summons the &#00D9FFWarden&r if it hears you too many times." "Mine it with a &#00D9FFSilk Touch&r tool to take it with you. A player-placed one will never summon the &#00D9FFWarden&r."]
	quest.2079134F80E404E3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sculk Shrieker"
	quest.207D39F607C6E3D8.quest_desc: ["Craft a &#00D9FFBlack Steel Axe&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r. It is durable and efficient at chopping wood, and belongs to the &#00D9FFBlack Steel&r set."]
	quest.207D39F607C6E3D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Steel Axe"
	quest.209976DE099D716A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFStrider Rock&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.209976DE099D716A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strider Rock"
	quest.209FAF376A5B8BEC.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCompression Upgrade&r automatically turns compatible items into their compact forms, so they take less space." "It works well for materials that fill containers fast and keeps your slots better used."]
	quest.209FAF376A5B8BEC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Compression Upgrade"
	quest.20ABBB37ABC4922E.quest_desc: ["Use it to make fish fillets. The amount you get depends on the type of fish."]
	quest.20ABBB37ABC4922E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wooden Fillet Knife"
	quest.20D9A6BE4049DE75.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFYellow Chalk&r is marginally more powerful than the simple &#00D9FFWhite&r. It is primarily used for &#00D9FFPossession&r rituals."]
	quest.20D9A6BE4049DE75.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Yellow Impure"
	quest.20E9E4DB23F8BA2F.quest_desc: ["With &#00D9FFthe Orb of Prophecy&r in hand, you can activate the portal and step into the &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r dimension." "Expect unknown dangers, strange biomes and powerful secrets, so prepare well before crossing."]
	quest.20E9E4DB23F8BA2F.quest_subtitle: "Travel to Starlight"
	quest.20E9E4DB23F8BA2F.title: "Into the Starlight"
	quest.20F805D44C988258.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAncient Codex&r is the netherite-tier spellbook of &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives 12 spell slots, &#00D9AA+20%&r &#00D9FFCooldown Reduction&r and &#00D9AA+200&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, making it one of the strongest general-purpose spellbooks."]
	quest.20F805D44C988258.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Netherite Spell Book"
	quest.20F9A5F14B342761.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCoral Bardiche&r is a &#FFA500Cataclysm&r weapon dropped by &#00D9FFDeepling&r enemies. It is known for heavy attacks and a distinctive look." "Defeat Deeplings to get this rare ocean weapon."]
	quest.20F9A5F14B342761.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coral Bardiche"
	quest.21046DD5D69EEDDA.quest_desc: ["This Table is used to compile &#00D9FFScrolls&r you have found and crafted into a &#00D9FFSpellbook&r. To remove a &#00D9FFScroll&r, click on the spell you want to remove and click the &#00D9FFScroll&r from the &#00D9FFInscription&r on the &#00D9FFRight Side&r."]
	quest.21046DD5D69EEDDA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inscription Table"
	quest.21119BCA97654F42.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFUniversal Cables&r are &#FFA500Mekanism&r's way to transfer power. Capacity: 51.20 kFE/t."]
	quest.21119BCA97654F42.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Universal Cable"
	quest.21119BCA97654F42.title: "Advanced Universal Cable"
	quest.2123669F8025A966.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRibboncleaver&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2123669F8025A966.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ribboncleaver"
	quest.2149DCDEA5545B75.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBrass Funnel&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2149DCDEA5545B75.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brass Funnel"
	quest.2155D16D6DBC5F92.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarfire Crossbow&r is a late-game ranged weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r in the &#00D9FFStarfire&r tier." "It is built for powerful ranged combat."]
	quest.2155D16D6DBC5F92.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfire Crossbow"
	quest.217163D161F7670C.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFSteel Casing&r is a block used in the crafting recipe of most &#FFA500Mekanism&r machines."]
	quest.217163D161F7670C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Casing"
	quest.217F284AD776E16A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLogistical Sorter&r is the brains of your item transportation network, letting you control exactly where your items go. Set up filters to match specific items, tags, or even entire categories of resources. Filtered items can then be directed to a chosen destination within the network. You can use the &#00D9FFDictionary&r to search for available item and block tags, making it much easier to create broad or highly specific filters. Combine Sorters with &#00D9FFRestrictive and Diversion Transporters&r to create reliable, automated item routing throughout your factory."]
	quest.217F284AD776E16A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistical Sorter"
	quest.217F284AD776E16A.title: "Logistical Sorter"
	quest.2182E8C050BC18FC.quest_desc: ["Output grows with the number of &#00D9FFSails&r attached, so fit all 8 for the best result."]
	quest.2182E8C050BC18FC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Windmill"
	quest.218411D5E4987463.quest_desc: ["Be careful, piranhas bite."]
	quest.218411D5E4987463.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Piranha"
	quest.2189FEFCAE0C16FD.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCultist Leggings&r are part of the &#00D9FFCultist Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+6&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFBlood Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft them from &#00D9FFWizard Leggings&r, 1 &#00D9FFBlood Rune&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r, or upgrade them at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r in supported versions."]
	quest.2189FEFCAE0C16FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cultist Leggings"
	quest.21A467F02AB070DC.quest_desc: ["ExtendedAE is a mod that can be used to speed up, and expand ae2 so its faster and bigger."]
	quest.21A467F02AB070DC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Entro Seed"
	quest.21B571F216FB8904.quest_desc: ["Gotta start somewhere, and this will let you hand-power your first mechanical creations, or jump-start your self-pumping steam boiler engines."]
	quest.21B571F216FB8904.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hand Crank"
	quest.21B9DE3FF594FA45.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMusic Disc Blocks&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.21B9DE3FF594FA45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Blocks"
	quest.21C55C5A4B933CAF.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnergy Cell Blazing&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.21C55C5A4B933CAF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell Blazing"
	quest.21D388E293A0BB58.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFAmethyst Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.21D388E293A0BB58.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Seeds"
	quest.21D8A54F15202BE8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFPerch&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.21D8A54F15202BE8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Perch"
	quest.21EE2FBD57F20239.quest_desc: ["Further enhances a spawner's core stats."]
	quest.21EE2FBD57F20239.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Summit Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.21EE2FBD57F20239.title: "Summit Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.21F5EB3F8F5D23F5.quest_desc: ["Works both as a shield and as a glider."]
	quest.21F5EB3F8F5D23F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Umbrella"
	quest.21FCD3C92ACB754D.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPressurized Tubes&r are a way of transporting types of gas, such as steam, hydrogen, and oxygen. Transfer rate: 750 mb/t."]
	quest.21FCD3C92ACB754D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Pressurized Tube"
	quest.22044F00AC22E39C.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFLimited Copper Barrel&r 1 into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.22044F00AC22E39C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Copper Barrel 1"
	quest.2219D20D021194D0.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Resonarium Leggings&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFDiamond Leggings&r, &#00D9FFSturdy Sheets&r, a &#00D9FFResonarium Plate&r and a &#00D9FFResonarium Upgrade Template&r." "The template can be found in &#00D9FFAncient Cities&r, &#00D9FFTrial Chambers and Strongholds&r."]
	quest.2219D20D021194D0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Leggings"
	quest.2226A5E598BA2684.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFPrevent Aechor Petal Spawning&r."]
	quest.2226A5E598BA2684.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Prevent Aechor Petal Spawning"
	quest.2228E1A971A32F06.quest_desc: ["Craft a full set of &#00D9FFLeather Armor&r. It is made from leather gathered from animals and gives light, basic protection with full freedom of movement." "It is a good first step before moving to stronger equipment."]
	quest.2228E1A971A32F06.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Leather Helmet, Leather Chestplate, Leather Leggings and Leather Boots"
	quest.2228E1A971A32F06.title: "Leather Armor"
	quest.222DB2CA1F81B96B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFWickpiercer&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.222DB2CA1F81B96B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wickpiercer"
	quest.22364C78859FA367.quest_desc: ["Defeat 4 &#00D9FFIgnited Berserkers&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r. They patrol the &#00D9FFBurning Arena&r and serve &#00D9FFIgnis&r." "Beating them prepares you for the fight against &#00D9FFIgnis&r."]
	quest.22364C78859FA367.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Ignited Berserker"
	quest.22364C78859FA367.title: "Ignited Berserker"
	quest.2247E5459B5D4301.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPressure Tubes&r transfer air between &#00D9FFCompressors and Machines&r, can be disguised to blend in with their environment. Additionally, &#00D9FFTube Modules&r can be attached to these &#00D9FFTubes&r to provide extra features or functionality."]
	quest.2247E5459B5D4301.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressure Tube"
	quest.224A1F6913108AA3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFRedstone Relay&r from &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r lets a &#00D9FFRedstone&r signal switch electrical power on or off in your network. It suits automated factories and &#00D9FFRedstone&r-controlled machines."]
	quest.224A1F6913108AA3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Relay"
	quest.22544EB8EE0604A0.quest_desc: ["Find &#00D9FFthe Amethyst Nest&r hidden in the &#00D9FFOverworld&r." "Deep inside is the lair of the &#00D9FFAmethyst Crab&r, so get ready for a fight."]
	quest.22544EB8EE0604A0.title: "Amethyst Nest"
	quest.22647EF2D9D42B5D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSteeleaf Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.22647EF2D9D42B5D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steeleaf Seeds"
	quest.226947DFFD9E50F1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSlicer&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.226947DFFD9E50F1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Slicer"
	quest.226F89C92F5D504E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCopoazu Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.226F89C92F5D504E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copoazu Sapling"
	quest.2271BF34DE180569.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPattern Encoding Terminal&r lets you encode patterns for crafting and processing. It is made by upgrading a &#00D9FFCrafting Terminal&r with an &#00D9FFEngineering Processor&r."]
	quest.22865F8986707CF0.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSpicy Hoglin Stew&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.22865F8986707CF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spicy Hoglin Stew"
	quest.228895BFE6D8D545.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThallasium Upgrade Smithing Template&r applies &#00D9FFThallasium&r-tier trims and recipes to compatible gear at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "It is the first step of &#00D9FFBetter End's&r equipment progression."]
	quest.228895BFE6D8D545.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.2289C9AAEC281148.quest_desc: ["Voids the items selected in its filter."]
	quest.2289C9AAEC281148.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Void Upgrade"
	quest.22A31024A138B0F7.quest_desc: ["Meka-&#00D9FFTool&r can be upgraded with &#00D9FFModules&r that are installed with the &#00D9FFModification Station&r."]
	quest.22A31024A138B0F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Meka Tool"
	quest.22A4BDA91482F77E.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFPrudentium&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.22AE205952E2DD8B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFFurnator Niotic&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.22AE205952E2DD8B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Furnator Niotic"
	quest.22B23DCCC5E5C225.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFerricore Hoe&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.22B23DCCC5E5C225.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Hoe"
	quest.22B4C8ECAD78BD45.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFEnriched Obsidian&r is used in the &#00D9FFMetallurgic Infuser&r. &#00D9FFEnriched Obsidian&r yields 80 units of obsidian in the &#00D9FFMetallurgic Infuser&r, the same as 8 &#00D9FFRefined Obsidian Dust&r."]
	quest.22B4C8ECAD78BD45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Refined Obsidian"
	quest.22C064FC3CA2AA23.quest_desc: ["You also need 10 unique legendary fish for the &#00D9FFEmerald Trophy&r."]
	quest.22C064FC3CA2AA23.quest_subtitle: "Catch 200 fish in total"
	quest.22CF92D9C0B1B43A.quest_desc: ["The Stalker drops &#00D9FFSoul Crystals&r." "Grind one in a &#00D9FFMillstone&r to get 3 &#00D9FFSoul Dust&r, or save it for the &#00D9FFSonorous Staff and Soul Elytra&r."]
	quest.22CF92D9C0B1B43A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Crystal"
	quest.22D9F2309203B2E1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSlime Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.22D9F2309203B2E1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Slime Seeds"
	quest.22DAC79D807D2F89.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.22DAC79D807D2F89.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Fangs"
	quest.22DCF5BE4DAC2742.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSilicon Press&r is used in an &#00D9FFInscriber&r to turn &#00D9FFSilicon&r into &#00D9FFPrinted Silicon&r. Presses are found in meteorites, and the &#00D9FFInscriber&r can duplicate one with an &#00D9FFIron Block&r."]
	quest.22E6E27E339F6336.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFWrench&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.22E6E27E339F6336.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wrench"
	quest.22E8397A2E00F3F3.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnergizing Rod Niotic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.22E8397A2E00F3F3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energizing Rod Niotic"
	quest.22F624120228DA3E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBucket&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.22F624120228DA3E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bucket"
	quest.22FFE46A22C609E4.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFAbyssal Sacrifice&r is a rare &#FFA500Cataclysm&r item used to summon the &#00D9FFLeviathan&r, the &#00D9FFAncient Remnant&r of the ocean depths." "Gather the required materials and prepare well for a tough underwater fight."]
	quest.22FFE46A22C609E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Abyssal Sacrifice"
	quest.22FFE46A22C609E4.title: "Abyssal Sacrifice"
	quest.230308CD365396D6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConjurers Talisman&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.230308CD365396D6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Conjurers Talisman"
	quest.230D36BF23D48568.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHandle Attachment Smithing Template&r lets you join a finished &#00D9FFBetter End&r tool head to its handle at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "You need it for &#00D9FFThallasium and Terminite&r tools and weapons."]
	quest.230D36BF23D48568.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Handle Attachment Smithing Template"
	quest.2328F563FE287CB7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBloody Voodoo Doll&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2328F563FE287CB7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bloody Voodoo Doll"
	quest.232F056CF68F37C7.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFGrandidiers Baobab Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.232F056CF68F37C7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Grandidiers Baobab Sapling"
	quest.23452C7E33F043EA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEvasion Elixir&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.23452C7E33F043EA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Evasion Elixir"
	quest.2348FCC1D9994BA5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFLimited Copper Barrel&r 3. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2348FCC1D9994BA5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Copper Barrel 3"
	quest.23542AE6ED642245.quest_desc: ["The Sandstorm in a &#00D9FFBottle&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a rare artifact holding the power of an ancient desert storm." "It is tied to the civilizations buried under the desert."]
	quest.23542AE6ED642245.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sandstorm in a Bottle"
	quest.235CFE9AED85B1AB.quest_desc: ["Cleaning up &#00D9FFChalk&r can be somewhat of a chore by hand. Thankfully, this is a solved problem: use a &#00D9FFBrush&r!"]
	quest.235CFE9AED85B1AB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brush"
	quest.2364038D77077F2F.quest_desc: ["Wadjet is a serpent-like mini-boss in &#FFA500Cataclysm&r's Cursed Pyramid. It guards the treasures with strong sand magic." "Defeating it drops &#00D9FFAncient Metal Ingots&r, the key material for ancient equipment."]
	quest.2364038D77077F2F.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Wadjet"
	quest.2364038D77077F2F.title: "Wadjet"
	quest.2369E85866998513.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDigital Miner&r is the scale mining machine of &#FFA500Mekanism&r. However, this machine is like no other as it \"magically-teleports\" mined blocks to its inventory."]
	quest.2369E85866998513.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Digital Miner"
	quest.236E10245B6308B5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSlimy Nest&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.236E10245B6308B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Slimy Nest"
	quest.23734E69D74BA281.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSalvaging Table&r breaks down unwanted &#00D9FFAffix Gear&r into &#00D9FFRarity Materials&r, which you can use to improve your equipment and progress."]
	quest.23734E69D74BA281.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Salvaging Table and Smart Filter"
	quest.23734E69D74BA281.title: "Salvaging"
	quest.23752F087B6323F4.quest_desc: ["Will make the storage pick up items within its range. Has more filtering options."]
	quest.23752F087B6323F4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.23977A87FEE832CC.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFHot Wings Bucket&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.23977A87FEE832CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hot Wings Bucket"
	quest.239B2A4AFDFA3312.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the shulker box."]
	quest.239B2A4AFDFA3312.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Shulker Box"
	quest.239D9AC37AC5B8B2.quest_desc: ["Well, this is the time! It will not get you everything, but it will get you a lot of the main ores. Everything comes later. The &#00D9FFSteam Quarry&r is a steam powered multiblock machine that uses different drills that you install onto it to dig deeper than bedrock and retrieves ores straight from the below, whatever might be under there. You can check which ores this method will provide by checking EMI."]
	quest.239D9AC37AC5B8B2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 13x Steel Machine Casing, Steam Quarry, 4x Chain and 6x Steel Machine Casing Pipe"
	quest.239D9AC37AC5B8B2.title: "Infinite Resources?"
	quest.239E7F5403867385.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarfire Sword&r is a high-tier weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is made with smithing and needs &#00D9FFStarfire&r-related materials from the mod's advanced content."]
	quest.239E7F5403867385.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfire Sword"
	quest.23A36856E4ECDEEF.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCursed Bow&r is a powerful &#FFA500Cataclysm&r ranged weapon dropped by &#00D9FFMaledictus&r in the &#00D9FFFrosted Prison&r." "Its special attacks ignore normal damage protection."]
	quest.23A36856E4ECDEEF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cursed Bow"
	quest.23A36856E4ECDEEF.title: "Cursed Bow"
	quest.23ADF75576C7CFEF.quest_desc: ["This machine is used to (dis)charge items that operate on &#00D9FFPneumatic Power&r, such as &#00D9FFDrones&r, &#00D9FFPneumatic Wrenches&r, and &#00D9FFVortex Cannons&r. It also manages upgrades for items that can accept them."]
	quest.23ADF75576C7CFEF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charging Station"
	quest.23B151AB16FF6FD0.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFObsidian&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.23BE3D7400003857.quest_desc: ["Plastic blocks a good way of making a cool base. They are aesthetic only."]
	quest.23BE3D7400003857.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Plastic"
	quest.23C553AD6AC611F8.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFNeptunium Helmet&r, &#00D9FFNeptunium Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFNeptunium Leggings and Neptunium Boots&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.23C553AD6AC611F8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Helmet, Neptunium Chestplate, Neptunium Leggings and Neptunium Boots"
	quest.23C553AD6AC611F8.title: "Neptunium Armor"
	quest.23C5DE3C94652080.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPrinted Circuit Board&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.23C5DE3C94652080.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Printed Circuit Board"
	quest.23CEE8175974CF6B.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.23CEE8175974CF6B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Flare"
	quest.23D446FCE94FB7A4.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAssembler Matrix&r can craft hundreds, if not thousands of items per tick, depending on how you configure it."]
	quest.23D446FCE94FB7A4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembler Matrix Wall, Assembler Matrix Pattern, Assembler Matrix Crafter and 2 more items"
	quest.23D446FCE94FB7A4.title: "Assembler Matrix"
	quest.23E56C60D6CA839B.quest_desc: ["Voids an item that is picked up which then provides a small amount of mana."]
	quest.23E56C60D6CA839B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Void Jar"
	quest.23E98D096A1BFDC0.quest_desc: ["If an occult familiar dies, it will drop such a shard. You can use this to revive it, if you like."]
	quest.23E98D096A1BFDC0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Shard"
	quest.23F054B209A2F57E.quest_desc: ["A piece of equipment worn on the backpack (the chest armor slot) that provides underwater respiration when a &#00D9FFGas Mask&r is worn (on the helmet armor slot)."]
	quest.23F054B209A2F57E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scuba Tank"
	quest.23F1DD9F400D7972.quest_desc: ["The Incinerator from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a greataxe built from &#00D9FFIgnis'&r power that sets enemies ablaze." "You can earn it by clearing the &#00D9FFBurning Arena&r."]
	quest.23F1DD9F400D7972.quest_subtitle: "Obtain The Incinerator"
	quest.23F1DD9F400D7972.title: "The Incinerator"
	quest.23FC33F83ACFC5C0.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFTome of Scrapping&r removes enchantments from an item and gives them back as books. It only recovers half of them and destroys the item. Use a &#00D9FFTome of Extraction&r to keep the item, or &#00D9FFSuperior Scrapping&r to recover everything."]
	quest.23FC33F83ACFC5C0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scrap Tome"
	quest.24033D42E93DAEE5.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFNeptunium Nugget&r is a rare fragment of a valuable ocean metal. You can only get one by fishing, so expect it to take some patience and luck." "Collecting enough of them lets you forge &#00D9FFNeptunium&r equipment."]
	quest.24033D42E93DAEE5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Nugget"
	quest.24033D42E93DAEE5.title: "Neptunium Nugget"
	quest.2403627388601B82.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFUpgrade Diamond&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2403627388601B82.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Diamond"
	quest.240F20C12C771975.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory and upgrade slots of the backpack."]
	quest.240F20C12C771975.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Backpack"
	quest.241A984254DF5706.quest_desc: ["Using these &#00D9FFMaterials&r you'll be able to construct you first &#00D9FFPressure Chamber&r."]
	quest.241A984254DF5706.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 21x Pressure Chamber Wall, Pressure Chamber Valve, 2x Pressure Chamber Interface and 2x Pressure Chamber Glass"
	quest.241A984254DF5706.title: "Your First Pressure Chamber"
	quest.241D2F19426D33B4.quest_desc: ["Use it to make fish fillets. The amount you get depends on the type of fish."]
	quest.241D2F19426D33B4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Fillet Knife"
	quest.2422274375D47B8E.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFImperium&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.2422B7E51E491269.quest_desc: ["The shipping container for international shipping. The data packet for comunication networks. And now… the humble &#00D9FFCardboard Package&r packet-izes item transfer, underpinning &#FFA500Create&r’s new item requesting and delivery abilities."]
	quest.2422B7E51E491269.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cardboard Package 12x12"
	quest.24389CE8F7E51A2F.quest_desc: ["Freezes targets. Slows them down and potentially encasing them in ice temporarily. Fire-resistant mobs are especially vulnerable to this ammo."]
	quest.24389CE8F7E51A2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo Freezing"
	quest.2444B671B3068D77.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBronze Composter&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2444B671B3068D77.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Composter"
	quest.244CD83573C73850.quest_desc: ["There are 4 stages of growth, just like &#00D9FFCertus Quartz Clusters&r. While in the first three stages you will get &#00D9FFEntro Dust&r, But in the fourth stage you can get &#00D9FFEntroized Crystals&r."]
	quest.244CD83573C73850.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Entro Dust"
	quest.245EBCE2A9181D65.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnergy Cable Niotic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.245EBCE2A9181D65.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cable Niotic"
	quest.2474E042D5328107.quest_desc: ["The range upgrade will expand the area of operation by &#00D9AA1 block&r in all directions. Multiple range upgrades can be installed."]
	quest.2474E042D5328107.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Range"
	quest.248EDD67A7CE50B9.quest_desc: ["Automatically uses potions, milk buckets and food that give effects."]
	quest.248EDD67A7CE50B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemy Upgrade"
	quest.2494ADFB9F5BDF09.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFEnder Pearls&r are dropped from endermen and are used to create &#00D9FFEnder Scrolls&r."]
	quest.2494ADFB9F5BDF09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Pearl"
	quest.2495F42B39D6C3EE.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMusic Disc&r: The Leviathan is a rare &#FFA500Cataclysm&r trophy dropped by &#00D9FFThe Leviathan&r, with a &#00D9AA10%&r drop chance from the boss." "It marks your victory over one of the ocean's most fearsome creatures."]
	quest.2495F42B39D6C3EE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc the Leviathan"
	quest.249948CE9F29AFA5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFOak Sapling&r, &#00D9FFSpruce Sapling&r, &#00D9FFBirch Sapling&r and 6 more items. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.249948CE9F29AFA5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Oak Sapling, Spruce Sapling, Birch Sapling and 6 more items"
	quest.249948CE9F29AFA5.title: "Basic Saplings"
	quest.249BA0F38C7AD688.quest_desc: ["Obtained from the &#00D9FFDistiller&r, this is &#00D9FFMercury&r in its rawest form."]
	quest.249BA0F38C7AD688.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Mercury Shard"
	quest.249BA0F38C7AD688.title: "Crystallized Mercury"
	quest.24A34D2F6B9156E7.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.24A34D2F6B9156E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Exchange"
	quest.24A3C2870C5A607D.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFSteeleaf&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.24AE372E79093B56.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.24AE372E79093B56.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.24CC87C656AE85C1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnder Cell Nitro&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.24CC87C656AE85C1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Cell Nitro"
	quest.24D4FBE7F6546E8A.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Pufferfish's Skills&r provides a skill-tree progression system. Open its interface to review available paths and understand how skills can shape a character."]
	quest.24D4FBE7F6546E8A.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.24DAC871074CC69F.title: "Hydra"
	quest.24E1F72FD6958747.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium Block&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.24E1F72FD6958747.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Block"
	quest.24F78DA0E1A26044.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFWitherite Ingots&r are a rare alloy made from the &#00D9FFWither's&r power and ancient technology." "They are used for advanced equipment and the &#00D9FFMechanical Fusion Anvil&r."]
	quest.24F78DA0E1A26044.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Witherite Ingot"
	quest.251E00BBEC2EDCFA.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAncient Remnant Music Disc&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a rare trophy tied to the &#00D9FFAncient Remnant&r." "Get it as proof that you beat the &#00D9FFCursed Pyramid's&r guardian."]
	quest.251E00BBEC2EDCFA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Ancient Remnant"
	quest.25356A67D756C072.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDragonskin Spell Book&r is the legendary &#00D9FFEnder&r spellbook. It gives 12 spell slots, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFEnder Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+200&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r." "It is crafted from &#00D9FFDragonskin&r, which you get from the &#00D9FFEnder Dragon&r."]
	quest.25356A67D756C072.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dragonskin Spell Book"
	quest.254B230173E70CD9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFDimension Key&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.254B230173E70CD9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dimension Key"
	quest.2553E9331113FD0A.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFIndustrial Hemp Seeds&r drop from tall grass. &#00D9FFThree Hemp Fibers&r craft into one &#00D9FFString&r."]
	quest.2553E9331113FD0A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hemp Fiber and 4x Seed"
	quest.255CB19132A69AF6.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGauntlet of Maelstrom&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a legendary gauntlet that releases strong wind attacks against enemies." "It is a rare treasure obtained from the ocean depths and the creatures that live there."]
	quest.255CB19132A69AF6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gauntlet of Maelstrom"
	quest.255CB19132A69AF6.title: "Gauntlet Of Maelstrom"
	quest.2566471D73D027C8.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFCrystalite Boots&r with an &#00D9FFInfusion Ritual&r using &#00D9FFTerminite Boots&r, an &#00D9FFAmber Gem and Crystal Shards&r around an &#00D9FFInfusion Pedestal&r." "They give permanent &#00D9FFSpeed I&r, which is handy for exploring the End."]
	quest.2566471D73D027C8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystalite Boots"
	quest.2566471D73D027C8.title: "Crystalite Boots"
	quest.256FBFEF574E2952.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.256FBFEF574E2952.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Crushing Factory"
	quest.2596249D0CC9CEE1.title: "Naga"
	quest.259C2D5026BA9FA8.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Functional Storage&r focuses on compact, high-capacity drawers and storage controllers. Use it for bulk resources and explore how drawers connect into a larger storage setup."]
	quest.259C2D5026BA9FA8.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.25A3B35B337A45CB.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCrafting Terminal&r combines an &#00D9FFME Terminal&r with a crafting grid, letting you craft from items stored on the network."]
	quest.25A3B35B337A45CB.title: "Craft from the Network"
	quest.25A3C0F0E2768D27.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFNano Quantum&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.25A5D615A1B73D04.quest_desc: ["Tip: even for contraptions not meant to travel on rails, &#00D9FFCart Assemblers&r are handy for placing contraptions into the world, or converting back to contraption form, and then picking them up again in item form with a &#00D9FFWrench&r."]
	quest.25A5D615A1B73D04.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cart Assembler"
	quest.25A9152D76C456C9.quest_desc: ["Changes a &#00D9FFVanilla&r storage to a &#FFA500Sophisticated Storage&r version."]
	quest.25A9152D76C456C9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Tier Upgrade"
	quest.25A95728488E9D44.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFDisplay Link&r from &#FFA500Create&r. It reads information from compatible blocks and shows it on &#00D9FFNixie Tubes&r, &#00D9FFDisplay Boards&r, &#00D9FFSigns&r, &#00D9FFHanging Signs and Lecterns&r." "It can display item names, inventory levels, train status, rotation speed, stress, fluid information and more. Its default range is &#00D9AA64 blocks&r."]
	quest.25A95728488E9D44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Display Link"
	quest.25ABEB94E3FA8B8A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFAvocado Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.25ABEB94E3FA8B8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Avocado Sapling"
	quest.25AD32BAD3D376AB.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMechanical Mixer&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.25AD32BAD3D376AB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Mixer"
	quest.25B43F14C8AFB5BE.quest_desc: ["The &#FFA500Cooking for Blockheads&r I book lists the dishes you can make with the ingredients in your inventory."]
	quest.25B43F14C8AFB5BE.quest_subtitle: "See what you can cook right now"
	quest.25B95CC6282843E1.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFStarlight Crystal Blocks&r are dense formations of condensed crystal energy in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "They are not needed for progression or crafting, so collecting them is optional and mostly for display."]
	quest.25B95CC6282843E1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 10x Red Starlight Crystal Block and 10x Blue Starlight Crystal Block"
	quest.25B95CC6282843E1.title: "Starlight Crystal Blocks"
	quest.25B9B8A5B2FCF4FC.quest_desc: ["Found in the &#00D9FFBronze Dungeon&r."]
	quest.25B9B8A5B2FCF4FC.quest_subtitle: "Get the Hammer of Kingbdogz"
	quest.25BB0F8CD8EDB2F4.quest_desc: ["This Bank has 27 slots and holds up to 4,096 items."]
	quest.25BB0F8CD8EDB2F4.quest_subtitle: "The third Bank tier"
	quest.25D175092F36F6E9.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFME Packing Tape&r can pack in-world &#00D9FFME Devices&r into a packaged &#00D9FFDevice&r item. How? Sneak + &#00D9FFMouse Right Click&r on a &#00D9FFDevice&r with the tape, and you can get a packaged item from it. All settings and inventory of the device will be kept. It can be very useful when you're moving your ME setup."]
	quest.25D175092F36F6E9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Me Packing Tape"
	quest.25D18AEB0F3247E5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFScrewdriver&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.25D18AEB0F3247E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Screwdriver"
	quest.25E265B81518E939.quest_desc: ["Find a &#00D9FFTrial Chamber&r hidden deep underground. These halls are built from tuff and copper and hold traps, &#00D9FFTrial Spawners&r, &#00D9FFVaults&r and strong enemies." "A &#00D9FFJourneyman Cartographer&r can sell you a &#00D9FFTrial Explorer Map&r that leads to the nearest chamber."]
	quest.25E265B81518E939.title: "Trial Chambers"
	quest.25E29897EFBC2C48.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Terminite Forged Plate&r from a &#00D9FFTerminite Ingot&r at an &#00D9FFAnvil&r with a &#00D9FFSmith Hammer&r." "It is the base component for a full set of &#00D9FFTerminite&r armor at the &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r."]
	quest.25E29897EFBC2C48.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Forged Plate"
	quest.25E2D4C241857FA5.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCrystal Crossbow&r is a ranged weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It belongs to the advanced equipment tier and is tied to crystalline materials found in the dimension."]
	quest.25E2D4C241857FA5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Crossbow"
	quest.25E2D4C241857FA5.title: "Crystal Crossbow"
	quest.25E6BA239766CA24.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFire Rune&r is a crafting ingredient in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r, used for advanced &#00D9FFFire&r crafting such as &#00D9FFFire Upgrade Orbs&r. It is the &#00D9FFFire&r-school &#00D9FFRunestone&r." "Combine a &#00D9FFBlank Runestone&r with 8 &#00D9FFBlaze Rods&r to make one. &#00D9FFBlaze Rods&r are the &#00D9FFFire Focus&r."]
	quest.25E6BA239766CA24.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fire Rune"
	quest.25F29894B20B4F91.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPowered Centrifuge&r takes FE to run at an increased processing speed."]
	quest.25F29894B20B4F91.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Powered Centrifuge"
	quest.25FA77113A39AC1A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHydra Chop&r is a rare meat dropped only by the &#00D9FFHydra&r. Cook it to get one of the most filling meals in the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r." "It restores a large amount of hunger, which suits long expeditions."]
	quest.25FA77113A39AC1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hydra Chop"
	quest.26077C7A671CCB3C.quest_desc: ["Place a &#00D9FFSeashelf&r in the enchanting table and use &#00D9FFInfusion&r. You need at least 45 &#00D9FFEterna&r, &#00D9AA15%&r &#00D9FFQuanta&r and &#00D9AA10%&r &#00D9FFArcana&r." "It gives &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFEterna&r (up to 60) and &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFArcana&r, and is the base for every advanced &#00D9FFSeashelf&r."]
	quest.26077C7A671CCB3C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Infused Seashelf"
	quest.261F7779BF98276C.quest_desc: ["Craft it from &#00D9FFMelons&r, &#00D9FFGlistering Melon Slices&r and a bookshelf." "It gives &#00D9AA-10&r &#00D9FFQuanta&r and &#00D9AA-2&r &#00D9FFEterna&r. Use it to reduce randomness and get more predictable enchantments."]
	quest.261F7779BF98276C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Melonshelf"
	quest.263514F80166F55F.quest_desc: ["To find the &#00D9FFStarlight Golem&r, hold the &#00D9FFSeeking Eye&r in your main hand and one of these items in your off-hand: Redstone, &#00D9FFGolem Steel Ingot&r or &#00D9FFOxidized Steel Ingot&r." "Without one of them the Eye will not lead you there."]
	quest.263514F80166F55F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.263514F80166F55F.title: "Find Boss"
	quest.263674C310D18958.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFArcanist Hood&r, &#00D9FFArcanist Robes&r, &#00D9FFArcanist Leggings and Arcanist Boots&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.263674C310D18958.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcanist Hood, Arcanist Robes, Arcanist Leggings and Arcanist Boots"
	quest.2643F5CF4596D650.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFDruidic Spell Book&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2643F5CF4596D650.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Druidic Spell Book"
	quest.264D4CDC6A0D788B.quest_desc: ["Like &#00D9FFthe Pump Upgrade&r, but it also works with fluid containers in your hand and fluid blocks in the world. You can filter which fluid gets pumped."]
	quest.264D4CDC6A0D788B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Pump Upgrade"
	quest.265190C39B930E70.quest_desc: ["Measure how much energy, in the form of &#00D9FFStress Units&r, your contraptions are generating and consuming, or how fast they are working."]
	quest.265190C39B930E70.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stressometer and Speedometer"
	quest.26546192A8EB52F1.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.26546192A8EB52F1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Pull"
	quest.266AEBC814987316.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBalsa Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.266AEBC814987316.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Balsa Sapling"
	quest.267EF67CCDE6D2C6.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCoke Oven&r works slowly, so build two or three early to keep your &#00D9FFCoal Coke&r stocked. One piece of coal yields &#00D9AA500 mB&r of &#00D9FFCreosote Oil&r, while a log yields only &#00D9AA250 mB&r."]
	quest.267EF67CCDE6D2C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 27x Cokebrick"
	quest.267EF67CCDE6D2C6.title: "Coke Oven"
	quest.2681E9502A687D30.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPerform the Ritual of Binding&r near a creature to get its bound script. One ritual can convert several at once." "Familiars have HP, but you can resummon them from the book if they die. Each familiar has its own effects, so check the book for details." "A summoned familiar reserves part of your source bar until you dispel it."]
	quest.2681E9502A687D30.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Familiar Starbuncle, Familiar Wixie, Familiar Amethyst Golem and 3 more items"
	quest.2681E9502A687D30.title: "Familiars"
	quest.2692F67AA6DA0F0B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSculk Sensor&r detects nearby vibrations such as footsteps or dropped items and emits a redstone signal." "Sneaking or walking on wool keeps it from noticing you."]
	quest.2692F67AA6DA0F0B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sculk Sensor and Calibrated Sculk Sensor"
	quest.269349E72E941AEB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFNether Brick Nest&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.269349E72E941AEB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Brick Nest"
	quest.26B9A1BD247ACE9B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFTeak Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.26B9A1BD247ACE9B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Teak Sapling"
	quest.26D15AAA1E70943C.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHoly Upgrade Orb&r is an upgrade material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Applied at the &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r, it gives &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFHoly Spell Power&r." "Craft it from 1 &#00D9FFEmpty Upgrade Orb&r and 8 &#00D9FFHoly Runes&r. By default, an applicable item can take up to 3 &#00D9FFUpgrade Orbs&r."]
	quest.26D15AAA1E70943C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Holy Upgrade Orb"
	quest.26D40F0FE4F4FF0B.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Incendium&r overhauls &#00D9FFNether&r terrain and exploration with new regions and points of interest. Travel through the &#00D9FFNether&r to discover its custom generation."]
	quest.26D40F0FE4F4FF0B.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.26E25367420EC532.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDeepsilver Chestplate&r is crafted from &#00D9FFDeepsilver Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Deepsilver armor raises movement speed, attack speed and knockback resistance. The full set also grants immunity to several negative status effects."]
	quest.26E25367420EC532.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Chestplate"
	quest.26E7A376DAAB455E.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFLeather&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.26FC791720C2AC14.quest_desc: ["The highest &#00D9FFWorld Tier&r. Equip a full set of &#00D9FFEpic Affix Gear&r (helmet, chestplate, leggings, boots and weapon), then defeat the &#00D9FFEnder Dragon&r."]
	quest.26FC791720C2AC14.quest_subtitle: "Reach World Tier: Pinnacle"
	quest.26FC791720C2AC14.title: "Pinnacle"
	quest.27065243D9D23777.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFWand&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.27065243D9D23777.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wand"
	quest.2711A6E34164DAE2.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFVitality Ankh&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is an ancient accessory that makes the wearer harder to kill and helps in deadly situations." "It is made from rare materials."]
	quest.2711A6E34164DAE2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vitality Ankh"
	quest.271A7748E93D9DB5.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFShadow Claws&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.271A7748E93D9DB5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shadow Claws"
	quest.271AC2BEE48B4A85.quest_desc: ["To put a mob in the jar, run the &#00D9FFRitual of Containment&r with the jar within &#00D9AA3 blocks&r of the &#00D9FFRitual Brazier&r and the mob within &#00D9AA6 blocks&r. You can pause the ritual with a redstone signal." "To release it, sneak and right-click the jar with a &#00D9FFDispel&r spell." "Some mobs are blacklisted. Hold the jar with the mob to check, or enable advanced tooltips and look for the jar_blacklist tag on the spawn egg."]
	quest.271AC2BEE48B4A85.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mob Jar"
	quest.272340E3885E2B29.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMagmator Niotic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.272340E3885E2B29.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magmator Niotic"
	quest.272D38871F3F739A.quest_desc: ["Look for a &#00D9FFRuined Portal&r in the End style."]
	quest.272D38871F3F739A.quest_subtitle: "Find an End-themed Ruined Portal"
	quest.2734EF1D692C320D.quest_desc: ["Generates a large amount of air from lightning strikes. Check &#00D9FFthe GUI&r for details."]
	quest.2734EF1D692C320D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electrostatic Compressor"
	quest.273E12E9CCDBBD6E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnchanted Spellbook&r has ten slots, for the more seasoned mage."]
	quest.273E12E9CCDBBD6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Spell Book"
	quest.27458EDF5F854368.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFStriderloaf&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.27458EDF5F854368.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Striderloaf"
	quest.275B4FC2986FE260.quest_desc: ["Grants immunity to knockback."]
	quest.275B4FC2986FE260.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steadfast Spikes"
	quest.275D4238928C567C.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCarp&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.275D4238928C567C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Carp"
	quest.275EE3BD321248D8.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.275EE3BD321248D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Purifying Factory"
	quest.276A9581F27678C8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSoulium Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.276A9581F27678C8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulium Seeds"
	quest.276B220CA49DBE53.quest_desc: ["Bring Riftmane into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.276B220CA49DBE53.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Riftmane"
	quest.2772596178EBED64.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBlazing Crystal Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2772596178EBED64.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazing Crystal Seeds"
	quest.277B64B85119DC38.quest_desc: ["Transfers energy."]
	quest.277B64B85119DC38.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cable Starter"
	quest.278066D4F5C2E248.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPortable Energy Interface&r from &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r moves &#00D9FFForge Energy&r to and from moving &#FFA500Create&r contraptions. When two interfaces meet, the contraption connects to an outside power network, which works well for electric trains and other moving machines."]
	quest.278066D4F5C2E248.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portable Energy Interface"
	quest.2787A61E2052E52B.quest_desc: ["A decorative block from &#FFA500Ars Nouveau&r to use if you want a little bit of glitz in your magical build."]
	quest.2787A61E2052E52B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Gilded Sourcestone Small Bricks"
	quest.278C7A854FA708EB.quest_desc: ["Ah, the humble &#00D9FFWater Wheel&r. It's the simplest first step to generating free power for &#FFA500Create&r, while also embodying rotational motion, an essential feature of &#FFA500Create&r."]
	quest.278C7A854FA708EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Water Wheel and Large Water Wheel"
	quest.27946D911EAB2C01.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFill the Etching Tank&r with &#00D9FFEtching Acid&r and insert &#00D9FFEmpty PCBs&r that have been exposed in a &#00D9FFUV Light Box&r. Optionally, you can heat the tank to above 50 degrees &#00D9FFCelsius&r to speed up the etching process, though this will cause the &#00D9FFEtching Acid&r to be consumed more rapidly. &#00D9FFExtract Unassembled PCBs&r from the sides and &#00D9FFFailed PCBs&r from the top or bottom of the tank."]
	quest.27946D911EAB2C01.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Etching Tank"
	quest.27A213407DC5A9C1.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFRefined Obsidian Ingot&r is an ingot created by placing &#00D9FFRefined Obsidian Dust&r into an &#00D9FFOsmium Compressor&r fueled with &#00D9FFLiquid Osmium&r (from &#00D9FFOsmium Ingots&r)."]
	quest.27A213407DC5A9C1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ingot Refined Obsidian"
	quest.27B6BEBD335F2FF5.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFIron&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.27BC33EE0CF97657.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSugar Apple Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.27BC33EE0CF97657.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sugar Apple Sapling"
	quest.27C1A6C5B2BA3DD9.quest_desc: ["This is the ultimate generator. The &#00D9FFPlasma Turbine&r uses &#00D9FFHelium Plasma&r to produce energy, up to 1,048,576 EU/t. This is about 100,000 EU per millibucket of &#00D9FFHelium Plasma&r, and a consumption rate of about 11 mb/t. As long as you know how to care for your factory, you will never need to worry about power ever again."]
	quest.27C1A6C5B2BA3DD9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 18x Iridium Machine Casing Pipe, 17x Plasma Handling Iridium Machine Casing and Plasma Turbine"
	quest.27C1A6C5B2BA3DD9.title: "Plasma Turbine"
	quest.27D840D1ED7B4A09.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Botany Pots&r provide compact, automated plant and crop growing. Check which soils and plants are supported and use the pots where passive production is useful."]
	quest.27D840D1ED7B4A09.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.27DAA4AFB43FACD8.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFDesk Bell&r, &#00D9FFPeculiar Bell and Haunted Bell&r from &#FFA500Create&r. The &#00D9FFDesk Bell&r can emit a &#00D9FFRedstone&r pulse." "The &#00D9FFPeculiar Bell&r is a decorative brass bell that can be turned into a &#00D9FFHaunted Bell&r, which reveals areas where hostile mobs may spawn."]
	quest.27DAA4AFB43FACD8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Desk Bell, Peculiar Bell and Haunted Bell"
	quest.27DD33AE9F6D26B2.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.27DD33AE9F6D26B2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Evaporate"
	quest.27EF30AD84A37B69.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHandheld Drill&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r is a portable mechanical drill. It suits material processing and construction around your factory without a stationary drill setup."]
	quest.27EF30AD84A37B69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Handheld Drill"
	quest.27F746A43CE468A1.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.27F746A43CE468A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Accelerate"
	quest.27FE0D17D8F455FC.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.27FE0D17D8F455FC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Infusing Factory"
	quest.281BDD88E98AB6C4.quest_desc: ["Blazebloom goo will transform blocks of primal coal into raw blaze ember. 3–4 blaze embers will drop from it. Burns &#00D9AA9x&r more items than coal."]
	quest.281BDD88E98AB6C4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coal T2"
	quest.282D59A55A7CC317.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCarob Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.282D59A55A7CC317.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Carob Sapling"
	quest.2831583B930B6785.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFChargepad&r is a wireless electric charging station. Any rechargeable items you have in your inventory will be charged while standing on it."]
	quest.2831583B930B6785.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chargepad"
	quest.284F0ABEFEBE4425.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarlit Diamond Sword&r is a late-game weapon crafted from &#00D9FFStarlit Diamond&r materials, added in version 0.5.0." "It is a big upgrade over &#00D9FFGlacite and Springstone&r gear and gives steady high damage before true celestial weapons."]
	quest.284F0ABEFEBE4425.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starlit Diamond Sword"
	quest.285A43D3899B024F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCell Component&r 1m. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.285A43D3899B024F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 1m"
	quest.285A8EBB0EE1213C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBlazegold Shovel&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.285A8EBB0EE1213C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazegold Shovel"
	quest.28660792B2E7DFA1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPlasma Turbine&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.28660792B2E7DFA1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plasma Turbine"
	quest.28660792B2E7DFA1.title: "Better than Nuclear Fission"
	quest.286803C3862A73DB.quest_desc: ["Starbuncle shards may be obtained in loot chests or by giving a starbuncle a gold nugget. Starbuncle shards are used to create starbuncle charms."]
	quest.286803C3862A73DB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starbuncle Shards"
	quest.286F45B6BBCDD643.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium Watering Can&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.286F45B6BBCDD643.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Watering Can"
	quest.2878FE5987B9D729.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCelestigem Shovel&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2878FE5987B9D729.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Shovel"
	quest.28824A6D88394A59.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFElectrum Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.28824A6D88394A59.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electrum Seeds"
	quest.288948A50665C30C.quest_desc: ["Causes explosions on impact. Avoid using it at close range!"]
	quest.288948A50665C30C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo Explosive"
	quest.289135A3C02884B6.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFIgnitium Ingots&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r mainly drop after defeating &#00D9FFIgnis&r." "They are used to craft some of the mod's strongest weapons, armor and relics."]
	quest.289135A3C02884B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignitium Ingot"
	quest.28A030D3FB585CF0.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLaser Gatling&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a ranged weapon that fires the same laser technology as &#00D9FFThe Harbinger&r." "It uses &#00D9FFRedstone&r as ammunition and can ignite blocks when fired."]
	quest.28A030D3FB585CF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Laser Gatling"
	quest.28A030D3FB585CF0.title: "Laser Gatling"
	quest.28A2EC44C6BDAB77.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFNetherite Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.28A2EC44C6BDAB77.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Netherite Seeds"
	quest.28B3E3D17FF3E0DD.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.28B83DF11CFA3A77.quest_desc: ["Like &#00D9FFthe Void Upgrade&r, with more filtering options."]
	quest.28B83DF11CFA3A77.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Void Upgrade"
	quest.28C4E37E68DAFAA9.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFNether Stove&r is a cooking station from &#FFA500My Nether's Delight&r made for dishes that use &#00D9FFNether&r ingredients." "It carries the cooking mechanics of &#FFA500Farmer's Delight&r into the &#00D9FFNether&r."]
	quest.28C4E37E68DAFAA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Bricks Stove"
	quest.28CF75BB46B75616.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFAlchemist Cauldron&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.28CF75BB46B75616.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemist Cauldron"
	quest.28D107C396ED1708.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPyrium Staff&r is a powerful &#00D9FFFire&r staff in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. In the main hand it gives 9 &#00D9FFAttack Damage&r, 1.5 &#00D9FFAttack Speed&r, &#00D9AA+15%&r &#00D9FFFire Spell Power&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFCast Time Reduction&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "It is crafted from 2 &#00D9FFPyrium Ingots&r, 1 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFNetherite Ingot&r."]
	quest.28D107C396ED1708.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyrium Staff"
	quest.28DF24A859ECBF2A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCapacitor Mv&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.28DF24A859ECBF2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor Mv"
	quest.28E100D9327D6454.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBallistarian Bracer&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.28E100D9327D6454.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ballistarian Bracer"
	quest.28E8F26DD82B73B8.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEgg Sandwich&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.28E8F26DD82B73B8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Egg Sandwich"
	quest.28F86392E0F9B71B.quest_desc: ["An &#00D9FFExtend Time&r flask and the &#00D9FFWixie Thread&r each act as a multiplier on potion duration."]
	quest.28F86392E0F9B71B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Potion Flask, Potion Flask Amplify and Potion Flask Extend Time"
	quest.2915EA2D06CCD0BA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnigma&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2915EA2D06CCD0BA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enigma"
	quest.29196147E5BD3ED7.quest_desc: ["Defeat a &#00D9FFShriek Worm&r." "Listen for its shriek, since it can strike from the ground."]
	quest.29196147E5BD3ED7.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Shriek Worm"
	quest.29196147E5BD3ED7.title: "Shriek Worm"
	quest.291C23C4D79B0B97.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFCursium Boots&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r by upgrading &#00D9FFNetherite Boots&r with a &#00D9FFCursium Upgrade Smithing Template&r and a &#00D9FFCursium Ingot&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "They belong to the &#00D9FFCursium&r armor set and grant the &#00D9FFGhostly Weightless&r ability, which reduces fall damage and allows a quick backdash."]
	quest.291C23C4D79B0B97.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cursium Boots"
	quest.29259F3FA0002C4D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFThread Heights&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.29259F3FA0002C4D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Heights"
	quest.2928C01693842EA6.quest_desc: ["Provides a touch spell before damaging an entity."]
	quest.2928C01693842EA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanters Sword"
	quest.29310AD0FC5238D1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEcho Glove&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.29310AD0FC5238D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Echo Glove"
	quest.29345E31ADD5A560.title: "Minoshroom"
	quest.2946A9ECB5F12A71.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFItem Pipes&r work just about the same as &#00D9FFFluid Pipes&r, aside from they will transport items and is much more configurable. Just like &#00D9FFFluid&r pipes, they will not connect to inventories by default, but you still can force a connection. If you right click a connection without a &#00D9FFWrench&r, you'll see a filter. This filter can be set to many different items at the same time and by default is set to whitelist. This means only items in the filter will be transported through the connection. Blacklist will disallow any items set to the filter to be transported through the connection. Item pipes will insert items into higher priorities first, and transfer 16 items every &#00D9AA3 seconds&r, but can be upgraded with &#00D9FFMotors&r for higher thoughput."]
	quest.2946A9ECB5F12A71.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Item Pipe"
	quest.2946A9ECB5F12A71.title: "Item Transportation"
	quest.29520A3ED368CCC6.quest_desc: ["The drill that will push you into the far bounds of technology. Made of that super light yet strong &#00D9FFTitanium&r from before, you'll be able to power your reactors and enter the quantum age."]
	quest.29520A3ED368CCC6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Titanium Drill"
	quest.29520A3ED368CCC6.title: "Titanium Drill"
	quest.29524EEE5B7B2F09.quest_desc: ["A reactor needs 36 reactor blocks. Hold them and look at the ground to preview a 3x3 shape, which turns red if the reactor cannot be built there. The reactor is &#00D9AA4 blocks&r tall."]
	quest.29524EEE5B7B2F09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 36x Reactor Starter"
	quest.29524EEE5B7B2F09.title: "Reactor (Starter)"
	quest.295BAEC05F73DFC8.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9AA36x&r &#00D9FFReactor Spirited&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.295BAEC05F73DFC8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 36x Reactor Spirited"
	quest.2968FEE9CAE5ECFA.quest_desc: ["Explore &#FFA500Actually Additions&r, a technology and utility mod with generators, machines, farming tools, and automation. Use EMI to discover the recipes and available machines."]
	quest.2968FEE9CAE5ECFA.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.297F0BBC8526DAD2.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAdvanced Portal Gun&r works like the &#00D9FFPortal Gun&r and also lets you save locations to teleport to. Open the menu with V by default, and rebind it if it clashes with another key. It uses power and &#00D9FFPortal Fluid&r."]
	quest.297F0BBC8526DAD2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portalgun V2"
	quest.2980D0B0EF7E81AD.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFLeather&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.2982CA9B69CC80D9.quest_desc: ["Doesn't support buses so you must first step down from &#00D9FFDense&r to a smaller cable (such as &#00D9FFFluix ME Glass Cable&r or &#00D9FFFluix ME Smart Cable&r) before using buses or panels. Shows load similarly to &#00D9FFFluix ME Smart Cable&r, with each line lit representing four channels in use."]
	quest.2982CA9B69CC80D9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluix Smart Dense Cable"
	quest.2982CA9B69CC80D9.title: "Fluix Dense Smart Cable"
	quest.2982D24B3875C074.quest_desc: ["A Spawner is the base for automated mob spawning. Obtain one to start modifying how it behaves."]
	quest.2982D24B3875C074.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawner"
	quest.2982D24B3875C074.title: "Spawner"
	quest.298B31EEE9A6CA80.quest_desc: ["Blackthorn can mutate into a &#00D9FFPurple Blackthorn&r when growing."]
	quest.298B31EEE9A6CA80.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Purple Blackthorn Sapling"
	quest.299704EAC96A5A9F.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFRotational Chasis and Linear Chassis&r help build contraptions without superglue."]
	quest.299704EAC96A5A9F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Radial Chassis"
	quest.299F3ADB39580F09.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCherry Plum Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.299F3ADB39580F09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cherry Plum Sapling"
	quest.29A2417BC7C4CF22.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFWatcher Claymore&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.29A2417BC7C4CF22.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Watcher Claymore"
	quest.29AA5AF08298664E.quest_desc: ["This unit increases the amount of energy the device it's attached to can hold. It is stackable up to 8 times."]
	quest.29AA5AF08298664E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Module Energy Unit"
	quest.29B11DA9B93E295F.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.29B11DA9B93E295F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Toss"
	quest.29CB1AB88816993E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFZoglin Trophy&r is a decorative block from &#FFA500My Nether's Delight&r. Place it to show off a &#00D9FFZoglin&r victory or your time in the &#00D9FFNether&r."]
	quest.29CB1AB88816993E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Zoglin Trophy"
	quest.29CD44313F7C8890.quest_desc: ["After gathering enough &#00D9FFEntro Crystal&r, you can finally craft your first &#00D9FFExtended Machine&r frame. The foundation for &#00D9FFExtended&r machines."]
	quest.29CD44313F7C8890.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Machine Frame"
	quest.29DBDBD72FFB3B0A.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCrafting Storage&r combines a &#00D9FFCrafting Unit&r with a &#00D9FFCell Component&r. It stores the ingredients needed for crafting jobs inside an &#00D9FFME Crafting CPU&r."]
	quest.29DBDBD72FFB3B0A.title: "Build a 1k Crafting Storage"
	quest.29DEE94E205B70FE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFYellorium Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.29DEE94E205B70FE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Yellorium Seeds"
	quest.29E5A8912F28E362.quest_desc: ["Casts shorter."]
	quest.29E5A8912F28E362.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heavy Hook"
	quest.29EE576A9AEB5847.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9AA8x&r &#00D9FFWindmill Blade&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.29EE576A9AEB5847.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Windmill Blade"
	quest.29F87D3B2A3FE110.quest_desc: ["Koboletons often drop &#00D9FFAncient Metal Nuggets&r in &#FFA500Cataclysm&r, and you can also find them around the &#00D9FFDesert Site and Cursed Pyramid&r." "Combine 9 nuggets to craft an &#00D9FFAncient Metal Ingot&r."]
	quest.29F87D3B2A3FE110.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ancient Metal Nugget"
	quest.29FA5DF916F12B75.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFGold Dungeon&r."]
	quest.29FA5DF916F12B75.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the Gold Dungeon boss"
	quest.2A02F235E7D16773.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMega Energy Cell&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2A02F235E7D16773.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mega Energy Cell"
	quest.2A181B2512B8B9E3.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFNiotic Crystal Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2A181B2512B8B9E3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Niotic Crystal Seeds"
	quest.2A1DE7DDC9F28A8A.quest_desc: ["This scroll helps with automation."]
	quest.2A1DE7DDC9F28A8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mimic Scroll"
	quest.2A2B1C7AA042DD8C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSpellbreaker&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2A2B1C7AA042DD8C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spellbreaker"
	quest.2A3625D28EB81F48.quest_desc: ["Allows other blocks to interact with your inventory, armor, or off-hand slots."]
	quest.2A3625D28EB81F48.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Playeraccessor"
	quest.2A3ED465EF751F73.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFElectric Motor&r from &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r is the counterpart of the &#00D9FFAlternator&r. It turns &#00D9FFForge Energy&r (FE) into rotational power for &#FFA500Create&r machines." "You can set its RPM, and higher speeds cost more FE. It can output up to 2048 SU."]
	quest.2A3ED465EF751F73.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Motor"
	quest.2A5282A6DA2EC003.quest_desc: ["The enchanting apparatus is to be used with arcane pedestals and an arcane core."]
	quest.2A5282A6DA2EC003.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanting Apparatus"
	quest.2A542220C493CC66.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Boots&r are crafted from &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Like the rest of the set, they ignite attackers and reduce fire damage, which suits hot, dangerous areas."]
	quest.2A542220C493CC66.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Boots"
	quest.2A546E1CBF76E314.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.2A546E1CBF76E314.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Conjure Water"
	quest.2A60F513EF50520E.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFFluix Pearl&r is made from &#00D9FFFluix&r, &#00D9FFFluix Dust&r, and an &#00D9FFEnder Pearl&r. It is required for AE2 wireless components and the &#00D9FFQuantum Link Chamber&r."]
	quest.2A68199F937A6738.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500L2 Archery&r expands ranged combat with additional bows and related equipment. Try different options to find a range and firing style that suits you."]
	quest.2A68199F937A6738.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.2A78072DE4A7BC4E.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFLime Chalk&r is needed to summon spirits greater than &#00D9FFFoliot&r. It certifies your mastery of the basics of occultism."]
	quest.2A78072DE4A7BC4E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Lime Impure"
	quest.2A863F800ECF8FC0.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSteel Honey Extractor&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2A863F800ECF8FC0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Honey Extractor"
	quest.2A8AD3ECC97D43DF.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to not use durability."]
	quest.2A8AD3ECC97D43DF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Hook"
	quest.2A9C6DF952D5C630.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCardboard Helmet&r, &#00D9FFCardboard Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFCardboard Leggings&r and 2 more items into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2A9C6DF952D5C630.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cardboard Helmet, Cardboard Chestplate, Cardboard Leggings and 2 more items"
	quest.2A9F72752BF5EE0D.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBeef Stew&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2A9F72752BF5EE0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Beef Stew"
	quest.2AA4A4F7E35FED0D.quest_desc: ["Crafting tables and similar blocks show extra buttons next to the grid. Use them to rotate a recipe, balance the items or clear the grid quickly."]
	quest.2AA4A4F7E35FED0D.quest_subtitle: "Rotate, balance and clear."
	quest.2AA4A4F7E35FED0D.title: "Crafting Helpers"
	quest.2AA73197149F232B.quest_desc: ["MekaSuit can be upgraded with &#00D9FFModules&r that are installed with the &#00D9FFModification Station&r."]
	quest.2AA73197149F232B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mekasuit Bodyarmor"
	quest.2AAA0F80DE60239D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2AAA0F80DE60239D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.2ADBD3B1767199CE.quest_desc: ["Shift-right-click a block of the same type as the nest you want to find. For example, use a sand nest or a sand block to find a sand nest."]
	quest.2ADBD3B1767199CE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nest Locator"
	quest.2AF2F3EC474594A0.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSlumbering Lichblade&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2AF2F3EC474594A0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Slumbering Lichblade"
	quest.2AFA7666648A8747.quest_desc: ["Shrinks the wearer."]
	quest.2AFA7666648A8747.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charm of Shrinking"
	quest.2B1C02522047CF1B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFTertium Helmet&r, &#00D9FFTertium Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFTertium Leggings and Tertium Boots&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2B1C02522047CF1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tertium Helmet, Tertium Chestplate, Tertium Leggings and Tertium Boots"
	quest.2B1C02522047CF1B.title: "Tertium Armor"
	quest.2B2A77CE16A02E47.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFChain of Souls&r is a mysterious item from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r tied to higher-tier progression and dimensional entities."]
	quest.2B2A77CE16A02E47.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chain of Souls"
	quest.2B2A77CE16A02E47.title: "Chain Of Souls"
	quest.2B2D9F3C796D1809.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPadauk Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2B2D9F3C796D1809.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Padauk Sapling"
	quest.2B31535D5A9B99C8.quest_desc: ["The final goal. Completing it earns the &#00D9FFTrophy&r of the &#00D9FFOlder Angler&r."]
	quest.2B31535D5A9B99C8.quest_subtitle: "Catch all 131 fish"
	quest.2B3A54ACD04DE476.quest_desc: ["The Immolator from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a legendary weapon that sets enemies on fire with every hit." "You get it from the &#00D9FFBurning Arena&r."]
	quest.2B3A54ACD04DE476.quest_subtitle: "Obtain The Immolator"
	quest.2B3A54ACD04DE476.title: "The Immolator"
	quest.2B41351F1A9D11A9.quest_desc: ["This is the electric version of the &#00D9FFSteam Blast Furnace&r. The &#00D9FFElectric Blast Furnace&r (aka EBF) uses induction heating to produce extreme temperatures, unlocking a plethora of new recipes. Plus, its overclock is bounded to 128 EU/t by default, just like other multi-block electric machines. The &#00D9FFElectronic Blast Furnace&r or EBF is made out of purely &#00D9FFHeatproof Machine Casings and Cupronickel Coils&r. Use your &#00D9FFWrench&r to see the mutliblock's shape and block placement. The controller is placed on the bottom layer and hatches and be placed on the top or bottom layer. Don't forget to add an &#00D9FFEnergy Input Hatch&r(es) or the EBF won't have any energy to run! Start with a &#00D9FFLV Energy Input Hatch&r and you can upgrade to higher tier &#00D9FFEnergy Input Hatches&r when you have the appropriate power tiers. Remember, the &#00D9FFLV Energy Input Hatch&r will only connect to LV cables. You'll also need item or fluid input hatches and item or fluid output hatches based off of the use case of the EBF. Check your EMI for it's new recipes and choose hatches based off your needs."]
	quest.2B41351F1A9D11A9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 14x Heatproof Machine Casing, 16x Cupronickel Coil and Electric Blast Furnace"
	quest.2B41351F1A9D11A9.title: "Electric Blast Furnace"
	quest.2B46B184A6DCB459.quest_desc: ["Biomass is an organic fuel from &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r. It can be processed into &#00D9FFBiomass Pellets&r and burned as a renewable fuel for your factory. The mod also lets you process it further into &#00D9FFBioethanol&r."]
	quest.2B46B184A6DCB459.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Biomass"
	quest.2B4B4235D47A4111.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFToaster&r turns bread into toast."]
	quest.2B4B4235D47A4111.quest_subtitle: "Turns bread into toast"
	quest.2B4BE453E6F5DC6B.quest_desc: ["MekaSuit can be upgraded with &#00D9FFModules&r that are installed with the &#00D9FFModification Station&r."]
	quest.2B4BE453E6F5DC6B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mekasuit Helmet"
	quest.2B54DC789F7EA9B2.quest_desc: ["You can use the &#00D9FFHeat Exchanger&r to, well, exchange heat. You can recover the &#00D9FFHigh Pressure Water&r to be used for another cycle. Remember that pressurizing &#00D9FFWater&r into &#00D9FFHigh Pressure Water&r costs a lot of energy, but the turbine will not necessarily give it back."]
	quest.2B54DC789F7EA9B2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heat Exchanger, 9x Frostproof Machine Casing, 9x Heatproof Machine Casing and 19x Stainless Steel Machine Casing Pipe"
	quest.2B54DC789F7EA9B2.title: "Heat Exchanger"
	quest.2B5AACFAB8A0F145.quest_desc: ["The Rod o' &#00D9FFLightning&r gives you a &#00D9AA+15%&r &#00D9FFSpell Cooldown Reduction and Lightning Spell Power&r, it also gives a &#00D9AA5%&r scroll power to non-lighting &#00D9FFScrolls&r. Use this to help cast spells more efficiently."]
	quest.2B5AACFAB8A0F145.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lightning Rod"
	quest.2B63B96C8B7EC0A5.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFMeef Stroganoff&r is made from &#00D9FFMeef&r, a rare meat dropped by the &#00D9FFMinoshroom&r. It restores a large amount of hunger." "It is a good meal to eat before heading deeper into the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r."]
	quest.2B63B96C8B7EC0A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Meef Stroganoff"
	quest.2B67B8D212905618.quest_desc: ["The Annihilator is a powerful &#FFA500Cataclysm&r endgame weapon, part of the mod's strongest arsenal." "You can upgrade it using the &#00D9FFMechanical Fusion Anvil&r."]
	quest.2B67B8D212905618.quest_subtitle: "Obtain The Annihilator"
	quest.2B67B8D212905618.title: "The Annhilator"
	quest.2B6C634F9680C682.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Hammer&r is crafted from &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Its strikes are slow but powerful with high knockback, which helps control crowds in mid-tier combat."]
	quest.2B6C634F9680C682.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Hammer"
	quest.2B748F6675CE603C.quest_desc: ["Used to heal or harm nearby entities. Also used to cure zombie villages."]
	quest.2B748F6675CE603C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Restoration"
	quest.2B7662026F1ABA0F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFHotdog&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2B7662026F1ABA0F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hotdog"
	quest.2B79B6DC990E011E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSorcerer Hood&r, &#00D9FFSorcerer Robes&r, &#00D9FFSorcerer Leggings and Sorcerer Boots&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2B79B6DC990E011E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sorcerer Hood, Sorcerer Robes, Sorcerer Leggings and Sorcerer Boots"
	quest.2B79B6DC990E011E.title: "Sorceror's Clothes"
	quest.2B7B18645BCAAC87.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFStarlit Diamonds&r are among the rarest treasures in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "They represent a higher material tier, and finding one means you are reaching the deeper, more dangerous parts of the dimension."]
	quest.2B7B18645BCAAC87.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starlit Diamond"
	quest.2B7B18645BCAAC87.title: "Starlit Diamond"
	quest.2B83605219431758.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSmart Filter&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2B83605219431758.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.2B83605219431758.title: "Boots"
	quest.2B8651AF164921EA.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMolecular Assembler&r crafts recipes automatically when supplied with ingredients by an ME network. It uses both core types and a crafting table."]
	quest.2B9EAD6614A7D8BE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBattery Starter&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2B9EAD6614A7D8BE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Battery Starter"
	quest.2BBE038357B06D7F.quest_desc: ["Crafted with an &#00D9FFIron Block&r in a &#00D9FFCharger&r used to make the &#00D9FFEnergy Processor&r."]
	quest.2BBE038357B06D7F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Processor Press"
	quest.2BC324F66DC5F41E.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Create&r is a mod of many talents. Mechanize parts and resources, farm, produce energy, add mechanical movement to your builds, build and schedule trains with a mail delivery network, move and store items and fluids, and build a smart factory. You can also copy and paste builds, and fill, drain or explore bodies of water or lava." "These quests are not a set path, so tackle them in any order."]
	quest.2BC324F66DC5F41E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 64x Andesite and 64x Zinc Nugget"
	quest.2BC867860E656705.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2BC867860E656705.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.2BC96850FFA89420.quest_desc: ["Adding a &#00D9FFCompression Card&r to your &#00D9FFBulk Storage Cell&r makes it automatically compress items/blocks to higher tiers of compression. Ex. Nuggets -> &#00D9FFIngots&r -> &#00D9FFBlocks&r. You'll also want a &#00D9FFDecompression Module&r somewhere on your network to also automatically de-compress items as needed. NOTE: &#00D9FFDecompression Module NEEDS&r to be on the same network as your autocrafting, otherwise your autocrafters can't see those items."]
	quest.2BC96850FFA89420.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Decompression Module and Compression Card"
	quest.2BC96850FFA89420.title: "Bulk Cell Compression"
	quest.2BE6FA0EE7E3BBC7.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnder Gate Basic&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2BE6FA0EE7E3BBC7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Gate Basic"
	quest.2BF7C8EEC063D3BA.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFRedstone Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2BF7C8EEC063D3BA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Seeds"
	quest.2C00296A5307B856.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFLv Steam Turbine&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2C00296A5307B856.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lv Steam Turbine"
	quest.2C00296A5307B856.title: "Better Than Solar Panels"
	quest.2C041BAE70CBDF25.quest_desc: ["A pre-programmed &#00D9FFDrone&r that harvests fully-grown crops within a 17x17x17 area centered on the position it's deployed from. This Drone has two basic modes depending on how it is deployed: Deploying on the ground will tell the drone to harvest any fully-grown crops within its area. Deploying on top of an inventory containing a Hoe will tell the drone to replant any crops it harvests within its area."]
	quest.2C041BAE70CBDF25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Harvesting Drone"
	quest.2C118A714F627961.quest_desc: ["This is the most basic &#00D9FFSpellbook&r, it can only hold five &#00D9FFSpells&r."]
	quest.2C118A714F627961.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Spell Book"
	quest.2C15DC88A479EF67.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFAndesite Alloy&r is key to starting out with &#FFA500Create&r. When mining early on, grab as much &#00D9FFAndesite&r as you can, and gather &#00D9FFZinc&r too so your &#00D9FFIron&r is free for other uses."]
	quest.2C15DC88A479EF67.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 32x Andesite Alloy"
	quest.2C1A94A6E32598DE.quest_desc: ["With just some crushed osmium, you can reinforce a plastic block. This makes it blast proof."]
	quest.2C1A94A6E32598DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Reinforced Plastic"
	quest.2C3882541DC61D09.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMagmator Basic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2C3882541DC61D09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magmator Basic"
	quest.2C45BFF5C0057F93.quest_desc: ["Obtain a full set of &#00D9FFChainmail Armor&r. It cannot normally be crafted, so each piece has to come from exploration, combat or trading." "It is lighter than plate armor but still offers reliable protection."]
	quest.2C45BFF5C0057F93.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chainmail Helmet, Chainmail Chestplate, Chainmail Leggings and Chainmail Boots"
	quest.2C45BFF5C0057F93.title: "Chainmail Armor"
	quest.2C4C72B18E9B63D8.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBattery Spirited&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2C4C72B18E9B63D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Battery Spirited"
	quest.2C719C70906A361F.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFME Canner&r automates the filling of buckets and tanks with &#00D9FFFluids&r, &#FFA500Mekanism&r Gases, and &#FFA500Powah&r. NOTE: Only the top and bottom side can link to the network and power."]
	quest.2C719C70906A361F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Caner"
	quest.2C79B13131D2B4C9.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMalarite Spear&r is an early-game weapon in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r, crafted from &#00D9FFMalarite&r found in swamp biomes." "It gives extra reach in melee combat."]
	quest.2C79B13131D2B4C9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Malarite Spear"
	quest.2C98C57012256FC3.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2C98C57012256FC3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.2CBD4A0732FC13F3.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Pipez&r offers simple pipes for moving items, fluids, energy, and other resources. Check the pipe types and extraction settings to build straightforward transport networks."]
	quest.2CBD4A0732FC13F3.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.2CD15A00D4882907.quest_desc: ["Ceraunus from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a massive anchor with 16 &#00D9FFAttack Damage&r that you can throw at enemies." "While sneaking, it releases waves in a fan shape. Craft it with 2 &#00D9FFEssence&r of the &#00D9FFStorm&r and 3 &#00D9FFLacrima&r."]
	quest.2CD15A00D4882907.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ceraunus"
	quest.2CD15A00D4882907.title: "Ceraunus"
	quest.2CEE93E5F727C96D.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSteam Quarry&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2CEE93E5F727C96D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steam Quarry"
	quest.2CEE93E5F727C96D.title: "From Minecraft to Craft"
	quest.2CF23140C0FB9402.quest_desc: ["Upgrades a &#00D9FFDiamond&r tier or below to &#00D9FFNetherite&r tier."]
	quest.2CF23140C0FB9402.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic to Netherite Tier Upgrade, Copper to Netherite Tier Upgrade, Iron to Netherite Tier Upgrade and 2 more items"
	quest.2CF23140C0FB9402.title: "Netherite Tier Upgrade"
	quest.2D094F9F6979E457.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFElectrolytic Separator&r sends controlled amounts of direct current into a fluid, causing the atoms in the fluid to break their bonds."]
	quest.2D094F9F6979E457.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electrolytic Separator"
	quest.2D12317C92E58AEC.quest_desc: ["This substance can be processed in a &#00D9FFThermopneumatic Processing Plant&r to produce &#00D9FFGasoline&r, which is a high-quality liquid fuel. It can also be placed in a &#00D9FFFurnace&r."]
	quest.2D12317C92E58AEC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Kerosene Bucket"
	quest.2D12317C92E58AEC.title: "Kerosene"
	quest.2D12E9DA74DE5AEE.quest_desc: ["Craft a &#00D9FFSoulium Dagger&r with 2 &#00D9FFSoulium Ingots&r and 2 &#00D9FFSoulium Dust&r, + a &#00D9FFGold Sword&r."]
	quest.2D12E9DA74DE5AEE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulium Dagger"
	quest.2D2118635BD72D8A.quest_desc: ["Cannon your build plans right into the world, block by block."]
	quest.2D2118635BD72D8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Schematicannon"
	quest.2D256ACB9F5023CA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMusic Disc Relic&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2D256ACB9F5023CA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Relic"
	quest.2D3054CFE8DAABB7.quest_desc: ["It’s brass, it spins, and it looks fly. ‘&#00D9FFNuff&r said."]
	quest.2D3054CFE8DAABB7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flywheel"
	quest.2D367D77B2FCE2EC.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFDormant Relic&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2D367D77B2FCE2EC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dormant Relic"
	quest.2D4AC98F0BC97B9E.quest_desc: ["Halves the cook time of all smelting recipes, at the cost of double fuel use."]
	quest.2D4AC98F0BC97B9E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Augment Speed"
	quest.2D52722717950481.quest_desc: ["Relay connectors work like the standard ones and are useful for extending a line. A right-click with &#00D9FFWire Cutters&r removes a wire."]
	quest.2D52722717950481.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Connector Lv Relay, Connector Mv Relay and Connector Hv Relay"
	quest.2D56054439A7F592.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFHoney Bottle&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2D56054439A7F592.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honey Bottle"
	quest.2D61722043555825.quest_desc: ["Scylla is a major &#FFA500Cataclysm&r boss who rules the &#00D9FFAcropolis&r and uses powerful storm attacks." "&#00D9FFDefeating the Storm Empress&r is a serious challenge."]
	quest.2D61722043555825.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Scylla"
	quest.2D61722043555825.title: "Scylla"
	quest.2D63780DCA9A1181.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFIroko Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2D63780DCA9A1181.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iroko Sapling"
	quest.2D660DFFEBA60499.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarlit Diamond Chestplate&r is crafted from &#00D9FFStarlit Diamonds&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "&#00D9FFStarlit Diamond&r armor gives protection comparable to &#00D9FFNetherite&r, with higher armor toughness and knockback resistance."]
	quest.2D660DFFEBA60499.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starlit Diamond Chestplate"
	quest.2D691C127237602C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2D691C127237602C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.2D694373D070BBB7.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCutting Board&r from &#FFA500Farmer's Delight&r works with a knife to process and prepare ingredients. Use it to make components for various recipes and meals."]
	quest.2D694373D070BBB7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cutting Board"
	quest.2D6C3A0B84ED63DE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCapitaine&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2D6C3A0B84ED63DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capitaine"
	quest.2D70DDEDD235DAB2.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMutton Wrap&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2D70DDEDD235DAB2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mutton Wrap"
	quest.2D76F03DC14DD75E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFOtherstone&r trader will make acquiring &#00D9FFOtherstone&r a lot more convenient - and more efficient."]
	quest.2D76F03DC14DD75E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Stone, Granite and 2 more items. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Otherstone Trader"
	quest.2D76F03DC14DD75E.title: "Ritual: Summon Otherstone Trader"
	quest.2D812EFE8E4D00CA.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPersonal Barrel&r gives you a private storage space for keeping large quantities of items close at hand. Like &#00D9FFthe Personal Chest&r, its contents are tied to you, letting you access your stored items without needing to return to a specific location. Perfect for storing bulk resources while keeping your main storage system organized."]
	quest.2D812EFE8E4D00CA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Personal Barrel"
	quest.2D8585DF9E458843.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFQIO Importer&r imports items from external inventories into the &#00D9FFQIO System&r. You just need to set the frequency and, if wanted, the filter."]
	quest.2D8585DF9E458843.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Importer"
	quest.2D862C43FCD886D9.quest_desc: ["Bring Scroll into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2D862C43FCD886D9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scroll"
	quest.2D87B99EE5C6FA76.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to not use durability and increases luck."]
	quest.2D87B99EE5C6FA76.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Star Hook"
	quest.2D899272A04E21C0.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSpice Rack&r stores spices and ingredients, and the &#00D9FFFruit Basket&r stores fruit for recipes."]
	quest.2D899272A04E21C0.quest_subtitle: "Storage for spices and fruit"
	quest.2D9C8B320D9792C1.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.2D9C8B320D9792C1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Freeze"
	quest.2D9ECE4FFDD55C5C.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFWither Assault Shoulder Weapon&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a ranged weapon that fires &#00D9FFWither Missiles&r. They deal damage, explode and inflict &#00D9FFWither II&r." "While sneaking, it fires a &#00D9FFWither Grenade&r instead, which causes a damaging explosion and a cloud of &#00D9FFWither&r smoke."]
	quest.2D9ECE4FFDD55C5C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wither Assault Shoulder Weapon"
	quest.2D9ECE4FFDD55C5C.title: "Wither Assault Shoulder Weapon"
	quest.2DA0C2C268C6733F.quest_desc: ["A simple generator that makes power from fluid fuels: &#00D9FFBlaze Ember&r, &#00D9FFVoidflame and Eclipse Ember Fuel&r."]
	quest.2DA0C2C268C6733F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Generatorfluidt1"
	quest.2DA23C0F18EE5DBA.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500FramedBlocks&r lets you create decorative blocks that can take on the appearance of other block types. Experiment with its framing tools to match your builds."]
	quest.2DA23C0F18EE5DBA.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.2DAAA8C550817CC3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFHotdog With Mixed Salad&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2DAAA8C550817CC3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hotdog With Mixed Salad"
	quest.2DAF9989EF84E6A5.quest_desc: ["You can connect &#00D9FFTanks&r above and below using a &#00D9FFWrench&r, provided that either &#00D9FFTank&r is empty or both tanks contain the same fluid."]
	quest.2DAF9989EF84E6A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Small Tank"
	quest.2DB4A833BB76A0B8.quest_desc: ["A large container that combines your gene samples automatically. Fill it with genes and give it a redstone signal. It may not be the most efficient way, but it is automated."]
	quest.2DB4A833BB76A0B8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gene Indexer"
	quest.2DECE1CAF2767EAF.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBreadfruit Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2DECE1CAF2767EAF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Breadfruit Sapling"
	quest.2E1CADF1DFAF3400.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnergizing Rod Starter&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2E1CADF1DFAF3400.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energizing Rod Starter"
	quest.2E1D06AEA3264398.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSolar Panel Blazing&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2E1D06AEA3264398.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Panel Blazing"
	quest.2E211A404D8FB0F6.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFGreedy Familiars&r collect items for you. When put in a &#00D9FFFamiliar Ring&r, they enhance your item collection range."]
	quest.2E211A404D8FB0F6.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Greedy"
	quest.2E2ED2FB6F533318.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMusic Disc Mall&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2E2ED2FB6F533318.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Mall"
	quest.2E30F446C2E7B9B8.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFArtificer's Cane&r reduces cooldown and cast time and boosts your spell power. It costs more than the &#00D9FFGraybeard Staff&r but is worth it for larger spells."]
	quest.2E30F446C2E7B9B8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Artificer Cane"
	quest.2E324E6C4BE77CB8.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Crystalite Elytra&r with an &#00D9FFInfusion Ritual&r using an &#00D9FFElytra&r, an &#00D9FFAmber Gem&r, &#00D9FFEnchanted Membranes and Crystal Shards&r around an &#00D9FFInfusion Pedestal&r." "With the full &#00D9FFCrystalite&r set, it grants permanent &#00D9FFRegeneration I&r in addition to its own armor bonus."]
	quest.2E324E6C4BE77CB8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elytra Crystalite"
	quest.2E324E6C4BE77CB8.title: "Crystalite Elytra"
	quest.2E521EE279E6FC50.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFNether Star Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2E521EE279E6FC50.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Star Seeds"
	quest.2E5691C67FA084DA.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFAxolotl Bucket&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2E5691C67FA084DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Axolotl Bucket"
	quest.2E5EB499D7FE1C18.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFWire Connectors&r link your network together. A right-click with &#00D9FFWire Cutters&r removes a wire."]
	quest.2E5EB499D7FE1C18.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Connector Lv, Connector Mv and Connector Hv"
	quest.2E5EB499D7FE1C18.title: "Wire Connectors"
	quest.2E60ADCA289E3971.quest_desc: ["Makes the storage pickup items. Has more filtering options."]
	quest.2E60ADCA289E3971.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Pickup Upgrade"
	quest.2E801E4A1F6C5E8B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFProgramming Puzzle&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2E801E4A1F6C5E8B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Programming Puzzle"
	quest.2E84C8F00822E8E7.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.2E84C8F00822E8E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Interact"
	quest.2E84DCEFDC88E416.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFPhantom Helmet and Phantom Chestplate&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2E84DCEFDC88E416.quest_subtitle: "Get a full set of Phantom Armor"
	quest.2E84DCEFDC88E416.title: "Knight Armorer"
	quest.2E9DE83B6DD63E8F.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFNightfall Spiders&r appear in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r when darkness falls." "They are fast and aggressive and attack when visibility is lowest, so stay alert while exploring at night."]
	quest.2E9DE83B6DD63E8F.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Nightfall Spider"
	quest.2E9DE83B6DD63E8F.title: "Nightfall Spiders"
	quest.2EC0B4A186F56CBE.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAtomic Disassembler&r is &#FFA500Mekanism&r's an all-in-one tool, essentially the ultimate, electronic version of the paxel."]
	quest.2EC0B4A186F56CBE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Atomic Disassembler"
	quest.2EC1B3FDF5E38407.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFCopper Sheet&r from &#FFA500Create&r by using a &#00D9FFMechanical Press&r on a &#00D9FFCopper Ingot&r." "It is needed to craft &#00D9FFFluid Pipes&r, &#00D9FFCopper Casings&r, &#00D9FFFluid Tanks&r, &#00D9FFHose Pulleys&r and other &#FFA500Create&r components."]
	quest.2EC1B3FDF5E38407.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Copper Sheet"
	quest.2EC1B3FDF5E38407.title: "Copper Sheet"
	quest.2EE1C2797F3DB8CC.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFRoasted Mutton Chops&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2EE1C2797F3DB8CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Roasted Mutton Chops"
	quest.2EEEA37B3E6377D5.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAeternium Sword Handle&r is a component for assembling an &#00D9FFAeternium Sword&r at the &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "You need it to finish &#00D9FFBetter End's&r strongest sword."]
	quest.2EEEA37B3E6377D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Sword Handle"
	quest.2EF1323B1718D92A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSphere of Self Sacrifice&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2EF1323B1718D92A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sphere of Self Sacrifice"
	quest.2EF5B5BBFC3960D1.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCursed Pyramid&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a large dungeon that rarely generates in &#00D9FFDesert&r biomes and is the home of the &#00D9FFAncient Remnant&r. Expect traps, hidden chambers, &#00D9FFKoboletons&r, &#00D9FFKobolediators&r, &#00D9FFWadjet&r and good loot." "Craft &#00D9FFthe Eye of Desert&r to point toward the nearest one."]
	quest.2EF5B5BBFC3960D1.title: "Cursed Pyramid"
	quest.2EFB7C0BB0992BCF.quest_desc: ["Transfers source from jars within &#00D9AA5 blocks&r that are not linked."]
	quest.2EFB7C0BB0992BCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Relay Collector"
	quest.2F0063EFF941FA8A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFGhast Sourdough&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2F0063EFF941FA8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ghast Sourdough"
	quest.2F02E4C86BE994F2.quest_desc: ["Parchments are used to create spells at the scribe's table."]
	quest.2F02E4C86BE994F2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blank Parchment"
	quest.2F03AA4B82241628.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCoconut Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2F03AA4B82241628.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coconut Sapling"
	quest.2F070A65778E6176.quest_desc: ["Mage blooms are used to create source and magebloom fiber. They are also used in crafting potions of spell damage."]
	quest.2F070A65778E6176.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magebloom Crop"
	quest.2F08028A906BF599.quest_desc: ["Changes the initial health of spawned mobs, for easier or tougher farms."]
	quest.2F08028A906BF599.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Initial Health Spawner Rune"
	quest.2F08028A906BF599.title: "Initial Health Spawner Rune"
	quest.2F0E2CECFB76D915.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnder Gate Nitro&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2F0E2CECFB76D915.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Gate Nitro"
	quest.2F10826047FC0333.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Naga Scale Tunic&r from scales dropped by the &#00D9FFNaga&r. It is light chest armor with solid protection for early exploration." "It is the first unique armor set in the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r."]
	quest.2F10826047FC0333.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Naga Chestplate"
	quest.2F1946FD2029D1CE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFLiving Flesh&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2F1946FD2029D1CE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Living Flesh"
	quest.2F2B8F5566C164E7.quest_desc: ["Generates source from nearby mob deaths and animal breeding."]
	quest.2F2B8F5566C164E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vitalic Sourcelink"
	quest.2F2E9022F2636786.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFDiamond&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.2F3D85386518130B.quest_desc: ["Right-click a furnace to copy its settings, then shift right-click another one to paste them."]
	quest.2F3D85386518130B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Copy"
	quest.2F4604D007BADC7E.quest_desc: ["It looks like cake, but it is not. Check the chests of a &#00D9FFDark Tower&r."]
	quest.2F4604D007BADC7E.quest_subtitle: "Find Experiment 115"
	quest.2F5488A8E6E13C45.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBlank Pattern&r is used to make crafting recipes automated. You must encode the &#00D9FFBlank Pattern&r in the &#00D9FFPattern Encoder&r, then place it into a &#00D9FFPattern Provider&r."]
	quest.2F5488A8E6E13C45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blank Pattern"
	quest.2F59CE1A4C5472E9.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSilver Fir Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2F59CE1A4C5472E9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Silver Fir Sapling"
	quest.2F5C45CE820FBB48.quest_desc: ["Using &#00D9FFthe Scroll Forge&r and a &#00D9FFDivine Pearl&r to craft a &#00D9FFHoly Scrolls&r which are good for healing and effects."]
	quest.2F5C45CE820FBB48.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scroll"
	quest.2F62A706BD64D864.quest_desc: ["Generates power from coal at &#00D9AA80 FE&r/t."]
	quest.2F62A706BD64D864.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Furnator Basic"
	quest.2F6A5150A6659166.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFWild Cherry Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2F6A5150A6659166.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wild Cherry Sapling"
	quest.2F6D3F23A386C4A7.quest_desc: ["Bookwyrms can come to life by using your charm on a lectern. Bookwyrms can be dyed."]
	quest.2F6D3F23A386C4A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bookwyrm Charm"
	quest.2F80AE3986AA6F1E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRice Roll Medley Block&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2F80AE3986AA6F1E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rice Roll Medley Block"
	quest.2F813EC1C3F612D3.quest_desc: ["A basic portable bank with 9 slots, holding up to 256 items."]
	quest.2F813EC1C3F612D3.quest_subtitle: "Your first Bank"
	quest.2F8863FE62B8F318.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMusic Disc Creator Music Box&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2F8863FE62B8F318.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Creator Music Box"
	quest.2F89C13D2217724A.quest_desc: ["Right-click a bee to add it to the filter, and put the filter in a crafting grid to clear it. Only the bees on the filter can enter the hive."]
	quest.2F89C13D2217724A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Entity Filter"
	quest.2F8E6FBA4F3E20E9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFNetwork Tool&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.2F8E6FBA4F3E20E9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Network Tool"
	quest.2F93E8EFEAF5F042.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnergy Cell Niotic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.2F93E8EFEAF5F042.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell Niotic"
	quest.2F98029090E48C1A.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFImperium&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.2F9B0F159322A622.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFKnightmetal&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.2FB679F6448E58BB.quest_desc: ["Reach this goal to earn the &#00D9FFCopper Trophy&r."]
	quest.2FB679F6448E58BB.quest_subtitle: "Catch 25 common fish"
	quest.2FCA4AF4F12BEAB4.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFKnightmetal&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.2FD1A4027A379DF3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFTerminite Hammer&r is a heavy tool and weapon forged from &#00D9FFTerminite Ingots&r. It works at the &#00D9FFAnvil&r and delivers strong knockback in combat." "Terminite is made by smelting a &#00D9FFThallasium Ingot&r with &#00D9FFEnd Dust&r in an &#00D9FFEnd Stone Smeltery&r."]
	quest.2FD1A4027A379DF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Hammer"
	quest.2FD643F010F6BE93.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFDye Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.2FD643F010F6BE93.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dye Seeds"
	quest.2FD6D67A89093511.quest_desc: ["Haunted pots in the &#00D9FFAncient Temple&r drop &#00D9FFGloomsherds&r. Collect any one of them." "They can be combined into a &#00D9FFDecorated Pot&r as a keepsake from the &#00D9FFOtherside&r."]
	quest.2FD6D67A89093511.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.2FD6D67A89093511.title: "Gloomsherds"
	quest.2FE2CA7C9DACA357.quest_desc: ["Like &#00D9FFSmart Observers&r can observe both whats in front of them or the contents of what’s in front of them, &#00D9FFTrain Observers&r can observe passing trains or even their cargo."]
	quest.2FE2CA7C9DACA357.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Track Observer"
	quest.2FEE2E40891D99EB.title: "Trade with the pope"
	quest.2FF0F7CB24BA2E89.quest_desc: ["The Deepshelf is an awakened &#00D9FFDormant Deepshelf&r, made through &#00D9FFInfusion&r." "It gives &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFEterna&r (up to 70), &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFQuanta&r and &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFArcana&r, and is the base for the &#00D9FFEchoing and Soul&r-&#00D9FFTouched&r shelves."]
	quest.2FF0F7CB24BA2E89.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepshelf"
	quest.2FF811C77AC3A218.quest_desc: ["Brass is an alloy of &#00D9FFCopper and Zinc&r, and you need to visit the &#00D9FFNether&r to prepare for it. Bring several empty &#00D9FFBlaze Burners&r, which you can use on a &#00D9FFBlaze Spawner&r to capture as many blazes as you have burners. With Brass you can craft the &#00D9FFDeployer&r, which performs normal player actions, and smarter versions of the basic machines."]
	quest.2FF811C77AC3A218.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brass Ingot"
	quest.301AB83CA2B4E3C6.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFScarecrow Boots&r are part of the &#00D9FFScarecrow Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r and &#00D9AA+75&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r." "They are crafted from &#00D9FFHay Bales&r."]
	quest.301AB83CA2B4E3C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pumpkin Boots"
	quest.301D72ED46635A99.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.301D72ED46635A99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Cut"
	quest.301F789B908303AE.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStirling Engine&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r converts heat into rotational power. A temperature difference produces mechanical energy, giving your &#FFA500Create&r factory another power source."]
	quest.301F789B908303AE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stirling Engine"
	quest.302674153BDDF460.quest_desc: ["The core component of a &#00D9FFSpawner&r. Insert into a &#00D9FFPressurized Spawner&r to generate mobs from the essence stored within. &#00D9FFSpawner Cores&r taken from a &#00D9FFVanilla Spawner&r contain the pure essence of one specific creature."]
	quest.302674153BDDF460.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawner Core"
	quest.3036BFDABC136E2B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFGlowstone Nest&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3036BFDABC136E2B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glowstone Nest"
	quest.305698D91ED0F51B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPlayer Transmitter Starter&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.305698D91ED0F51B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Transmitter Starter"
	quest.305B45830330885C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnder Gate Blazing&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.305B45830330885C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Gate Blazing"
	quest.305EFC585DACDFAE.quest_desc: ["Bring Wraithfang into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.305EFC585DACDFAE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wraithfang"
	quest.306C2470CBF8206C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFNoodle Soup&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.306C2470CBF8206C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Noodle Soup"
	quest.307636D95097C040.quest_desc: ["Allows moving of source between source jars and source relays."]
	quest.307636D95097C040.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Relay"
	quest.307849B01B174A88.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBurner Stock&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r is a part used in heat-based machinery. Add it to your setup to support more advanced heating and processing systems."]
	quest.307849B01B174A88.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Burner"
	quest.30819B5772C4DF62.quest_desc: ["What it says on the tin: the way to link inventories to other specific &#FFA500Create&r compontents."]
	quest.30819B5772C4DF62.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stock Link"
	quest.3085BC970DAA25B1.quest_desc: ["Deals significantly more damage than &#00D9FFStandard Ammo&r. Its large mass results in a very short range and causes the &#00D9FFMinigun&r to use air at an increased rate."]
	quest.3085BC970DAA25B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo Weighted"
	quest.308BEF9DEAC0126E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAmethyst Crab&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a crystal-covered creature that fiercely guards its nest." "Defeat it to clear the &#00D9FFAmethyst Nest&r."]
	quest.308BEF9DEAC0126E.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Amethyst Crab"
	quest.308BEF9DEAC0126E.title: "Amethyst Crab"
	quest.309428F9208349F2.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCursed Garden&r is a maze-like, overgrown structure in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r where the &#00D9FFLunar Monstrosity&r hides." "To find it, hold the &#00D9FFSeeking Eye&r with a natural item from the dimension in your off-hand."]
	quest.309428F9208349F2.title: "Cursed Garden"
	quest.30AFA497560FB721.quest_desc: ["This works like the &#00D9FFItem Collector&r but it takes EXP instead which you can input and output manually with a button, you can also click it with a bucket to get &#00D9FFLiquid EXP&r."]
	quest.30AFA497560FB721.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Experienceholder"
	quest.30B86F77CA5C2FFA.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFExperience Hatch&r from &#FFA500Create: Enchantment Industry&r connects directly to fluid storage. You can store your own experience as &#00D9FFLiquid Experience&r and take it back from the tank later." "It has a configurable filter and handles up to 1000 experience points per interaction."]
	quest.30B86F77CA5C2FFA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Experience Hatch"
	quest.30BBA584619AF960.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFNaga&r is the first major boss of the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r and guards the &#00D9FFNaga Courtyard&r. Beating it opens the way to tougher challenges, so do not underestimate it despite its easy reputation."]
	quest.30BBA584619AF960.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Naga"
	quest.30BBA584619AF960.title: "Naga"
	quest.30BF9815A29438B9.quest_desc: ["Well, this is your upgrade! You can choose how many layers you'd like to, up to 9, and it'll output one fluid per layer! To choose which size you want to have the &#00D9FFDistillation Tower&r set to, use the selector in the top left of its screen."]
	quest.30BF9815A29438B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Distillation Tower, 14x Clean Stainless Steel Machine Casing and Stainless Steel Machine Casing Pipe"
	quest.30BF9815A29438B9.title: "Distillation Tower"
	quest.30C4511E584730CE.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarlit Diamond Leggings&r is crafted from &#00D9FFStarlit Diamonds&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "&#00D9FFStarlit Diamond&r armor gives protection comparable to &#00D9FFNetherite&r, with higher armor toughness and knockback resistance."]
	quest.30C4511E584730CE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starlit Diamond Leggings"
	quest.30CF6161090C4235.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMechanical Fusion Anvil&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a crafting station that combines high-tier weapons, armor and rare materials into upgraded equipment." "Craft it with 6 &#00D9FFWitherite Ingots&r, 2 &#00D9FFBlocks of Redstone&r and an &#00D9FFAnvil&r."]
	quest.30CF6161090C4235.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Fusion Anvil"
	quest.30CF6161090C4235.title: "Mechanical Fusion Anvil"
	quest.30D4D2147884C2B4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSolar Panel Hardened&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.30D4D2147884C2B4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Panel Hardened"
	quest.30D6B1F91FB638C1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMusic Disc Chirp&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.30D6B1F91FB638C1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Chirp"
	quest.30DB1AB65A76F0CB.quest_desc: ["The Shattered drops &#00D9FFSculk Bones&r." "They are needed for the &#00D9FFSonorous Staff&r and the &#00D9FFSoul Elytra&r."]
	quest.30DB1AB65A76F0CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sculk Bone"
	quest.30E377E1346D2C28.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFFerricore Sword&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.30E377E1346D2C28.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Sword"
	quest.30F62E1EACE6F8DE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFLens of Ender&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.30F62E1EACE6F8DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lens of Ender"
	quest.30FBC8E1D2BC86DC.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFForge the Aeternium Ingot&r in an &#00D9FFEnd Stone Smeltery&r from a &#00D9FFTerminite Ingot&r and a &#00D9FFNetherite Ingot&r. You may also find it as rare loot in structures such as the &#00D9FFEnd Village&r." "It is &#00D9FFBetter End's&r strongest material and makes gear better than &#00D9FFNetherite&r."]
	quest.30FBC8E1D2BC86DC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Ingot"
	quest.3101B52EA9E2145C.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFPattern Provider&r supplies encoded patterns to adjacent inventories or machines. It is a key part of connecting external processing to ME autocrafting."]
	quest.31030170FC80FA6F.quest_desc: ["Remember, keep your drygmy happy."]
	quest.31030170FC80FA6F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Drygmy Charm"
	quest.3103720E88BE03C9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCyanite Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3103720E88BE03C9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cyanite Seeds"
	quest.31155A6522F0DC95.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFElectric Blast Furnace&r."]
	quest.31155A6522F0DC95.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Electric Blast Furnace"
	quest.3120166ED1297774.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFNugget of Experience&r is a compact form of experience from &#FFA500Create: Enchantment Industry&r. You can get it through &#FFA500Create&r's automated processing and convert it into &#00D9FFLiquid Experience&r." "It is useful for storing and transporting experience in your factory, and it appears in recipes that need concentrated experience."]
	quest.3120166ED1297774.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Experience Nugget"
	quest.3122DA2A0A19B66B.quest_desc: ["Bring Whisperwind into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3122DA2A0A19B66B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whisperwind"
	quest.31296273903A43C5.quest_desc: ["Darker and cooler than &#00D9FFIron&r.. Plus about 1000 times stronger. It's time to make some &#00D9FFSteel&r! Use that coal coke you produced earlier and crush it down to a pile of dust. Then, combine that with iron dust to get your &#00D9FFUncooked Steel Dust&r. Remember, using the &#00D9FFMixer&r will increase your output. Now, remember the finest steel has to go through the hottest fire; so we'll be using the &#00D9FFSteam Blast Furnace&r to reach the extreme temperatures required to melt down the powdered mixture and fuse them together. Now that you have obtained steel, you can upgrade your bronze machines with &#00D9FFSteel Machine Upgrades&r. Steel machines can process recipes up to 4 EU/t and will process recipes at twice the speed than normal as long as the energy usage doesn't go above 4 EU/t. With this higher roof of energy usage, you might be able to make new things now."]
	quest.31296273903A43C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Ingot"
	quest.31296273903A43C5.title: "Your First Steel!"
	quest.312EC5131F64186F.quest_desc: ["Enchanter's tools can be given a spell at the &#00D9FFScribe's Table&r. The Bow benefits from &#00D9FFEndless Quiver&r, and the &#00D9FFCrossbow&r works well for mining when paired with &#00D9FFSplit&r arrow."]
	quest.312EC5131F64186F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spell Bow and Spell Crossbow"
	quest.31336C51580290B8.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAeternium Shovel&r is a top-tier digging tool with the best durability in &#00D9FFBetter End's&r tool line." "Craft it with an &#00D9FFAeternium Anvil&r and a &#00D9FFNetherite&r or &#00D9FFAeternium Smith Hammer&r."]
	quest.31336C51580290B8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Shovel"
	quest.313AC630F7B7BCAA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSword&r on a &#00D9FFStick&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.313AC630F7B7BCAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sword on a Stick"
	quest.313D8C953BAF5B2E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFModification Station&r is used for applying modular upgrades to the &#00D9FFMeka&r-&#00D9FFSuit&r in exchange for energy."]
	quest.313D8C953BAF5B2E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Modification Station"
	quest.313E5D7958A2BC77.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEngineer's Hammer&r is the most useful tool in this chapter. Use it to assemble multiblocks such as the &#00D9FFCoke Oven and Blast Furnace&r."]
	quest.313E5D7958A2BC77.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hammer"
	quest.313E91CFDF8ADF39.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.313E91CFDF8ADF39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Place Block"
	quest.314673C5F21DB29B.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Enchanted Membrane&r with an &#00D9FFInfusion Ritual&r: place a &#00D9FFPhantom Membrane&r and four &#00D9FFCrystal Shards&r around an &#00D9FFInfusion Pedestal&r." "You need it to infuse a regular &#00D9FFElytra&r into the &#00D9FFCrystalite Elytra&r."]
	quest.314673C5F21DB29B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanted Membrane"
	quest.314673C5F21DB29B.title: "Enchanted Membrane"
	quest.3159641C57C3F661.quest_desc: ["This is the top insulated tier, since there is no insulated HV wire."]
	quest.3159641C57C3F661.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Wirecoil Electrum Ins"
	quest.316639E7D35449CF.quest_desc: ["Main component used for crafting &#00D9FFFE Storage Cells&r, which you can use to store FE in your ME system."]
	quest.316639E7D35449CF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Core 1k"
	quest.3166FB4E96BD4B34.quest_desc: ["It is in the troll caves and lets you burn away the thorn barriers."]
	quest.3166FB4E96BD4B34.quest_subtitle: "Find the Lamp of Cinders"
	quest.31678122A7EAF3CE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFChilidog&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.31678122A7EAF3CE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chilidog"
	quest.31692F3E64CDC0F3.quest_desc: ["The Alternator is a key machine in &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r. It turns &#FFA500Create&r's rotational power into &#00D9FFForge Energy&r (FE), so your kinetic machinery can generate electricity." "It needs at least 32 RPM and has a 5 kFE internal buffer. In version 1.6.0 for &#00D9FFNeoForge&r 1.21.1, it has shaft connections on both sides, which makes it easier to fit into a setup."]
	quest.31692F3E64CDC0F3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alternator"
	quest.31762B3FF40814C2.title: "The Walking Dead"
	quest.317BA35A84E61CEB.quest_desc: ["To begin spell casting, you will need to first obtain a spellbook. A spellbook will allow you to create, store, and cast spells using spell mana. You can also dye your spell book by placing dye next to the spell book in the crafting grid."]
	quest.317BA35A84E61CEB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Novice Spell Book"
	quest.317BA35A84E61CEB.title: "Novice Spell Book"
	quest.317BB6EF9816D31B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSpeed Upgrade&r will decrease the time a bee spends inside the hive."]
	quest.317BB6EF9816D31B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Time"
	quest.317C21DFF6448046.quest_desc: ["Craft with &#00D9FFFE Storage Components&r to store power."]
	quest.317C21DFF6448046.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fe Cell Housing"
	quest.3187473363009CC3.quest_desc: ["Fluid flow from mechanical rotation! Can work in parallel to increase fluid flow, or spaced out in series to push flows over long pipe runs."]
	quest.3187473363009CC3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Pump"
	quest.3187B46018DB409A.quest_desc: ["The Productivity upgrade will increase the number of combs a bee produces per trip. Multiple productivity upgrades can be installed."]
	quest.3187B46018DB409A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Productivity"
	quest.3190B245725F2518.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSpawn Egg Configurable Bee&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3190B245725F2518.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Egg Configurable Bee"
	quest.3191B05E172A7ED6.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFPressurizer&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3191B05E172A7ED6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressurizer"
	quest.3191B05E172A7ED6.title: "Under Pressure"
	quest.3192E33EC2F3001B.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#FFA500Aether&r Sleep."]
	quest.3192E33EC2F3001B.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Aether Sleep"
	quest.3194F0186360E5DC.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFThermodynamic Conductors&r are a way of transporting heat. Insulation: 8,000."]
	quest.3194F0186360E5DC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.31A0C98EA03E4641.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAdvanced Card&r is a crafting component used to craft &#00D9FFUpgrades&r."]
	quest.31A0C98EA03E4641.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Card"
	quest.31A0C98EA03E4641.title: "Advanced Upgrades"
	quest.31A2BA9F565C32E3.quest_desc: ["This machine allows heat to purify matter into &#00D9FFAlchemical Mercury&r. Place a &#00D9FFPyromantic Brazier&r below the &#00D9FFDistiller&r and fuel it with furnace fuel to provide heat. Fuels last twice as long as in a &#00D9FFFurnace&r."]
	quest.31A2BA9F565C32E3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Distiller and Pyromantic Brazier"
	quest.31A75C935A136873.quest_desc: ["Better than you model train tracks: straights, curves (two kinds), and slopes, works across &#00D9FFNether&r portals and unloaded chunks too!"]
	quest.31A75C935A136873.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Track"
	quest.31B09F8305099DAD.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500L2 Weaponry&r adds additional weapons and combat options. Explore its weapon range and compare their strengths with the other gear available in the pack."]
	quest.31B09F8305099DAD.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.31B4BD2DEDFB9DDC.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFTesla Coil&r is an advanced machine from &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r. It uses &#00D9FFForge Energy&r to charge compatible electrical items and can shock &#00D9FFPlayers and Mobs&r." "In version 1.6.0 for &#00D9FFNeoForge&r 1.21.1, it gives off light while active and shows its remaining run time correctly when energy runs low."]
	quest.31B4BD2DEDFB9DDC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tesla Coil"
	quest.31C37E1C303C56D5.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.31C37E1C303C56D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Infusing Factory"
	quest.31C886EEA4BF364B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGolem Steel Greatsword&r is a heavy weapon crafted from &#00D9FFGolem Steel Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "The ingots come from the &#00D9FFStarlight Golem&r fight, and the weapon belongs to the mod's advanced tier."]
	quest.31C886EEA4BF364B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Golem Steel Greatsword"
	quest.31C886EEA4BF364B.title: "Golem Steal Greatsword"
	quest.31D65AD46BB61FCC.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSolar Generator&r harnesses sunlight to create power."]
	quest.31D65AD46BB61FCC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Generator"
	quest.31D82BC4F5B81732.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Unusual End&r adds new discoveries and content to End exploration. Travel beyond the main island and look for its unusual additions."]
	quest.31D82BC4F5B81732.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.31D98C2CF9F82426.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFWind Turbine's&r giant blades harness the force of the wind to generate power. Each &#00D9FFWind Turbine&r requires a fairly large 1x1x5 area. The machine will generate power day and night, in sun or rain, but the turbine must have a clear view of the sky (over the rotor housing at the top of the tower)."]
	quest.31D98C2CF9F82426.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wind Generator"
	quest.31E3A018A97F5817.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSunfire&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.31E3A018A97F5817.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sunfire"
	quest.31E82CD01EAD4B67.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnergy Cable Spirited&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.31E82CD01EAD4B67.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cable Spirited"
	quest.31EA548BE2CEA33C.quest_desc: ["Blocks of blaze ember can be transformed into raw voidflame coal. 3–4 voidflame coals will drop. Burns &#00D9AA27x&r more items than coal."]
	quest.31EA548BE2CEA33C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coal T3"
	quest.31EBB7995663A627.quest_desc: ["Fills vanilla fluid containers and applies fluids to items in sequenced recipes."]
	quest.31EBB7995663A627.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spout"
	quest.31F03335093C0F41.quest_desc: ["It drops from the &#00D9FFSnow Queen&r. It shoots three arrows at once but uses only one arrow and one point of durability."]
	quest.31F03335093C0F41.quest_subtitle: "Get the Tri-Bow"
	quest.31F03335093C0F41.title: "The Tri-Bow"
	quest.31FC442BAEF7FE35.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Obtain Egg."]
	quest.31FC442BAEF7FE35.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Obtain Egg"
	quest.31FC442BAEF7FE35.title: "Don't Count Your Moas..."
	quest.3215E5C6BAB9BA51.quest_desc: ["The Actuator's storage space is limited by default. Stabilizers strengthen its link to the storage dimension so it can store more."]
	quest.3215E5C6BAB9BA51.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Stabilizer Tier1"
	quest.321FA1030481627D.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnergizing Rod Basic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.321FA1030481627D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energizing Rod Basic"
	quest.32272E9BD1620B62.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPlayer Transmitter Spirited&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
