	quest.323F4F419BF296EB.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFElectromancer Robe&r is the chestpiece of the &#00D9FFElectromancer Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+8&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFLightning Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Craft it from 8 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFLightning Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Robes&r with 1 &#00D9FFLightning Rune&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r in supported versions."]
	quest.323F4F419BF296EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electromancer Chestplate"
