	quest.329F1E681C42CFB1.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMalarite Sword&r is an early-game weapon in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r, crafted from &#00D9FFMalarite&r found in the &#00D9FFDark Swamp&r." "It uses a simple crafting table recipe and belongs to the basic tier."]
