	quest.331AD1C039607798.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFInfusion Pedestal&r is the core block of &#00D9FFBetter End's Infusion Ritual&r system." "Arrange several around a central pedestal to craft items like the &#00D9FFEnchanted Membrane&r, &#00D9FFEternal Crystal and Crystalite&r armor."]
