	quest.3336D404FA43FE6E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Sword&r is crafted from &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It deals moderate damage and sets targets on fire, which works well against mobs in early to mid progression."]
