	quest.338C7768B4D676D3.quest_desc: ["Up until now, you've only used &#00D9FFDrives&r that held two dimensional data, in the form of zeros and ones. Now, let's hold three dimensional data, in the form of raw matter. This is a far more complex drive type, so it'll be expensive and you will not be able to store much at the start."]
	quest.338C7768B4D676D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spatial Cell Component 2"
