	quest.33E096F228450088.quest_desc: ["Feathers, &#00D9FFBooks&r, and &#00D9FFBlack Dye&r can be transformed in &#00D9FFSpiritfire&r to obtain versions more receptive to working with &#00D9FFSpirits&r."]
