	quest.33FCCF03F08E02B9.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDeepsilver Leggings&r is crafted from &#00D9FFDeepsilver Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Deepsilver armor raises movement speed, attack speed and knockback resistance. The full set also grants immunity to several negative status effects."]
