	quest.33FE4F12360F4227.quest_desc: ["A glass container that displays a bee from your collection. Insert a bee cage with a hopper or pipe."]
	quest.33FE4F12360F4227.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jar Oak"
	quest.340066CD010A55B5.quest_desc: ["Automates the smoker using items from the storage."]
	quest.340066CD010A55B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Auto Smoking Upgrade"
	quest.34162303439CCAC0.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPriest Boots&r are part of the &#00D9FFPriest Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFHoly Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft them from 4 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFHoly Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Boots&r with 1 &#00D9FFHoly Rune&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r."]
	quest.34162303439CCAC0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Priest Boots"
	quest.3417F7FC6DF546A5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFLarge Steam Turbine&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3417F7FC6DF546A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Large Steam Turbine"
	quest.3417F7FC6DF546A5.title: "Enslaved Hurricane"
	quest.34185B3B860DE4E1.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFThe Whispers&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFWarden Stick&r, &#00D9FFEcho Ingot&r, &#00D9FFEcho Shards&r, a &#00D9FFSculk Catalyst&r, a &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard and Weapon Parts&r." "It carries the &#00D9FFSonic Boom&r spell."]
	quest.34185B3B860DE4E1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whisper Staff"
	quest.34199BE9217C384D.quest_desc: ["Used to cast a spell upon yourself."]
	quest.34199BE9217C384D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanters Mirror"
	quest.3441B1B867AFBED3.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSpirited Crystal Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3441B1B867AFBED3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spirited Crystal Seeds"
	quest.3445CC7147DCF47E.quest_desc: ["The Harbinger from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a powerful ancient machine hidden deep beneath the &#00D9FFOverworld&r with a devastating arsenal." "Destroy it to show you can face &#FFA500Cataclysm&r's greatest threats."]
	quest.3445CC7147DCF47E.quest_subtitle: "Defeat The Harbinger"
	quest.3445CC7147DCF47E.title: "The Harbinger"
	quest.3449A1A3E860FAF3.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFuzzy Card&r, &#00D9FFSpeed Card&r, &#00D9FFInverter Card and Equal Distribution Card&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3449A1A3E860FAF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fuzzy Card, Speed Card, Inverter Card and Equal Distribution Card"
	quest.3449A1A3E860FAF3.title: "Advanced Upgrades"
	quest.344ADE2180F485EA.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.344ADE2180F485EA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Snare"
	quest.344EBBBE464E0E8F.quest_desc: ["A variety of &#00D9FFSulfur&r types exist, split across many tiers."]
	quest.344EBBBE464E0E8F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.344EBBBE464E0E8F.title: "Sulfurs"
	quest.3457495C63E13C2E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Helmet&r is crafted from &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Each piece of this armor ignites attackers and reduces fire damage, which suits hot, dangerous areas."]
	quest.3457495C63E13C2E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Helmet"
	quest.345AF78BF31E5DF8.quest_desc: ["Upgrade an &#00D9FFInfused Hellshelf&r with &#00D9FFGlowstone&r." "It gives &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFEterna&r (up to 60), &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFQuanta&r and a little &#00D9FFArcana&r. A solid all-round shelf."]
	quest.345AF78BF31E5DF8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glowing Hellshelf"
	quest.346AC6D1EC7D9BBB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFGrilled Salmon&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.346AC6D1EC7D9BBB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Grilled Salmon"
	quest.346F8ACE0AE44FBC.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCoil Lv&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.346F8ACE0AE44FBC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coil Lv"
	quest.3473EB7AD69E5C5A.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFSteel Hatches&r have double the capacity of bronze hatches, increasing one inventory slot to 2, and increasing a multi-block's max steam usage rate from 2 EU/t to 4 EU/t. As long as there is a single steel fluid input hatch receiving steam, your entire multi-block is upgraded to a \"steel tier.\". Allowing multiblocks to use 4 EU/t means exactly what you think it does, it doubles the top speed of the processes. A &#00D9FFSteel Boiler&r will produce twice as much steam as a bronze one. That means it will max out at 16 EU/t instead of 8. The &#00D9FFSteel Water Pump&r will also produce twice as much &#00D9FFWater&r as it's bronze counterpart, so a max of 250mb of &#00D9FFWater&r fro every adjacent water source for up to 2000mb of &#00D9FFWater&r every &#00D9AA5 seconds&r."]
	quest.3473EB7AD69E5C5A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Item Output Hatch, Steel Item Input Hatch and Steel Fluid Input Hatch"
	quest.3473EB7AD69E5C5A.title: "Steel Hatches"
	quest.3477ACB71980D035.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFApricot Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3477ACB71980D035.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Apricot Sapling"
	quest.34784AD607BB3907.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Azure Sea Shield&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r using &#00D9FFLacrima&r and gold." "Blocking an attack can trigger a counter that knocks the attacker back, gives them &#00D9FFSlowness II&r and grants you &#00D9FFStrength II&r."]
	quest.34784AD607BB3907.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Azure Sea Shield"
	quest.34784AD607BB3907.title: "Azure Sea Shield"
	quest.34A2B6273E3DE229.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFChemical Washer&r turns &#00D9FFSlurry&r into &#00D9FFClean Slurry&r using &#00D9FFWater&r. The clean slurry then needs to be further refined by pumping it into a &#00D9FFChemical Crystallizer&r. Note that unlike most &#FFA500Mekanism&r machines this one has fixed \"in\" and \"out\" sides for the mineral flow. \"In\" will be on the left when first placed and \"out\" is on the right."]
	quest.34A2B6273E3DE229.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Washer"
	quest.34AE8138669FD50A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFWizard Hat and Wizard Hood&r are two variants of the same &#00D9FFWizard Armor&r headpiece in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Both give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Either one is crafted from &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r."]
	quest.34AE8138669FD50A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wizard Helmet and Wizard Hat"
	quest.34C60ADD15C339EB.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFDiamond&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.34C78427A24B86E3.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFIron Fishing Rod&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.34C78427A24B86E3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Fishing Rod"
	quest.34CC359F82940541.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFDawnquiver&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.34CC359F82940541.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dawnquiver"
	quest.34D04E583B63CD5F.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.34D04E583B63CD5F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Summon Vex"
	quest.34DDE44E60BB8B29.quest_desc: ["Collect different kinds of bait. The right bait improves your chances of catching rare and valuable fish."]
	quest.34DDE44E60BB8B29.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.34DDE44E60BB8B29.title: "Baits"
	quest.34EDB874318340F6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFHogskin&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.34EDB874318340F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hogskin"
	quest.34F04E98312B4F33.quest_desc: ["A handy tool that shows the fish in your surroundings."]
	quest.34F04E98312B4F33.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Fish Radar"
	quest.34F9077D00F4549F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCelestigem Leggings&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.34F9077D00F4549F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Leggings"
	quest.350F711BF77781A0.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFTin Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.350F711BF77781A0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tin Seeds"
	quest.351240185EE70EA5.quest_desc: ["The Actuator's storage space is limited by default. Stabilizers strengthen its link to the storage dimension so it can store more."]
	quest.351240185EE70EA5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Stabilizer Tier2"
	quest.3542746A9C52E09C.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.3542746A9C52E09C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Hex"
	quest.3549221506BDE70C.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFNetherite Hammer&r is a heavy tool and weapon you need, along with the &#00D9FFAeternium Anvil&r, to forge &#00D9FFAeternium&r equipment." "Without it you cannot turn raw &#00D9FFAeternium&r into plates and tool heads."]
	quest.3549221506BDE70C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Netherite Hammer"
	quest.356CA5DB72734326.quest_desc: ["The Second tier of &#00D9FFSpellbook&r only holding 6 &#00D9FFSpells&r."]
	quest.356CA5DB72734326.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Spell Book"
	quest.3570964B2399D29D.quest_desc: ["Source is an important part of &#FFA500Ars Nouveau&r."]
	quest.3570964B2399D29D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Source Jar"
	quest.357CF9A61FD926BC.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFSmelt Raw Ironwood&r, which is crafted shapeless from 1 &#00D9FFLiveroot&r, 1 &#00D9FFIron Ingot&r and 1 &#00D9FFGold Nugget&r."]
	quest.357CF9A61FD926BC.quest_subtitle: "Get an Ironwood Ingot"
	quest.3581D598234958A5.quest_desc: ["Adds a stonecutter to the storage."]
	quest.3581D598234958A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stonecutter Upgrade"
	quest.359970E5B5A94E26.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Warden Mage Chestplate&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFNetherite Mage Chestplate&r from &#00D9FFIron's Spells&r, &#00D9FFEcho Ingots&r, &#00D9FFWarden Carapace&r, a &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard&r and a &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Template&r." "Spell power and upgrades from the netherite piece are not kept."]
	quest.359970E5B5A94E26.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Mage Chestplate"
	quest.35A6AB035CFF965E.quest_desc: ["The pedestal is in the &#00D9FFDark Forest&r ruins. Claim your title there."]
	quest.35A6AB035CFF965E.quest_subtitle: "Place a trophy on the pedestal"
	quest.35A6B43CE99A7691.quest_desc: ["Bring Core 64k into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.35A6B43CE99A7691.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Core 64k"
	quest.35BBD78000100029.quest_desc: ["You will need 59 more &#00D9FFReactor Glass&r blocks for a total of 123 glass blocks. The frame of the &#00D9FFSupercritical Phase Shifter&r must consist of &#00D9FFSPS Casings&r. The sides, bottom and top can consist of either &#00D9FFSPS Casings&r, &#00D9FFReactor Glass&r or &#00D9FFSPS Ports&r. In order to insert energy through a port, a &#00D9FFSupercharged Coil&r has to be attached to the &#00D9FFSPS Port&r on the inside of the multiblock. There are other ways of building a SPS, so be sure to look different ways up. Be warned, the more production you want, the resources and power you'll need."]
	quest.35BBD78000100029.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 60x Sps Casing, 3x Sps Port, 59x Reactor Glass and Supercharged Coil"
	quest.35C2A3FE88732660.quest_desc: ["Bring Controls into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.35C2A3FE88732660.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Controls"
	quest.35C6B2C60242EDA2.quest_desc: ["A pre-programmed &#00D9FFDrone&r that collects items within a 17x17x17 area (before range upgrades) centered on the position it's deployed from. This Drone has two basic modes depending on where it is deployed in relation to its deposit inventory: Deploying on top of an inventory will filter what the &#00D9FFDrone&r collects to only match items inside the inventory at the time of deployment. Deploying on the ground next to an inventory will tell the &#00D9FFDrone&r to collect any items within its area."]
	quest.35C6B2C60242EDA2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Collector Drone"
	quest.35D6F66E836AD148.quest_desc: ["The Actuator's storage space is limited by default. Stabilizers strengthen its link to the storage dimension so it can store more."]
	quest.35D6F66E836AD148.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Stabilizer Tier3"
	quest.35DA27939FD74C2A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLV Energy Input Hatch&r is like a giant electrical inlet. Do remember that you can upgrade the multiblock machine by replacing the &#00D9FFEnergy Input Hatch&r with an upgraded tier, increasing the maximum power rate for recipes and increasing overall overclocking capabilities."]
	quest.35DA27939FD74C2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lv Energy Input Hatch"
	quest.35DA27939FD74C2A.title: "LV Energy Input Hatch"
	quest.35DBE69283017194.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.35DBE69283017194.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.35E288DBD1B1381B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFFluid Hatch&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r makes it easy to insert and extract fluids from fluid tanks, which helps in automated setups." "It was introduced alongside the &#00D9FFFluid Gauge&r in the 2.2a-BETA update for &#00D9FFMinecraft&r 1.21 to 1.21.1."]
	quest.35E288DBD1B1381B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluid Hatch"
	quest.35E6404B7ABD257A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFArcane Ingot&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.35E6404B7ABD257A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Ingot"
	quest.35E769858BBA9F88.quest_desc: ["Upgrade a &#00D9FFDeepshelf&r with a &#00D9FFSoul Lantern and Sculk&r." "It gives &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFEterna&r (up to 75) and &#00D9AA+15&r &#00D9FFQuanta&r. Good if you want wild, high-roll enchantments."]
	quest.35E769858BBA9F88.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Touched Deepshelf"
	quest.35FB1B9F7DE2B724.quest_desc: ["Makes the storage pickup items."]
	quest.35FB1B9F7DE2B724.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pickup Upgrade"
	quest.360E2467D78EC55E.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFPrudentium&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.361C0D7B160F5779.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFLime Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.361C0D7B160F5779.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lime Sapling"
	quest.361CEF92D5D53467.quest_desc: ["Multiplies the number of items that fit in each slot by 16."]
	quest.361CEF92D5D53467.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Tier 4"
	quest.362649F35397D659.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFRaw Stuffed Hoglin&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.362649F35397D659.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Raw Stuffed Hoglin"
	quest.362A10F8805913EE.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.362A10F8805913EE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Orbit"
	quest.362CDD23E712D82C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBlack Locust Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.362CDD23E712D82C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Locust Sapling"
	quest.3631E1EB82EA9014.quest_desc: ["Used with the &#00D9FFVacuum Trap&r, this machine will suck up any mobs near it and put them in a &#00D9FFSpawner Core&r, for that too work you must first craft a &#00D9FFSpawner Core&r and insert into the a &#00D9FFVacuum Trap&r."]
	quest.3631E1EB82EA9014.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vacuum Trap"
	quest.363A614691A42198.quest_desc: ["Look for an &#00D9FFAncient City&r in the &#00D9FFDeep Dark&r, far below the surface. Its chests can hold &#00D9FFEcho Shards&r, &#00D9FFWarden Carapace&r and the &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Template&r." "Be careful around &#00D9FFSculk Shriekers&r. Three shrieks will summon the &#00D9FFWarden&r."]
	quest.363A614691A42198.title: "Ancient City"
	quest.36400D26EEABD70C.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: &#00D9FFHot Biome Land Ruin&r (desert), &#00D9FFWarm Biome Land Ruin&r (plains), &#00D9FFCold Biome Land Ruin&r (taiga), &#00D9FFSnowy Biome Land Ruin&r (snowy plains) and the &#00D9FFNether Ruin&r."]
	quest.36400D26EEABD70C.quest_subtitle: "Find all 5 ruin variants"
	quest.365016FE986E446F.quest_desc: ["Shulkers in &#00D9FFEnd Cities&r drop &#00D9FFShulker Shells&r." "They are the ingredient for &#00D9FFShulker Boxes&r."]
	quest.365016FE986E446F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Shulker Shell"
	quest.365016FE986E446F.title: "Shulker Shell"
	quest.3651542FFED54E7A.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCultist Boots&r are part of the &#00D9FFCultist Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFBlood Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft them from 4 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFBlood Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Boots&r with 1 &#00D9FFBlood Rune&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r in supported versions."]
	quest.3651542FFED54E7A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cultist Boots"
	quest.365250D4F5B19F71.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Ars Nouveau&r provides spell crafting, magical devices, powerful trinkets, and magical entity automation."]
	quest.365250D4F5B19F71.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Worn Notebook"
	quest.36530CC20B0D2324.quest_desc: ["The upgraded &#00D9FFTome of Scrapping&r. It extracts all of an item's enchantments onto books, but still destroys the item."]
	quest.36530CC20B0D2324.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Improved Scrap Tome"
	quest.36530CC20B0D2324.title: "Superior Scrapping"
	quest.365770482E8AB3B3.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFried Hoglin Chop&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.365770482E8AB3B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fried Hoglin Chop"
	quest.36756F0900ABA5E4.quest_desc: ["Press &#00D9FFRight Click&r on &#00D9FFStill Water&r or &#00D9FFFlowing Water&r to fill. Place Fuel inside the &#00D9FFChainsaw&r using &#00D9FFRight Click&r. &#00D9FFToggle Silk Touch&r with &#00D9FFLeft Shift&r + &#00D9FFRight Click&r."]
	quest.36756F0900ABA5E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steam Chainsaw"
	quest.36794E2B8C235CED.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnder Core&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.36794E2B8C235CED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Core"
	quest.367FFB447D28B83B.quest_desc: ["[ { \"text\": \"Join the &#FFA500NeoTech Reborn&r Discord!\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://discord.gg/8Hz9qTjJaB\" }, \"color\": \"aqua\" } ]"]
	quest.367FFB447D28B83B.quest_subtitle: "Meet other players, find the community, and join the conversation."
	quest.367FFB447D28B83B.title: "Join the NeoTech Reborn Discord"
	quest.368ED8B4B5670143.quest_desc: ["Need a steamy upgrade? The &#00D9FFLarge Steam Boiler&r is an upgraded version of the smaller bronze and steel boilers. It uses fuel 8 times faster than the &#00D9FFFurnace&r, but it produces 256 mb/t of steam when at max temperature. Make sure you don't forget to provide it &#00D9FFWater&r! The main block you'll need is &#00D9FFBronze Plated Bricks&r, but you'll also need other blocks shown in your EMI. The &#00D9FFLarge Steam Boiler&r is comprised of one layer of &#00D9FFHeatproof Machine Casings&r with layers of &#00D9FFBronze Plated Bricks and Pipe Machine Casings&r. The Controller is on the second layer, on top of the &#00D9FFHeatproof Machine Casings&r. Don't forget you can use your &#00D9FFWrench&r to show the shape of the multiblock and placement of the blocks needed for it. The required hatches must be placed on the bottom layer. You'll need a way to input water and a solid fuel, as well as a way to extract &#00D9FFSteam&r."]
	quest.368ED8B4B5670143.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 24x Bronze Plated Bricks, 6x Heatproof Machine Casing, Large Steam Boiler and 2x Bronze Machine Casing Pipe"
	quest.368ED8B4B5670143.title: "Large Steam Boiler"
	quest.36938B0CCC8BAAC2.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPortal Fluid Catalyst&r plus &#00D9FFPolymorphic Fluid&r makes &#00D9FFUnstable Portal Fluid&r, which can only exist in the End. &#00D9FFUnstable Portal Fluid&r plus a goo of tier 3 or higher makes &#00D9FFStable Portal Fluid&r."]
	quest.36938B0CCC8BAAC2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portal Fluid Catalyst, Unstable Portal Fluid Bucket and Portal Fluid Bucket"
	quest.3694E18A5BECA7CB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMusic Disc Mellohi&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3694E18A5BECA7CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Mellohi"
	quest.369D75AC83F07817.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGlacite Leggings&r is crafted from &#00D9FFGlacite&r materials in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Glacite armor protects against freezing environments and slows enemies that attack you."]
	quest.369D75AC83F07817.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Leggings"
	quest.36A5438EABF3E9B1.quest_desc: ["Compacts items into their compressed versions. Only 2x2 recipes."]
	quest.36A5438EABF3E9B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Compacting Upgrade"
	quest.36A6D528027829C4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPyrolyse Oven&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.36A6D528027829C4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyrolyse Oven"
	quest.36ACC12F1A2913CD.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9AA4x&r &#00D9FFWaterwheel Segment&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.36ACC12F1A2913CD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Waterwheel Segment"
	quest.36B231BC87B41E01.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBacon Wrapped Sausage&r on a &#00D9FFStick&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.36B231BC87B41E01.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bacon Wrapped Sausage on a Stick"
	quest.36C2663C56364BE9.quest_desc: ["Use your whirlisprig charm on a flower to bring a whirlisprig to life. You can also use dye on your whirlisprig."]
	quest.36C2663C56364BE9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whirlisprig Charm"
	quest.36CAF348B61E20EC.quest_desc: ["Automates the blast furnace using items from the backpack."]
	quest.36CAF348B61E20EC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Auto Blasting Upgrade"
	quest.36DACD876BAB96A8.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnchanting Template&r from &#FFA500Create: Enchantment Industry&r is used in the mod's automated enchanting system together with the &#00D9FFBlaze Enchanter&r." "In newer versions, an unenchanted template has no enchantment glint, which makes it easy to tell apart from an enchanted one."]
	quest.36DACD876BAB96A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanting Template"
	quest.36F00C19255A6B37.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPeach Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.36F00C19255A6B37.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Peach Sapling"
	quest.36F7C25EC5BD5047.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnergy Cell Hardened&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.36F7C25EC5BD5047.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell Hardened"
	quest.370D31482EC483FF.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFHedge&r."]
	quest.370D31482EC483FF.quest_subtitle: "Defeat a spider in a Hedge Maze"
	quest.37136D3A987DA7C6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMusic Disc&r 13. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.37136D3A987DA7C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc 13"
	quest.3713B3863DB767EA.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFTerminite Upgrade Smithing Template&r applies &#00D9FFTerminite&r-tier upgrades to compatible tools and armor at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "Terminite sits between &#00D9FFThallasium and Aeternium&r and is made from &#00D9FFThallasium Ingots and End Dust&r."]
	quest.3713B3863DB767EA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.37169E306FB35C13.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.37169E306FB35C13.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Heal"
	quest.371BE75622BA661A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBlock of Experience&r from &#FFA500Create: Enchantment Industry&r is a compact form of &#00D9FFLiquid Experience&r. It works as a concentrated experience source in advanced enchanting and is part of &#00D9FFSuper Enchanting&r progression." "In newer versions, lightning can transform &#00D9FFExperience Blocks&r as part of that progression."]
	quest.371BE75622BA661A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Experience Block"
	quest.372F90BF0928F68D.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFPrevent Swet Spawning&r."]
	quest.372F90BF0928F68D.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Prevent Swet Spawning"
	quest.37467D6A306DD448.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLunar Monstrosity&r waits at the heart of the &#00D9FFCursed Garden&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It cannot be damaged normally. Its body must be ignited first, which makes it vulnerable."]
	quest.37467D6A306DD448.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Lunar Monstrosity"
	quest.37467D6A306DD448.title: "Lunar Monstrosity"
	quest.374C0B3319A67D26.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFAdvanced Upgrade&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.374C0B3319A67D26.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Upgrade"
	quest.374C0B3319A67D26.title: "Machine Speedup-Speedup"
	quest.376F5EE5E3C32048.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFOmni Speed Controller&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r is an in-line speed controller that lets you set the rotational speed of a mechanical system precisely. It is especially handy in compact, advanced &#FFA500Create&r contraptions."]
	quest.376F5EE5E3C32048.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Omni Speed Controller"
	quest.3788D925B3F165E6.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFPulse Extender&r from &#FFA500Create&r. It lengthens a &#00D9FFRedstone&r pulse by a configurable time so short signals can control machines and automation." "The duration ranges from &#00D9AA2 ticks&r to &#00D9AA60 minutes&r. It can also be inverted to stay powered by default and give a temporary shutdown pulse."]
	quest.3788D925B3F165E6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pulse Repeater"
	quest.378C1E8A428D2B58.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFElm Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.378C1E8A428D2B58.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elm Sapling"
	quest.37A823113CFA0238.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.37A823113CFA0238.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Crushing Factory"
	quest.37C1777A017654F8.quest_desc: ["This substance can be processed in a &#00D9FFRefinery&r to create various fuels, which can eventually be used to produce &#00D9FFPlastic&r."]
	quest.37C1777A017654F8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Oil Bucket"
	quest.37C4277D80E37F2A.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Building Gadgets 2&r provides tools for placing, copying, and modifying larger groups of blocks. Learn its gadget modes and settings before using them on a large build."]
	quest.37C4277D80E37F2A.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.37CB97FB7071E157.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFLimited Copper Barrel&r 2. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.37CB97FB7071E157.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Copper Barrel 2"
	quest.37D84E2E11ACA2D6.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFLone Star Skeletons&r roam &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r and attack from range." "They can overwhelm unprepared explorers quickly, so defeating one is a good test of your readiness."]
	quest.37D84E2E11ACA2D6.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Lonestar Skeleton"
	quest.37D84E2E11ACA2D6.title: "LoneStar Skeletons"
	quest.37DB0AD3F33D5CAD.quest_desc: ["Type '@mysticalagriculture augment' into the EMI/EMI search field to bring up all the augments at your disposal."]
	quest.37DB0AD3F33D5CAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Unattuned Augment"
	quest.37E1F4C12703F6E6.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnd Crystal&r heals the &#00D9FFEnder Dragon&r and sits on the obsidian pillars around the arena." "It is also the base ingredient for &#00D9FFBetter End's Eternal Crystal&r in an &#00D9FFInfusion Ritual&r."]
	quest.37E1F4C12703F6E6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain End Crystal"
	quest.37E7D3C4A742FB81.quest_desc: ["Essential for drill contraptions: a set of &#00D9FFMechanical Drills&r arranged on a horizontal plane drills down into the world."]
	quest.37E7D3C4A742FB81.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rope Pulley"
	quest.37E8DD20B7F8288A.quest_desc: ["Adds a smoker to the backpack."]
	quest.37E8DD20B7F8288A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smoking Upgrade"
	quest.37F32EEFA9330F95.quest_desc: ["Increases the wearer's flatulence."]
	quest.37F32EEFA9330F95.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whoopee Cushion"
	quest.3803DF864FB67E36.quest_desc: ["Stay clear of bare wires, because they hurt. Insulated wires solve that. This coil handles up to &#00D9AA2048 FE&r/t, so move to MV wire for anything higher."]
	quest.3803DF864FB67E36.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wirecoil Copper"
	quest.382F5D589320AF78.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFRaw Amaramber&r is a rare material infused with starlight energy and hidden in the terrain of &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is used for advanced crafting, so gather enough to start working with it."]
	quest.382F5D589320AF78.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 5x Raw Amaramber"
	quest.382F5D589320AF78.title: "Raw Amaramber"
	quest.383971F46FE9934E.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Terminite Chestplate&r from &#00D9FFTerminite Plating&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "You can later upgrade it into &#00D9FFCrystalite&r or &#00D9FFAeternium&r armor."]
	quest.383971F46FE9934E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Chestplate"
	quest.383CF3C7858B7CA6.quest_desc: ["Any type of barrel counts, not just oak. Expands the inventory of the barrel."]
	quest.383CF3C7858B7CA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Barrel"
	quest.383CF3C7858B7CA6.title: "Iron Barrel"
	quest.384A595713F8175C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.384A595713F8175C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.3873C8BF436FA4DE.quest_desc: ["This Rod is pre-attuned to locate a &#00D9FFRare&r material."]
	quest.3873C8BF436FA4DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sulfur Attuned Divination Rod Rare"
	quest.38853BDD58F19B1F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCell Component&r 64m. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.38853BDD58F19B1F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 64m"
	quest.3889600717425DB6.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Warden Hoe&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFNetherite Hoe&r, &#00D9FFEcho Ingots&r, a &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard&r and a &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Template&r."]
	quest.3889600717425DB6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Hoe"
	quest.3895C493392514BF.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3895C493392514BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.38B1659299CB5B71.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBlock and Chain&r is a heavy weapon once used by &#00D9FFGoblin Knights&r, made of an iron block on a chain. It is slow but hits with great impact." "It takes practice to use, and it works especially well against heavily armored foes and groups."]
	quest.38B1659299CB5B71.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Block and Chain"
	quest.38BDA4C04CE69387.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnder Cell Basic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.38BDA4C04CE69387.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Cell Basic"
	quest.38BE233EA9E17B73.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEvocation Upgrade Orb&r is an upgrade material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Applied at the &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r, it gives &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFEvocation Spell Power&r." "Craft it from 1 &#00D9FFEmpty Upgrade Orb&r and 8 &#00D9FFEvocation Runes&r."]
	quest.38BE233EA9E17B73.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Evocation Upgrade Orb"
	quest.38C3B0E3023E725B.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Confluence Otherworld&r adds a separate world of exploration and content. Look for its route into the dimension and discover its unique environments and resources."]
	quest.38C3B0E3023E725B.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.38CDC415197910DB.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThallasium Axe&r chops wood and fights. Forge it from &#00D9FFThallasium Ingots&r at an &#00D9FFAnvil&r with a &#00D9FFSmith Hammer&r." "It belongs to the first tier of &#00D9FFBetter End's&r equipment."]
	quest.38CDC415197910DB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Axe"
	quest.38D9A7614CB6FBF0.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFoliot&r are the first type of spirit you will work with, and the least dangerous."]
	quest.38D9A7614CB6FBF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Foliot"
	quest.38EB9DA8E9F8A742.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPie Crust&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.38EB9DA8E9F8A742.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pie Crust"
	quest.38EDB8263D6AB5BE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCapacitor Nitro&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.38EDB8263D6AB5BE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor Nitro"
	quest.38EF1D2C873C34B3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFWood Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.38EF1D2C873C34B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wood Seeds"
	quest.390A1E2CE9B27C69.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFThread Starbuncle&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.390A1E2CE9B27C69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Starbuncle"
	quest.390C6837EC35BEA1.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Create&r a party with /ftbteams party create <name> and invite friends with /ftbteams party invite <player>. Members of a party share quest progress."]
	quest.390C6837EC35BEA1.quest_subtitle: "Parties share progress."
	quest.390C6837EC35BEA1.title: "Play with Friends"
	quest.39116B943AB5A383.quest_desc: ["Claim the rewards of this quest to get started. You receive an &#00D9FFEccentric Tome&r with the guidebooks of many mods already inside, and a &#00D9FFPrefab House&r item that builds a small starting home." "If you lose the tome, you can craft it again."]
	quest.39116B943AB5A383.quest_subtitle: "Everything you need to begin."
	quest.39116B943AB5A383.title: "Starter Kit"
	quest.3922AC1B156532D3.quest_desc: ["Lets you put backpacks inside another backpack."]
	quest.3922AC1B156532D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inception Upgrade"
	quest.392460E022982817.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Ancient Spear&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r using &#00D9FFAncient Metal Ingots&r." "Its special ability throws a sandstorm projectile that damages enemies and applies &#00D9FFCurse&r of the &#00D9FFDesert II&r."]
	quest.392460E022982817.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ancient Spear"
	quest.3942D5CA461FF632.quest_desc: ["Time to plumb the depths of &#FFA500Create&r's.. plumbing."]
	quest.3942D5CA461FF632.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Ingot"
	quest.394456986E472364.quest_desc: ["Allows you to see a certain block for a period of time."]
	quest.394456986E472364.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Scrying"
	quest.39528772CF17CC45.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Resonarium Pickaxe&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFDiamond Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFSturdy Sheets&r, a &#00D9FFResonarium Plate&r and a &#00D9FFResonarium Upgrade Template&r." "The template can be found in &#00D9FFAncient Cities&r, &#00D9FFTrial Chambers and Strongholds&r."]
	quest.39528772CF17CC45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Pickaxe"
	quest.39584D8D8FF6C258.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFFlamewind&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.39584D8D8FF6C258.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flamewind"
	quest.39594206DFA1F746.quest_desc: ["Consuming this fruit will open your &#00D9FFThird Eye&r, allowing you to see things you otherwise could not."]
	quest.39594206DFA1F746.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Datura"
	quest.3959498A55970754.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFProcessing Unit&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3959498A55970754.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Processing Unit"
	quest.3959498A55970754.title: "Bitcoin Miner"
	quest.395A0D7134FE9513.quest_desc: ["Rotate components precisely. Open and close &#00D9FFFluid Valves&r. Dye-able."]
	quest.395A0D7134FE9513.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.395EE225F6E1DB59.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFNaga Armors&r."]
	quest.395EE225F6E1DB59.quest_subtitle: "Craft Naga Scale chest and leg armor"
	quest.396366F1E72A8155.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnergizing Orb&r crafts the materials for the higher-end machines."]
	quest.396366F1E72A8155.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energizing Orb"
	quest.3976EFF2C816F2DC.quest_desc: ["In addtion to being a crafting ingredient, &#00D9FFAndesite Casing&r can be used to encase &#00D9FFShafts and Belts&r, and also &#00D9FFLarge and Small Cogwheels&r. The later use is handy for keeping compact as possible a gear train meant to raise the rpms from early power sources."]
	quest.3976EFF2C816F2DC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Andesite Casing"
	quest.39856E4272E859D3.quest_desc: ["An upgraded &#00D9FFAdvanced Control Circuit&r, used in many tier 3 machines and items."]
	quest.39856E4272E859D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Control Circuit"
	quest.39A3E80396491DE6.quest_desc: ["Your AntiMatter can be pumped out via pressurized tube and into a chemical crystalliser. There, it gets turned into pellets."]
	quest.39A3E80396491DE6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pellet Antimatter"
	quest.39B6DC70970412F2.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCompressed Iron Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.39B6DC70970412F2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Compressed Iron Seeds"
	quest.39B9711A2CE68FF6.quest_desc: ["Defeat a &#00D9FFSludge&r, a slime-like creature of the &#00D9FFOtherside&r." "It drops &#00D9FFResonarium&r, the material for &#00D9FFResonarium&r gear."]
	quest.39B9711A2CE68FF6.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Sludge"
	quest.39B9711A2CE68FF6.title: "Sludge"
	quest.39C414E363FED29F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSweetgum Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.39C414E363FED29F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sweetgum Sapling"
	quest.39C96A0C6B300BE7.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFThread Life Drain&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.39C96A0C6B300BE7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Life Drain"
	quest.39E08B6E69041551.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSizzling Pudding&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.39E08B6E69041551.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sizzling Pudding"
	quest.39E75FE928CCE4D1.quest_desc: ["Make a &#00D9FFStrawberry Milkshake&r and fill a bucket with it. It is a sweet, refreshing drink to add to your &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r milkshake collection."]
	quest.39E75FE928CCE4D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strawberry Milkshake Bucket"
	quest.39F8E52708A4BF39.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFBrass Hand&r from &#FFA500Create&r. It is crafted from &#00D9FFAndesite Alloy and Brass Sheets&r." "It is used to make the &#00D9FFDeployer and Extendo Grip&r, so it is an important step toward advanced &#FFA500Create&r machinery."]
	quest.39F8E52708A4BF39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brass Hand"
	quest.3A210290AA459D13.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFTrial Chambers&r are structures found deep underground, where trial spawners summon powerful mobs." "Survive the trial to earn a &#00D9FFTrial Key&r. It opens special vaults in the chambers for valuable rewards."]
	quest.3A210290AA459D13.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ominous Trial Key and Trial Key"
	quest.3A210290AA459D13.title: "Trial Keys"
	quest.3A2B6439D1C6FF2F.quest_desc: ["Makes fermentation more efficient. You may want to automate it."]
	quest.3A2B6439D1C6FF2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fermentation Starter"
	quest.3A458BD4B5490D95.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFArmored Elytra&r is an &#00D9FFElytra&r reinforced with &#00D9FFBetter End&r materials for better durability while gliding." "Repair it with an &#00D9FFAeternium Ingot&r at an &#00D9FFAnvil&r, or with the &#00D9FFMending&r enchantment."]
	quest.3A458BD4B5490D95.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elytra Armored"
	quest.3A46C094CF063210.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFTertium&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.3A52B2E17355ED8C.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFItem Storage Cell&r 64m into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3A52B2E17355ED8C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 64m"
	quest.3A636EC59F62BCAE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFDigital Circuit&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3A636EC59F62BCAE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Digital Circuit"
	quest.3A636EC59F62BCAE.title: "No need for Sodium anymore!"
	quest.3A654D389F1BE286.quest_desc: ["Induction Provides make up the transfer rate of the battery, both input and output. Transfer Rate: 102.40 kFE/t."]
	quest.3A654D389F1BE286.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Induction Provider"
	quest.3A87C3D492AAC15B.quest_desc: ["Craft it in a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r from an &#00D9FFIron Ingot&r and a vial of &#00D9FFFiery Blood&r or &#00D9FFFiery Tears&r."]
	quest.3A87C3D492AAC15B.quest_subtitle: "Get a Fiery Ingot"
	quest.3A8867FDA77C2ECB.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBattery Blazing&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3A8867FDA77C2ECB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Battery Blazing"
	quest.3A9A280E0A3EF818.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFTwisted Blade&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3A9A280E0A3EF818.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Twisted Blade"
	quest.3AA4B3BA0698AD26.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFFrostfall&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3AA4B3BA0698AD26.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Frostfall"
	quest.3AA523E360B4151E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFOrb of Prophecy&r is a rare artifact tied to the &#00D9FFGatekeeper&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It unlocks the portal to the dimension, and you cannot advance without it."]
	quest.3AA523E360B4151E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Orb of Prophecy"
	quest.3AA523E360B4151E.title: "Orb Of Prophecy"
	quest.3AAAB9DF50064EA9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSand Pear Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3AAAB9DF50064EA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sand Pear Sapling"
	quest.3AB5DFC45E943980.quest_desc: ["A parrot familiar."]
	quest.3AB5DFC45E943980.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Parrot"
	quest.3AB5EEEFFE75F921.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMelon Popsicle&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3AB5EEEFFE75F921.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Melon Popsicle"
	quest.3AC89BD7683ED8D1.quest_desc: ["This machine breaks &#00D9FFBlocks&r in the world. Configurable."]
	quest.3AC89BD7683ED8D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blockbreakert1"
	quest.3AC95C4FF910D68A.quest_desc: ["Use this tablet to create magical helpers to include the weald walker and amethyst golem."]
	quest.3AC95C4FF910D68A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Awakening"
	quest.3ACF0EAC5C5CEAB0.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFDivination Rods&r locate valuable blocks from afar. Sneak-use the rod on a block to attune it, then charge it up to send a particle toward the nearest matching block, which uses durability. Use it normally to ping that location again. The gem turns more purple the closer you get." "The &#00D9FFGlass Rod&r is the cheapest and only locates &#00D9FFAbundant and Common&r blocks."]
	quest.3ACF0EAC5C5CEAB0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Divination Rod T1"
	quest.3AF7DF414C900EED.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCryomancer Boots&r are part of the &#00D9FFCryomancer Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFIce Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft them from 4 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFIce Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Boots&r with 1 &#00D9FFIce Rune&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r."]
	quest.3AF7DF414C900EED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cryomancer Boots"
	quest.3B0687AFEC997D89.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRelic Experience Bottle&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3B0687AFEC997D89.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Relic Experience Bottle"
	quest.3B15519D9BD74AA6.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFWhirling Broom&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3B15519D9BD74AA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whirling Broom"
	quest.3B38F61AE414D03B.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFBrass Sheet&r from &#FFA500Create&r by pressing a &#00D9FFBrass Ingot&r with a &#00D9FFMechanical Press&r." "It is used for advanced components such as &#00D9FFBrass Casings&r, &#00D9FFBrass Hands&r, &#00D9FFBrass Tunnels&r, &#00D9FFMechanical Arms and Redstone Links&r."]
	quest.3B38F61AE414D03B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brass Sheet"
	quest.3B400A10672B862B.quest_desc: ["This machine exposes &#00D9FFEmpty PCBs&r to &#00D9FFUV Light&r, preparing them for processing in an &#00D9FFEtching Tank&r. A longer exposure time improves the likelihood of successful etching, though the process slows down over time. You can set a threshold to determine when a PCB is considered finished; a lower threshold speeds up processing but increases the risk of failed etching. &#00D9FFFailed PCBs&r can be recycled in a &#00D9FFBlast Furnace&r for another attempt."]
	quest.3B400A10672B862B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Uv Light Box"
	quest.3B52675F0BFBB74C.quest_desc: ["Defeat &#00D9FFCitadel Keeper&r."]
	quest.3B52675F0BFBB74C.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Citadel Keeper"
	quest.3B5646F6FDF402EB.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Gateways to Eternity&r introduces challenge encounters through gateways. Learn how to activate a gateway, prepare for the waves, and claim its rewards."]
	quest.3B5646F6FDF402EB.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.3B58C219ECDAC0D7.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Super Factory Manager&r lets you control complex automation with programmable factory logic. Start with a simple input-to-output setup and expand its rules as needed."]
	quest.3B58C219ECDAC0D7.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.3B58DEC4ED0F1BB6.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFDiamond&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.3B5D09F2B541F129.quest_desc: ["The pack includes several furniture mods with decorative and functional pieces. Browse their blocks and recipes to furnish a base in your preferred style."]
	quest.3B5D09F2B541F129.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.3B671CC375F06724.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500The Undergarden&r is a dark underground dimension with its own biomes, creatures, and resources. Prepare for its conditions before setting out to explore."]
	quest.3B671CC375F06724.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.3B6DCB07631D1121.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDeepsilver Shovel&r is crafted from &#00D9FFDeepsilver Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is used for digging in swamp and &#00D9FFNightfall&r regions and lasts longer than iron tools."]
	quest.3B6DCB07631D1121.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Shovel"
	quest.3B6E3BB402776419.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBlock of Super Experience&r from &#FFA500Create: Enchantment Industry&r is made when lightning strikes a &#00D9FFBlock of Experience&r." "It can be used for &#00D9FFSuper Enchanting&r or compacted into &#00D9FFNuggets of Super Experience&r. Unlike normal experience, &#00D9FFSuper Experience&r has no liquid form."]
	quest.3B6E3BB402776419.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Super Experience Block"
	quest.3B77FE09990A44A5.quest_desc: ["The Fairy heals and supports other familiars while draining your enemies' life."]
	quest.3B77FE09990A44A5.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Fairy"
	quest.3B8BC6CC1B02ED7E.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFVials of Blood&r are obtained by standing in an &#00D9FFAlchemist Cauldron&r or by &#00D9FFStanding&r in a normal &#00D9FFCauldron&r with a fire under it. Once it fills up with some blood you can Right-&#00D9FFClick&r with an empty bottle to collect the blood."]
	quest.3B8BC6CC1B02ED7E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blood Vial"
	quest.3BACCC6A2CAA9818.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFLesser Spell Slot Upgrade&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3BACCC6A2CAA9818.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lesser Spell Slot Upgrade"
	quest.3BB1B7935FADD720.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPortable QIO Dashboard&r is just a portable version of the dashboard."]
	quest.3BB1B7935FADD720.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portable Qio Dashboard"
	quest.3BCAFB9C3CCD9515.quest_desc: ["Fuel heats the furnace twice as fast, but all cooking recipes run a quarter slower."]
	quest.3BCAFB9C3CCD9515.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Augment Fuel"
	quest.3BD25483DB5F53BE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSteel Packer&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3BD25483DB5F53BE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Packer"
	quest.3BD25483DB5F53BE.title: "To Pack Or Not To Pack"
	quest.3BE1A07D7DCA6C81.quest_desc: ["Using &#00D9FFthe Scroll Forge&r and a &#00D9FFBlood Vial&r to craft a &#00D9FFBlood Scrolls&r."]
	quest.3BE1A07D7DCA6C81.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scroll"
	quest.3BEB56F2EFDF553C.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFToggle Bus&r is the same as a &#00D9FFGlass Cable&r, but is used to temporarily disable the section of a system downstream from it when unpowered. Powering it will allow data and power to pass once again."]
	quest.3BEB56F2EFDF553C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Toggle Bus"
	quest.3BEB56F2EFDF553C.title: "Toggle Bus"
	quest.3BF23B530B3EB7B1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFToxic Longsword&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3BF23B530B3EB7B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Toxic Longsword"
	quest.3BF474BA8E696316.quest_desc: ["You will need a combination of these different blocks to build the turbine. It is a complicated machine, so it is recommended to research it first. There are a ton of different tutorials on &#00D9FFYouTube&r."]
	quest.3BF474BA8E696316.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Turbine Valve, Turbine Vent, Turbine Blade and 5 more items"
	quest.3BF62E66A9B81D75.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFAndesite&r, &#00D9FFCopper and Brass Bogie Steps&r give you a practical way to climb aboard and add an industrial touch to your train." "It is worth collecting all three variants."]
	quest.3BF62E66A9B81D75.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Andesite Bogie Steps, Brass Bogie Steps and Copper Bogie Steps"
	quest.3BF7B61BB0D724C6.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCrystal Niotic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3BF7B61BB0D724C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Niotic"
	quest.3C02C4A077E07896.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSoulium Seed Base&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3C02C4A077E07896.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulium Seed Base"
	quest.3C05948D3A02D4BA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFThunder Bolt Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3C05948D3A02D4BA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thunder Bolt Sapling"
	quest.3C0850C41E780C48.quest_desc: ["Equip a full set of &#00D9FFRare Affix Gear&r (helmet, chestplate, leggings, boots and weapon), then defeat the &#00D9FFWither&r."]
	quest.3C0850C41E780C48.quest_subtitle: "Reach World Tier: Summit"
	quest.3C0850C41E780C48.title: "The Summit"
	quest.3C3AEFEE03F702F2.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMyrtle Ebony Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3C3AEFEE03F702F2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Myrtle Ebony Sapling"
	quest.3C3F8AF9841A1D11.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9AA2x&r &#00D9FFFormation Core&r and &#00D9AA2x&r &#00D9FFAnnihilation Core&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3C3F8AF9841A1D11.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Formation Core and 2x Annihilation Core"
	quest.3C3F8AF9841A1D11.title: "The two Cores"
	quest.3C4D234ED85FC063.quest_desc: ["Upgrades a &#00D9FFBasic&r or &#00D9FFCopper&r storage to &#00D9FFIron&r tier."]
	quest.3C4D234ED85FC063.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic to Iron Tier Upgrade and Copper to Iron Tier Upgrade"
	quest.3C4D234ED85FC063.title: "Iron Tier Upgrade"
	quest.3C4F9711592D2278.quest_desc: ["Upgrades can be put into machines and hives to increase their functionality or improve the performance."]
	quest.3C4F9711592D2278.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Base"
	quest.3C681A8671313F41.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFStainless Steel Ingot&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3C681A8671313F41.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stainless Steel Ingot"
	quest.3C681A8671313F41.title: "Invar with Slot Locking"
	quest.3C6CC2168711B897.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFFoggy Blast Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3C6CC2168711B897.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Foggy Blast Sapling"
	quest.3C74CE1EA5F15362.quest_desc: ["A wrench that rotates blocks. Try it on your favorite tech blocks that have wrench interactions."]
	quest.3C74CE1EA5F15362.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Wrench"
	quest.3C80BA4CD4E3205B.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFBulk Storage Cells&r can hold an infinite amount of 1 singular item."]
	quest.3C80BA4CD4E3205B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bulk Item Cell"
	quest.3C8ADEBAEC36DE06.quest_desc: ["Armor-piercing ammo."]
	quest.3C8ADEBAEC36DE06.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo Ap"
	quest.3C8DC1B65F027AAD.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFWireless Terminal&r is a regular &#00D9FFTerminal&r that can be used to access an &#00D9FFME System&r wirelessly. Use an &#00D9FFAccess Point&r to connect up your &#00D9FFTerminal&r and use &#00D9FFBooster Cards&r to increase the total distance from that &#00D9FFAccess Point&r you want to be able to use your system. Using multiple &#00D9FFAccess Points&r on the same network in different locations can help you cover a larger footprint."]
	quest.3C8DC1B65F027AAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wireless Terminal"
	quest.3C8DC1B65F027AAD.title: "Wireless Terminal"
	quest.3C9F95FEDD54A449.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFNano&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.3CB1879E6E46D1A6.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFInferium&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.3CB1EA7659B5A4A7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFLogwood Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3CB1EA7659B5A4A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logwood Sapling"
	quest.3CEF188D9C59CF25.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFThallasium Leggings&r from &#00D9FFThallasium Plating&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "They give the entry-level protection of &#00D9FFBetter End's&r armor line."]
	quest.3CEF188D9C59CF25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Leggings"
	quest.3D01D4524B4043D2.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Volume&r of the &#00D9FFDeep&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFNetherite Spell Book&r, &#00D9FFEcho Ingots&r, a &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard&r and a &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Template&r." "Spells from the old book are not kept, so empty it first."]
	quest.3D01D4524B4043D2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Volume of the Deep"
	quest.3D0DD00DB1602DB1.quest_desc: ["You can upgrade a basic &#FFA500Sophisticated Storage&r container to the &#00D9FFCopper Tier&r. It boosts the container and opens the way to more advanced storage options."]
	quest.3D0DD00DB1602DB1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic to Copper Tier Upgrade"
	quest.3D2524909A2B138A.quest_desc: ["Place a &#00D9FFHellshelf&r in the enchanting table and use &#00D9FFInfusion&r. The option appears once the table has at least 45 &#00D9FFEterna&r and &#00D9AA30%&r &#00D9FFQuanta&r." "It gives &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFEterna&r (up to 60) and &#00D9AA+5&r &#00D9FFQuanta&r, and is the base for every advanced &#00D9FFHellshelf&r."]
	quest.3D2524909A2B138A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Infused Hellshelf"
	quest.3D30505F0C58F0ED.quest_desc: ["Makes melee attacks deal fire damage."]
	quest.3D30505F0C58F0ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fire Gauntlet"
	quest.3D30DE240B488D3A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFGoldfish&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3D30DE240B488D3A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Goldfish"
	quest.3D4390F743BB5126.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Bosses'Rise&r turns boss fights into real encounters. Each boss has its own arena, its own moveset and phases that change how you have to play, so winning comes from reading the fight instead of tanking it. "]
	quest.3D4390F743BB5126.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.3D46CE667582329F.quest_desc: ["Drygmy shards can be found in loot chests. Drygmy shards are used to create drygmy charms."]
	quest.3D46CE667582329F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Drygmy Shard"
	quest.3D6066ED0346CE06.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.3D6066ED0346CE06.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Leap"
	quest.3D611D08691AF5FF.quest_desc: ["Allows you to move items from your &#00D9FFStorage Drives&r into other &#00D9FFStorage&r drives. Useful if you want to compress items in &#00D9FFDrives&r or empty &#00D9FFDrives&r to make bigger ones."]
	quest.3D611D08691AF5FF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Io Port"
	quest.3D61DBC728EC482D.quest_desc: ["Flux Storage keeps excess energy and only fills once every &#00D9FFFlux Point&r has received enough. Stored energy can only leave through a &#00D9FFFlux Point&r. This tier has a transfer limit of 20,000. Networks do not need storage to work."]
	quest.3D61DBC728EC482D.quest_subtitle: "Stores surplus energy in your network"
	quest.3D629369D4381551.quest_desc: ["Use the starbuncle charm on the ground to create a starbuncle."]
	quest.3D629369D4381551.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starbuncle Charm"
	quest.3D63CB521550EC46.quest_desc: ["A one-time warp to a specified location."]
	quest.3D63CB521550EC46.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Warping"
	quest.3D6B672BA124961F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFChicken Soup&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3D6B672BA124961F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chicken Soup"
	quest.3D7D5A7F91C9B7D5.quest_desc: ["Simple version: collects fluids, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.3D7D5A7F91C9B7D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.3D7FFDF4548AE546.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFWaxweaver&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3D7FFDF4548AE546.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Waxweaver"
	quest.3D8FE3E0F08AF1E6.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Hill1."]
	quest.3D8FE3E0F08AF1E6.quest_subtitle: "Defeat a Redcap Goblin in a small Hollow Hill"
	quest.3DA0B5970547DA41.quest_desc: ["Multiplies the number of stacks that can fit in a slot by 8."]
	quest.3DA0B5970547DA41.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Tier 3"
	quest.3DA2A4662C54DD98.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFEnergy Cells&r store up to 200,000 AE. They do not accept power directly but are used to add additional power storage to an already existing &#00D9FFME Network&r."]
	quest.3DA2A4662C54DD98.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell"
	quest.3DAB2EA1053E0DAA.quest_desc: ["The Devil provides resistance to fire."]
	quest.3DAB2EA1053E0DAA.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Devil"
	quest.3DBEC2403FEA3077.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Zanite."]
	quest.3DBEC2403FEA3077.quest_subtitle: "Get a Zanite Gemstone"
	quest.3DD32E24F8A24FAD.quest_desc: ["Obtained from ore found commonly around sea level, &#00D9FFSal Ammoniac&r is a crystal brimming with useful properties. You will want a decent supply of it."]
	quest.3DD32E24F8A24FAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sal Ammoniac Crystal"
	quest.3DE1B4FF6A24FE7B.quest_desc: ["Comes in several colors to match any decor."]
	quest.3DE1B4FF6A24FE7B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.3DE941A927F6D58F.quest_desc: ["Adds a stonecutter to the backpack."]
	quest.3DE941A927F6D58F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stonecutter Upgrade"
	quest.3DF3D2A4A8A736C8.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFBlood Rune&r is a crafting ingredient in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r, used for advanced &#00D9FFBlood&r crafting such as &#00D9FFBlood Upgrade Orbs&r. It is the &#00D9FFBlood&r-school &#00D9FFRunestone&r." "Combine a &#00D9FFBlank Runestone&r with 8 &#00D9FFBlood Vials&r to make one. &#00D9FFBlood Vials&r are the &#00D9FFBlood Focus&r."]
	quest.3DF3D2A4A8A736C8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blood Rune"
	quest.3E0BDA5AE487EECA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFArctic Helmet&r, &#00D9FFArctic Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFArctic Leggings and Arctic Boots&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3E0BDA5AE487EECA.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Arctic Armor"
	quest.3E0BDA5AE487EECA.title: "Arctic Armorer"
	quest.3E0F594055E7944F.quest_desc: ["Use a &#00D9FFSchematic and Quil&r to save a build or a piece of your world. Use an &#00D9FFEmpty Schematic&r in a &#00D9FFSchematic Table&r to put your schemes in motion."]
	quest.3E0F594055E7944F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Schematic and Quill and Empty Schematic"
	quest.3E188DFCAF1277B3.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFThermo Generator Starter&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3E188DFCAF1277B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermo Generator Starter"
	quest.3E1D3B3F78067D3F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFWestern Hemlock Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3E1D3B3F78067D3F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Western Hemlock Sapling"
	quest.3E43003D1193AD5A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAeternium Hoe&r is a top-tier farming tool forged from &#00D9FFAeternium&r, the strongest material in &#00D9FFBetter End&r." "It finishes the mod's tool progression along with the rest of the &#00D9FFAeternium&r set."]
	quest.3E43003D1193AD5A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Hoe"
	quest.3E4A7158F4BBBFEB.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCompressed Steel&r is crafted with an &#00D9FFIron Ingot&r thrown on the ground and blown up by TNT, but you will not always get your return on it. Expected loss is &#00D9AA25%&r of your &#00D9FFIron&r thrown. &#00D9FFNeeds Casing&r for cable tier to convert to (LV by default). Note: By holding SHIFT over any PNC item will give a description of the item."]
	quest.3E4A7158F4BBBFEB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 64x Ingot Iron Compressed"
	quest.3E4A7158F4BBBFEB.title: "Welcome to PNC"
	quest.3E6CF9EE620AB242.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBlast Furnace&r also outputs &#00D9FFSlag&r. Crush it for &#00D9FFSand&r, or use it in &#00D9FFConcrete&r and a few other building blocks."]
	quest.3E6CF9EE620AB242.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 27x Blastbrick"
	quest.3E6CF9EE620AB242.title: "Blast Furnace"
	quest.3E6D77B5161E00B4.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRighteous Relic&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3E6D77B5161E00B4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Righteous Relic"
	quest.3E6E4ABA17AE83C6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFThermo Generator Basic&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3E6E4ABA17AE83C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermo Generator Basic"
	quest.3E7028558A5513C6.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCultivated Pear Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3E7028558A5513C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cultivated Pear Sapling"
	quest.3E7619BBBA700412.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFChemical Crystallizer&r turns &#00D9FFClean Slurry&r into &#00D9FFCrystals&r and lithium into lithium dust. This is one of the select many machines in &#FFA500Mekanism&r to have dedicated, unchangeable sides for input and output."]
	quest.3E7619BBBA700412.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Crystallizer"
	quest.3E77595FE3410515.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBow Blazegold&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3E77595FE3410515.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bow Blazegold"
	quest.3E7DAF1A83243373.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFNutmeg Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3E7DAF1A83243373.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nutmeg Sapling"
	quest.3E8C2D813E7AF7A6.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Modern Dynamics&r adds configurable transport for items and other resources. Explore its network components and filters as another option for automating a base."]
	quest.3E8C2D813E7AF7A6.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.3E92DC0B9D6AB427.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.3E92DC0B9D6AB427.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Sawing Factory"
	quest.3E9B1C4C5D01971E.quest_desc: ["You need the focus from the labyrinth first."]
	quest.3E9B1C4C5D01971E.quest_subtitle: "Craft and open the Maze Map"
	quest.3E9B1C4C5D01971E.title: "And Now, to Find the Exit."
	quest.3E9E1A26BCE91AF4.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the barrel."]
	quest.3E9E1A26BCE91AF4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Netherite Barrel"
	quest.3E9E1A26BCE91AF4.title: "Netherite Barrel"
	quest.3EACD434A13F0A9C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBook of Binding Afrit&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3EACD434A13F0A9C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Afrit"
	quest.3EAF5695FAEB6E80.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFThread Magic Capacity&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.3EAF5695FAEB6E80.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Magic Capacity"
	quest.3EBA52D8E254A7D8.quest_desc: ["Applies an extra level of &#00D9FFFortune&r to mined blocks."]
	quest.3EBA52D8E254A7D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lucky Scarf"
	quest.3EBC5FA0600539F7.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFFission Reactor&r is a complicated multiblock structure. Therefore, it is recommended to research some common designs. &#00D9FFFission Reactors&r require constant attention unless you have a large amount of fail safes. Even if you do, it is still good practice to place it far away from your base, or in another dimension. In the event of a meltdown, it will blanket a very large radius in lethal radiation that will last for quite a few ingame weeks."]
	quest.3EBC5FA0600539F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Fission Reactor Port, Fission Fuel Assembly, Control Rod Assembly and 2 more items"
	quest.3EE23EFF33BD6FD3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCow Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3EE23EFF33BD6FD3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cow Seeds"
	quest.3EFF6E83AE509F6B.quest_desc: ["Counters give your kitchen more working space and let you extend the layout."]
	quest.3EFF6E83AE509F6B.quest_subtitle: "Extra space for your kitchen"
	quest.3F0FBA9B295C00F7.quest_desc: ["This Rod can locate &#00D9FFRare&r materials."]
	quest.3F0FBA9B295C00F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Divination Rod T2"
	quest.3F1B5FD368DA75AF.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFStable Wormholes&r are placeable access points to the &#00D9FFStorage Actuator&r. Items can be piped in and out, but a transporter spirit is recommended for extraction to avoid lag." "The &#00D9FFStorage Remote&r lets you reach your storage from far away with no range or dimension limit, as long as the actuator's chunk is loaded."]
	quest.3F1B5FD368DA75AF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stable Wormhole and Storage Remote"
	quest.3F1B5FD368DA75AF.title: "Storage Access"
	quest.3F1CCB36D5B017CE.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFUniversal Cables&r are &#FFA500Mekanism&r's way to transfer power. Capacity: 3.20 kFE/t."]
	quest.3F1CCB36D5B017CE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Universal Cable"
	quest.3F1CCB36D5B017CE.title: "Basic Universal Cable"
	quest.3F2021A5A184DB17.quest_desc: ["This magical bow can be inscribed with a spell."]
	quest.3F2021A5A184DB17.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spell Bow"
	quest.3F3FB417B1559B1B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRosewood Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3F3FB417B1559B1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rosewood Sapling"
	quest.3F5689FFD66B4B4D.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.3F5689FFD66B4B4D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Lightning"
	quest.3F6064916ED91F2E.quest_desc: ["This is used for decoration or rituals."]
	quest.3F6064916ED91F2E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Brazier"
	quest.3F66E1BE7E440FF6.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.3F66E1BE7E440FF6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Crushing Factory"
	quest.3F9305C8DF6F929A.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFBlaze Rods&r are used to craft &#00D9FFFire Scrolls&r."]
	quest.3F9305C8DF6F929A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blaze Rod"
	quest.3F93A3134DEBD500.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBull Pine Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3F93A3134DEBD500.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bull Pine Sapling"
	quest.3FA07C689D211D45.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Resonarium Shovel&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFDiamond Shovel&r, &#00D9FFSturdy Sheets&r, a &#00D9FFResonarium Plate&r and a &#00D9FFResonarium Upgrade Template&r." "The template can be found in &#00D9FFAncient Cities&r, &#00D9FFTrial Chambers and Strongholds&r."]
	quest.3FA07C689D211D45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Shovel"
	quest.3FA7DEFE4DDBB86C.quest_desc: ["Adds a blasting furnace to the storage."]
