	quest.3FBEE43365F45CE9.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFWandering Magician Shoes&r are part of the basic &#00D9FFWandering Magician Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+2&r &#00D9FFArmor&r and &#00D9AA+25&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r." "Craft them by combining &#00D9FFLeather Boots&r with &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r, an accessible early-game option."]
