	quest.3FC4AE282D470051.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFDog Food&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.3FC4AE282D470051.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dog Food"
	quest.3FC4C3958F159E39.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAlchemist Robe&r is an equipment item from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r tied to alchemy progression." "It belongs to the alchemist gear set and, depending on the version, enhances exploration or alchemy mechanics."]
	quest.3FC4C3958F159E39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemist Robe"
	quest.3FC5130B6B318364.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCopper Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.3FC5130B6B318364.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Seeds"
	quest.3FC8112EC8BB1F0B.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFMagehunter&r is a strong sword in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r, carried by the &#00D9FFVindicator&r on the second floor of an &#00D9FFArchevoker Fort&r. It can drop when you defeat that &#00D9FFVindicator&r." "In the main hand it gives 7 &#00D9FFAttack Damage&r, 1.6 &#00D9FFAttack Speed&r, 2.5 &#00D9FFAttack Range&r and &#00D9AA+15%&r &#00D9FFSpell Resistance&r."]
	quest.3FC8112EC8BB1F0B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magehunter"
	quest.3FD83E71D2C6C707.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFEnriched Carbon&r is used in the &#00D9FFMetallurgic Infuser&r. &#00D9FFEnriched Carbon&r yields 80 units of carbon in the infuser, the same as 8 coal or 4 charcoal."]
	quest.3FD83E71D2C6C707.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Carbon"
	quest.3FF3B795E82E89A2.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPressurized Tubes&r are a way of transporting types of gas, such as steam, hydrogen, and oxygen. Transfer Rate: 256,000 mb/t."]
	quest.3FF3B795E82E89A2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Pressurized Tube"
	quest.3FFCACDBC7FDA173.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.3FFCACDBC7FDA173.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Touch"
	quest.40057BD424CD6D99.quest_desc: ["This &#00D9FFCatalyst&r slowly turns &#00D9FFMercury&r into &#00D9FFMercury Flux&r, a source of &#00D9FFEnergy&r for alchemical devices."]
