	quest.40A5DE9150D0B86A.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFEvocation Rune&r is a crafting ingredient in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r, used for advanced &#00D9FFEvocation&r crafting such as &#00D9FFEvocation Upgrade Orbs&r." "Combine a &#00D9FFBlank Runestone&r with 8 &#00D9FFEmeralds&r to make one. Emeralds are the &#00D9FFFocus&r of the &#00D9FFEvocation&r school."]
