	quest.40B37C654D4967C7.quest_desc: ["Upgrade &#00D9FFTerminite Boots&r with an &#00D9FFAeternium Forged Plate&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r to craft &#00D9FFAeternium Boots&r." "They finish the &#00D9FFAeternium&r armor set, &#00D9FFBetter End's&r strongest protective gear."]
