	quest.40F1800B8526827B.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFBreak Ender Ore&r, found in many End biomes, to get &#00D9FFEnder Shards&r." "Craft &#00D9FFEnd Dust&r from them in an &#00D9FFAnvil&r. They are also needed for the &#00D9FFEternal Crystal Infusion Ritual&r."]
