	quest.419C8A067CAF52C1.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFiery Helmet&r, &#00D9FFFiery Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFFiery Leggings and Fiery Boots&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
