	quest.42A1EC7B1A728313.quest_desc: ["This enchantment applies a spell to your &#FFA500Ars Nouveau&r armor. Enchanter's tools do not need it. For example, &#00D9FFSelf&r, &#00D9FFHeal and Amplify&r heals you whenever you get hit."]
