	quest.42C397FE505CC3C9.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFJukebox Upgrade&r turns your backpack into a portable jukebox. You can play music discs from its upgrade tab." "The &#00D9FFAdvanced Jukebox Upgrade&r stores several discs and adds track switching, shuffle and repeat modes."]
	quest.42C397FE505CC3C9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jukebox Upgrade and Advanced Jukebox Upgrade"
	quest.42C397FE505CC3C9.title: "Jukebox and Advanced Jukebox Upgrade"
	quest.42C4503B515BC005.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFLimited Gold Barrel&r 4. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.42C4503B515BC005.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Gold Barrel 4"
	quest.42CAF522E640BE57.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFSolar Neutron Activator&r takes one fluid and uses the power of the sun to turn it into another. It does not use power, but like stated, requires sunlight. This is the one of the first steps into making a fusion reactor. You will need to put &#00D9FFLithium&r, from the &#00D9FFEvap Plants&r, into it to make &#00D9FFTritium&r."]
	quest.42CAF522E640BE57.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Neutron Activator"
	quest.42CF588A0AF75C45.quest_desc: ["Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their &#00D9FFFactory&r equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the &#00D9FFTier Installer&r and it will upgrade that machine. its level (&#00D9FFBasic&r, Advanced, or &#00D9FFElite&r) depending on the level of the &#00D9FFTier Installer&r used."]
	quest.42CF588A0AF75C45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Tier Installer"
	quest.42DFB47A9BF08F29.quest_desc: ["Ensuring you have keybinds set, hold shift over the &#00D9FFHelmet&r piece to see which key you must press to enable &#00D9FFNight Vision&r. Do the same for the &#00D9FFLeggings and Boots&r for &#00D9FFSpeed Boost and Step Boost&r respectively. The armor can also be &#00D9FFDyed and Trimmed&r."]
	quest.42DFB47A9BF08F29.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nano Helmet, Nano Chestplate, Nano Leggings and Nano Boots"
	quest.42DFB47A9BF08F29.title: "Nano Suit"
	quest.42F88B4FEBBDA6FE.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHydraulic Press&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r brings strong hydraulic processing to your factory. It compacts and processes materials in ways standard &#FFA500Create&r machines cannot."]
	quest.42F88B4FEBBDA6FE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hydraulic Press"
	quest.42FC15CB7B7D0CD5.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Warden Leggings&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFNetherite Leggings&r, &#00D9FFEcho Ingots&r, &#00D9FFWarden Carapace&r, a &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard&r and a &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Template&r." "Enchantments on the netherite piece are not kept, so enchant the result afterwards."]
	quest.42FC15CB7B7D0CD5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Leggings"
	quest.4305A8C0E0E954C6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBullet Pepper&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4305A8C0E0E954C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bullet Pepper"
	quest.4307DE422770452B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBulwark&r of the &#00D9FFFlame&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a legendary shield imbued with &#00D9FFIgnis'&r power." "It lets you withstand heavy attacks, and it is one of the best relics from the &#00D9FFBurning Arena&r."]
	quest.4307DE422770452B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bulwark of the Flame"
	quest.4307DE422770452B.title: "Bulwark Of The Flame"
	quest.430B6EC5C2E07EF0.quest_desc: ["Get a &#00D9FFCopper Ingot&r. Copper is useful for crafting early tools, machines and components."]
	quest.430B6EC5C2E07EF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 64x Copper Ingot"
	quest.430B6EC5C2E07EF0.title: "Copper Collector"
	quest.4313C74A109377D7.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFUnbreakable Skull&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a rare trophy linked to the cursed desert warriors." "It is an accessory, and the &#00D9FFBelt of Beginner&r adds &#00D9FFCurio&r slots for it."]
	quest.4313C74A109377D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Unbreakable Skull"
	quest.43149151A5354233.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBlazegold Boots&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.43149151A5354233.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazegold Boots"
	quest.431726AB35F1031B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFChocolate Pie Slice&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.431726AB35F1031B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chocolate Pie Slice"
	quest.431A2DC1D16F0719.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSquid Ink Pasta&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.431A2DC1D16F0719.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Squid Ink Pasta"
	quest.43293AD176CDA9A8.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Warden Shovel&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFNetherite Shovel&r, &#00D9FFEcho Ingots&r, a &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard&r and a &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Template&r."]
	quest.43293AD176CDA9A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Shovel"
	quest.43369AE8C8A4A347.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFAllspice Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.43369AE8C8A4A347.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Allspice Sapling"
	quest.433863879CFD076B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBasic Fluid Tank&r can hold up to &#00D9AA14000mB&r of fluids. It can double as a bucket by switching its mode to bucket mode."]
	quest.433863879CFD076B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Fluid Tank"
	quest.433AADDE5F53343F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBloodwake&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.433AADDE5F53343F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bloodwake"
	quest.434D23129E54AAB9.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFExtracts Spawner Cores&r from &#00D9FFVanilla Spawners&r. Be ready for a challenge…."]
	quest.434D23129E54AAB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawner Extractor"
	quest.434DF25E6DD7ACB8.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBlue Yonder Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.434DF25E6DD7ACB8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blue Yonder Sapling"
	quest.435187F5B5EB3963.quest_desc: ["Used to create different types of &#00D9FFProcessors&r. The inscriber can also \"create\" presses by duplicating an existing press with an &#00D9FFIron Block&r."]
	quest.435187F5B5EB3963.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inscriber"
	quest.435BD89FA19787D3.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSoulium Ingot&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.435BD89FA19787D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulium Ingot"
	quest.4373ED4700D90FC3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEngineering Processor&r is made in an &#00D9FFInscriber&r from a &#00D9FFPrinted Engineering Circuit&r, &#00D9FFPrinted Silicon and Redstone&r. It is used for the &#00D9FFME Controller&r, &#00D9FFMolecular Assembler&r and many other machines."]
	quest.437C9CE5AC044541.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCanteen&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.437C9CE5AC044541.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Canteen"
	quest.43884CC55F5D7DDD.quest_desc: ["This is used to copy and paste settings of &#00D9FFME Devices&r. This is also used to link P2&#00D9FFP Tunnels&r."]
	quest.43884CC55F5D7DDD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Memory Card"
	quest.43884CC55F5D7DDD.title: "Memory Card"
	quest.439455FDC9BD37E3.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9AA4x&r &#00D9FFInferium Essence&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.439455FDC9BD37E3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Inferium Essence"
	quest.439455FDC9BD37E3.title: "Gather Inferium Essence"
	quest.43ADA919280C097E.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFLapis Lazuli&r is a key resource for enchanting gear. Handle it carefully and bring some back." "You will need it to upgrade your weapons and armor."]
	quest.43ADA919280C097E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 32x Lapis Lazuli"
	quest.43ADA919280C097E.title: "Lapis Discovery"
	quest.43DA96FDDA24D10F.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFDivine Pearls&r are crafted using one &#00D9FFGold Ingot&r and one &#00D9FFAmethyst Shard&r in a &#00D9FFCrafting Bench&r. They are used to create &#00D9FFHoly Scrolls&r."]
	quest.43DA96FDDA24D10F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Divine Pearl"
	quest.43DE94A09F886107.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCold Striderloaf&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.43DE94A09F886107.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cold Striderloaf"
	quest.43E2922C6586604A.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the chest."]
	quest.43E2922C6586604A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Netherite Chest"
	quest.43E2922C6586604A.title: "Netherite Chest"
	quest.43EC58F58B7206DA.quest_desc: ["Stores 8 charges of a potion."]
	quest.43EC58F58B7206DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Potion Flask"
	quest.43F8875D2E24DED9.quest_desc: ["Captures bees for storage or transport. Right-click a bee with the cage to catch it, and right-click again to release it."]
	quest.43F8875D2E24DED9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bee Cage"
	quest.43F9DE0957530B96.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFWither Skeleton Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.43F9DE0957530B96.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wither Skeleton Seeds"
	quest.4401999C21229782.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPasta With Meatballs&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4401999C21229782.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pasta With Meatballs"
	quest.44099EBC6A0E5A64.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSugar Maple Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.44099EBC6A0E5A64.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sugar Maple Sapling"
	quest.440E2B9D3C11EE69.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarfire Hammer&r is a late-game heavy weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r in the &#00D9FFStarfire&r tier." "It is built for high-damage melee attacks."]
	quest.440E2B9D3C11EE69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfire Hammer"
	quest.440EE63E20B0C52A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBlastproof Alloy Plate&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.440EE63E20B0C52A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blastproof Alloy Plate"
	quest.440EE63E20B0C52A.title: "Creeper Nightmare"
	quest.441815259B642CB7.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFYeti&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.441E636144B67259.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFAtlantic Halibut&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.441E636144B67259.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Atlantic Halibut"
	quest.442BB42F883698CD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFOsmium Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.442BB42F883698CD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Osmium Seeds"
	quest.442C865BA39D437D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFChef Hat&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.442C865BA39D437D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chef Hat"
	quest.444BE6FEF26CFA3F.quest_desc: ["Iron ingots are the basis of many tools, weapons and armor. Smelt iron ore in a furnace to get them."]
	quest.444BE6FEF26CFA3F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Ingot"
	quest.444BE6FEF26CFA3F.title: "Molten Potential"
	quest.445B1A87EDD03C87.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.445B1A87EDD03C87.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Redstone Signal"
	quest.4460877D3B63EC51.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Used &#00D9FFSteel Upgrade&r."]
	quest.4460877D3B63EC51.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Used Steel Upgrade"
	quest.446D191A2628E5BB.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHandheld Saw&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r is a portable tool for quick material processing. Keep it nearby to handle cutting jobs without a stationary machine."]
	quest.446D191A2628E5BB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Handheld Saw"
	quest.4486D8B84EE7D81E.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCelestigem Sword&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4486D8B84EE7D81E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Sword"
	quest.448B91713475C5C3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFQuesting Ram&r only appears in the &#00D9FFQuest Grove&r, which is a rare spawn. Give it one wool of each of the 16 colors, either by right-clicking it or by dropping the wool in front of it."]
	quest.448B91713475C5C3.quest_subtitle: "Give the Questing Ram what it is missing"
	quest.4496F13DC6E772FC.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFGearbox&r and a &#00D9FFVertical Gearbox&r from &#FFA500Create&r. Gearboxes redirect rotational power between axes." "The standard &#00D9FFGearbox&r handles horizontal directions, while the &#00D9FFVertical Gearbox&r links horizontal and vertical axes."]
	quest.4496F13DC6E772FC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gearbox and Vertical Gearbox"
	quest.449AC4149447C26B.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to set attackers on fire."]
	quest.449AC4149447C26B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flame Pendant"
	quest.44ADE9005757637C.quest_desc: ["The &#FFA500Cooking for Blockheads&r II book lets you craft food using the ingredients in your inventory."]
	quest.44ADE9005757637C.quest_subtitle: "Cook straight from your inventory"
	quest.44CC46E4EFDC509F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEclipsealloy Shovel&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.44CC46E4EFDC509F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Shovel"
	quest.44CFB3403E8D0BF6.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMeteorite Compass&r points toward the nearest meteorite. Meteorites contain &#00D9FFSky Stone&r and other useful materials."]
	quest.44CFB3403E8D0BF6.title: "Compass and Meteorite"
	quest.44D2D8EC560D8297.quest_desc: ["Press M to open the full-screen map. From there you can claim chunks to protect your base."]
	quest.44D2D8EC560D8297.quest_subtitle: "Protect your base."
	quest.44D2D8EC560D8297.title: "Claim Your Land"
	quest.44D4F624126DA371.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSoul Extractor&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.44D4F624126DA371.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Extractor"
	quest.44DB40AE52CB1D95.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFEnriched Diamond&r is used in the &#00D9FFMetallurgic Infuser&r. &#00D9FFEnriched Diamond&r yields 80 units of diamond in the &#00D9FFMetallurgic Infuser&r, the same as 8 diamonds."]
	quest.44DB40AE52CB1D95.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Diamond"
	quest.44E3CE67401E0238.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFElectromancer Boots&r are part of the &#00D9FFElectromancer Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFLightning Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft them from 4 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFLightning Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Boots&r with 1 &#00D9FFLightning Rune&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r."]
	quest.44E3CE67401E0238.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electromancer Boots"
	quest.44F0EF0D7B03A5E2.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSealed Rapier&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.44F0EF0D7B03A5E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sealed Rapier"
	quest.45051BB3EEA08C1A.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500NetherEx&r expands &#00D9FFNether&r exploration with additional environments and content. Discover its features while traveling through the &#00D9FFNether&r."]
	quest.45051BB3EEA08C1A.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.452EDABF74564FCF.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAmaramber Sickle&r was added in version 0.4.2 as part of the &#00D9FFAmaramber&r set in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It gathers plants and vegetation efficiently."]
	quest.452EDABF74564FCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amaramber Sickle"
	quest.4533FE25145D8E82.quest_desc: ["Your second multi-block: The &#00D9FFSteam Blast Furnace&r! This one is nearly the same, with the only difference being it's one taller and uses &#00D9FFFire Clay Bricks&r instead of regular &#00D9FFBricks&r. Use the same trick with the &#00D9FFWrench&r to show you the block placements and don't forget you'll need only 3 hatches this time. They're the same as the &#00D9FFCoke Oven&r, without the fluid output hatch, not yet anyway! You will use this &#00D9FFSteam Blast Furnace&r to make your first &#00D9FFSteel&r!"]
	quest.4533FE25145D8E82.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Item Input Hatch, Bronze Fluid Input Hatch, Bronze Item Output Hatch and 2 more items"
	quest.4533FE25145D8E82.title: "Steam Blast Furnace"
	quest.45410E3C4A9DF1C4.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFGray Chalk&r stabilizes pentacles even more than its predecessor."]
	quest.45410E3C4A9DF1C4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Gray Impure"
	quest.45412ABD582FF8D7.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFUpgrade Obsidian&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.45412ABD582FF8D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Obsidian"
	quest.454578CEB0618DFA.quest_desc: ["The Beaver increases the speed at which you harvest wood. It will also try to chop down trees."]
	quest.454578CEB0618DFA.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Beaver"
	quest.4549D908277481DB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4549D908277481DB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.454F456F34978425.quest_desc: ["This spirit will mine random &#00D9FFOres&r. It is also a little faster."]
	quest.454F456F34978425.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Djinni Ores"
	quest.456654B12D46BD13.quest_desc: ["Notable rituals: Awakening creates helpers like amethyst golems, bookwyrms for storage lecterns and weald walkers, which are not very strong. &#00D9FFConjure Island&r: Plains converts the area around it into another biome. Water and air blocks get replaced, and source is only needed while it runs."]
	quest.456654B12D46BD13.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Burrowing, Ritual Awakening, Ritual Conjure Island Plains and 6 more items"
	quest.456654B12D46BD13.title: "Green Tablets"
	quest.456DB9B6BF60ADA3.quest_desc: ["Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their &#00D9FFFactory&r equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the &#00D9FFTier Installer&r and it will upgrade that machine. its level (&#00D9FFBasic&r, Advanced, or &#00D9FFElite&r) depending on the level of the &#00D9FFTier Installer&r used."]
	quest.456DB9B6BF60ADA3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Tier Installer"
	quest.457F623DAAA55AD9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSteak and Potatoes&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.457F623DAAA55AD9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steak and Potatoes"
	quest.4581119D3965F503.quest_desc: ["Assemble this multiblock with the &#00D9FFEngineer's Hammer&r. It crushes ores and other materials into dust."]
	quest.4581119D3965F503.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 10x Steel Scaffolding Standard, 10x Light Engineering, 9x Hopper and 2 more items"
	quest.4581119D3965F503.title: "Crusher Multiblock"
	quest.458A3FAB0F83652D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCrab&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.458A3FAB0F83652D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crab"
	quest.458A44D96BD7C86A.quest_desc: ["The sword breaks after use, so make the hit count."]
	quest.458A44D96BD7C86A.quest_subtitle: "Attack something with the Glass Sword"
	quest.458B3F19C9BBA511.quest_desc: ["This Module vents high-pressure air when the tube pressure reaches 4.9 bar (19.9 for &#00D9FFAdvanced Pressure Tubes&r). While it helps prevent explosions, it results in energy loss and wasted fuel. With a &#00D9FFModule Expansion Card&r, you can precisely adjust the pressure threshold through the GUI."]
	quest.458B3F19C9BBA511.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Safety Tube Module"
	quest.4590F5422A848829.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.4590F5422A848829.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Gust"
	quest.45922831D24638C0.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFTwisted Ghasta&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45922831D24638C0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Twisted Ghasta"
	quest.4594A8C1E81F7D37.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEldritch Manuscript&r is made with &#00D9FFEight Knowledge Fragments&r and one &#00D9FFEcho Shard&r. These are both found while looting &#00D9FFAncient Cities&r. Upon use it will give you the power of one &#00D9FFEldritch Scroll&r that you choose. You may unlock more but, a new &#00D9FFManuscript&r is needed per scroll."]
	quest.4594A8C1E81F7D37.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eldritch Manuscript"
	quest.45A9CD4D5ADD0A3E.quest_desc: ["Defeat 3 &#00D9FFProwlers&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r, one of the more dangerous enemies the mod adds." "Track them down."]
	quest.45A9CD4D5ADD0A3E.quest_subtitle: "Defeat The Prowler"
	quest.45A9CD4D5ADD0A3E.title: "The Prowler"
	quest.45C0DCC447288A06.quest_desc: ["An &#00D9FFArmored Version&r of the &#00D9FFJetpack&r."]
	quest.45C0DCC447288A06.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jetpack Armored"
	quest.45C24C7004A8F701.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFZombie Scepter&r drops from the &#00D9FFTwilight Lich&r. It lets you summon or control zombie minions during a fight." "It can be unpredictable, so it works best in controlled situations such as groups of enemies or dungeons."]
	quest.45C24C7004A8F701.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Zombie Scepter"
	quest.45C56FC46B501F99.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSecond Highest Tiered Storage Cell&r in normal AE2, which can contain 65,536 bytes of storage. 65,536 bytes of storage can hold 8,128 &#00D9FFStacks&r of a single item. or 4,160 &#00D9FFStacks&r,while holding 63 &#00D9FFDifferent&r items."]
	quest.45C56FC46B501F99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 64k"
	quest.45D60F041613F241.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBuddhas Hand Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.45D60F041613F241.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Buddhas Hand Sapling"
	quest.45E5BA0514FCA493.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMidnight Mantle&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45E5BA0514FCA493.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Midnight Mantle"
	quest.45E8EC554D3F1E25.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLaser Matrix System&r is the only way for the &#00D9FFFusion Reactor&r to start. It requires millions of RF to run, so make sure you have ample power to run these lasers. The &#00D9FFLaser Amplifier&r takes in lasers and stores the energy. You can use a redstone signal to tell it to output the energy. This one should be directed at the reactor's laser focus matrix. The &#00D9FFTractor Beam&r takes in lasers and outputs them in a different direction. This is a way to add more lasers to your system to store more power faster. They can, also, be used to mine blocks. The laser is, well, the laser. The laser will mine blocks, so make sure to know where it's pointing."]
	quest.45E8EC554D3F1E25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Laser Amplifier, Laser Tractor Beam and Laser"
	quest.45EE0F13462F75B7.quest_desc: ["Let your favorite mob drive your trains!"]
	quest.45EE0F13462F75B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Schedule"
	quest.45F47E7CE8CF1E27.quest_desc: ["Defeat a &#00D9FFSculk Leech&r to get &#00D9FFSoul Dust&r. They can also be hiding inside &#00D9FFCrystallized Amber&r."]
	quest.45F47E7CE8CF1E27.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Sculk Leech"
	quest.45F47E7CE8CF1E27.title: "Sculk Leech"
	quest.45F61C0596335D0F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMusic Disc Cat&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45F61C0596335D0F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Cat"
	quest.45F7B6D8B7FB411A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFTertium Sword&r, &#00D9FFTertium Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFTertium Shovel&r and 2 more items. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45F7B6D8B7FB411A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tertium Sword, Tertium Pickaxe, Tertium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.45F7B6D8B7FB411A.title: "Tertium Tools and Weaponry"
	quest.46053853A84567F9.quest_desc: ["The arcane core is to be placed beneath the enchanting apparatus to aid in magical endeavors."]
	quest.46053853A84567F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Core"
	quest.460D439B9F4B56D2.quest_desc: ["Press R while your inventory or a container is open to sort its contents."]
	quest.460D439B9F4B56D2.quest_subtitle: "One key does it."
	quest.460D439B9F4B56D2.title: "Sort Your Inventory"
	quest.461FC236C6A942D3.quest_desc: ["This allows to and from transfer of source from many jars at once."]
	quest.461FC236C6A942D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Relay Splitter"
	quest.462AB51D40A6902B.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFlux Dust&r comes from redstone. Place obsidian above bedrock, drop redstone dust between them, then left-click the obsidian. You can use as much redstone as you like each time."]
	quest.462AB51D40A6902B.quest_subtitle: "Make Flux Dust from redstone"
	quest.4636111DB885DDB0.quest_desc: ["Brontes is a heavy hammer from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r, part of the same arsenal as &#00D9FFCeraunus&r." "It is one of the mod's powerful weapons."]
	quest.4636111DB885DDB0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brontes"
	quest.4636111DB885DDB0.title: "Brontes"
	quest.463E9EA378DD2604.quest_desc: ["This Machine can place &#00D9FFFluids&r in the world, It's highly configurable."]
	quest.463E9EA378DD2604.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluidplacert1"
	quest.46517FD86E76A766.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFRobit&r is &#FFA500Mekanism&r's mechanical companion. He can act as a crafting grid, a furnace, an anvil, a chest, or simply a cute little buddy."]
	quest.46517FD86E76A766.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Robit"
	quest.46535886413DEE2A.quest_desc: ["The lowest tier of the stack upgrades."]
	quest.46535886413DEE2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Starter Tier"
	quest.46661D30758804B0.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMoonring Bow&r is a ranged weapon dropped by the &#00D9FFLunar Monstrosity&r in the &#00D9FFCursed Garden&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is guaranteed to drop when you defeat the boss."]
	quest.46661D30758804B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Moonring Bow"
	quest.46661D30758804B0.title: "Moonring Bow"
	quest.4669C67518ADA658.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Naga Scale Leggings&r from scales collected from the &#00D9FFNaga&r. They balance agility and protection." "They are part of the &#00D9FFNaga Scale&r armor set and help prepare you for the tougher enemies ahead."]
	quest.4669C67518ADA658.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Naga Leggings"
	quest.46753DE03E5ECFB9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFHawthorn Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.46753DE03E5ECFB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hawthorn Sapling"
	quest.4681D2BA66A2EBE4.quest_desc: ["Induction Provides make up the transfer rate of the battery, both input and output. Transfer Rate: 6.55 MFE/t."]
	quest.4681D2BA66A2EBE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Induction Provider"
	quest.468CD002E147A5DD.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFRider Flute&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.468CD002E147A5DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rider Flute"
	quest.468FA0F4EEF3ED46.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFExtended Buses&r have increased upgrade slots, and are &#00D9AA8x&r faster."]
	quest.468FA0F4EEF3ED46.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Export Bus Part and Ex Import Bus Part"
	quest.468FA0F4EEF3ED46.title: "Extended Buses"
	quest.46931846DB13F776.quest_desc: ["Threads are upgrades for your Ars armor. Each armor piece has up to 3 slots, and a higher slot level gives a stronger effect. Some threads only work in a level 3 slot, and threads do not stack, only the highest level is active." "Notable threads: &#00D9FFHigh Step&r adds step height per level, &#00D9FFWixie&r extends potion duration, and &#00D9FFUndying&r acts as a &#00D9FFTotem of Undying&r when you sleep." "&#00D9FFWixie's Enchanting Apparatus&r with AE2 makes this easier."]
	quest.46931846DB13F776.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Depths, Thread Heights, Thread Whirlisprig and 16 more items"
	quest.46931846DB13F776.title: "All The Threads"
	quest.46963B5745F0ECA6.quest_desc: ["Shadow-&#00D9FFWalker Armor&r is the chestpiece of the &#00D9FFShadow&r-&#00D9FFWalker Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+8&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFEnder Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Craft it from 8 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFEnder Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Robes&r with 1 &#00D9FFEnder Rune&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r."]
	quest.46963B5745F0ECA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shadowwalker Chestplate"
	quest.46A2949DFA16CC6E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.46A2949DFA16CC6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.46A5B3D57084D1C4.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAlchemist Mask&r is a utility item from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r tied to alchemy progression." "Depending on the version, it enhances exploration or alchemy mechanics."]
	quest.46A5B3D57084D1C4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemist Mask"
	quest.46BA34923525F3D8.quest_desc: ["Changes player-related spawning conditions, so the spawner cares less about players being nearby."]
	quest.46BA34923525F3D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignore Players Spawner Rune"
	quest.46BA34923525F3D8.title: "Ignore Players Spawner Rune"
	quest.46BB618D32E11D1A.quest_desc: ["Craft a &#00D9FFSleeping Bag&r to sleep safely without a bed. It lets you set your spawn point and rest almost anywhere."]
	quest.46BB618D32E11D1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.46BB618D32E11D1A.title: "Sleeping Bag"
	quest.46BC1669476A046C.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFGhast Salad&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.46BC1669476A046C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ghast Salad"
	quest.46C76FD0C9D0F414.quest_desc: ["Makes the backpack pick up items that you walk over."]
	quest.46C76FD0C9D0F414.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pickup Upgrade"
	quest.46CA95E874EC90D1.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.46CA95E874EC90D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Compressing Factory"
	quest.46E8C57260187BDB.quest_desc: ["Mine the glowing &#00D9FFAurora Crystal&r formations in the &#00D9FFCrystal Mountains&r to get &#00D9FFCrystal Shards&r." "They are among the most common ingredients in &#00D9FFBetter End's Infusion Rituals&r."]
	quest.46E8C57260187BDB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Shards"
	quest.46F11C259FC72F5D.quest_desc: ["An &#00D9FFExport Bus&r pushes selected items from your network into an attached inventory. Use it to supply machines or keep blocks stocked."]
	quest.46FD132CE008A57A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSmart Filter&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.46FD132CE008A57A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.46FE1E29B6F9B0DE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFGolden Egg&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.46FE1E29B6F9B0DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Golden Egg"
	quest.470B9BBE473E4872.quest_desc: ["The \"&#00D9FFQuartz&r in &#00D9FFNetherrack&r\" block is an alternative recipe for the &#00D9FFQuartz Nest&r. It is crafted with 1 &#00D9FFNetherrack&r and 8 &#00D9FFNether Quartz&r."]
	quest.470B9BBE473E4872.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Quartz Nest"
	quest.470C6BCB3EB14006.quest_desc: ["Will calcify and lose efficiency over time to a minimum of &#00D9AA33%&r efficiency when not using &#00D9FFDistilled Water&r. Using an Axe on the &#00D9FFBoiler&r will reset its calcification."]
	quest.470C6BCB3EB14006.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Solar Boiler"
	quest.470D9FDD6617D4F6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFShield of Retaliation&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.470D9FDD6617D4F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shield of Retaliation"
	quest.4725035EE888EDE4.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFRedstone Control Module&r is meant to let you control your machines with redstone! Right Clicking the module in your hand will change its setting from the machine requiring a &#00D9FFHigh Signal&r to &#00D9FFLow Signal&r and vice versa. Then place it into the redstone module slot. What this means is: While the setting is on &#00D9FFHigh Signal&r, the machine will only function if it is given a redstone signal. No redstone signal will turn it off. While the setting is on &#00D9FFLow Signal&r, the machine will only function if it is not given a redstone signal. A redstone signal will turn it off."]
	quest.4725035EE888EDE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Control Module"
	quest.472D846A7E655FAC.quest_desc: ["Gives you a longer window to reel in a fish."]
	quest.472D846A7E655FAC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Hook"
	quest.47515072B948EB9E.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFShadowpulse Goo&r turns &#00D9FFNetherite Blocks&r into &#00D9FFEclipse Alloy&r. It is fed with &#00D9FFSculk&r or &#00D9FFSculk Catalysts&r, and it can produce lower-tier resources faster. &#00D9FFCelestigem and Eclipse Alloy&r tools, weapons and armor need power to work."]
	quest.47515072B948EB9E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Raw Eclipsealloy, 2x Eclipsealloy Ingot and Gooblock Tier4"
	quest.47515072B948EB9E.title: "Making Eclipse Alloy"
	quest.475BFEF6EAA09FED.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Resonarium Axe&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFDiamond Axe&r, &#00D9FFSturdy Sheets&r, a &#00D9FFResonarium Plate&r and a &#00D9FFResonarium Upgrade Template&r." "The template can be found in &#00D9FFAncient Cities&r, &#00D9FFTrial Chambers and Strongholds&r."]
	quest.475BFEF6EAA09FED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resonarium Axe"
	quest.476135F0C7C9EE87.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFGooblock Tier&r1. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.476135F0C7C9EE87.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gooblock Tier1"
	quest.4775A233A5C46004.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.4775A233A5C46004.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Firework"
	quest.4776A81A79761BC5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCashew Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4776A81A79761BC5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cashew Sapling"
	quest.477AD8B1CEF350E7.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.477AD8B1CEF350E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Duration Down"
	quest.47A13F2B2331B0CC.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGoblin Stronghold&r lies deep beneath the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r. Its tomb holds the &#00D9FFKnight Phantoms&r, spectral warriors who still guard their fallen king." "They fight as a coordinated group with constant attacks, which makes this one of the toughest fights in the dimension. You need to defeat every &#00D9FFPhantom Knight&r to win."]
	quest.47A13F2B2331B0CC.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Knight Phantom"
	quest.47A13F2B2331B0CC.title: "Knight Phantom"
	quest.47A34AA5D80EC039.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCoffea Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.47A34AA5D80EC039.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coffea Sapling"
	quest.47A8BDA63DB27FA9.quest_desc: ["Vacuum tube, thermionic valve, &#00D9FFElectron Tube&r, by any name it’s a cool looking item and a key ingredient for &#FFA500Create&r components that have “smarts”."]
	quest.47A8BDA63DB27FA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electron Tube"
	quest.47A94E3465331798.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFThread Warding&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47A94E3465331798.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Warding"
	quest.47B79E9F1154361E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCore&r 4k. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47B79E9F1154361E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Core 4k"
	quest.47BD4D89EE0EECEA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFArcanethyst&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.47BD4D89EE0EECEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcanethyst"
	quest.47CDF2F5E5F3BF4A.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFSteam Blast Furnace&r."]
	quest.47CDF2F5E5F3BF4A.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Steam Blast Furnace"
	quest.47CF20BA88F5854A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBasic Control Circuit&r is a &#00D9FFCrafting Component&r used in the creation of multiple lower-tier machines."]
	quest.47CF20BA88F5854A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Control Circuit"
	quest.47D5460052C9075E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47D5460052C9075E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Anvil"
	quest.47E3BE49B4A74BF0.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFClove Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47E3BE49B4A74BF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Clove Sapling"
	quest.47E472ECCFC6B98D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMjolnir&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47E472ECCFC6B98D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mjolnir"
	quest.47F9ADAAF38A864D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSpawn Egg Configurable Bee&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.47F9ADAAF38A864D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Egg Configurable Bee"
	quest.47FB3A48D3E0C1BF.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSapphire Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.47FB3A48D3E0C1BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sapphire Seeds"
	quest.47FD673F259F1C85.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: Badlands, &#00D9FFBasalt&r, &#00D9FFBirch&r, &#00D9FFCrimson&r, &#00D9FFDesert&r, End, &#00D9FFGiant Tree Taiga&r, Icy, &#00D9FFJungle&r, &#00D9FFMangrove&r, &#00D9FFNether Brick&r, Oak, &#00D9FFOcean&r, &#00D9FFSavanna&r, &#00D9FFSoul&r, &#00D9FFSnowy&r, &#00D9FFTaiga and Warped&r."]
	quest.47FD673F259F1C85.quest_subtitle: "Find all 18 Pillager Outpost variants"
	quest.481148E497D80C70.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSealed Claymore&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.481148E497D80C70.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sealed Claymore"
	quest.4817447020A18FF9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSteeleaf Sword&r, &#00D9FFSteeleaf Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFSteeleaf Shovel and Steeleaf Axe&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4817447020A18FF9.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Steeleaf Tools"
	quest.4817447020A18FF9.title: "Steeleaf Tools"
	quest.4820F100479FE39D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFConfigurator&r is more than just a wrench - it's the essential tool for managing your &#FFA500Mekanism&r setup. &#00D9FFHold SHIFT&r and scroll to switch between its different modes. The currently selected mode is displayed in the bottom-left of your screen. * &#00D9FFConfigure&r. Change the input and output sides of machines without opening their GUI. * &#00D9FFEmpty&r. &#00D9FFHold SHIFT&r + RIGHT-CLICK to empty the contents of a machine or container. * &#00D9FFRotate&r. Rotate machines with RIGHT-CLICK or SHIFT + RIGHT-CLICK, depending on the desired orientation. You can also RIGHT-CLICK a machine's face to make it face the side you're clicking."]
	quest.4820F100479FE39D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurator"
	quest.4820F100479FE39D.title: "Configurator"
	quest.4855505E6625D540.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFJellyfish Necklace&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4855505E6625D540.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jellyfish Necklace"
	quest.48857E853D866C67.quest_desc: ["Sniffers can find &#00D9FFSussy Bee&r spawn eggs while sniffing the ground. A &#00D9FFSussy Bee&r turns nearby sand and gravel into suspicious sand and gravel, but only produces functional blocks in biomes where those naturally appear."]
	quest.48857E853D866C67.quest_subtitle: "Get a Sussy Bee spawn egg"
	quest.48857E853D866C67.title: "Sussy Bee"
	quest.489EB3838F3C864F.quest_desc: ["Installed in the &#00D9FFME Wireless Access Point&r, it provides a steadily increasing range of blocks at a cost of higher power consumption. Up to 64 &#00D9FFBoosters&r may be inserted for a total range of &#00D9AA528 block&r radius and an energy cost of 4.1kAE/t."]
	quest.489EB3838F3C864F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wireless Booster"
	quest.48A955140CAE34CE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCaelestis&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.48A955140CAE34CE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Caelestis"
	quest.48CAB78C5FCBA7E7.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCore&r 256k. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.48CAB78C5FCBA7E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Core 256k"
	quest.48D5E5A84C84C94D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFFlamethrower&r is a ranged weapon which uses &#00D9FFHydrogen&r gas as its fuel. It is fairly effective against mobs as it deals damage when they are directly hit with the stream and sets them on fire."]
	quest.48D5E5A84C84C94D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flamethrower"
	quest.48E2FD95A5DAB41E.quest_desc: ["This tablet occasionally bone meals nearby plants or causes baby animals to grow."]
	quest.48E2FD95A5DAB41E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Overgrowth"
	quest.48F52EC19F0A2F07.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSequoia Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.48F52EC19F0A2F07.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sequoia Sapling"
	quest.48F6C6EECCDC7986.quest_desc: ["Applies an extra level of &#00D9FFLooting&r to killed entities."]
	quest.48F6C6EECCDC7986.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Superstitious Hat"
	quest.48F92C67E144BD68.quest_desc: ["Glue blocks into contraptions of any size, be they small or super."]
	quest.48F92C67E144BD68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Super Glue"
	quest.48FEA69CE9039374.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFTool Assembly Smithing Template&r combines a &#00D9FFBetter End&r tool head with a handle into a finished tool at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "It is used for &#00D9FFThallasium&r, &#00D9FFTerminite and Aeternium&r tools and weapons."]
	quest.48FEA69CE9039374.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tool Assembly Smithing Template"
	quest.491CC7839C223077.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFReforging Table&r replaces an &#00D9FFAffix Item's Affixes&r with a new combination, using &#00D9FFRarity Materials&r and reforging resources. Use it when the item's rarity is worth keeping but its &#00D9FFAffixes&r are not."]
	quest.491CC7839C223077.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reforging Table"
	quest.491CC7839C223077.title: "Reforge Your Gear"
	quest.4930F1ACA3F96E7E.quest_desc: ["Obtain &#00D9FFthe Bloom Stone Chestplate and Bloom Stone Pauldrons&r from the &#FFA500Cataclysm&r: Spellbooks addon." "Collect both pieces of &#00D9FFBloom Stone&r equipment."]
	quest.4930F1ACA3F96E7E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bloom Stone Pauldrons"
	quest.4946175485D645F5.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHellrazor&r is the upgraded &#00D9FFDecrepit Scythe&r in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It holds 1 imbued spell and comes with &#00D9FFRaise Hell III&r. In the main hand it gives 13 &#00D9FFAttack Damage&r and 1.4 &#00D9FFAttack Speed&r." "&#00D9FFRaise Hell III&r deals 15 &#00D9FFDamage&r in an 8-block radius, casts 3 times, costs 180 &#00D9FFMana&r and has a 12.5-second cooldown." "Upgrade &#00D9FFthe Decrepit Scythe&r with 1 &#00D9FFTimeless Slurry&r and 1 &#00D9FFPyrium Ingot&r."]
	quest.4946175485D645F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hellrazor"
	quest.494693F57B143380.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPlagued Mask&r is the headpiece of the &#00D9FFPlagued Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFNature Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Upgrade a &#00D9FFWizard Helmet&r with 1 &#00D9FFNature Rune&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r to make it."]
	quest.494693F57B143380.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plagued Helmet"
	quest.49504FE5CAE306B6.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFHellshelf of Masterful Sight&r is the upgraded &#00D9FFSightshelf&r and adds &#00D9AA+2&r &#00D9FFClues&r." "Upgrade a &#00D9FFHellshelf of Sight&r with &#00D9FFEmerald Blocks&r, &#00D9FFNetherite Ingots&r and potions."]
	quest.49504FE5CAE306B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sightshelf T2"
	quest.49517AE7EE79586C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.49517AE7EE79586C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.495611D83A45B8B7.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFrozen Bones&r are dropped from &#00D9FFStrays&r and are used to craft &#00D9FFIce Scrolls&r."]
	quest.495611D83A45B8B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Frozen Bone"
	quest.4960CD87DDFD204E.quest_desc: ["Used to bind circuits together in an inscriber."]
	quest.4960CD87DDFD204E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Printed Silicon"
	quest.49677C96B7800837.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPressurized Tubes&r are a way of transporting types of gas, such as steam, hydrogen, and oxygen. Transfer Rate: 64,000 mb/t."]
	quest.49677C96B7800837.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Pressurized Tube"
	quest.4978AA38D8236D1E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDecrepit Flamberge&r is a strong two-handed sword used by &#00D9FFAncient Knights&r in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r, and they can drop it." "In the main hand it gives 11 &#00D9FFAttack Damage&r, 1.3 &#00D9FFAttack Speed&r and &#00D9AA+4&r &#00D9FFArmor&r. You can later upgrade it into the &#00D9FFLegionnaire Flamberge&r with &#00D9FFTimeless Slurry&r and a &#00D9FFPyrium Ingot&r."]
	quest.4978AA38D8236D1E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Keeper Flamberge"
	quest.4980BCED9BDBA721.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFFlask&r of the &#00D9FFRed Mist&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4980BCED9BDBA721.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flask of the Red Mist"
	quest.4998F33B8C4E6757.quest_desc: ["This machine uses energy to extract dusts out of certain blocks and ores, making it essential to producing different kinds of tools. Not to be mistaken with the &#00D9FFCrusher&r, this machine is the pulverizer equivalent in other mods."]
	quest.4998F33B8C4E6757.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enrichment Chamber"
	quest.499BFE8BA61C89CC.quest_desc: ["A pre-programmed &#00D9FFDrone&r that defends a 31x31x31 area centered on the position it's deployed from. This Drone has two basic modes depending on how it is deployed: Deploying on the ground will tell the &#00D9FFDrone&r to attack any mobs which enter its area using whatever it already has on-board. Deploying on top of an inventory containing a &#00D9FFWeapon&r or &#00D9FFMinigun Ammo&r (assuming the drone is carrying a minigun upgrade) will tell the &#00D9FFDrone&r to arm itself using items inside the inventory before defending its area."]
	quest.499BFE8BA61C89CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Guard Drone"
	quest.49A28053D89F5202.quest_desc: ["Keep away from bare wires. This coil handles up to &#00D9AA32768 FE&r/t."]
	quest.49A28053D89F5202.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wirecoil Steel"
	quest.49AD5BF5AA91F934.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnd Stone Nest&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.49AD5BF5AA91F934.quest_subtitle: "Obtain End Stone Nest"
	quest.49CD7119588EFBCE.quest_desc: ["This is used to generate source from nearby food."]
	quest.49CD7119588EFBCE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mycelial Sourcelink"
	quest.49D28B33799B36AB.quest_desc: ["Craft a &#00D9FFBank Link&r together with the &#00D9FFBank&r you want to link it to. The Bank is not consumed." "Put the linked &#00D9FFBank&r in a &#00D9FFBank Dock&r to reach the same contents from multiple places and stash items on the go."]
	quest.49D28B33799B36AB.quest_subtitle: "Access one Bank from several places"
	quest.49E05F1C90518BE5.quest_desc: ["Mine copper ore underground to get &#00D9FFRaw Copper&r. It is one of the first metals you will find and is used for crafting and decoration." "This is a good way to learn how to mine and process metals."]
	quest.49E05F1C90518BE5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 32x Raw Copper"
	quest.49E05F1C90518BE5.title: "Raw &#FD6E01Copper"
	quest.49E6B0016D1E1DD1.quest_desc: ["The most basic miner spirit. It will bring back random blocks, some of which may be ore."]
	quest.49E6B0016D1E1DD1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Foliot Unspecialized"
	quest.49EE141C4FD46F8F.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Pickaxe&r is crafted from &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is a mid-tier mining tool that resists heat, which suits geothermal regions."]
	quest.49EE141C4FD46F8F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Pickaxe"
	quest.49FC9C6C179B4628.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Neptunium Hoe&r from &#FFA500Aquaculture&r 2. It is made from &#00D9FFNeptunium&r, a rare fishing treasure material, and has high durability. It also completes the &#00D9FFNeptunium&r tool set."]
	quest.49FC9C6C179B4628.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Hoe"
	quest.49FE61875E545B7D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFScepter of Twilight&r is the strongest scepter dropped by the &#00D9FFTwilight Lich&r. It fires powerful magical attacks that can overwhelm enemies quickly." "Its power is chaotic, so handle it with care."]
	quest.49FE61875E545B7D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Twilight Scepter"
	quest.49FED56FA740215E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFOmni Gearbox&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r is a flexible way to connect and redirect mechanical power. It helps you build more compact and versatile kinetic networks." "It was added in the 2.2a-BETA update for &#00D9FFMinecraft&r 1.21 to 1.21.1."]
	quest.49FED56FA740215E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Omni Gearbox"
	quest.4A1035A5566EB4A1.quest_desc: ["This spirit takes care of farming trees for you. It even attempts to replant them!"]
	quest.4A1035A5566EB4A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Smart Filter and 4x Oak Sapling. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Lumberjack"
	quest.4A1035A5566EB4A1.title: "Ritual: Summon Foliot Lumberjack"
	quest.4A1062A8CB38B7AE.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFLimited Iron Barrel&r 4 into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A1062A8CB38B7AE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Iron Barrel 4"
	quest.4A161F6CA84621D3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCalculation Press&r is used in an &#00D9FFInscriber&r to turn &#00D9FFCertus Quartz&r into a &#00D9FFPrinted Calculation Circuit&r. Presses are found in meteorites, and the &#00D9FFInscriber&r can duplicate one with an &#00D9FFIron Block&r."]
	quest.4A18F79E859C2F35.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPiglin Mask&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A18F79E859C2F35.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Piglin Mask"
	quest.4A1FC00E24064975.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBow Celestigem&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A1FC00E24064975.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bow Celestigem"
	quest.4A23C16B3418A2C5.quest_desc: ["Used to cast tier 2 glyphs or lower."]
	quest.4A23C16B3418A2C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Apprentice Spell Book"
	quest.4A4287D52B617086.quest_desc: ["This mysterious &#FFA500Simply Swords&r item can transform into unique weapons. The result depends on the conditions and blocks involved, so it is a good way to get powerful, rare weapons."]
	quest.4A4287D52B617086.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Contained Remnant"
	quest.4A45135E97DBCE0B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Gar. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4A45135E97DBCE0B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gar"
	quest.4A478B7E15435C9C.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAntiprotronic Nucleosynthesizer&r takes antimatter and turns one item into another. One recipe is turning coal into diamonds."]
	quest.4A478B7E15435C9C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer"
	quest.4A66221F79042336.quest_desc: ["Malarite is a basic material found in swamp-like biomes of &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is used to craft early-game tools and weapons."]
	quest.4A66221F79042336.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Malarite"
	quest.4A6DF57AB87B9565.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAethersent Bottoms&r is crafted from &#00D9FFAethersent Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is part of the &#00D9FFAethersent&r armor set, tied to meteors and celestial materials found in the dimension."]
	quest.4A6DF57AB87B9565.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aethersent Bottoms"
	quest.4A767C78AE8FF637.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnergy Discharger Starter&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A767C78AE8FF637.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Discharger Starter"
	quest.4A828CCE62DFEC66.quest_desc: ["This Bank has 36 slots and holds up to 16,384 items."]
	quest.4A828CCE62DFEC66.quest_subtitle: "The fourth Bank tier"
	quest.4A87B7CF8FFE9590.quest_desc: ["The Market sells things like saplings, seeds and bone meal. Emeralds are the currency."]
	quest.4A87B7CF8FFE9590.quest_subtitle: "Buy seeds and more with emeralds"
	quest.4A89C1C145646884.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBrown Trout&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4A89C1C145646884.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brown Trout"
	quest.4A9D28AA281FA6F5.quest_desc: ["Arcane pedestals are used along with the enchanting apparatus to create magical items."]
	quest.4A9D28AA281FA6F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Pedestal"
	quest.4A9EE25B961AB116.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSugarbag Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A9EE25B961AB116.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sugarbag Honeycomb"
	quest.4AB7420E4AC7D9EF.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFUltimate Bin&r is a storage block which can hold 262,144 of a single item. It will retain its inventory when broken."]
	quest.4AB7420E4AC7D9EF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Bin"
	quest.4ABD54CF90945DB4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCooldown Ring&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4ABD54CF90945DB4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cooldown Ring"
	quest.4AC0A33A52608BA9.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.4AC0A33A52608BA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Summon Wolves"
	quest.4AD54FE570F81689.quest_desc: ["Stronger creatures and rarer resources show up as you progress in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Two important ones are the refined &#00D9FFAethersent Ingot&r and the rare &#00D9FFCreator Hide&r, both used in advanced crafting."]
	quest.4AD54FE570F81689.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aethersent Ingot and Creteor Hide"
	quest.4AD54FE570F81689.title: "Advanced Starlight Materials"
	quest.4ADCBDEB3BC4BB7D.quest_desc: ["When used to block, you gain a small mana boost and spell damage."]
	quest.4ADCBDEB3BC4BB7D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanters Shield"
	quest.4AE6FFA9F0833787.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4AE6FFA9F0833787.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.4B232DF6258697A6.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFAncient Knowledge Fragments&r can be found rarely in bookshelf loot, more commonly found in &#00D9FFAncient Cities&r or by trading with a &#00D9FFWandering Trader&r. These are used to Craft an &#00D9FFEldritch Manuscript&r which is key in unlocking &#00D9FFAncient Knowledge&r that was lost long, long ago and is now only seen used by &#00D9FFWardens&r and the few who dare to go looking for this old school of magic."]
	quest.4B232DF6258697A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ancient Knowledge Fragment"
	quest.4B23784649F94B08.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSocotra Dragon Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4B23784649F94B08.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Socotra Dragon Sapling"
	quest.4B415299FF7EA8B6.quest_desc: ["Stand in water while wearing &#00D9FFPhoenix Armor&r to turn it into obsidian armor."]
	quest.4B415299FF7EA8B6.quest_subtitle: "Collect a full set of obsidian armor"
	quest.4B415299FF7EA8B6.title: "Ice Bucket Armor"
	quest.4B49E98292B1898F.quest_desc: ["Increases the wearer's maximum health."]
	quest.4B49E98292B1898F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Heart"
	quest.4B4D9BF973338300.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFBlaze Ember&r plus &#00D9FFPolymorphic Fluid&r gives unrefined &#00D9FFBlaze Ember&r fuel. &#00D9FFVoidflame Coal&r plus refined &#00D9FFBlaze Ember&r fuel gives unrefined &#00D9FFVoidflame&r fuel, and &#00D9FFEclipse Ember&r plus refined &#00D9FFVoidflame&r fuel gives unrefined &#00D9FFEclipse Ember&r fuel. An unrefined fuel plus a goo of at least the same tier gives the refined fuel."]
	quest.4B4D9BF973338300.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Refined T2 Fluid Bucket, Refined T3 Fluid Bucket and Refined T4 Fluid Bucket"
	quest.4B4D9BF973338300.title: "Fluid Fuels"
	quest.4B69081BB1747107.quest_desc: ["Faster and more fuel efficient than the lower tiers."]
	quest.4B69081BB1747107.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Furnace"
	quest.4B6D9AE6BE1844AD.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBacon Sandwich&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4B6D9AE6BE1844AD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bacon Sandwich"
	quest.4B804BC05BBA2E53.quest_desc: ["Using a &#00D9FFWrench&r, you can rotate almost any machine by right-clicking and pick up almost any pipe, fluid or not. You can shift-right-click on a machine to configure the output side. When you're holding the &#00D9FFWrench&r, you can hover over any face of the machine and you'll get a grid of sorts. Shift-rick-clicking on the middle square will set the output face to the side the grid is on. Doing so to the rectangles will place the output to the face 90 degrees relative to the corner elected to allow for configuration in hard to reach spaces. Finally the small squares in each corner will set the output to the opposite side of the grid. Remember, you cannot break the machine using the &#00D9FFWrench&r, it WILL destroy it and you will not get it back. Just use your trusty &#00D9FFPickaxe&r instead."]
	quest.4B804BC05BBA2E53.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wrench"
	quest.4B804BC05BBA2E53.title: "Wrench"
	quest.4B910D4EBC941ABC.quest_desc: ["We have a lot to cover. Cable networks have hard limitations on the amount of energy they will pull into the network depending on the tier. you can see a few stats below.. &#00D9FFMax Transfer Rate&r: 256 EU/t. Material: Tin. &#00D9FFMax Transfer Rate&r: 1024 EU/t. Material: Electrum. &#00D9FFMax Transfer Rate&r: 8192 EU/t. Material: &#00D9FFAluminum&r. &#00D9FFMax Transfer Rate&r: 65536 EU/t. Material: &#00D9FFAnnealed Copper&r. Now, the input and transfer rate is hard capped, but the discharge rate is infinite. This mean, for example, a LV cable network can provide more than 256 EU/t for a short amount of time. The larger the cable network, the larger the internal cable buffer. All this \"stored\" energy can be discharged almost instantaneously if given a place to go to. Do keep in mind that each tier of cable will only connect to it's respective tier electric machine. A LV cable will not connect to steam machines, MV machines, or HV machines. The method that each machine uses to process and use electricity is different depending on the strength of the power it receives. If you want to transfer more energy than the cable tier allows you to, you can either create multiple cable networks or use &#00D9FFTransformers&r. Transformers allow you to step up or step down your power. This means, for example, you can take LV power and turn it into HV power and vice versa. As you'll see, an X to Y transformer will connect to Y cables on its output side and X cables on its 5 input sides. You can use your &#00D9FFWrench&r to configure which side the output is. Cables follow the same rules that fluid and item pipes follow. Using a &#00D9FFWrench&r on them will disconnect connections and shift right clicking will break them, this time losing the power in that specific section of cable network. P.S. Cables from &#FFA500Modern Industrialization&r, connected to any medium that accepts FE power, will &#00D9AA10x&r the power from EU to FE. There is an upgrade to this down the line, so look out for it!"]
	quest.4B910D4EBC941ABC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tin Cable"
	quest.4B910D4EBC941ABC.title: "Energy Transfer"
	quest.4B9EC06C6CFC18CA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSupremium Sword&r, &#00D9FFSupremium Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFSupremium Shovel&r and 2 more items. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4B9EC06C6CFC18CA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Sword, Supremium Pickaxe, Supremium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.4B9EC06C6CFC18CA.title: "Supremium Tools and Weaponry"
	quest.4BA03A7BDA98F841.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9AA4x&r &#00D9FFSoulium Dust&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4BA03A7BDA98F841.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Soulium Dust"
	quest.4BA03A7BDA98F841.title: "Soulium Dust"
	quest.4BB45B2E57D2CDC7.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFLarge Diesel Generator&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4BB45B2E57D2CDC7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Large Diesel Generator"
	quest.4BB45B2E57D2CDC7.title: "Fast and Furious 42: Armageddon"
	quest.4BBDF2C2666D8BA1.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFTerminite Axe&r is a woodcutting and combat tool forged from &#00D9FFTerminite Ingots&r, one step above &#00D9FFThallasium&r." "It is not the strongest gear, but it is a needed step toward &#00D9FFAeternium and Crystalite&r equipment."]
	quest.4BBDF2C2666D8BA1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Axe"
	quest.4BCD6192960BB513.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFQIO Exporter&r exports items from the &#00D9FFQIO System&r into other inventories. You just need to set the frequency and the filters for exporting."]
	quest.4BCD6192960BB513.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Exporter"
	quest.4BFE4A17CDC64114.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFElite Bin&r is a storage block which can hold 32,768 of a single item. It will retain its inventory when broken."]
	quest.4BFE4A17CDC64114.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Bin"
	quest.4BFE77077C798033.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBasic Card&r is a crafting component used to craft &#00D9FFUpgrades&r."]
	quest.4BFE77077C798033.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Card"
	quest.4BFE77077C798033.title: "Basic Card"
	quest.4C05BB9DDAD2583A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCinnamon Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4C05BB9DDAD2583A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cinnamon Sapling"
	quest.4C16A7BA37C9F6C0.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLegionnaire Flamberge&r is the upgraded &#00D9FFDecrepit Flamberge&r in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It has 11 &#00D9FFAttack Damage&r, 1.5 &#00D9FFAttack Speed&r and &#00D9AA+4&r &#00D9FFArmor&r." "Upgrade &#00D9FFthe Decrepit Flamberge&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r with 1 &#00D9FFTimeless Slurry&r and 1 &#00D9FFPyrium Ingot&r."]
	quest.4C16A7BA37C9F6C0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Legionnaire Flamberge"
	quest.4C185C574ADE6333.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFVillager Spell Book&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4C185C574ADE6333.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Villager Spell Book"
	quest.4C337411178D3E3B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGreater Conjurer's Talisman&r gives &#00D9AA+15%&r &#00D9FFSummon Damage&r, so your summoned creatures hit harder." "It also stops summon spells from going on cooldown when their summons time out on their own."]
	quest.4C337411178D3E3B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Greater Conjurers Talisman"
	quest.4C4F3DAA367281E1.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFerricore Pickaxe&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4C4F3DAA367281E1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Pickaxe"
	quest.4C66518F4C6B4965.quest_desc: ["The Mace deals massive damage, especially with a falling attack. Striking from above can finish off most creatures." "It rewards good timing, so craft one and practice."]
	quest.4C66518F4C6B4965.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mace"
	quest.4C66518F4C6B4965.title: "The Mace"
	quest.4C71BF1C683BE2DB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMahogany Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4C71BF1C683BE2DB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mahogany Sapling"
	quest.4C7CF6CBFC0F0880.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.4C7CF6CBFC0F0880.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Compressing Factory"
	quest.4C7E231442DC94DF.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFColor Applicator&r can be used to paint colorable blocks, which include cables, wool, terracotta, glass, concrete and anything else you can think of. Use Paintballs or &#00D9FFSpecific Dyes&r to paint and snowballs to clean off the paint. Use &#00D9FFthe Charger&r to charge the &#00D9FFApplicator&r. The &#00D9FFColor Applicator&r works like a &#00D9FFStorage Cell&r, so to fill it, use the &#00D9FFME Chest&r. Right-&#00D9FFClick&r to apply a color and &#00D9FFScroll&r-&#00D9FFWheel&r to change colors while holding shift. Test different upgrades to see if they can help your &#00D9FFColor Applicator&r!"]
	quest.4C7E231442DC94DF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Color Applicator"
	quest.4C7E231442DC94DF.title: "Color Applicator"
	quest.4C873325175C838A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFFusion Reactor&r is a complicated structure. In simple terms it requires at least 1, or 2, inputs for fuel, and 1 out for power. You may, also, add an output for heat that you can use elsewhere. It requires a laser matrix for the lasers to start the reaction. Aside from the casings, it, also, requires the controller on the top."]
	quest.4C873325175C838A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 61x Fusion Reactor Frame, 4x Fusion Reactor Port, Fusion Reactor Controller and 2 more items"
	quest.4C8786F3AC6EF5D7.quest_desc: ["Will make the storage pick up items within its range."]
	quest.4C8786F3AC6EF5D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.4C927526150D82C2.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFStorms Edge&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4C927526150D82C2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storms Edge"
	quest.4C941F4A2CD2F747.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.4C941F4A2CD2F747.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Combining Factory"
	quest.4CABCB2DF637C9EC.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMagic Map&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4CABCB2DF637C9EC.quest_subtitle: "Craft and open the Magic Map"
	quest.4CABCB2DF637C9EC.title: "I Can See Forever"
	quest.4CBAAA8963F41194.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCandlenut Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4CBAAA8963F41194.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Candlenut Sapling"
	quest.4CC0888001F9A36C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCertus Quartz Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4CC0888001F9A36C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Certus Quartz Seeds"
	quest.4CC2965B839763F0.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnergy Tablet&r is a portable, rechargeable battery pack that can be charged with up to 1,000kJ of energy and can then be used to power other devices. It is also an ingredient in many recipes."]
	quest.4CC2965B839763F0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Tablet"
	quest.4CC303D7BFC987F4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEclipsealloy Helmet&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4CC303D7BFC987F4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Helmet"
	quest.4CD1ACEB629D36F1.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFOak Barrel&r is a basic, compact &#FFA500Sophisticated Storage&r container." "Its upgrade system lets you add extra capacity and specialized upgrades, so it fits into almost any storage setup."]
	quest.4CD1ACEB629D36F1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Barrel"
	quest.4CD52596642932DE.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFIronwood Sword&r, &#00D9FFIronwood Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFIronwood Shovel and Ironwood Axe&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4CD52596642932DE.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Ironwood Tools"
	quest.4CD52596642932DE.title: "Ironwood Tools"
	quest.4CD7C19C70D86CB0.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCloak of Concealment&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4CD7C19C70D86CB0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cloak of Concealment"
	quest.4CEA79B25D65F561.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBlackfish&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4CEA79B25D65F561.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blackfish"
	quest.4CFCCF89C723D9D4.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFHv Steam Turbine&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4CFCCF89C723D9D4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hv Steam Turbine"
	quest.4CFCCF89C723D9D4.title: "Better than Water Wheel"
	quest.4D0205CFF07F5EE3.quest_desc: ["Like &#00D9FFthe Refill Upgrade&r, with more filtering options."]
	quest.4D0205CFF07F5EE3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Refill Upgrade"
	quest.4D15BD9D0733647A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLightning Upgrade Orb&r is an upgrade material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Applied at the &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r, it gives &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFLightning Spell Power&r." "Craft it from 1 &#00D9FFEmpty Upgrade Orb&r and 8 &#00D9FFLightning Runes&r. Upgrade Orbs can be applied to compatible equipment to raise its magical power."]
	quest.4D15BD9D0733647A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lightning Upgrade Orb"
	quest.4D1C1392569392BD.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSpicy Noodle Soup&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4D1C1392569392BD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spicy Noodle Soup"
	quest.4D30A0B3CBFF7185.quest_desc: ["Transfers energy."]
	quest.4D30A0B3CBFF7185.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cable Basic"
	quest.4D352EBF712EBE6E.quest_desc: ["Improves swimming speed in water."]
	quest.4D352EBF712EBE6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flippers"
	quest.4D3C04FD055D64EB.quest_desc: ["To produce energy, the &#00D9FFSolar Panel&r needs a matching tier &#00D9FFPhotovoltaic Cell&r in its inventory. By supplying &#00D9FFDistilled Water&r to the &#00D9FFSolar Panel&r, the &#00D9FFPhotovoltaic Cell&r in its slot will last &#00D9AA2x&r as long! Energy generation rates are determined by how high the sun is in the sky and if the sky is visible."]
	quest.4D3C04FD055D64EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lv Solar Panel"
	quest.4D3C04FD055D64EB.title: "Solar Panels"
	quest.4D3ECEFBF4FC1737.quest_desc: ["Automates the blasting furnace using items from the storage."]
	quest.4D3ECEFBF4FC1737.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Auto Blasting Upgrade"
	quest.4D3F5D8ED41209A0.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFEncased Fans&r can do some neat things to mobs and entities, and this will let them spray those effects all around. Tip: clustered &#00D9FFNozzles&r’ effects stack. Try it out."]
	quest.4D3F5D8ED41209A0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nozzle"
	quest.4D435CB53F9D6116.quest_desc: ["Increases jump height and grants immunity to fall damage."]
	quest.4D435CB53F9D6116.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bunny Hoppers"
	quest.4D4B88AE8272D8F4.quest_desc: ["Reach this goal to earn the &#00D9FFIron Trophy&r."]
	quest.4D4B88AE8272D8F4.quest_subtitle: "Catch 35 unique fish"
	quest.4D5DD939E3B0E80D.quest_desc: ["Make a &#00D9FFPumpkin Milkshake&r and fill a bucket with it. It is a seasonal treat with an autumn flavor for your milkshake collection."]
	quest.4D5DD939E3B0E80D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pumpkin Milkshake Bucket"
	quest.4D6A2907407216EE.quest_desc: ["You can occasionally find &#00D9FFDemon's Dream&r seeds by breaking short grass. When grown, it can be harvested for &#00D9FFDemon's Dream&r fruit, which has many uses for occult matters."]
	quest.4D6A2907407216EE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Datura Seeds"
	quest.4D7B6CF67ED640D4.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer walk on fluids while sprinting."]
	quest.4D7B6CF67ED640D4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aqua Dashers"
	quest.4D89F8D7F75740F7.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCapacitor Hv&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4D89F8D7F75740F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor Hv"
	quest.4D8FBCA57F8C473D.quest_desc: ["Visit every &#00D9FFNether&r biome, from crimson forests to soul sand valleys." "Each has its own dangers, resources and secrets."]
	quest.4D8FBCA57F8C473D.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Explore Nether"
	quest.4D8FBCA57F8C473D.title: "Master of the Nether"
	quest.4D96034CD8297FD6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMoonlight Magic Crepe Myrtle Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4D96034CD8297FD6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Moonlight Magic Crepe Myrtle Sapling"
	quest.4D988B4FA26268DE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFApple Pie Slice&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4D988B4FA26268DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Apple Pie Slice"
	quest.4DA097E571421551.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGlacite Helmet&r is crafted from &#00D9FFGlacite&r materials in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Glacite armor protects against freezing environments and slows enemies that attack you."]
	quest.4DA097E571421551.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Helmet"
	quest.4DB6EC9635C51114.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDeepsilver Pickaxe&r is crafted from &#00D9FFDeepsilver Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is an early to mid progression pickaxe for swamp and &#00D9FFNightfall&r regions, with durability between iron and diamond."]
	quest.4DB6EC9635C51114.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Pickaxe"
	quest.4DD06AEFB9CB1691.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Knightmetal Shield&r from &#00D9FFKnightmetal Ingots&r. It is built to withstand heavy hits and has excellent durability." "It is a dependable choice for exploring the most dangerous parts of the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r."]
	quest.4DD06AEFB9CB1691.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Knightmetal Shield"
	quest.4DD84C192C13BA30.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDeepsilver Hoe&r is crafted from &#00D9FFDeepsilver Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It prepares farmland in swamp and &#00D9FFNightfall&r regions and lasts longer than an iron hoe."]
	quest.4DD84C192C13BA30.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Hoe"
	quest.4DE42312B34F6F7B.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFThread Wixie&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4DE42312B34F6F7B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Wixie"
	quest.4DE54F88918EC37B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFApple Pie&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4DE54F88918EC37B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Apple Pie"
	quest.4DEA189D0E8FA603.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCapture Net&r from &#FFA500Naturalist&r lets you catch animals and carry them somewhere else. It is a handy way to relocate creatures safely."]
	quest.4DEA189D0E8FA603.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capture Net"
	quest.4DEA189D0E8FA603.title: "Capture Net"
	quest.4DEC9922ABB7FB12.quest_desc: ["Same amount of slots as the &#00D9FFExtended Interface&r, but holds &#00D9AA16x&r the amount per slot (1048). &#00D9FFME Extended Interface&r hold 64 items per slot, with quadruple the slots the normal &#00D9FFInterface&r has."]
	quest.4DEC9922ABB7FB12.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Interface and Oversize Interface"
	quest.4DEE9AFE0A642625.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFArctic&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.4DF6AB2247056E6F.quest_desc: ["The Productivity upgrade will increase the number of combs a bee produces per trip."]
	quest.4DF6AB2247056E6F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Productivity 4"
	quest.4E0540CE9D67DFF2.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFReaction Chamber&r will allow you to make &#00D9FFCrystals and Specialty Ingots&r from AE2 with the cost of POWAH. More efficient than in-world recipes."]
	quest.4E0540CE9D67DFF2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reaction Chamber"
	quest.4E0D814162BE2F3A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFHazel Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4E0D814162BE2F3A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hazel Sapling"
	quest.4E1CA3E48BAD2888.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMusic Disc Creator&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4E1CA3E48BAD2888.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Creator"
	quest.4E25B851C9445A57.quest_desc: ["Doing so clears the acid rain and prepares you for the &#00D9FFHighlands&r."]
	quest.4E25B851C9445A57.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the Hydra, Ur-Ghast and Snow Queen"
	quest.4E27A44D21DB0508.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFScotch Eggs&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4E27A44D21DB0508.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scotch Eggs"
	quest.4E29E319522B77C9.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFArctic&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.4E2FF1B0A1D39E81.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFHoney Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4E2FF1B0A1D39E81.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honey Seeds"
	quest.4E46519EFA48FECC.quest_desc: ["Keeps refilling stacks of the selected items in your inventory."]
	quest.4E46519EFA48FECC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Refill Upgrade"
	quest.4E5233D70925A7E7.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFFlowglaze Smithing Template&r upgrades &#00D9FFFlowglaze&r-related equipment in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It cannot be crafted and is found as loot in chests in specific structures. It is required for &#00D9FFFlowglaze&r gear recipes."]
	quest.4E5233D70925A7E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowglaze Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.4E5233D70925A7E7.title: "Flowglaze Smithing Template"
	quest.4E5C776ABCEF5DDC.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9AA36x&r &#00D9FFReactor Blazing&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4E5C776ABCEF5DDC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 36x Reactor Blazing"
	quest.4E5F290E8EE80DFE.quest_desc: ["The pipes you'll craft to transport the many liquids and gasses can only contain a single type of fluid at a time and they will not connect directly to empty pipes or containers and machines automatically, so make sure to use that &#00D9FFWrench&r to configure them properly. You can forcefully initiate a connection by right-clicking the center of the pipe with your &#00D9FFWrench&r, or by right-clicking a block with a pipe in your hand; thought it *6won't consume the pipe, just connect it. Every tick,. the &#00D9FFFluid Pipe&r will attempt to evenly extract from all connected blocks and then attempt to insert that into all other connected blocks. Few other tips you might enjoy: Use them wisely and abuse them to your complete advantage: You can have up to 3 pipes in a single block for ultimate compact-ness! Luckily, pipes of different color will never connect. Finally, right-clicking a pipe with a &#00D9FFWrench&r will change the connection type and shift-right-clicking will drop the pipe. Time for some spaghetti?"]
	quest.4E5F290E8EE80DFE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Fluid Pipe"
	quest.4E5F290E8EE80DFE.title: "Fluid Transportation"
	quest.4E72552F0B4702D2.quest_desc: ["Wixie shards are used to create wixie charms."]
	quest.4E72552F0B4702D2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wixie Shards"
	quest.4E76028E335C7AA1.quest_desc: ["Dropped in the &#00D9FFGold Dungeon&r."]
	quest.4E76028E335C7AA1.quest_subtitle: "Get a piece of Phoenix Armor"
	quest.4E84C807543AFBA3.quest_desc: ["This substance can be processed in a &#00D9FFThermopneumatic Processing Plant&r to produce &#00D9FFKerosene&r or, by adding &#00D9FFRedstone&r, &#00D9FFLubricant&r. It serves as a reasonable liquid fuel and can also be placed in a &#00D9FFFurnace&r."]
	quest.4E84C807543AFBA3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diesel Bucket"
	quest.4E84C807543AFBA3.title: "Diesel"
	quest.4E87637FF30936CD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFGravichestplate&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4E87637FF30936CD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gravichestplate"
	quest.4E87637FF30936CD.title: "Gravichestplate!"
	quest.4E87CDA4312CA1F5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFProgrammer&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4E87CDA4312CA1F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Programmer"
	quest.4E89DF5098AF2720.quest_desc: ["Lacrima is a rare &#FFA500Cataclysm&r crafting material." "It is used for &#00D9FFAcropolis&r gear such as &#00D9FFAstrape&r, &#00D9FFCeraunus&r and the &#00D9FFAzure Sea Shield&r."]
	quest.4E89DF5098AF2720.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lacrima"
	quest.4E8A3CEF278F57D3.quest_desc: ["Multiplies the number of stacks that can fit in a slot by 2."]
	quest.4E8A3CEF278F57D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Tier 1"
	quest.4E9320A95A9AFD8F.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory and upgrade slots of the backpack."]
	quest.4E9320A95A9AFD8F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Netherite Backpack"
	quest.4E97D0399A9AC4AF.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnergy Cable Hardened&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4E97D0399A9AC4AF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cable Hardened"
	quest.4EA3283B94A00F39.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFZombie Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4EA3283B94A00F39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Zombie Seeds"
	quest.4EAE523B94BD0E17.quest_desc: ["Using &#00D9FFthe Scroll Forge&r and a &#00D9FFPoisonous Potato&r to make a &#00D9FFNature Scrolls&r which are good for &#00D9FFPoison&r damage or keeping foes rooted in place."]
	quest.4EAE523B94BD0E17.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scroll"
	quest.4EC12D56648EFF7C.quest_desc: ["This machine does a better job at making &#00D9FFCurved Plates and Rings&r than the &#00D9FFCompressor&r. It's speedier and better. Does crafts at double the speeds!"]
	quest.4EC12D56648EFF7C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Bending Machine"
	quest.4EC1F886368398E0.quest_desc: ["The Athame is a special melee weapon from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r, dropped by &#00D9FFDeepling&r enemies." "Defeat Deeplings to get this rare ocean weapon."]
	quest.4EC1F886368398E0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Athame"
	quest.4EC39D7E40155B91.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarfire Pickaxe&r is a high-tier mining tool from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is made with smithing and needs advanced materials from late-game content."]
	quest.4EC39D7E40155B91.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfire Pickaxe"
	quest.4ED13E43CA6A963D.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMusic Disc Strad&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4ED13E43CA6A963D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Strad"
	quest.4ED254864CD92A25.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory and upgrade slots of the backpack."]
	quest.4ED254864CD92A25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Backpack"
	quest.4EDF24D238A7293C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPlayer Transmitter Hardened&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4EDF24D238A7293C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Transmitter Hardened"
	quest.4EE149DC592FF3E0.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFArchitects Staff&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.4EE149DC592FF3E0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Architects Staff"
	quest.4EE3B453CA3577F2.quest_desc: ["Defeat &#00D9FFArchevoker&r."]
	quest.4EE3B453CA3577F2.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Archevoker"
	quest.4F04486BB1B2D4E2.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFUniversal Cables&r are &#FFA500Mekanism&r's way to transfer power. Capacity: 3.27 MFE/t."]
	quest.4F04486BB1B2D4E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Universal Cable"
	quest.4F04486BB1B2D4E2.title: "Ultimate Universal Cable"
	quest.4F048C94AB89CBA7.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4F048C94AB89CBA7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.4F0F65BD46B33437.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCopper Shulker Box&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4F0F65BD46B33437.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Shulker Box"
	quest.4F2727A61958C7CB.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFFire Scrolls&r with the &#00D9FFScroll Forge&r and a &#00D9FFBlaze Rod&r. They are great for burning enemies, so watch out for friends and their pets."]
	quest.4F2727A61958C7CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scroll"
	quest.4F350CA3D75762EF.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.4F350CA3D75762EF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Ender Inventory"
	quest.4F367BCDBEE8D14D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBlaze Instruction Manual&r is a rare &#00D9FFFire&r spellbook in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives 10 spell slots, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFFire Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+200&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r." "It is a rare drop from &#00D9FFBlazes&r."]
	quest.4F367BCDBEE8D14D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blaze Spell Book"
	quest.4F425C565D7379B4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSausage and Potatoes&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4F425C565D7379B4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sausage and Potatoes"
	quest.4F48C0C7EA0FB1F5.quest_desc: ["Gives more customization to when the player should be fed."]
	quest.4F48C0C7EA0FB1F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Feeding Upgrade"
	quest.4F5E513AD04F8FBD.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFQIO Drives&r hold the items in a &#00D9FFQIO System&r. They work similar to AE2 drives where it has a maximum amount of space and types it can hold."]
	quest.4F5E513AD04F8FBD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Drive Time Dilating"
	quest.4F642CA17685D8AD.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFTertium Essence&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4F642CA17685D8AD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tertium Essence"
