	quest.654939AB7E016432.quest_desc: ["Hover &#FFA500Just Dire Things&r upgrades in EMI and hold shift for descriptions."]
	quest.654939AB7E016432.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.655C0FBF1FB00D89.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCell Component&r 16m into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.655C0FBF1FB00D89.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 16m"
	quest.65642C5D4CCA838C.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.65642C5D4CCA838C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Invisibility"
	quest.656B2EB771061568.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFInverse Gearshift&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r reverses the direction of rotation in your mechanical setups. It allows more flexible and compact factory designs."]
	quest.656B2EB771061568.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inverse Gearshift"
	quest.656BC7FB6923D7F9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFLimited Gold Barrel&r 3. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.656BC7FB6923D7F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Gold Barrel 3"
	quest.6576DB1AB024F726.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6576DB1AB024F726.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.657A2F7D9D62CAB9.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.657A2F7D9D62CAB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.659859FDDFB43D6A.quest_desc: ["Drive them with a &#00D9FFThreshold Switch&r on a &#00D9FFVault&r to get a progress bar showing how full it is."]
	quest.659859FDDFB43D6A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nixie Tube"
	quest.659A5309A77BDDFD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFGraphite Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.659A5309A77BDDFD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Graphite Seeds"
	quest.65A3F4F22D836189.quest_desc: ["Craft an &#00D9FFEnchanting Table&r to improve your tools, weapons and armor with magic. Enchantments boost effectiveness and durability, and can add special abilities." "It is worth having before tougher fights."]
	quest.65A3F4F22D836189.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanting Table"
	quest.65A3F4F22D836189.title: "Enchanting Table"
	quest.65A949B3F6F8049E.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFProgrammable Controller&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.65A949B3F6F8049E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Programmable Controller"
	quest.65B8D316605D1A0B.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBlue Tenderloin Steak&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.65B8D316605D1A0B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blue Tenderloin Steak"
	quest.65C34D7FD093D83F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCopper Barrel&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.65C34D7FD093D83F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Barrel"
	quest.65CCF4B3E7A9F67D.quest_desc: ["Upgrades a &#00D9FFGold&r tier or below to a &#00D9FFDiamond&r tier."]
	quest.65CCF4B3E7A9F67D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic to Diamond Tier Upgrade, Copper to Diamond Tier Upgrade, Iron to Diamond Tier Upgrade and Gold to Diamond Tier Upgrade"
	quest.65CCF4B3E7A9F67D.title: "Diamond Tier Upgrade"
	quest.65CDA8AFE4EC9F0D.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.65CDA8AFE4EC9F0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Fell"
	quest.65F921DCB4A7FCE7.quest_desc: ["Simple redstone control for reversing rotational motion. Very handy when your build needs one."]
	quest.65F921DCB4A7FCE7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gearshift"
	quest.65FA4A7FE399C79D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAdvanced Bin&r is a storage block which can hold 8192 of a single item. It will retain its inventory when broken."]
	quest.65FA4A7FE399C79D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Bin"
	quest.6603D5F5FF9A7108.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFInferium&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.6608848EC38ED912.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFCoral Chunk&r is dropped by &#00D9FFCoralssus&r in &#FFA500Cataclysm&r. It is used to craft items tied to the mod's ocean content."]
	quest.6608848EC38ED912.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coral Chunk"
	quest.66116025A09661C2.quest_desc: ["The Geode-&#00D9FFEncased Bookshelf of Stability&r gives &#00D9FFQuantic Stability&r, so &#00D9FFQuanta&r can only make your enchantments stronger, never weaker." "Craft it from &#00D9FFCalcite&r, a bookshelf and &#00D9FFBudding Amethyst&r. Get &#00D9FFthe Budding Amethyst&r by infusing an &#00D9FFAmethyst Block&r with at least 60 &#00D9FFEterna&r, &#00D9AA50%&r &#00D9FFArcana&r and between &#00D9AA30%&r and &#00D9AA50%&r &#00D9FFQuanta&r."]
	quest.66116025A09661C2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Geode Shelf"
	quest.6618C74E0BA18AEA.quest_desc: ["Bring Tempest into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6618C74E0BA18AEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tempest"
	quest.662D3632D4E28C1C.quest_desc: ["The main block of the mod's storage system. Right-click it with &#00D9FFBookwyrm Charms&r to summon &#00D9FFBookwyrms&r, and each one raises the number of storages you can bind. Use &#00D9FFthe Dominion Wand&r to bind a storage to the &#00D9FFLectern&r. It needs no source."]
	quest.662D3632D4E28C1C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Lectern"
	quest.663B52B7C99A8858.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFBio Fuel&r can be used for numerous things. We are after substrate."]
	quest.663B52B7C99A8858.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bio Fuel"
	quest.663E618B3E57F6F6.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFImperium Sword&r, &#00D9FFImperium Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFImperium Shovel&r and 2 more items into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.663E618B3E57F6F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Sword, Imperium Pickaxe, Imperium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.663E618B3E57F6F6.title: "Imperium Tools and Weaponry"
	quest.665DFCA333D7FB39.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGatling Breaker&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r is an advanced tool made for rapid block breaking. Its continuous mechanical force speeds up large-scale excavation and automated mining."]
	quest.665DFCA333D7FB39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gatling Breaker"
	quest.6669FF5BE3276035.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMechanical Grindstone&r from &#FFA500Create: Enchantment Industry&r brings the vanilla &#00D9FFGrindstone&r into your factory. It automatically processes items, removes enchantments and extracts experience, and also offers a sanding function for compatible recipes." "Connect it to &#FFA500Create&r's rotational power to automate grinding."]
	quest.6669FF5BE3276035.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Grindstone"
	quest.666D6DE84597DA56.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFNano&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.667AEEA648FABA79.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnder Bow&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.667AEEA648FABA79.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Bow"
	quest.66954C678B1B21A1.quest_desc: ["EMI may not show this recipe because of a bug. In a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r, combine a &#00D9FFCelestigem Pickaxe&r, &#00D9FFAxe and Shovel&r, in that order."]
	quest.66954C678B1B21A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Paxel"
	quest.6699ADB734C1C57B.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFThermopneumatic Processing Plant&r is used to convert liquids into other liquids. For example, combining &#00D9FFLPG and Coal&r in this machine can produce &#00D9FFLiquid Plastic&r. Additionally, the TPP can perform fuel cracking, where heavier fuels are transformed into lighter ones. This means: &#00D9FFDiesel&r -> &#00D9FFKerosene&r. Kerosene -> &#00D9FFGasoline&r. Gasoline -> LPG."]
	quest.6699ADB734C1C57B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermopneumatic Processing Plant"
	quest.66A3143D5384E27D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFGlow Berry Custard&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.66A3143D5384E27D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glow Berry Custard"
	quest.66B27D8FA9533AE2.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.66B27D8FA9533AE2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Summon Decoy"
	quest.66B52DD6E837486C.quest_desc: ["For packing and unpacking packages."]
	quest.66B52DD6E837486C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Packager"
	quest.66BCA7F7CE25650E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBrazil Nut Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.66BCA7F7CE25650E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brazil Nut Sapling"
	quest.66BE62BECF412B02.quest_desc: ["Smelts quickly while using fuel sparingly."]
	quest.66BE62BECF412B02.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Obsidian Furnace"
	quest.66C2B02E47C7B363.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnergy Discharger Niotic&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.66C2B02E47C7B363.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Discharger Niotic"
	quest.66CDD772F62C21B0.quest_desc: ["This Bank has 81 slots and can hold close to unlimited items."]
	quest.66CDD772F62C21B0.quest_subtitle: "The top Bank tier"
	quest.66E1C3E8377C64C0.quest_desc: ["Bare wires shock anyone who touches them, so keep your distance or insulate them. This coil carries up to &#00D9AA8192 FE&r/t, and anything above that needs HV wire."]
	quest.66E1C3E8377C64C0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wirecoil Electrum"
	quest.66F41E7315D542E5.quest_desc: ["Crafted by the &#00D9FFMetallurgic Infuser&r this is the basis from which &#00D9FFSteel Dust&r can be attained by reprocessing it in the &#00D9FFMetallurgic Infuser&r."]
	quest.66F41E7315D542E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Iron"
	quest.66F68463A18E35ED.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFChocolate Pie&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.66F68463A18E35ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chocolate Pie"
	quest.66FE015C521E3067.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFUpgrade Iron&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.66FE015C521E3067.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Iron"
	quest.6708332772DCBEE4.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCrushing Wheel&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6708332772DCBEE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crushing Wheel"
	quest.67090FA3629FFCB9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFAerial Pearl&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.67090FA3629FFCB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aerial Pearl"
	quest.67324038300F58ED.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPlate of Striderloaf&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.67324038300F58ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plate of Striderloaf"
	quest.673448ADEC2A5A85.quest_desc: ["You'll finally be able to construct a &#00D9FFNuclear Reactor&r that uses different types of &#00D9FFFluid and Fuel Rods&r to produce various gaseous fuels, &#00D9FFSteam&r in massive quantities, and radioactive materials. The &#00D9FFNuclear Reactor&r is not for the faint of heart. You'll need to keep watch on the gauges for thermal and neutron interaction when constructing one of four different sized reactors."]
	quest.673448ADEC2A5A85.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nuclear Reactor, 27x Nuclear Alloy Machine Casing Pipe and 77x Nuclear Casing"
	quest.673448ADEC2A5A85.title: "Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.673526545A09C2CC.quest_desc: ["This device separates incoming air into hot and cold components, with one side becoming hot and the other cold. The amount of air used depends on the pressure. For optimal efficiency, be aware that there is a minor thermal connection between the hot and cold sides. To make the most of the heat, vent the cold side with a &#00D9FFHeat Sink&r, and do the opposite if you want to maximize the cold."]
	quest.673526545A09C2CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vortex Tube"
	quest.675291ECEC4EAE0B.quest_desc: ["Find a city in the &#00D9FFNether&r."]
	quest.675291ECEC4EAE0B.quest_subtitle: "Enter a Nether City"
	quest.675CBEB4D18573CD.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFPulse Extender&r from &#FFA500Create&r. It lengthens a &#00D9FFRedstone&r pulse by a configurable time so short signals can control machines and automation." "The duration ranges from &#00D9AA2 ticks&r to &#00D9AA60 minutes&r. It can also be inverted to stay powered by default and give a temporary shutdown pulse."]
	quest.675CBEB4D18573CD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pulse Extender"
	quest.67643B27D0426FFE.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPersonal Chest&r gives you a private storage space that stays with you wherever you go. Unlike a normal chest, its contents can be accessed from any &#00D9FFPersonal Chest&r linked to you, making it perfect for keeping frequently used items close at hand. Use it as your personal stash for tools, building materials, or anything else you don't want cluttering your inventory."]
	quest.67643B27D0426FFE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Personal Chest"
	quest.67671BD4A0BC0AAA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSpawn Egg Configurable Bee&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.67671BD4A0BC0AAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Egg Configurable Bee"
	quest.676FA58F3C47E4BF.quest_desc: ["Collect various gadgets and try them out. They can make your adventures and challenges easier."]
	quest.676FA58F3C47E4BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.676FA58F3C47E4BF.title: "Gadgets"
	quest.678BC8459EA2CB5E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFWhite Willow Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.678BC8459EA2CB5E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Willow Sapling"
	quest.67901E9D344FFB3B.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.67901E9D344FFB3B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Sawing Factory"
	quest.67994560ECCA0934.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAlloy Kiln&r makes alloys such as &#00D9FFInvar and Electrum&r. Click the progress arrow in its screen to browse the recipes."]
	quest.67994560ECCA0934.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Alloybrick"
	quest.67994560ECCA0934.title: "Alloy Kiln"
	quest.679B5A8C6D2FF3E7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFNickel Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.679B5A8C6D2FF3E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nickel Seeds"
	quest.67AA14CCD8A98355.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFDark Steel Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.67AA14CCD8A98355.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dark Steel Seeds"
	quest.67CDDDAC88A5EB7F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFPressure Gauge&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.67CDDDAC88A5EB7F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressure Gauge"
	quest.67CDDDAC88A5EB7F.title: "Pressure Gauge"
	quest.67EC9F15C26823FD.quest_desc: ["Upgrade a &#00D9FFTerminite Chestplate&r with an &#00D9FFAeternium Forged Plate&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r to craft the &#00D9FFAeternium Chestplate&r." "It belongs to &#00D9FFBetter End's&r strongest armor set, tougher than any vanilla armor."]
	quest.67EC9F15C26823FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Chestplate"
	quest.67EE4FAD164E2E9A.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFQIO Drives&r hold the items in a &#00D9FFQIO System&r. They work similar to AE2 drives where it has a maximum amount of space and types it can hold."]
	quest.67EE4FAD164E2E9A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Drive Supermassive"
	quest.67F2AFD711612AB1.quest_desc: ["Defeat a &#00D9FFSculk Snapper&r to get &#00D9FFSoul Dust&r."]
	quest.67F2AFD711612AB1.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Sculk Snapper"
	quest.67F2AFD711612AB1.title: "Sculk Snapper"
	quest.67F7FAB96737DCE9.quest_desc: ["Found in the &#00D9FFSilver Dungeon&r. The final dungeon awaits."]
	quest.67F7FAB96737DCE9.quest_subtitle: "Get a Regeneration Stone"
	quest.680EFE1327029DE7.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFSticker&r from &#FFA500Create&r. It temporarily attaches blocks to moving &#00D9FFContraptions&r." "With a &#00D9FFRedstone&r signal it extends and attaches to the block in front of it, so that block moves with the contraption. It suits small, selective attachments where &#00D9FFSuper Glue&r would be too much."]
	quest.680EFE1327029DE7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sticker"
	quest.68128312E6B71D7A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBow Ferricore&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.68128312E6B71D7A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bow Ferricore"
	quest.6818A20457B9CE1F.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSpiked Cloak&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6818A20457B9CE1F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spiked Cloak"
	quest.682BDA5E5C0D67EE.quest_desc: ["These are a cool way of lighting up your base. They can be placed on almost any surface and have the same range as a torch."]
	quest.682BDA5E5C0D67EE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Glow Panel"
	quest.68383D89E14C4816.quest_desc: ["Defeat &#00D9FFPyromancer&r."]
	quest.68383D89E14C4816.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Pyromancer"
	quest.6842A82A93D9E0AF.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFCursium Leggings&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r by upgrading &#00D9FFNetherite Leggings&r with a &#00D9FFCursium Upgrade Smithing Template&r and a &#00D9FFCursium Ingot&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "They belong to the &#00D9FFCursium&r armor set and grant &#00D9FFEthereal Form&r, which gives a chance to dodge incoming attacks."]
	quest.6842A82A93D9E0AF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cursium Leggings"
	quest.6872683F564A1953.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFImperium Essence&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6872683F564A1953.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Essence"
	quest.6879835A5EB411D3.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.6879835A5EB411D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Sawing Factory"
	quest.687C152255B2F039.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFIron&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.68987C39EB057268.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.68987C39EB057268.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.6898A9BD0F6445DF.quest_desc: ["The Elevator uses pressure to move you between floors with a &#00D9FFController&r. One &#00D9FFElevator Base&r lets you go up &#00D9AA6 blocks&r, and stacking more bases adds &#00D9AA6 blocks&r each. Adding the same number of bases beside the first widens the elevator." "Place a &#00D9FFController&r at eye level, beside the shaft, at every floor you want to use."]
	quest.6898A9BD0F6445DF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Elevator Base, 2x Elevator Caller and 16x Elevator Frame"
	quest.6898A9BD0F6445DF.title: "Elevator"
	quest.68997D3C0D3537F7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSoulium Spawner&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.68997D3C0D3537F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulium Spawner"
	quest.68B24C676649A14D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCrescent Spear&r is a melee weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r, linked to advanced progression and lunar-themed materials."]
	quest.68B24C676649A14D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crescent Spear"
	quest.68B24C676649A14D.title: "Crescent Spear"
	quest.68B4FDA866C82343.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBarbecue Stick&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.68B4FDA866C82343.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Barbecue Stick"
	quest.68BE861624099976.quest_desc: ["Allows a double jump."]
	quest.68BE861624099976.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cloud in a Bottle"
	quest.68C5BB6BE173F681.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFItem Drain&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.68C5BB6BE173F681.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Drain"
	quest.68C6F3B563E6F104.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFPink Ivory Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.68C6F3B563E6F104.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pink Ivory Sapling"
	quest.68F0D22512AFF15B.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFRaw Mithril&r is a &#00D9FFRare&r crafting material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It drops from &#00D9FFMithril Ore and Deepslate Mithril Ore&r." "Smelt it in a &#00D9FFBlast Furnace&r to get &#00D9FFMithril Scrap&r, which is used for &#00D9FFMithril Ingots&r and other strong equipment."]
	quest.68F0D22512AFF15B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Raw Mithril"
	quest.68F1C04B022F5BCA.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFGreen Fertilizer&r increases crop growth."]
	quest.68F1C04B022F5BCA.quest_subtitle: "A fertilizer for crops"
	quest.6920BB5C3E6FEADC.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFUpgrade Emerald&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6920BB5C3E6FEADC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Emerald"
	quest.6920F841AB22880C.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Thallasium Forged Plate&r from a &#00D9FFThallasium Ingot&r at an &#00D9FFAnvil&r with a &#00D9FFSmith Hammer&r." "You can then use it at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r to build a full set of &#00D9FFThallasium&r armor."]
	quest.6920F841AB22880C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Forged Plate"
	quest.693E7A746445C115.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFDogwood Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.693E7A746445C115.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dogwood Sapling"
	quest.694EC4445C182219.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFAdvanced Air Compressor&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.694EC4445C182219.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Air Compressor"
	quest.6950AB287CDFB65B.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFKinetic Dynamo&r produces more FE the faster its &#00D9FFWater Wheel&r or &#00D9FFWindmill&r spins."]
	quest.6950AB287CDFB65B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dynamo"
	quest.695217245E1FF9F5.quest_desc: ["Logistics frames handle logistics tasks in a network, using drones or pipes pressurized to at least 3 bar. A &#00D9FFLogistics Wrench&r is needed to work with them." "Frames pass items in order of priority. Active provider frames push to requester, storage and default storage frames. Default storage frames push to requester and storage frames and accept from active providers. Storage frames push to requesters and accept from active providers and default frames. Passive frames only push to requesters. Requester frames accept from active provider, passive and storage frames." "Filters control what each frame pushes or accepts, and requester frames can also set a desired amount. Overlapping filters can add up. Nothing is transported if no inventory or tank in the network has room."]
	quest.695217245E1FF9F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistics Frame Active Provider, Logistics Frame Default Storage, Logistics Frame Passive Provider and 2 more items"
	quest.695217245E1FF9F5.title: "Logistics Frames"
	quest.695C3AFD2AC5E607.quest_desc: ["The Mummy simply fights your enemies in hand-to-hand combat."]
	quest.695C3AFD2AC5E607.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Mummy"
	quest.6976C4C1772EAFF2.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGlacite Chestplate&r is crafted from &#00D9FFGlacite&r materials in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Glacite armor protects against freezing environments and slows enemies that attack you."]
	quest.6976C4C1772EAFF2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Chestplate"
	quest.69788511382BAB82.quest_desc: ["Craft a &#00D9FFBlack Steel Pickaxe&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r. It offers excellent durability and mining efficiency, and belongs to the &#00D9FFBlack Steel&r set."]
	quest.69788511382BAB82.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Steel Pickaxe"
	quest.697B8CD2A3391461.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCharged Snowball&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.697B8CD2A3391461.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charged Snowball"
	quest.699D1AC6EA5EDE1B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFTerminite Hoe&r is a farming tool forged from &#00D9FFTerminite Ingots&r and prepares farmland more efficiently than &#00D9FFThallasium&r tools." "It belongs to &#00D9FFBetter End's&r mid-tier equipment."]
	quest.699D1AC6EA5EDE1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Hoe"
	quest.69A8FEDB187F3F17.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFImperium Helmet&r, &#00D9FFImperium Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFImperium Leggings and Imperium Boots&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.69A8FEDB187F3F17.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Helmet, Imperium Chestplate, Imperium Leggings and Imperium Boots"
	quest.69A8FEDB187F3F17.title: "Imperium Armor"
	quest.69AF1379B6E79EFC.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to damage attackers."]
	quest.69AF1379B6E79EFC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thorn Pendant"
	quest.69BAA907D762FFD7.quest_desc: ["Used for modifying lots of &#00D9FFPatterns&r at once."]
	quest.69BAA907D762FFD7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pattern Modifier"
	quest.69C30CDF2E40F86C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFElderberry Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.69C30CDF2E40F86C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elderberry Sapling"
	quest.69C69E412DC52FF7.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFHoneycomb Milky&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.69C69E412DC52FF7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honeycomb Milky"
	quest.69D236F98086F9F1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnergy Hopper Blazing&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.69D236F98086F9F1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Hopper Blazing"
	quest.69FB4C1FF6EDAFCB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSwamp Gum Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.69FB4C1FF6EDAFCB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Swamp Gum Sapling"
	quest.6A0AD1EDDED4F8F0.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFIncubate Moa&r."]
	quest.6A0AD1EDDED4F8F0.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Incubate Moa"
	quest.6A1526D7FF35F810.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.6A1526D7FF35F810.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Wind Shear"
	quest.6A187DD8BA99E2A3.quest_desc: ["Induction Provides make up the transfer rate of the battery, both input and output. Transfer Rate: 819.20 kFE/t."]
	quest.6A187DD8BA99E2A3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Induction Provider"
	quest.6A20AF7178C44C2A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9AA16x&r &#00D9FFCrystal Nitro&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6A20AF7178C44C2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Crystal Nitro"
	quest.6A20AF7178C44C2A.title: "Nitro Crystal"
	quest.6A2A241353ECD7D4.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFIce Rune&r is a crafting ingredient in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r, used for advanced Ice crafting such as &#00D9FFIce Upgrade Orbs&r. The Ice school uses &#00D9FFFrozen Bone&r as its &#00D9FFFocus&r." "Combine 1 &#00D9FFBlank Runestone&r with 8 &#00D9FFFrozen Bones&r to make one."]
	quest.6A2A241353ECD7D4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ice Rune"
	quest.6A2F8461FEC2CB3A.quest_desc: ["A Hohlraum is the starting source for the reactor. However, you still need a reliable source of &#00D9FFTritium and Deuterium&r as the reactor requires it to run. You will need to create D-&#00D9FFT Fuel&r to fill this &#00D9FFHohlraum&r."]
	quest.6A2F8461FEC2CB3A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hohlraum"
	quest.6A30C3761E2E4ADA.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnder Gate Hardened&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6A30C3761E2E4ADA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Gate Hardened"
	quest.6A331140E85EB0B4.quest_desc: ["Upgraded version of the &#00D9FFEnriched Alloy&r which some &#FFA500Mekanism&r machines and items use. Crafted in the &#00D9FFMetallurgic Infuser&r by infusing an &#00D9FFEnriched Alloy&r with &#00D9FFDiamond Dust&r or &#00D9FFCompressed Diamond&r."]
	quest.6A331140E85EB0B4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alloy Reinforced"
	quest.6A4F2178F4E09456.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFStarfish Bucket&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6A4F2178F4E09456.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfish Bucket"
	quest.6A57357AFB68EB68.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.6A57357AFB68EB68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Dispel"
	quest.6A58ADFB3B5D8BD5.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCommon Ink&r is the most basic magical ink in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. The &#00D9FFScroll Forge&r uses it to make &#00D9FFCommon&r-rarity spell scrolls." "You can find it in magical structures or get it from powerful magical creatures."]
	quest.6A58ADFB3B5D8BD5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Common Ink"
	quest.6A635458FD18C0E7.quest_desc: ["Upgrade an &#00D9FFInfused Seashelf&r with a &#00D9FFHeart&r of the &#00D9FFSea and Prismarine Shards&r." "It gives &#00D9AA+15&r &#00D9FFEterna&r (up to 60) and a large &#00D9AA+20&r &#00D9FFArcana&r, making it one of the best shelves for rare enchantments."]
	quest.6A635458FD18C0E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heart Seashelf"
	quest.6A6F3CDF729858F3.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500The Twilight Forest&r is a hidden dimension of endless dusk, full of dense woods, ruins and powerful creatures." "To enter it, you need to build a portal using natural materials."]
	quest.6A6F3CDF729858F3.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Root"
	quest.6A6F3CDF729858F3.title: "The Twilight Forest"
	quest.6A73814A3702AC23.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFChainmail&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.6A7D91C7521BD24A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCentrifuge&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6A7D91C7521BD24A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Centrifuge"
	quest.6A7D91C7521BD24A.title: "Actually It's The Centripetal Force"
	quest.6A8C1CAC247FA31E.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFThermodynamic Conductors&r are a way of transporting heat. Insulation: 10."]
	quest.6A8C1CAC247FA31E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.6AA7E2DFCF420728.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPurification Chamber&r uses oxygen to refine &#00D9FFOres&r and shards into clumps. Each ore makes 3 clumps, whereas each shard only gives one clump."]
	quest.6AA7E2DFCF420728.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Purification Chamber"
	quest.6AC612A16BB94AFB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6AC612A16BB94AFB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.6ACD4EBCFC3477E4.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCore&r 16k. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6ACD4EBCFC3477E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Core 16k"
	quest.6AD21696A3A815C9.quest_desc: ["Now that you have a &#00D9FFConcurrent Processor&r you can now craft some more items to help you through &#00D9FFExtendedAE&r."]
	quest.6AD21696A3A815C9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Concurrent Processor"
	quest.6ADFB35DB13126FF.quest_desc: ["This unit allows you to fly. The controls are the same compared to creative mode."]
	quest.6ADFB35DB13126FF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Module Gravitational Modulating Unit"
	quest.6B072654AF8B4EC4.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFinger Lime Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6B072654AF8B4EC4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Finger Lime Sapling"
	quest.6B14097C730883B0.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnder Cell Blazing&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6B14097C730883B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Cell Blazing"
	quest.6B176850FD69337C.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnchanting Table&r of the &#00D9FFRaven&r lets you set the core enchanting stats directly for precise control over your setup."]
	quest.6B176850FD69337C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Raven Enchanting Table"
	quest.6B176850FD69337C.title: "The Raven Knows"
	quest.6B1BEC79005075E8.quest_desc: ["Curios adds slots for charms and accessories next to your inventory. Item tooltips tell you which slot an item can go in."]
	quest.6B1BEC79005075E8.quest_subtitle: "Extra equipment slots."
	quest.6B1BEC79005075E8.title: "Curios Slots"
	quest.6B2E837EB9A3DB28.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarlit Diamond Shovel&r is a late-game tool crafted from &#00D9FFStarlit Diamond&r materials in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It digs efficiently in advanced biomes and is the top digging tier before celestial endgame content."]
	quest.6B2E837EB9A3DB28.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starlit Diamond Shovel"
	quest.6B32683A2B473683.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFChainmail&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.6B32EFC2CDA5ED29.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Thallasium Chestplate&r from &#00D9FFThallasium Plating&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "It is part of the first armor set &#00D9FFBetter End&r adds."]
	quest.6B32EFC2CDA5ED29.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Chestplate"
	quest.6B3AA1C03FFF6612.quest_desc: ["Harvested from &#00D9FFAnimals&r while using a &#00D9FFKnife&r."]
	quest.6B3AA1C03FFF6612.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tallow"
	quest.6B3F2C31283D4A50.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Shovel&r is crafted from &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is used for digging in geothermal regions and sits at the mid tier of the &#00D9FFSpringstone&r gear."]
	quest.6B3F2C31283D4A50.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Shovel"
	quest.6B420B672720971F.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFRage of Stars&r is a mid-tier star-themed weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It sits between the elemental materials and late-game celestial gear, and focuses on burst magical damage and area star effects."]
	quest.6B420B672720971F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rage of Stars"
	quest.6B45D96E96AAFB6E.quest_desc: ["The Stove is a &#FFA500Farmer's Delight&r cooking station for preparing many dishes. Place ingredients inside to turn them into meals, which makes it a core part of any kitchen."]
	quest.6B45D96E96AAFB6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stove"
	quest.6B4DABF4DE611839.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFNano Quantum&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.6B52A4936EA6FE4F.quest_desc: ["Filters items being piped in/out with more filtering options."]
	quest.6B52A4936EA6FE4F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Filter Upgrade"
	quest.6B58916E6D785ED5.quest_desc: ["The fluid canister holds 8 &#00D9FFBuckets&r of whatever fluid you like. It has a unique “fill” mode for automatically filling fluid holding items in your inventory."]
	quest.6B58916E6D785ED5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluid Canister"
	quest.6B5DD03E0BF1D016.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnergizing Rod Spirited&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6B5DD03E0BF1D016.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energizing Rod Spirited"
	quest.6B636C89BD920956.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFHarbinger&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6B636C89BD920956.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Harbinger"
	quest.6B6AEB271F09290A.quest_desc: ["Brassy, black sided, and very stylish."]
	quest.6B6AEB271F09290A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Railway Casing"
	quest.6B7A444CF23FA973.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFUpgrade Gold&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6B7A444CF23FA973.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Gold"
	quest.6B7BBCFA9187F2E6.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r has three basic spools: &#00D9FFEmpty Spool&r, &#00D9FFCopper Spool and Gold Spool&r. The &#00D9FFEmpty Spool&r is the base for the wired ones." "&#00D9FFCopper and Gold Spools&r link &#00D9FFConnectors&r and carry electrical energy between them. Each uses 4 wires of its metal."]
	quest.6B7BBCFA9187F2E6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spool, Copper Spool and Gold Spool"
	quest.6B7BC9B9ECF64FFD.quest_desc: ["If &#00D9FFInternet Protocol&r has ports, than &#00D9FFPackage Frogports&r must be part of CCP: &#00D9FFChain Conveyor Protocol&r."]
	quest.6B7BC9B9ECF64FFD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Package Frogport"
	quest.6B87EFBA4CAD37D8.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Loreception."]
	quest.6B87EFBA4CAD37D8.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Loreception"
	quest.6B87EFBA4CAD37D8.title: "Lore-Ception!"
	quest.6B89604387EC4F3D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFExpulsion Ring&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6B89604387EC4F3D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Expulsion Ring"
	quest.6B902C0B6CE683CA.quest_desc: ["This questbook is actively being developed. Some mod guides may be incomplete, change over time, or not exist yet. Checkmarks are optional read markers; there is no required quest order or gameplay objective."]
	quest.6B902C0B6CE683CA.quest_subtitle: "The guide is a work in progress, not a finished questline."
	quest.6B902C0B6CE683CA.title: "Questbook Under Development"
	quest.6B9C2BB068B89D1A.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFScepter of Fortification&r drops from the &#00D9FFTwilight Lich&r. It lets you create protective barriers, which helps in both combat and survival." "Its power is limited, so use it with care."]
	quest.6B9C2BB068B89D1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fortification Scepter"
	quest.6B9E34653D582016.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEclipse Gate Wand&r has &#00D9FFLava Repair&r, &#00D9FFAir Burst&r up to strength 8, &#00D9FFVoid Shift&r up to &#00D9AA30 blocks&r and &#00D9FFEclipse Gate&r, which opens a portable hole. All blocks except tile entities vanish temporarily, and after a short time the hole collapses and the blocks return."]
	quest.6B9E34653D582016.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsegate Wand"
	quest.6BA4B719E5A64CAC.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFMount Phyg&r."]
	quest.6BA4B719E5A64CAC.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Mount Phyg"
	quest.6BA4E8DA6AF6C6A0.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFluix Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6BA4E8DA6AF6C6A0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluix Seeds"
	quest.6BAFF698ACCCFE0A.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCrystallized Amber&r can be found in the &#00D9FFOtherside&r." "Each block contains something, usually an item but sometimes a &#00D9FFSculk Leech&r, so break it with care."]
	quest.6BAFF698ACCCFE0A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystallized Amber"
	quest.6BB594CD94381638.quest_desc: ["This machine detects a player or mob and emits a redstone signal!"]
	quest.6BB594CD94381638.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sensort1"
	quest.6BB7D2717E73C5EE.quest_desc: ["Find &#00D9FFthe Desert Site&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r, a small structure in &#00D9FFDesert&r biomes full of sandstone traps, hidden loot and dangerous enemies." "Check every corner before heading deeper down."]
	quest.6BB7D2717E73C5EE.title: "Desert Site"
	quest.6BB87A8365C1C5ED.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPeridot Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6BB87A8365C1C5ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Peridot Seeds"
	quest.6BCC1A61CD7E90B2.quest_desc: ["Used to change the weather."]
	quest.6BCC1A61CD7E90B2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Cloudshaping"
	quest.6BECEC88B39E4C3B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDeepshelf of Arcane Treasures&r lets &#00D9FFTreasure Enchantments&r, such as &#00D9FFMending&r, appear in the enchanting table." "Craft it from &#00D9FFDeepshelves&r, &#00D9FFDiamonds&r, &#00D9FFGold Blocks&r and an &#00D9FFEmerald Block&r."]
	quest.6BECEC88B39E4C3B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Treasure Shelf"
	quest.6BFC8DB5E2F62F5F.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFAmethyst Crab Meat&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is an unusual delicacy taken from the defeated &#00D9FFAmethyst Crab&r."]
	quest.6BFC8DB5E2F62F5F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Crab Meat"
	quest.6C142604C565F1E5.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFProtection Upgrade Orb&r is an upgrade material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Applied at the &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r, it gives &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Resistance&r." "Craft it from 1 &#00D9FFEmpty Upgrade Orb&r and 8 &#00D9FFProtective Runes&r. By default, compatible equipment accepts up to 3 upgrades."]
	quest.6C142604C565F1E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Protection Upgrade Orb"
	quest.6C45809FFDD0FBCF.quest_desc: ["Through the power of gravity, throwing 1 &#00D9FFGold Ingot&r, 1 &#00D9FFLapis Lazuli&r, and 1 &#00D9FFEntro&r dust you will obtain 1 &#00D9FFEntro Infused Ingot&r."]
	quest.6C45809FFDD0FBCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Entro Ingot"
	quest.6C494F9D6CCE6111.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFVoidshimmer Goo&r turns &#00D9FFDiamond Blocks&r into &#00D9FFCelestigems&r. It is fed with &#00D9FFEnder Pearls&r or &#00D9FFChorus Fruit&r, and it can produce the resources of lower tiers faster. &#00D9FFCelestigem and Eclipse Alloy&r tools, weapons and armor need power to work."]
	quest.6C494F9D6CCE6111.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Celestigem and Gooblock Tier3"
	quest.6C494F9D6CCE6111.title: "Making Celestigems"
	quest.6C4A85F9A1C02D1D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMonkey Puzzle Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6C4A85F9A1C02D1D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Monkey Puzzle Sapling"
	quest.6C5352B98C9BAFF4.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Axe&r is crafted from &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is a heat-resistant, mid-tier tool for chopping wood in geothermal regions."]
	quest.6C5352B98C9BAFF4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Axe"
	quest.6C5729829DB3D863.title: "Ur-Ghast"
	quest.6C5889B6CFE66D67.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnergy Cell Spirited&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6C5889B6CFE66D67.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell Spirited"
	quest.6C5A6C92D9D3255D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFChicken Sandwich&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6C5A6C92D9D3255D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chicken Sandwich"
	quest.6C5D737795BF9388.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDeepsilver Axe&r is crafted from &#00D9FFDeepsilver Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It works for chopping and fighting in swamp and &#00D9FFNightfall&r areas, with more durability than iron tools."]
	quest.6C5D737795BF9388.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Axe"
	quest.6C9E886CC1EE3D8A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFHemp Fabric&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6C9E886CC1EE3D8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hemp Fabric"
	quest.6CA2B05E986937CB.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPolymorphic Catalyst&r is the key to unlock &#FFA500Just Dire Things&r' better fuels. Drop one piece of polymorphic catalyst into water, and polymorphic fluid will result."]
	quest.6CA2B05E986937CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Polymorphic Catalyst and Polymorphic Fluid Bucket"
	quest.6CA786134D0DA32B.quest_desc: ["Pulls items to it within a configurable area. You can place the magnet field somewhere else and increase its range."]
	quest.6CA786134D0DA32B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Itemcollector"
	quest.6CCC0C85FD188EB8.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFGrapefruit Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6CCC0C85FD188EB8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Grapefruit Sapling"
	quest.6CD536084D807B99.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFVoltmeter&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6CD536084D807B99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Voltmeter"
	quest.6CE34C7BB7E569C3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStack Upgrade Tier&r 1+ lets compatible items stack beyond their normal limit in your &#FFA500Sophisticated Storage&r containers." "That means more items fit without using extra slots, which makes every container more efficient."]
	quest.6CE34C7BB7E569C3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Tier 1 Plus"
	quest.6CEFF519AC0F4981.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBlazegold Leggings&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6CEFF519AC0F4981.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazegold Leggings"
	quest.6CFD8C74EEF6AAC4.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.6CFD8C74EEF6AAC4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Rune"
	quest.6D12982E206076B3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCelestigem Hoe&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6D12982E206076B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Hoe"
	quest.6D152CC9EE402249.quest_desc: ["This device is a portal to another dimension that only your spirits can enter. Supply a miner spirit and it brings back ore and other blocks, storing them in its inventory." "Redstone can disable it, and a comparator can read the lamp's durability."]
	quest.6D152CC9EE402249.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dimensional Mineshaft"
	quest.6D1D917C76B40906.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFResistive Heater&r converts FE into &#00D9FFHeat&r, giving you a reliable way to supply heat to your &#00D9FFThermal Evaporation Plant&r. Connect it to the plant's &#00D9FFThermal Evaporation Valve&r to transfer the generated &#00D9FFHeat&r directly into the tower. Use it when you need a controllable heat source for increasing the temperature and improving the evaporation process."]
	quest.6D1D917C76B40906.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Resistive Heater"
	quest.6D1D917C76B40906.title: "Resistive Heater"
	quest.6D33F52AB5E994BA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEuropean Larch Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6D33F52AB5E994BA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain European Larch Sapling"
	quest.6D39E8BD0BD78A8E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLibrary of Alexandria&r greatly expands how many enchantments you can store. It pairs well with the &#00D9FFTome of Extraction&r for moving enchantments off existing gear into your collection."]
	quest.6D39E8BD0BD78A8E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Library"
	quest.6D3BF32E8DAF8F91.quest_desc: ["Janitor spirits can pick up items and deposit them into containers. They're particularly useful to gather the products of other spirits."]
	quest.6D3BF32E8DAF8F91.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Brush, Dispenser and Hopper. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Cleaner"
	quest.6D3BF32E8DAF8F91.title: "Ritual: Summon Foliot Janitor"
	quest.6D4E45392F3BDEB0.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFFlowglaze Pickaxe&r is a mining tool from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r in the &#00D9FFFlowglaze&r tier." "It is crafted from &#00D9FFFlowglaze&r materials and fits mid-to-late game."]
	quest.6D4E45392F3BDEB0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowglaze Pickaxe"
	quest.6D593EE9664927ED.quest_desc: ["Used to store power, you will need to get yourself a &#00D9FFFE Cell Housing&r."]
	quest.6D593EE9664927ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Insulating Resin"
	quest.6D66859037ADC9B0.quest_desc: ["Adds a smoker to the storage."]
	quest.6D66859037ADC9B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smoking Upgrade"
	quest.6D68225D5481E46D.quest_desc: ["Use it to make fish fillets. The amount you get depends on the type of fish."]
	quest.6D68225D5481E46D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Fillet Knife"
	quest.6D6A8C839BA1FEBC.quest_desc: ["It is found in &#00D9FFAurora Palaces&r. It fires like a normal bow, but a hit swaps your place with the target. Be careful where that leaves you."]
	quest.6D6A8C839BA1FEBC.quest_subtitle: "Find the Ender Bow"
	quest.6D6A8C839BA1FEBC.title: "The Ender Bow"
	quest.6D6D9842CFD8C951.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFIce Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6D6D9842CFD8C951.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ice Seeds"
	quest.6D7235B9B9C960DD.quest_desc: ["The Gas-&#00D9FFBurning Generator&r can use a plethora of flammable gases to generate electricity. Gases like &#00D9FFHydrogen and Ethene&r can be good for a large amount of power early on. Check your EMI to see which gases are truly flammable and how much power you can generate with them."]
	quest.6D7235B9B9C960DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gas Burning Generator"
	quest.6D7235B9B9C960DD.title: "Gas-Burning Generator"
	quest.6D8991B1B64AAF0F.title: "Questing Ram"
	quest.6D8BE79061F0CC20.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFApprentice Spellbook&r is a better book and requires a trip to the &#00D9FFNether&r."]
	quest.6D8BE79061F0CC20.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Spell Book"
	quest.6D93F89EE75F5733.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFRolling Mill&r from &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r is a kinetic machine that turns metal into &#00D9FFRods and Wires&r." "It handles &#00D9FFCopper&r, &#00D9FFIron&r, &#00D9FFGold&r, &#00D9FFBrass and Electrum&r, which you need for electrical parts. Power it with &#FFA500Create&r's rotational force."]
	quest.6D93F89EE75F5733.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rolling Mill"
	quest.6D96DFC86C32B8BB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSeed Reprocessor&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6D96DFC86C32B8BB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Seed Reprocessor"
	quest.6D998327C7098C51.quest_desc: ["This spirit will bring back random ores - including deepslate ores."]
	quest.6D998327C7098C51.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Afrit Deeps"
	quest.6DCD49C382DB1C9C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMango Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6DCD49C382DB1C9C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mango Sapling"
	quest.6DE384270098B0D5.quest_desc: ["Transmits energy from the attached source to any power consumer within an offset AOE."]
	quest.6DE384270098B0D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energytransmitter"
	quest.6DFD4C8C70B53F69.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGlacite Shovel&r is crafted from &#00D9FFGlacite Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It digs in cold biomes and is more durable than earlier-tier tools."]
	quest.6DFD4C8C70B53F69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Shovel"
	quest.6E0AFC4F93A709DE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFYew Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6E0AFC4F93A709DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Yew Sapling"
	quest.6E1B7E482248CD70.quest_desc: ["Arcane stone is used for crafting items from &#FFA500Ars Nouveau&r. You may also want to use this in your &#FFA500Ars Nouveau&r magical area."]
	quest.6E1B7E482248CD70.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Sourcestone"
	quest.6E1B7E482248CD70.title: "Sourcestone"
	quest.6E1C7AD61242989D.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Bone Reptile Chestplate&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r using &#00D9FFAncient Metal Ingots and Koboleton Bones&r." "It is durable, with good protection and knockback resistance."]
	quest.6E1C7AD61242989D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bone Reptile Chestplate"
	quest.6E2020218315C399.quest_desc: ["Processes resource combs into resources and honey. It holds 10 buckets of liquid and outputs fluid to any fluid storage block next to it. It also separates genetic material from bee material bottles into genes."]
	quest.6E2020218315C399.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Centrifuge"
	quest.6E3E449AF33D6E57.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSeeking Eye&r is an &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r item that points you toward the dimension's bosses." "It can find threats that ordinary exploration would not turn up."]
	quest.6E3E449AF33D6E57.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Seeking Eye"
	quest.6E3E449AF33D6E57.title: "Seeking Eye"
	quest.6E3E4E3C6CE74A69.quest_desc: ["A simple generator that makes power from coal and other solid fuels."]
	quest.6E3E4E3C6CE74A69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Generatort1"
	quest.6E43042D3CEE208D.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMinnow&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6E43042D3CEE208D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Minnow"
	quest.6E45DE5B628038D1.quest_desc: ["Whilst in the &#00D9FFNether&r, you must fight your way to the &#00D9FFHogs&r, and obtain &#00D9FFHogskin&r."]
	quest.6E45DE5B628038D1.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Hoglin"
	quest.6E4B1039904C224F.quest_desc: ["Feed it &#00D9FFForge Energy&r and it powers any receiver linked to it."]
	quest.6E4B1039904C224F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heater"
	quest.6E5CD41866DE6111.quest_desc: ["A key piece of most &#FFA500Create&r builds: interchanges axis of rotational motion between one plane and another."]
	quest.6E5CD41866DE6111.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gearbox"
	quest.6E6769A01053B690.quest_desc: ["There may be other ways to make more power in modded, but it is hard to top the satisfaction of a boiler driving many &#00D9FFSteam Engines&r… as many as you can setup fed with enough heat and water."]
	quest.6E6769A01053B690.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steam Engine"
	quest.6E6A0D502DFCC952.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSky Steel Ingot&r can be used to craft &#00D9FFMEGA Item Storage&r cells. It is made by dropping &#00D9FFCharged Certus Quartz&r, &#00D9FFIron&r, and &#00D9FFSky Stone&r into water. The &#00D9FFSky Osmium Ingot&r can be used to craft &#00D9FFMEGA Chemical Storage&r cells. It is made by dropping &#00D9FFCharged Certus Quartz&r, &#00D9FFOsmium&r, and &#00D9FFSky Stone&r into water. The &#00D9FFSky Bronze Ingot&r can be used to craft &#00D9FFMEGA Fluid Storage&r cells. It is made by dropping &#00D9FFCharged Certus Quartz&r, &#00D9FFCopper&r, and &#00D9FFSky Stone&r into water."]
	quest.6E6A0D502DFCC952.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sky Steel Ingot, Sky Bronze Ingot and Sky Osmium Ingot"
	quest.6E6B1DFAFF693FAA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCapacitor Spirited&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6E6B1DFAFF693FAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor Spirited"
	quest.6E6DE23E9CCF1E39.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSoul Sand Nest&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6E6DE23E9CCF1E39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Sand Nest"
	quest.6E703B6CB23A1180.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnergized Steel Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6E703B6CB23A1180.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energized Steel Seeds"
	quest.6E87762F6639137B.quest_desc: ["Try every food that is exclusive to the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r."]
	quest.6E87762F6639137B.quest_subtitle: "Eat all the Twilight Forest foods"
	quest.6E8BC6B8B1890312.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFOsmium Compressor&r is used to create &#00D9FFRefined Obsidian Ingots&r from &#00D9FFRefined Obsidian Dust and Glowstone Ingots&r from &#00D9FFGlowstone Dust&r. It fuses liquid &#00D9FFOsmium&r (melted down &#00D9FFOsmium Ingots&r placed in the machine's bottom slot) with the originating materials to create their corresponding ingots."]
	quest.6E8BC6B8B1890312.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Osmium Compressor"
	quest.6E90FA61DB81B8BC.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFImperium Gemstone&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6E90FA61DB81B8BC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Gemstone"
	quest.6E9DEBC2D6333DFE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFPlate of Cold Striderloaf&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6E9DEBC2D6333DFE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plate of Cold Striderloaf"
	quest.6E9F5C14939476E4.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFGhast Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6E9F5C14939476E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ghast Seeds"
	quest.6E9FB509B6778926.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCopper Stool&r with &#00D9FFFestive Lights&r is a decorative block that pairs a copper stool with festive lighting. It adds some character to a factory, workshop or living space."]
	quest.6E9FB509B6778926.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Festive Spool"
	quest.6EA2495260EAC420.quest_desc: ["Bring Minigun into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6EA2495260EAC420.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Minigun"
	quest.6EA8CCAF032487D3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLarge Steam Furnace&r can smelt recipes in batches of up to 8 at a &#00D9AA25%&r deduction of EU cost. Keep in mind, it will not do a mix of recipes, they must be the same type. If not, each type of recipe will be split into their batch of a max of 8."]
	quest.6EA8CCAF032487D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Large Steam Furnace, 16x Bronze Plated Bricks, 7x Fire Clay Bricks and 2 more items"
	quest.6EABD47309F354DD.quest_desc: ["You'll want to craft a &#00D9FFPattern Encoding Terminal&r to be able to encode patterns with crafting recipes for your autocrafting system. The &#00D9FFPattern Access Terminal&r is another upgrade or the &#00D9FFTerminal&r. This Terminal will allow you to make a &#00D9FFPattern&r of items you want your system to craft."]
	quest.6EABD47309F354DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pattern Encoding Terminal and Pattern Access Terminal"
	quest.6EABD47309F354DD.title: "Pattern Encoding Terminal"
	quest.6EB4CFA725680541.quest_desc: ["Actually does nothing on it's own.. but is a key ingredient in making other desirable stuff. Also maybe the first thing you will want to build a contraption to make."]
	quest.6EB4CFA725680541.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Precision Mechanism"
	quest.6EB8725CD38955BC.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFNeptunium Fishing Rod&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6EB8725CD38955BC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Fishing Rod"
	quest.6EBF12BBAB828C1B.quest_desc: ["Feeds the player from food in the storage."]
	quest.6EBF12BBAB828C1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Feeding Upgrade"
	quest.6ECAED363B693583.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFSigil of Socketing&r adds another socket to compatible &#00D9FFAffix Gear&r, making room for one more Gem."]
	quest.6ECAED363B693583.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sigil of Socketing"
	quest.6ECAED363B693583.title: "More Room"
	quest.6ECF9993595C000E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSupremium Helmet&r, &#00D9FFSupremium Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFSupremium Leggings and Supremium Boots&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6ECF9993595C000E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Helmet, Supremium Chestplate, Supremium Leggings and Supremium Boots"
	quest.6ECF9993595C000E.title: "Supremium Armor"
	quest.6EDAA5067E208646.quest_desc: ["Steel can come from this mod or from other mods in the pack."]
	quest.6EDAA5067E208646.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ingot Steel"
	quest.6EDAA5067E208646.title: "Steel Ingot"
	quest.6EEC0078D6A23658.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMystical Fertilizer&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6EEC0078D6A23658.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mystical Fertilizer"
	quest.6EF2D4401AAFD366.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.6EF2D4401AAFD366.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Sensitive"
	quest.6F0773C261CCF352.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGlacite Sword&r is crafted from &#00D9FFGlacite Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is a mid-tier weapon that slows enemies, which helps control crowds in cold biomes."]
	quest.6F0773C261CCF352.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Sword"
	quest.6F0AA458CD49A86C.quest_desc: ["Filters items being piped in/out."]
	quest.6F0AA458CD49A86C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Filter Upgrade"
	quest.6F0B6FF4B75E8D66.quest_desc: ["An advanced compressor that utilizes sunlight to pressurize air. Its efficiency improves as it gets hotter, but excessive heat buildup will cause the compressor to shut down, necessitating manual repair."]
	quest.6F0B6FF4B75E8D66.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Compressor"
	quest.6F0E941A3F0A6300.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFChemical Infuser&r combines or reacts two gases to create another gas. The gas gauges on the left and right side of its GUI are the input tanks, and correspond to correspond with the left and right sides of the machine. The gauge in the middle is for the resulting gas, which likewise is output through the front of the machine."]
	quest.6F0E941A3F0A6300.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Infuser"
	quest.6F2CDCF53BDD5F0D.quest_desc: ["Make a &#00D9FFGlowberry Milkshake&r to bring the taste of &#00D9FFGlow Berries&r into your factory. This glowing variant adds a unique touch to the milkshakes of &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r."]
	quest.6F2CDCF53BDD5F0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glowberry Milkshake"
	quest.6F3E82436B6DCD42.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFBank Dock&r can be placed in the world and works like a chest while a &#00D9FFBank&r sits inside it."]
	quest.6F3E82436B6DCD42.quest_subtitle: "Place a Bank in a chest-like dock"
	quest.6F43A73447924D09.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFTitanium Ingot&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6F43A73447924D09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Titanium Ingot"
	quest.6F43A73447924D09.title: "Steel but Pink"
	quest.6F67CAC027801375.quest_desc: ["Give this scroll to a starbuncle, and it will help keep you further organized."]
	quest.6F67CAC027801375.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deny Scroll"
	quest.6F68802E3CECA25D.quest_desc: ["To establish a &#00D9FFMercurial Logistics&r network, these &#00D9FFWires&r must be used to link between in- and outputs. &#00D9FFConnection Nodes&r allow for multiple wires to converge to one point, if needed."]
	quest.6F68802E3CECA25D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistics Connector Node and Copper Wire"
	quest.6F68802E3CECA25D.title: "Mercurial Connections"
	quest.6F713004201B6207.quest_desc: ["An upgraded &#00D9FFBasic Control Circuit&r, used in many tier 2 machines and items."]
	quest.6F713004201B6207.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Control Circuit"
	quest.6F810D21904F00B6.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFHolly Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6F810D21904F00B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Holly Sapling"
	quest.6F9082A1F400E5D3.quest_desc: ["Upgrade those &#00D9FFLarge Steam Boilers&r already! This advanced version can quadruple the &#00D9FFSteam&r production to 1024 mb/t of steam at full temperature. It's a little taller so remember to use the &#00D9FFWrench&r to see multiblock shape and block placement."]
	quest.6F9082A1F400E5D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Large Steam Boiler"
	quest.6F9082A1F400E5D3.title: "Advanced Large Steam Boiler"
	quest.6F9AEFBE29744AE4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFZebrano Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6F9AEFBE29744AE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Zebrano Sapling"
	quest.6FBFBC067DD3FD2A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPistachio Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6FBFBC067DD3FD2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pistachio Sapling"
	quest.6FD1D4CDDE2DFD69.quest_desc: ["The Actuator's storage space is limited by default. Stabilizers strengthen its link to the storage dimension so it can store more."]
	quest.6FD1D4CDDE2DFD69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Stabilizer Tier4"
	quest.6FD8B163635D5992.quest_desc: ["Cuts down even the tallest trees, or cuts many things into.. many more things. So many recipes apply for many possible inputs to the &#00D9FFMechanical Saw&r, that you'll want to lock in the recipe by hitting the top of it with an example of the desired output."]
	quest.6FD8B163635D5992.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Saw"
	quest.6FDB74D30B768032.quest_desc: ["Bring Icestone into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6FDB74D30B768032.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Icestone"
	quest.6FDB74D30B768032.title: "Cold as Ice"
	quest.6FDEAD51DB6A6F36.quest_desc: ["Some quests reward a T3 &#00D9FFCodex&r (&#00D9FFAncient Codex Entry&r). T3 &#00D9FFCodexes&r do not spawn naturally."]
	quest.6FDEAD51DB6A6F36.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Split, Glyph Blink, Glyph Burst and 13 more items"
	quest.6FDEAD51DB6A6F36.title: "Tier 3 Glyphs"
	quest.6FEB8BBF4480C371.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMana Upgrade Orb&r is an upgrade material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Applied at the &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r, it gives &#00D9AA+50&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r." "It works on compatible equipment, and by default a piece can receive up to 3 upgrades."]
	quest.6FEB8BBF4480C371.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mana Upgrade Orb"
	quest.6FEE5D7DF1072157.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCursium Ingots&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r are rare and dropped by &#00D9FFMaledictus&r in the &#00D9FFFrosted Prison&r." "They are used to craft powerful &#00D9FFCursium&r equipment."]
	quest.6FEE5D7DF1072157.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cursium Ingot"
	quest.6FF0A56C73DEA914.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFRowan Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6FF0A56C73DEA914.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rowan Sapling"
	quest.6FF65DF3C9FB95AE.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSilver Ring&r is a simple but useful magical accessory from &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It is a modest base for your magical gear, so consider wearing it as you build up your setup."]
	quest.6FF65DF3C9FB95AE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Silver Ring"
	quest.6FF8077A77706421.quest_desc: ["Clawdian is a &#FFA500Cataclysm&r mini-boss inside the &#00D9FFAcropolis&r. It is a huge crustacean warrior with a giant claw that guards the stronghold." "Defeat it to clear one of the &#00D9FFAcropolis'&r toughest guardians."]
	quest.6FF8077A77706421.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Clawdian"
	quest.6FF8077A77706421.title: "Clawdian"
	quest.700FCEDBE64F3313.quest_desc: ["MekaSuit can be upgraded with &#00D9FFModules&r that are installed with the &#00D9FFModification Station&r."]
	quest.700FCEDBE64F3313.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mekasuit Boots"
	quest.7014B2366D779AE2.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCharger&r turns &#00D9FFCertus Quartz&r into &#00D9FFCharged Certus Quartz&r and recharges tools and items that use AE power. The Crank powers it by hand, so you can use it before you have any other power."]
	quest.7014B2366D779AE2.title: "Charger"
	quest.70211D7B2E93E8DE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSolar Panel Starter&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.70211D7B2E93E8DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Panel Starter"
	quest.702506FB0F4559A7.quest_desc: ["An &#00D9FFEnergy Cube&r is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems."]
	quest.702506FB0F4559A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Energy Cube"
	quest.702984EE8F429BEA.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFThread Gliding&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.702984EE8F429BEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Gliding"
	quest.7037E44B49F9B43A.quest_desc: ["Found a sound that annoys you? Open your inventory and click the muffler button at the top right to quiet it."]
	quest.7037E44B49F9B43A.quest_subtitle: "Silence what bothers you."
	quest.7037E44B49F9B43A.title: "Muffle Noisy Sounds"
	quest.70468C1143E1CE47.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFSteeleaf&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.7047A0BAF1E7C171.quest_desc: ["Plain ol' &#00D9FFCardboard&r. So basic, and yet.."]
	quest.7047A0BAF1E7C171.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cardboard"
	quest.7048646BCF846E42.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPyromancer Boots&r are part of the &#00D9FFPyromancer Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFFire Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "In the current version, make them from a &#00D9FFFire Rune&r, &#00D9FFWizard Boots and Arcane Essence&r."]
	quest.7048646BCF846E42.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyromancer Boots"
	quest.704B403E2FE198AC.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarfire Scythe&r is a late-game melee weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r in the &#00D9FFStarfire&r tier." "It is built for sweeping attacks and extra reach compared to standard weapons."]
	quest.704B403E2FE198AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starfire Scythe"
	quest.705073EFD9A5E1D1.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFElectrum Wire&r from &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r carries electrical energy between compatible components. It belongs to the mod's electrical system with connectors and other wiring, and helps you build reliable links across your network."]
	quest.705073EFD9A5E1D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electrum Wire"
	quest.7067FBA480B8B646.quest_desc: ["The rarest of them all, &#00D9FFPrecious&r resources are often of exceptional value."]
	quest.7067FBA480B8B646.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemical Sulfur Iesnium, Alchemical Sulfur Emerald, Alchemical Sulfur Diamond and Alchemical Sulfur Netherite"
	quest.7067FBA480B8B646.title: "Precious Sulfurs"
	quest.707123C855FC3A68.quest_desc: ["It drops from the &#00D9FFSnow Queen&r and helps if your aim is poor. Enchanting it with &#00D9FFPower V&r makes it as strong as the &#00D9FFTri-Bow&r."]
	quest.707123C855FC3A68.quest_subtitle: "Get the Seeker Bow"
	quest.707123C855FC3A68.title: "The Seeker Bow"
	quest.7071E4442193DCC8.quest_desc: ["A reinforced version of the &#00D9FFBasic Pressure Tube&r, these can be camouflaged and have &#00D9FFTube Modules&r added to provide extra functionality."]
	quest.7071E4442193DCC8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reinforced Pressure Tube"
	quest.707AC1502CB5CC38.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium Helmet&r, &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium Leggings and Awakened Supremium Boots&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.707AC1502CB5CC38.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Helmet, Awakened Supremium Chestplate, Awakened Supremium Leggings and Awakened Supremium Boots"
	quest.707AC1502CB5CC38.title: "Awakened Supremium Armor"
	quest.707E0F4AC4A3468F.quest_desc: ["A Bottle o' &#00D9FFLightning&r is obtained by Right-&#00D9FFClicking&r a bottle on a charged creeper."]
	quest.707E0F4AC4A3468F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lightning Bottle"
	quest.7080BBF387CF1381.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMv Steam Turbine&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7080BBF387CF1381.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mv Steam Turbine"
	quest.7080BBF387CF1381.title: "Better Than Wind Mills"
	quest.708B451E3FFBE2B9.quest_desc: ["For &#00D9FFthe Electric Chain Saw&r: Press &#00D9FFLeft Shift and Right Click&r to swap between &#00D9FFFortune&r/&#00D9FFLooting and Silk Touch&r. For &#00D9FFthe Electric Mining Drill&r: Press &#00D9FFLeft Shift and Right Click&r to swap between &#00D9FFFortune and Silk Touch&r. For Both: Use &#00D9FFAlt and Mouse Scroll&r to change mining speeds."]
	quest.708B451E3FFBE2B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Chainsaw and Electric Mining Drill"
	quest.708B451E3FFBE2B9.title: "Electric Accessories"
	quest.709902273BED82EB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPrudentium Watering Can&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.709902273BED82EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Watering Can"
	quest.70A1B99C599C3639.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPlagued Boots&r are part of the &#00D9FFPlagued Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFNature Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Make them with 1 &#00D9FFNature Rune&r, 1 &#00D9FFWizard Boots&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r."]
	quest.70A1B99C599C3639.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plagued Boots"
	quest.70AB7073F3E04EA6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.70AB7073F3E04EA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.70B98506E050EED0.quest_desc: ["Lignite is a truly abundant fuel source that can be found in the world. It's pretty much &#00D9FFCoal&r, but brown. It has a lower carbon content despite burning the same amount as &#00D9FFCoal&r; created the same way too. This means you can keep your real &#00D9FFCoal&r for other projects or recipes, keep &#00D9FFLignite&r to fuel your &#00D9FFSteam Mining Drill&r instead."]
	quest.70B98506E050EED0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 64x Lignite Coal"
	quest.70B98506E050EED0.title: "Lignite Coal"
	quest.70CEB03E6D7FD326.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFRed Delicious Apple Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.70CEB03E6D7FD326.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Red Delicious Apple Sapling"
	quest.70D3CF50F6A50C69.quest_desc: ["Lava and water together, for example, produce &#00D9AA31 FE&r/t. Other fluid pairs work too, so it is worth experimenting."]
	quest.70D3CF50F6A50C69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermoelectric Generator"
	quest.70D45EF935FBEB29.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFEnd Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.70D45EF935FBEB29.quest_subtitle: "Obtain End Seeds"
	quest.70D80C15C1E42E9E.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFluix Dust&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.70D80C15C1E42E9E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluix Dust"
	quest.70D9DF4A9E061CEB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSynodontis&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.70D9DF4A9E061CEB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Synodontis"
	quest.70EC5669790E2538.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThallasium Pickaxe&r is a mining tool forged from &#00D9FFThallasium Ingots&r with a &#00D9FFSmith Hammer and Anvil&r." "It starts &#00D9FFBetter End's&r tool progression, above iron but below &#00D9FFTerminite and Aeternium&r."]
	quest.70EC5669790E2538.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Pickaxe"
	quest.70EF2EEA2EA17121.quest_desc: ["An utility head armor piece, used in conjunction with the &#00D9FFScuba Tank&r to breathe underwater. It can be enchanted with respiration and water breathing for extended use."]
	quest.70EF2EEA2EA17121.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scuba Mask"
	quest.7107506BF772DD74.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnchantment Library&r stores enchanted books so you can retrieve them later, without filling your storage with books."]
	quest.7107506BF772DD74.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Library"
	quest.7115C45F384550B7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSealed Sword&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7115C45F384550B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sealed Sword"
	quest.712331CFE1AA1774.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMatter Condenser&r will allow you to make &#00D9FFMatter Balls&r for the &#00D9FFPaint Gun&r, and make &#00D9FFSingularities&r at the cost of item entities."]
	quest.712331CFE1AA1774.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Condenser"
	quest.7127CF11ABA2F241.quest_desc: ["Trees in the Torreya Forest of &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r drop &#00D9FFTorreya Logs&r." "You can use them for crafting and building in the dimension."]
	quest.7127CF11ABA2F241.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 10x Torreya Log"
	quest.7127CF11ABA2F241.title: "Torreya Wood"
	quest.712DC413A1DABC9F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPomegranate Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.712DC413A1DABC9F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pomegranate Sapling"
	quest.714C8B0F3D2859AA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFLimited Iron Barrel&r 1. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.714C8B0F3D2859AA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Iron Barrel 1"
	quest.715C6089ADFFA16B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnergy Hopper Nitro&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.715C6089ADFFA16B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Hopper Nitro"
	quest.7195E352119B893E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFConcentration Amulet&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7195E352119B893E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Concentration Amulet"
	quest.71B13BEA19B4BCF8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFPecan Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.71B13BEA19B4BCF8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pecan Sapling"
	quest.71BA0C3C951BE449.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCryomancer Coat&r is the chestpiece of the &#00D9FFCryomancer Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+8&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFIce Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Robes&r with 1 &#00D9FFIce Rune&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r to get it."]
	quest.71BA0C3C951BE449.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cryomancer Chestplate"
	quest.71D82A7618C07718.quest_desc: ["Collect 8 coal and 16 cobblestone, then craft a furnace. Coal works as your first fuel, and stone leads to stronger tools and blocks." "The furnace unlocks smelting, which is key for progression."]
	quest.71D82A7618C07718.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Coal, 16x Cobblestone and Furnace"
	quest.71D82A7618C07718.title: "Stone Progression"
	quest.71DBE4620D736352.quest_desc: ["Slowly restores hunger while walking on grass."]
	quest.71DBE4620D736352.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rooted Boots"
	quest.71F3355F7329434D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFHorn&r of the &#00D9FFWild Hunter&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.71F3355F7329434D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Horn of the Wild Hunter"
	quest.71FB339EBF50F9A6.quest_desc: ["This helps locate budding amethyst and magical creatures within a &#00D9AA75 block&r radius."]
	quest.71FB339EBF50F9A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dowsing Rod"
	quest.72047ED9D52B3CF4.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Warden Boots&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFNetherite Boots&r, &#00D9FFEcho Ingots&r, &#00D9FFWarden Carapace&r, a &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard&r and a &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Template&r." "Enchantments on the netherite piece are not kept, so enchant the result afterwards."]
	quest.72047ED9D52B3CF4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Boots"
	quest.721BBDF08D8B5B61.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnergy Discharger Basic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.721BBDF08D8B5B61.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Discharger Basic"
	quest.721D739DB60501AE.quest_desc: ["Bring Emberblade into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.721D739DB60501AE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emberblade"
	quest.721EBB4B78B425A7.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#FFA500Aether&r Champion."]
	quest.721EBB4B78B425A7.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Aether Champion"
	quest.721EED4CFFFCC1B1.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnder Upgrade Orb&r is an upgrade material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. Applied at the &#00D9FFArcane Anvil&r, it gives &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFEnder Spell Power&r." "Craft it from 1 &#00D9FFEmpty Upgrade Orb&r and 8 &#00D9FFEnder Runes&r. &#00D9FFEnder Runes&r are the runestones of the &#00D9FFEnder&r school."]
	quest.721EED4CFFFCC1B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Upgrade Orb"
	quest.7230F1A546BEEB0B.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFOlive Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7230F1A546BEEB0B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Olive Sapling"
	quest.7232D8F8AC59C7B6.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.7232D8F8AC59C7B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Smelt"
	quest.723DF58ED0AD9ADB.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLimited Oak Barrel III&r offers more capacity than the earlier tiers and keeps the compact barrel shape." "Keep expanding your storage to work toward the most powerful containers."]
	quest.723DF58ED0AD9ADB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Barrel 3"
	quest.723DFC38D29BBDC9.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFDistillery&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.723DFC38D29BBDC9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Distillery"
	quest.723DFC38D29BBDC9.title: "Al Capone Approves"
	quest.724765B7DA80CECF.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSteeleaf Helmet&r, &#00D9FFSteeleaf Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFSteeleaf Leggings and Steeleaf Boots&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.724765B7DA80CECF.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Steeleaf Armor"
	quest.724765B7DA80CECF.title: "Steeleaf Armorer"
	quest.725ABB2AEA4B1E1D.quest_desc: ["It can be a hassle to harvest &#00D9FFOtherwood&r saplings - as they are unstable, you can only see and harvest them while under the &#00D9FFThird Eye&r. This trade spirit fixes that little problem, by exchanging your unstable saplings with ones that need no &#00D9FFThird Eye&r to interact with."]
	quest.725ABB2AEA4B1E1D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Oak Sapling, Birch Sapling and 2 more items. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Sapling Trader"
	quest.725ABB2AEA4B1E1D.title: "Ritual: Summon Otherworld Sapling Trader"
	quest.725BAACD9646C523.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFIron Wire&r from &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r is made in the &#00D9FFRolling Mill&r and used in recipes for several electrical components. You will want it alongside &#00D9FFCopper Wire&r and the other metal wires as your network grows."]
	quest.725BAACD9646C523.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Wire"
	quest.7269C90D724A67F6.quest_desc: ["Used in the creation of some glyphs."]
	quest.7269C90D724A67F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Earth Essence"
	quest.72750076B9971EC5.quest_desc: ["Pumps fluid between the tank upgrade and adjacent blocks."]
	quest.72750076B9971EC5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pump Upgrade"
	quest.7278129E7775C0F9.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnergy Boomerang&r is a ranged weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It appears in the advanced part of the mod's progression."]
	quest.7278129E7775C0F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Boomerang"
	quest.7278129E7775C0F9.title: "Energy Boomerang"
	quest.72805EEF37B00307.quest_desc: ["A decorative lighting choice from &#FFA500Ars Nouveau&r."]
	quest.72805EEF37B00307.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sconce"
	quest.72817769D050E08B.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFSteam Whistle&r from &#FFA500Create&r. It is a musical block powered by steam and triggered with &#00D9FFRedstone&r." "You can place it on &#00D9FFFluid Tanks&r, tune it to different notes and extend it for other pitches. It can also be installed on &#00D9FFTrains&r as their signature whistle."]
	quest.72817769D050E08B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steam Whistle"
	quest.728E96063D7A6B3E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFThermo Generator Spirited&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.728E96063D7A6B3E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermo Generator Spirited"
	quest.72932C84DB6B31BF.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSilverfish&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.72932C84DB6B31BF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Silverfish"
	quest.729846289E25C493.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMinced Strider&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.729846289E25C493.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Minced Strider"
	quest.72990A1C544789D5.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAmber Gem&r is most often gathered from &#00D9FFAmber Ore&r in the &#00D9FFAmber Land&r, though it can also be crafted or found elsewhere in &#00D9FFBetter End&r." "It is mainly used in &#00D9FFInfusion Rituals&r, and also for &#00D9FFEyes of Ender&r and decorative &#00D9FFAmber Blocks&r."]
	quest.72990A1C544789D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amber Gem"
	quest.72A902D3F7D49667.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMalarite Pickaxe&r is an early-game mining tool in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r, crafted from &#00D9FFMalarite&r found in swamp biomes." "It uses a standard crafting table recipe."]
	quest.72A902D3F7D49667.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Malarite Pickaxe"
	quest.72B1B1FF2FB91137.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFImperium Watering Can&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.72B1B1FF2FB91137.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Watering Can"
	quest.72C54536C81BB476.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFYellow Cake&r is obtained by putting &#00D9FFUranium Ingots&r in the &#00D9FFEnrichment Chamber&r. &#00D9FFYellow Cake&r will be needed to make &#00D9FFFissile Fuel&r for the &#00D9FFFission Reactor&r."]
	quest.72C54536C81BB476.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Yellow Cake Uranium"
	quest.72D18B947FE41BE3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRed Crepe Myrtle Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.72D18B947FE41BE3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Red Crepe Myrtle Sapling"
	quest.72DDA41980D35D8B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAmaramber Sword&r was added in version 0.4.2 with the other &#00D9FFAmaramber&r tools in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Amaramber equipment is linked to fiery effects and to materials gathered from &#00D9FFTorreya&r trees."]
	quest.72DDA41980D35D8B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amaramber Sword"
	quest.72E0EC631DAC1513.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFBlack Moa&r."]
	quest.72E0EC631DAC1513.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Black Moa"
	quest.72E31A9E5B6E8E20.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.72E31A9E5B6E8E20.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.72EB399A714D6B45.quest_desc: ["You know how placing one chest next to another can form a double chest? &#00D9FFWell Vaults&r are like that, but up to 81 vaults can be combined together. The catch? You can't look inside them directly. Get things in and out with &#00D9FFChutes&r, &#00D9FFHatches&r, &#00D9FFFunnels&r, and &#00D9FFPackagers&r. Tip: see the &#00D9FFInventory Ticker&r for &#FFA500Create&r's great take on a storage terminal."]
	quest.72EB399A714D6B45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Vault"
	quest.72F47E08EC9820A4.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFThermoelectric Plate&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.72F47E08EC9820A4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermoelectric Plate"
	quest.72F4D17AAB9039B0.quest_desc: ["This device spawns mobs using pressure, bypassing light-level restrictions and enabling redstone control. It requires a &#00D9FFSpawner Core&r to function. Be aware that a partially empty &#00D9FFSpawner Core&r will result in reduced efficiency."]
	quest.72F4D17AAB9039B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressurized Spawner"
	quest.7308408DF2D17B69.quest_desc: ["Shelves are the foundation of an &#00D9FFApothic Enchanting&r setup. There are 32 valid shelf positions around the table, and each shelf needs an air block between it and the table to count." "Eterna sets the available enchantment level and power. Quanta changes the enchantment pool, but too much makes weaker enchantments more likely. Arcana influences the rarity and quality of enchantments. Each shelf has its own &#00D9FFEterna&r cap, and anything above it is ignored." "Try different shelf combinations to find the right balance."]
	quest.7308408DF2D17B69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7308408DF2D17B69.title: "Bookshelves"
	quest.7309FF5CF1382CC4.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFSpiritfire&r is a special kind of flame that can transform some objects into others. You can make some by throwing a &#00D9FFDemon's Dream&r fruit on the ground, and lighting it on fire. You can throw &#00D9FFAndesite&r into it to receive &#00D9FFOtherstone&r, and &#00D9FFOak Saplings&r to receive &#00D9FFOtherworld Saplings&r."]
	quest.7309FF5CF1382CC4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Otherstone and Otherworld Sapling Natural"
	quest.7309FF5CF1382CC4.title: "Spiritfire"
	quest.731343AE541DE305.quest_desc: ["Alternative to the &#00D9FFQuantum Ring&r. Has limited range of &#00D9AA1000 blocks&r, unlike the &#00D9FFQuantum Ring&r."]
	quest.731343AE541DE305.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wireless Connect and Wireless Tool"
	quest.7317D61CCCC82396.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Crystalite Helmet&r with an &#00D9FFInfusion Ritual&r using a &#00D9FFTerminite Helmet&r, an &#00D9FFAmber Gem and Crystal Shards&r around an &#00D9FFInfusion Pedestal&r." "Wearing the full set gives permanent &#00D9FFRegeneration I&r."]
	quest.7317D61CCCC82396.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystalite Helmet"
	quest.7317D61CCCC82396.title: "Crystalite Helmet"
	quest.731919B68976F65A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFruit Salad&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.731919B68976F65A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fruit Salad"
	quest.731E63F6EF9320ED.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFRaw Iridium&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.731E63F6EF9320ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Raw Iridium"
	quest.731E63F6EF9320ED.title: "Diamond 2.0: Electric Boogaloo"
	quest.7329381EB18B221C.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFAll Starlight Biomes&r."]
	quest.7329381EB18B221C.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: All Starlight Biomes"
	quest.7329381EB18B221C.title: "Starlight Explorer"
	quest.733E17B7A8D38AF8.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEmerald Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.733E17B7A8D38AF8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emerald Seeds"
	quest.733E3A8C7B5AAC69.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFInferium Helmet&r, &#00D9FFInferium Chestplate&r, &#00D9FFInferium Leggings and Inferium Boots&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.733E3A8C7B5AAC69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inferium Helmet, Inferium Chestplate, Inferium Leggings and Inferium Boots"
	quest.733E3A8C7B5AAC69.title: "Inferium Armor"
	quest.73569C57D2719DF4.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMultimeter&r is a tool from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r for the mod's electrical systems. Use it to inspect electrical components and see how much power runs through your machinery."]
	quest.73569C57D2719DF4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Multimeter"
	quest.7368C5F4DEDE02DA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFFluorite Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7368C5F4DEDE02DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluorite Seeds"
	quest.737205B6431E1110.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCrystal Spirited&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.737205B6431E1110.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Spirited"
	quest.73893F32A771FD27.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: &#00D9FFJungle&r, &#00D9FFNether&r, &#00D9FFIcy and Desert&r."]
	quest.73893F32A771FD27.quest_subtitle: "Find all 4 Monument variants"
	quest.738E5EDA74096D71.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPyromancer Hat&r is the headpiece of the &#00D9FFPyromancer Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFFire Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft it from 5 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFFire Rune&r, or upgrade a &#00D9FFWizard Helmet&r with 1 &#00D9FFFire Rune&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r in newer versions."]
	quest.738E5EDA74096D71.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyromancer Helmet"
	quest.73A6C0AE8DA146CA.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFRuned Flavolite&r, a variant of &#00D9FFFlavolite&r gathered in the &#00D9FFPainted Mountains&r and inscribed for ritual use." "You need it to build the ring of an &#00D9FFEternal Portal&r, which takes you back to the &#00D9FFOverworld&r from deep in the End."]
	quest.73A6C0AE8DA146CA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flavolite Runed"
	quest.73A6C0AE8DA146CA.title: "Runed Flavolite"
	quest.73AE558310570B1A.quest_desc: ["Craft a spyglass from copper ingots and amethyst shards. It lets you zoom in on distant places."]
	quest.73AE558310570B1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spyglass"
	quest.73AE558310570B1A.title: "Spyglass"
	quest.73B0D3914092EC3E.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.73B0D3914092EC3E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.73CC91E6472B52C5.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFIce Venom Vial&r is a crafting material in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. &#00D9FFRefine Icy Fangs&r in an &#00D9FFAlchemist Cauldron&r filled with water to make it." "It is used for strong Ice equipment, including the &#00D9FFFrostbranded Book and Boreal Blade&r."]
	quest.73CC91E6472B52C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ice Venom Vial"
	quest.73D03096609B274E.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEclipsealloy Leggings&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.73D03096609B274E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Leggings"
	quest.73D44417EA546403.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLogic Press&r is used in an &#00D9FFInscriber&r to turn &#00D9FFGold&r into a &#00D9FFPrinted Logic Circuit&r. Presses are found in meteorites, and the &#00D9FFInscriber&r can duplicate one with an &#00D9FFIron Block&r."]
	quest.73F1D97AF9D33D65.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Rechiseled&r adds additional decorative block variants. Browse its crafting options to find coordinated textures for your builds."]
	quest.73F1D97AF9D33D65.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.740753C7869E8F16.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFDragon Egg Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.740753C7869E8F16.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dragon Egg Seeds"
	quest.740CA0BB081DB68C.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Construction Sticks&r helps place repeated blocks more quickly. Explore its placement behavior for walls, floors, and other building tasks."]
	quest.740CA0BB081DB68C.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.741A2E8C7E2BC6FD.quest_desc: ["Notable rituals: Binding turns special mobs into familiars. Containment traps entities in a &#00D9FFJar of Containment&r. Challenge summons a raid when used in a village. Flight grants creative flight within about &#00D9AA60 blocks&r. &#00D9FFSummon Wilden&r summons wilden mobs, including the &#00D9FFChimera&r if augmented."]
	quest.741A2E8C7E2BC6FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Challenge, Ritual Binding, Ritual Flight and 6 more items"
	quest.741A2E8C7E2BC6FD.title: "Purple Tablets"
	quest.7420A81F7BDFF713.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFDry Ice&r gives your reactor the best cooling."]
	quest.7420A81F7BDFF713.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dry Ice"
	quest.742522CCADD8D349.quest_desc: ["The most powerful controlled spirit of all, &#00D9FFMarid&r offer many benefits to master summoners."]
	quest.742522CCADD8D349.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Marid"
	quest.7429C528F6279261.quest_desc: ["Search the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r for everything that comes from trees: saplings, leaves, slabs and every other wood item. Craft it, loot it, or find it."]
	quest.7429C528F6279261.quest_subtitle: "Collect everything that comes from trees"
	quest.7432202F127281C8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSmart Filter&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7432202F127281C8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7432202F127281C8.title: "Leggins"
	quest.743D2FBBE95AE443.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSteel Wiremill&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.743D2FBBE95AE443.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Wiremill"
	quest.743D2FBBE95AE443.title: "Neither a Wire nor a Mill"
	quest.743D6326A9572107.quest_desc: ["This cell can store radioactive chemicals, unlike the regular &#00D9FFChemical Storage Cell&r. Needs to be partitioned before you can use it."]
	quest.743D6326A9572107.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Radioactive Chemical Cell"
	quest.743FB39F466AD219.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFElectric Bow&r works like the vanilla Bow and shoots normal &#00D9FFArrows&r. The difference is, that every shot doesn't damage, but discharges the bow. If the internal energy storage is empty, the bow doesn't work and needs to be recharged e.g. on a &#00D9FFBasic Energy Cube&r."]
	quest.743FB39F466AD219.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Bow"
	quest.744A46E122AAB6FE.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.744A46E122AAB6FE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Harvest"
	quest.744BA04736CC3AA9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFRose Gum Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.744BA04736CC3AA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rose Gum Sapling"
	quest.745A895DB39AB45F.quest_desc: ["Smelts 192 items."]
	quest.745A895DB39AB45F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Insanium Coal"
	quest.745BF52B10A54F77.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMinoshroom&r, a mix of minotaur and mushroom, rules the underground &#00D9FFLabyrinth&r of the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r." "Reaching it means getting through the maze, its traps and its monsters. Defeating it rewards you with valuable loot and opens the way to harder challenges."]
	quest.745BF52B10A54F77.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Minoshroom"
	quest.745BF52B10A54F77.title: "Minoshroom"
	quest.745C8130B75C03F6.quest_desc: ["Can by &#00D9FFDyed and Trimmed&r! &#00D9FFToggle Creative Flight&r by pressing N."]
	quest.745C8130B75C03F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nano Gravichestplate"
	quest.74686F4B403A0336.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFWatching Warglaive&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.74686F4B403A0336.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Watching Warglaive"
	quest.747A44CBD0D9D80F.quest_desc: ["Rare resources take more effort to find or to create, and are in some cases not found in nature."]
	quest.747A44CBD0D9D80F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemical Sulfur Platinum, Alchemical Sulfur Silver, Alchemical Sulfur Uranium and 5 more items"
	quest.747A44CBD0D9D80F.title: "Rare Sulfurs"
	quest.74887E460F06E36B.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.74887E460F06E36B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Craft"
	quest.74922CD545618585.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCooking Table&r is where you prepare food using ingredients from the kitchen blocks around it."]
	quest.74922CD545618585.quest_subtitle: "The heart of your kitchen"
	quest.749B136F98C186D0.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Warden Mage Leggings&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFNetherite Mage Leggings&r from &#00D9FFIron's Spells&r, &#00D9FFEcho Ingots&r, &#00D9FFWarden Carapace&r, a &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard&r and a &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Template&r." "Spell power and upgrades from the netherite piece are not kept."]
	quest.749B136F98C186D0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Mage Leggings"
	quest.74A344692DDC46B8.quest_desc: ["This machine uses advanced technology to compress items down to atomic size, allowing it to access and manipulate a player’s inventory directly. Items can be input and output via hoppers, and they will be added to or removed from the inventory of the player who placed the machine. You can also use smarter insertion methods, such as &#00D9FFDrones&r or &#00D9FFLogistics Frames&r, or other mods, to automatically manage the player's inventory, like keeping it stocked with 64 torches, for instance."]
	quest.74A344692DDC46B8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aerial Interface"
	quest.74A946BAD3F975DF.quest_desc: ["Pay attention: it might make one thing on a &#00D9FFDepot&r, and another in a &#00D9FFBasin&r."]
	quest.74A946BAD3F975DF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Press"
	quest.74BF5D78022B1402.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSteel Ingot&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.74BF5D78022B1402.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Ingot"
	quest.74C2921884820E96.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFAviar's Circle&r is the first pentacle you will prepare. It is for summoning &#00D9FFFoliot&r. Refer to the &#00D9FFDictionary of Spirits&r for how to lay it out."]
	quest.74C2921884820E96.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk White, Smart Filter, Golden Sacrificial Bowl and 6x Sacrificial Bowl"
	quest.74C2921884820E96.title: "Aviar's Circle"
	quest.74C90AF76F9F39E4.quest_desc: ["Use it to fill your moat, drain a swamp, pump water or lava without limit."]
	quest.74C90AF76F9F39E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hose Pulley"
	quest.74CE4975DD8CAE61.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFGiant Takoyaki&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.74CE4975DD8CAE61.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Giant Takoyaki"
	quest.74DC153CDFBA4270.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFSteel Alloy Smelter&r allows you to create alloys from two different ingots without needing to mix the dusts in a &#00D9FFMixer&r first. Check your EMI to see which alloys can be made this way. You can also use any combination of equal amounts of resources to create an alloy, such as nine tiny dust + nine nuggets. What you cannot do is nine tiny dust + one ingot, as the amounts are different."]
	quest.74DC153CDFBA4270.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Alloy Smelter"
	quest.74E85AA325F1FA7D.quest_desc: ["A unique axe dropped by the &#00D9FFMinoshroom&r."]
	quest.74E85AA325F1FA7D.quest_subtitle: "Get the Diamond Minotaur Axe"
	quest.74EC653C3DFF15EB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBalsam Fir Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.74EC653C3DFF15EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Balsam Fir Sapling"
	quest.74FEE5E4E73AE4D8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRotten Spell Book&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.74FEE5E4E73AE4D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rotten Spell Book"
	quest.7505D3C0A8577B60.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFChemical Tanks&r are &#FFA500Mekanism&r's batteries for storing &#00D9FFGases&r. They can be placed as a block and do interact with &#00D9FFPressurized Tubes&r. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7505D3C0A8577B60.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Chemical Tank"
	quest.750AD0EAFD7AC8E6.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPacific Halibut&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.750AD0EAFD7AC8E6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pacific Halibut"
	quest.751144D1292A6218.quest_desc: ["Crush a Gem with an &#00D9FFAnvil&r in the world to turn it into &#00D9FFGem Dust&r. Once you have crushed a few, you can use the &#00D9FFSalvaging Table&r instead."]
	quest.751144D1292A6218.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gem Dust and Anvil"
	quest.75128491D856EC48.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBaked Cod Stew&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.75128491D856EC48.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Baked Cod Stew"
	quest.751D857F2D3C4799.quest_desc: ["A step up in speed and fuel efficiency from the lower tiers."]
	quest.751D857F2D3C4799.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Furnace"
	quest.752D6FA1C0B8E30F.quest_desc: ["Point 2 &#00D9FFPoint&r (P2P) &#00D9FFTunnels&r can be overwhelmingly complex, but at the same time extremely useful. These tunnels can be used to transfer up to 32 channels from one point to the other. But it's wildly inefficient. Those 32 channels get compacted into a single channel. This means, you can theoretically wire up 1,024 channels through a single dense cable, instead of only 32. You'll have to use the &#00D9FFMemory Card&r to link up the tunnels together via frequencies. Shift-Right-&#00D9FFClicking&r on the \"entrace\" tunnel will set the memory card to that frequency. Right-&#00D9FFClicking&r on the \"exit\" tunnel with set the tunnel to the frequency of the \"entrance\" one. Keep in mind, you can have multiple \"exit\" tunnels so long as the total channels used between them don't go beyond the number of channels entered into the \"entrance\" tunnel. There are also different types of &#00D9FFPoint&r 2 &#00D9FFPoint Tunnels&r. Aside from one that carries &#00D9FFME Channels&r, there are ones that transfer raw power, fluids, items, light, and even redstone! They work the same way, aside from carrying channels. It takes some practice to use, so experiment with them first. Once you get the hang of it, your &#00D9FFME System&r will be looking more than professional!"]
	quest.752D6FA1C0B8E30F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Me P2p Tunnel"
	quest.752D6FA1C0B8E30F.title: "P2P"
	quest.75389E3F80712BE4.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCopper Rod&r, &#00D9FFIron Rod and Gold Rod&r are the basic metal rods of &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r. Make them in the &#00D9FFRolling Mill&r, where one ingot gives 2 rods." "They are crafting parts for the mod's electrical items, including wires, spools and connectors."]
	quest.75389E3F80712BE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Rod, Iron Rod and Gold Rod"
	quest.7569E5A18129C681.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFChemical Tanks&r are &#FFA500Mekanism&r's batteries for storing &#00D9FFGases&r. They can be placed as a block and do interact with &#00D9FFPressurized Tubes&r. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7569E5A18129C681.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Chemical Tank"
	quest.757395B08E2C21B5.quest_desc: ["The turbine is a multiblock added by &#FFA500Mekanism&r that can generate a load of power using steam. Steam can be created in various ways. Both reactors are a decent way, but you may, also, use the &#00D9FFBoiler&r to create steam."]
	quest.757395B08E2C21B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Turbine Casing"
	quest.7574A64692A5C7A6.quest_desc: ["Now you can make a large tank! This is a tank multi-block that can store 64,000mb per block within the total volume the tank takes up, air blocks and solid. When you place down a &#00D9FFLarge Tank&r, open its GUI and check out the top left. It'll let you choose which size you want. Once you've chosen, hold out your trusty wrench and a hologram will show you where to place blocks. Use a &#00D9FFLarge Tank Hatch&r too. It works just like other hatches, aside from it only being a point of access to the tank. It'll input and output from any hatches you put on it."]
	quest.7574A64692A5C7A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Large Tank and Large Tank Hatch"
	quest.7591056997C2F9D1.quest_desc: ["The Ur-&#00D9FFGhast&r waits atop the &#00D9FFDark Tower&r, which is filled with machines, traps and servants." "It stays out of reach, circling above the arena and firing explosive fireballs. Patience and good timing help, since you need to lure it into range before attacking. Beating it is a major step in the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r."]
	quest.7591056997C2F9D1.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Ur Ghast"
	quest.7591056997C2F9D1.title: "UrGhast"
	quest.75AE6FD1F735AFA7.quest_desc: ["An &#00D9FFAncient Temple&r lies hidden deep in the &#00D9FFOtherside&r." "Inside you will find haunted pots and a secret chest with rare loot."]
	quest.75AE6FD1F735AFA7.title: "Ancient Temple"
	quest.75D770DAAB018140.quest_desc: ["Reduces the probability of taking any damage by &#00D9AA25%&r for each piece of the &#00D9FFQuantum Armor Set&r."]
	quest.75D770DAAB018140.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Chestplate"
	quest.75D770DAAB018140.title: "Quantum Immortality"
	quest.75E71375DDC9767B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPyromancer Robe&r is the chestpiece of the &#00D9FFPyromancer Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+8&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFFire Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r, and can hold 1 imbued spell." "Craft it from 8 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFFire Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Robes&r with 1 &#00D9FFFire Rune&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r."]
	quest.75E71375DDC9767B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyromancer Chestplate"
	quest.75ED69E18231F41C.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStainless Steel Drill&r is a new drill that can be used in both the &#00D9FFQuarry&r and the &#00D9FFOil Drilling Rig&r. For the quarry, you'll obtain some new rare resources that will be extremely beneficial for the future. In the drilling rig, you'll be able to pump out &#00D9FFShale Oil&r which can be distilled into &#00D9FFHelium&r, &#00D9FFSulfuric Crude Oil&r, and &#00D9FFSulfuric Naphtha&r."]
	quest.75ED69E18231F41C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Stainless Steel Drill"
	quest.75ED69E18231F41C.title: "Stainless Steel Drill"
	quest.76038E770204018C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBrimstone Claymore&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.76038E770204018C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brimstone Claymore"
	quest.760BA24623B42810.quest_desc: ["A shield is essential for defense. It blocks many attacks, including arrows and melee damage." "Craft one to get through dangerous fights."]
	quest.760BA24623B42810.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shield"
	quest.7615DDC3B658B31C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7615DDC3B658B31C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.76189167938C3130.quest_desc: ["Burns honey to produce power. Honey can be piped in, or honey bottles, blocks and buckets can be added in the GUI. It accepts two upgrades: Productivity lowers honey consumption, and &#00D9FFSpeed&r raises the output speed."]
	quest.76189167938C3130.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honey Generator"
	quest.761C32656BB95304.quest_desc: ["An Induction battery is a large, long-term, multiblock battery that, depending on what's inside it, can store a massive amount of power."]
	quest.761C32656BB95304.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 32x Induction Casing, 2x Induction Port and Structural Glass"
	quest.7627C14240D3C503.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEnder Library&r is the upgraded &#00D9FFEnchantment Library&r, with a much higher level limit. Stored enchantments are kept when you upgrade." "Infuse a &#00D9FFLibrary&r with 100 &#00D9FFEterna&r, &#00D9AA100%&r &#00D9FFArcana and Quanta&r between &#00D9AA45%&r and &#00D9AA50%&r. It is the true endgame of enchanting."]
	quest.7627C14240D3C503.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Library"
	quest.762E163EFBE44BBF.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFerricore Leggings&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.762E163EFBE44BBF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Leggings"
	quest.763A2390A719BA47.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFUpgrade Silver&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.763A2390A719BA47.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Silver"
	quest.763D64561B2BA06B.quest_desc: ["Used for crafting wands, rituals and decoration. &#00D9FFArchwood&r trees generate randomly in the world, and &#00D9FFArchwood Saplings&r can also be bought at the &#00D9FFMarket&r from &#00D9FFFarming&r for &#00D9FFBlockheads&r."]
	quest.763D64561B2BA06B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blue Archwood Log, Purple Archwood Log, Green Archwood Log and Red Archwood Log"
	quest.763EA2539F967175.quest_desc: ["The Productivity upgrade will increase the number of combs a bee produces per trip."]
	quest.763EA2539F967175.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Productivity 2"
	quest.763F16245FAEF950.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFItem Storage Cell&r 256m. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.763F16245FAEF950.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 256m"
	quest.763FC9996A56D0AC.quest_desc: ["Make a smooth &#00D9FFVanilla Milkshake&r as another classic drink for your factory. Combine the ingredients and let &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r handle the mixing."]
	quest.763FC9996A56D0AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vanilla Milkshake"
	quest.764476D35A55D9C6.quest_desc: ["Now that you're producing energy in the medium voltage tier, you'll need to make sure your machines can accept that new found power. Normally, cables will not even connect to machines if they aren't of the same tier. But, by placing an &#00D9FFAdvanced Machine Hull&r (or higher tier) into the slot in the top right of the machine, you'll have upgraded the machine to the tier of power it associates with it. By default, electric machines are already at the &#00D9FFBasic Machine Hull&r tier and there is no need to put &#00D9FFBasic Machine Hulls&r into the slot. Make sure you check for which machines actually need the upgrades so you aren't wasting resources on machines that don't really need the extra boost."]
	quest.764476D35A55D9C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Machine Hull"
	quest.764476D35A55D9C6.title: "Hull Upgrades"
	quest.764EA020E2F6DF14.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFVegetable Soup&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.764EA020E2F6DF14.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vegetable Soup"
	quest.765420594DC733D1.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSolar Panel Nitro&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.765420594DC733D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Panel Nitro"
	quest.76591A558118A7F9.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAethersent Cape&r is crafted from &#00D9FFAethersent Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is part of the &#00D9FFAethersent&r armor set, tied to meteors and celestial materials found in the dimension."]
	quest.76591A558118A7F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aethersent Cape"
	quest.765F1F306BC7545D.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer move freely in water."]
	quest.765F1F306BC7545D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charm of Sinking"
	quest.7666ACA6FB7791F7.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCapacitor Niotic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7666ACA6FB7791F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor Niotic"
	quest.766ADA1FCA0604EC.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCelestigem Pickaxe&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.766ADA1FCA0604EC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Pickaxe"
	quest.7677C5A5173195DE.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFSteeleaf&r is found in &#00D9FFLabyrinth&r, &#00D9FFHollow Hill and Dark Tower&r chests. As a tool or armor it is as strong as diamond but less durable than iron."]
	quest.7677C5A5173195DE.quest_subtitle: "Get some Steeleaf"
	quest.768A0ADC0567A5CA.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the shulker box."]
	quest.768A0ADC0567A5CA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Shulker Box"
	quest.769A0CE4777F8826.quest_desc: ["Simple version: breaks blocks, using a tool if you give it one, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.769A0CE4777F8826.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.76C6A4FE76850ADA.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFZinc Ingot&r from &#FFA500Create&r by smelting &#00D9FFZinc Ore&r or &#00D9FFCrushed Zinc Ore&r." "Combined with &#00D9FFCopper&r, &#00D9FFZinc&r makes &#00D9FFBrass&r, a key material for more advanced &#FFA500Create&r machinery and logistics."]
	quest.76C6A4FE76850ADA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Zinc Ingot"
	quest.76D07EE5DAFEA90D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFHoneycomb Ghostly&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.76D07EE5DAFEA90D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honeycomb Ghostly"
	quest.76D2482C90266C3D.quest_desc: ["Adds a blast furnace to the backpack."]
	quest.76D2482C90266C3D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blasting Upgrade"
	quest.76E4F68C80148028.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFTurntable&r from &#FFA500Create&r. When it has rotational power, it spins entities standing on it, including players and armor stands." "It is crafted from a &#00D9FFShaft&r and a &#00D9FFWooden Slab&r."]
	quest.76E4F68C80148028.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Turntable"
	quest.76E9C42F3D4011D0.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.76E9C42F3D4011D0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.76F76B9C1EE6DB62.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.76F76B9C1EE6DB62.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Ignite"
	quest.76FE0ED2B314DE22.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFNuclear Waste&r can be processed in an &#00D9FFIsotropic Centrifuge&r to make &#00D9FFPlutonium&r. The Plutonium can be used to make a pellet. The pellet is used to make casing for another machine, or, reprocessed into more fuel."]
	quest.76FE0ED2B314DE22.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pellet Plutonium"
	quest.76FE4D9FF7B2DEC9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRabbit Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.76FE4D9FF7B2DEC9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rabbit Seeds"
	quest.771E4279E4352BC1.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPlayer Transmitter Niotic&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.771E4279E4352BC1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Transmitter Niotic"
	quest.77299101A3B86FAD.quest_desc: ["Scylla can drop the rare &#00D9FFMusic Disc Scylla&r after her defeat." "It plays “&#00D9FFScylla&r” by &#00D9FFRotch Gwylt&r, the music from the &#00D9FFStorm Empress&r fight."]
	quest.77299101A3B86FAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Music Disc Scylla"
	quest.772AD8376DD7E3DE.quest_desc: ["An upgrade already? Trying to take your house with you? Good idea! Tents tend to hurt backs."]
	quest.772AD8376DD7E3DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spatial Cell Component 16"
	quest.772AD8376DD7E3DE.title: "Medium Spatial Component"
	quest.7737C72546226B32.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7737C72546226B32.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Injecting Factory"
	quest.7746747CC50E3F1B.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFRing of Thrift&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7746747CC50E3F1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Thrift"
	quest.7752170CD763C9D9.quest_desc: ["Defeat &#00D9FFApothecarist&r."]
	quest.7752170CD763C9D9.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Apothecarist"
	quest.775B1ED6F9A4EC5A.quest_desc: ["Ignites its target. Be cautious, it can also set fire to the surrounding environment!"]
	quest.775B1ED6F9A4EC5A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo Incendiary"
	quest.776090CBC143782E.quest_desc: ["Obtain a &#00D9FFWand of Symmetry&r from &#FFA500Create&r. It mirrors blocks you place or break across a chosen axis or pattern." "It offers &#00D9FFMirror Once&r, &#00D9FFRectangular and Octagonal&r modes, which suit symmetrical builds and large structures. Its default range is &#00D9AA50 blocks&r."]
	quest.776090CBC143782E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wand of Symmetry"
	quest.776290E451C33C1A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFKinetic Belt&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.776290E451C33C1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Kinetic Belt"
	quest.777D3B19A9CC26E9.quest_desc: ["Craft a &#00D9FFBlack Steel Targe&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r. This sturdy shield gives reliable protection against strong enemies and belongs to the &#00D9FFBlack Steel&r set."]
	quest.777D3B19A9CC26E9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Black Steel Targe"
	quest.7780ED6483FC9986.quest_desc: ["Time for that beautifully shining &#00D9FFOrange Ingot&r? You'll need to grab some of the &#00D9FFCopper and Tin&r dust you get from the &#00D9FFForge Hammer&r to make it. It's a simple mixture of 3:1 &#00D9FFCopper&r to Tin in your crafting grid. Once you progress, you'll find a way to produce this mixture more efficiently since you're spilling some dust making it on hand. Remember that &#00D9FFSteam Machines&r will accept inputs from any side, be it items, steam or another fluid. You can lock their slots by clicking on the padlock looking button in the interface. Locked slots will make sure the machine only accepts one type of item or fluid per slot. Every machine has an output side as well, and you can enable auto-output from inside the interface. Using your trusty &#00D9FFWrench&r you can adjust the output side with ease! If you don't want so many items in the slots at a time, use that &#00D9FFScroll Wheel&r of yours to adjust the maximum number of items stored at a time. P.S. Right clicking on a steam machine with gunpowder will double it's speed and steam consumption. Keep that in mind when looking at recipes. That gunpowder may just save you a trip to hell."]
	quest.7780ED6483FC9986.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Bronze Ingot"
	quest.7780ED6483FC9986.title: "Your First Bronze"
	quest.7781942B1A14BD68.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7781942B1A14BD68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.778ABC2270839133.quest_desc: ["The chestplate of the &#00D9FFFiery&r armor set. Together with the leggings, it unlocks the helmet."]
	quest.778D8C6EA2C66267.quest_desc: ["Screw a house, take your entire lair with you! But be warned, it won't be cheap!"]
	quest.778D8C6EA2C66267.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spatial Cell Component 128"
	quest.778D8C6EA2C66267.title: "Large Spatial Component"
	quest.779AE73897718D2F.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCelestigem Chestplate&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.779AE73897718D2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Chestplate"
	quest.77A9AB166FA8A789.quest_desc: ["The boiler needs an input and output for the water and steam. Depending on how you're using the boiler, you may, also, need 2 more valves for coolant exchange. Begin with a 3x3 layer of casings. Then place the heating element in the center. Surround that in casings or reactor glass. The edges must be casings. Build another layer of casings with the pressure disperser on top of the heating element. Then cover it all up to with more casings. &#FFA500Mekanism&r has a decent &#00D9FFWiki&r if you have trouble with the structure."]
	quest.77A9AB166FA8A789.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Boiler Valve, 32x Boiler Casing, 2x Reactor Glass and 2 more items"
	quest.77C87D1B3D283583.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBrown Amber Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.77C87D1B3D283583.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brown Amber Sapling"
	quest.77F510BC1BD66741.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFVoidShift Wand&r has &#00D9FFAir Burst&r up to strength 4 and &#00D9FFVoid Shift&r, which teleports you up to &#00D9AA15 blocks&r."]
	quest.77F510BC1BD66741.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Voidshift Wand"
	quest.77F5E3CBD8F6CC37.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFHorse Feed&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.77F5E3CBD8F6CC37.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Horse Feed"
	quest.77FDFD4FD5C46D39.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFHoney Treats&r calm angry bees and make baby bees grow up faster. They can also be combined with genes to transfer genetics from one bee to another."]
	quest.77FDFD4FD5C46D39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honey Treat"
	quest.780CD81B1FCC5D06.quest_desc: ["Make a &#00D9FFStrawberry Milkshake&r, a refreshing fruit drink for your production line. Mix the required ingredients to get this sweet creation from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r."]
	quest.780CD81B1FCC5D06.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strawberry Milkshake"
	quest.780EF8B9FD6437F4.quest_desc: ["You also need 2 unique legendary fish and 2 unique golden fish for the &#00D9FFGold Trophy&r."]
	quest.780EF8B9FD6437F4.quest_subtitle: "Catch 100 fish in total"
	quest.7817F46D48C398E2.quest_desc: ["Simple version: works in pairs and swaps blocks, air included. Entities teleport on their own. Has redstone sensitivity options. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.7817F46D48C398E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.78259DA399CD3333.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFForge the Terminite Ingot&r in an &#00D9FFEnd Stone Smeltery&r by combining a &#00D9FFThallasium Ingot&r (or &#00D9FFIron Ingot&r) with &#00D9FFEnd Dust&r." "You can also rarely find it in &#00D9FFBetter End&r structures. It is used for stronger tools, armor and anvils."]
	quest.78259DA399CD3333.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Ingot"
	quest.782883242EF18A65.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.782883242EF18A65.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Glide"
	quest.782E726D920AB09C.quest_desc: ["(but really, with this you can transfer fluids to or from mobile contraptions and trains)."]
	quest.782E726D920AB09C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portable Fluid Interface"
	quest.78335834458025F1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFInductor&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78335834458025F1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inductor"
	quest.78335834458025F1.title: "The L in RLC"
	quest.78350B4B6E39910E.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFRoast Chicken Block&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.78350B4B6E39910E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Roast Chicken Block"
	quest.78399D60F97240DC.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.78399D60F97240DC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.784334FD0614CDF0.quest_desc: ["This is standard &#00D9FFMinigun Ammo&r with no special properties. However, it can be crafted with a &#00D9FFPotion&r to imbue the &#00D9FFAmmo&r with the potion's effects."]
	quest.784334FD0614CDF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo"
	quest.784E88D88936B5FF.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFAssemble the Terminite Sword&r from a &#00D9FFTerminite&r tool head and sword handle at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r. It improves on the &#00D9FFThallasium&r sword." "It leads toward &#00D9FFBetter End's&r stronger &#00D9FFAeternium&r sword."]
	quest.784E88D88936B5FF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Terminite Sword"
	quest.7867CF2DB8DC10A5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFAlmond Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7867CF2DB8DC10A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Almond Sapling"
	quest.786D1CD2CAA19D15.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLogic Processor&r is made in an &#00D9FFInscriber&r from a &#00D9FFPrinted Logic Circuit&r, &#00D9FFPrinted Silicon and Redstone&r. It is used for buses, terminals and more."]
	quest.787A726BEEC0BB74.quest_desc: ["Craft any &#00D9FFRune&r that goes best with the magic armor or upgrade orb that you want."]
	quest.787A726BEEC0BB74.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.788432F711B73CB5.quest_desc: ["Shadow-&#00D9FFWalker Boots&r are part of the &#00D9FFShadow&r-&#00D9FFWalker Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFEnder Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft them from 4 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFEnder Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Boots&r with 1 &#00D9FFEnder Rune&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r in supported versions."]
	quest.788432F711B73CB5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shadowwalker Boots"
	quest.78940B88116D45F4.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFCeylon Ebony Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.78940B88116D45F4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ceylon Ebony Sapling"
	quest.7897E36F8F23152C.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Create&r has trains. You need &#00D9FFSturdy Sheets&r to get started with them."]
	quest.7897E36F8F23152C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sturdy Sheet"
	quest.789A10860CF32379.quest_desc: ["Find an &#00D9FFElytra&r on an &#00D9FFEnd Ship&r. These wings let you glide, which makes crossing the &#00D9FFEnd's&r scattered islands much easier." "It is also the base for &#00D9FFBetter End's Armored and Crystalite&r elytra."]
	quest.789A10860CF32379.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elytra"
	quest.789A10860CF32379.title: "Elytra"
	quest.78A0AC192B39D776.quest_desc: ["Simple version: places blocks, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.78A0AC192B39D776.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.78B0C026C3A8AAEA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78B0C026C3A8AAEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.78C2C746DCFC3174.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFExperience Lantern&r from &#FFA500Create: Enchantment Industry&r absorbs experience from players and nearby XP orbs." "It can also act as an actor on &#FFA500Create&r contraptions, so you can automate XP collection and feed it into your processing setup."]
	quest.78C2C746DCFC3174.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Experience Lantern"
	quest.78C4FC782DA6BB39.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPolarizer&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78C4FC782DA6BB39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Polarizer"
	quest.78C4FC782DA6BB39.title: "One Recipe (+2) To Rule Them All"
	quest.78C5BB7457C5BAE4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFArchmage Glove&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78C5BB7457C5BAE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Archmage Glove"
	quest.78CBBFEB45DC3232.quest_desc: ["Provides an occasional positive potion effect that last a little bit."]
	quest.78CBBFEB45DC3232.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Belt of Unstable Gifts"
	quest.78DB487D39F4F5E4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFMechanical Piston&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78DB487D39F4F5E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Piston"
	quest.78E93EEB139A2DCF.quest_desc: ["Lets redstone control the spawner. Useful for switches, timers and farm control."]
	quest.78E93EEB139A2DCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Control Spawner Rune"
	quest.78E93EEB139A2DCF.title: "Redstone Control Spawner Rune"
	quest.78EE71687E06BB0D.quest_desc: ["Once you have mastered the basics, you can move on to working with &#00D9FFDjinn&r, intermediate-level spirits."]
	quest.78EE71687E06BB0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Djinni"
	quest.78F90F3D296FE242.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMeat Shredder&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r is a powerful weapon tied to &#00D9FFThe Harbinger&r." "It ignores the normal damage invulnerability time of enemies, which makes it especially effective against &#FFA500Cataclysm&r bosses."]
	quest.78F90F3D296FE242.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Meat Shredder"
	quest.78F90F3D296FE242.title: "Meat Shredder"
	quest.78FEBD362F77ED53.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFBronze Mixer&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78FEBD362F77ED53.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Mixer"
	quest.7908B7140D3968AC.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPressurized Tubes&r are a way of transporting types of gas, such as steam, hydrogen, and oxygen. Transfer Rate: 2,000 mb/t."]
	quest.7908B7140D3968AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Pressurized Tube"
	quest.791FBB3174C61904.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFAssembler&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.791FBB3174C61904.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembler"
	quest.791FBB3174C61904.title: "Avengers, Assemble!"
	quest.792702F585B4AC44.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPrimogel Goo&r turns &#00D9FFIron Blocks&r into &#00D9FFRaw Ferricore&r. Place &#00D9FFthe Iron Blocks&r on either side of the goo and feed it by right-clicking it with &#00D9FFRotten Flesh&r or &#00D9FFSugar&r. The item a goo block accepts is shown on any side of the block."]
	quest.792702F585B4AC44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Block, 2x Raw Ferricore and 2x Ferricore Ingot"
	quest.792702F585B4AC44.title: "Making Ferricore"
	quest.7928F7C6539606C1.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFTertium Gemstone&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7928F7C6539606C1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tertium Gemstone"
	quest.7944DB1550E8A68B.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFree Runners&r are an item that allows players to ascend 1-block inclines automatically (like the &#00D9FFHorse&r), as well as preventing fall damage as long as they are charged. A fall will reduce the item's charge, depending on how far the fall was."]
	quest.7944DB1550E8A68B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Free Runners"
	quest.794841B00C233CDE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFWhitebeam Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.794841B00C233CDE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whitebeam Sapling"
	quest.7949F86C9FF11AE1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFJackfruit Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7949F86C9FF11AE1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jackfruit Sapling"
	quest.794C2D0B1870C833.quest_desc: ["Bring Soulpyre into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.794C2D0B1870C833.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soulpyre"
	quest.794E82A9D10A4F25.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer breathe underwater."]
	quest.794E82A9D10A4F25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Snorkel"
	quest.79765BEC0A6FD693.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.79765BEC0A6FD693.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Pierce"
	quest.798931F2FBCE7245.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFImplosion Compressor&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.798931F2FBCE7245.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Implosion Compressor"
	quest.798931F2FBCE7245.title: "Automated Creeper"
	quest.7994E33730AB8D3D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSmart Filter&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7994E33730AB8D3D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.79AA4BDCE68B2106.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnergy Cell Starter&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.79AA4BDCE68B2106.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell Starter"
	quest.79C02189B9A6C0AB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFUpgrade Crystal&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.79C02189B9A6C0AB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Crystal"
	quest.79C48188CA2E69E5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFNuclear Reactor&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.79C48188CA2E69E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.79C48188CA2E69E5.title: "3.6 Roentgen"
	quest.79DBC6A0539ADA92.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCharged Redstone&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.79DBC6A0539ADA92.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charged Redstone"
	quest.79E0A15A0FBCD2CC.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLiquefaction Cauldron&r soaks resources in solvent to produce &#00D9FFSulfur&r from them. Heat is required for the reaction. Note that some resources, like ores, produce more than one sulfur."]
	quest.79E0A15A0FBCD2CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Liquefaction Cauldron"
	quest.7A0B0655724B1A23.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFChompolotl&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7A0B0655724B1A23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chompolotl"
	quest.7A11E6F38D301E68.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Sophisticated Storage&r offers a &#00D9FFShulker Box&r that is compact and portable, which makes carrying large amounts of items easy." "It supports &#FFA500Sophisticated Storage&r upgrades, so you can tailor it to your needs."]
	quest.7A11E6F38D301E68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shulker Box"
	quest.7A23CAFFDF33BEA7.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCharging Station&r transfers energy at &#00D9AA4000 FE&r/t."]
	quest.7A23CAFFDF33BEA7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charging Station"
	quest.7A2423E7722019B9.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFChemical Injection Chamber&r uses &#00D9FFHydrogen Chloride&r gas to turn ores into 4 &#00D9FFShards&r. It is the start of x4 ore processing and requires a steady supply of &#00D9FFHydrogen Chloride&r, which in turn requires the player to have a &#00D9FFThermal Evaporation Plant&r running. It can also turn &#00D9FFWater Vapor and Dirt&r into &#00D9FFClay&r. Like most &#FFA500Mekanism&r machines, the &#00D9FFChemical Injection Chamber&r has a &#00D9FFFactory&r block of itself."]
	quest.7A2423E7722019B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Injection Chamber"
	quest.7A26B9373A0083F6.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Ignitium Boots&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r using &#00D9FFIgnitium&r." "They give excellent protection for the &#00D9FFNether&r and belong to the &#00D9FFIgnitium&r armor set."]
	quest.7A26B9373A0083F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignitium Boots"
	quest.7A3E635BE3DB601B.quest_desc: ["Generates power from coal at &#00D9AA200 FE&r/t."]
	quest.7A3E635BE3DB601B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Furnator Hardened"
	quest.7A454EFA49F742A9.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPigment Extractor&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7A454EFA49F742A9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pigment Extractor"
	quest.7A4B0862BC8E8B44.quest_desc: ["This module emits a redstone signal with strength proportional to the pressure within the tubes. When equipped with a &#00D9FFModule Expansion Card&r, you can precisely adjust the threshold through the GUI."]
	quest.7A4B0862BC8E8B44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressure Gauge Module"
	quest.7A610F5F4F61052F.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFBattery Nitro&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7A610F5F4F61052F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Battery Nitro"
	quest.7A65EC2241F7D9A4.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Hill2."]
	quest.7A65EC2241F7D9A4.quest_subtitle: "Defeat a Redcap Sapper in a medium Hollow Hill"
	quest.7A815B50256D0495.quest_desc: ["Digs 4 surrounding holes to bedrock."]
	quest.7A815B50256D0495.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Burrowing"
	quest.7A827B8762AEDD2A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFDirt Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7A827B8762AEDD2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dirt Seeds"
	quest.7A8384D46BAE8FF5.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFEpic Ink&r is the fourth tier of magical ink in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It is used in the &#00D9FFScroll Forge&r to make &#00D9FFEpic&r-rarity spell scrolls and to upgrade spells that require &#00D9FFEpic Ink&r." "It can be found in magic structures or obtained from powerful magical creatures."]
	quest.7A8384D46BAE8FF5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Epic Ink"
	quest.7A8384D46BAE8FF5.title: "Epic Ink"
	quest.7A8CAC086FAA7CE5.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFLeather Handle Attachment Smithing Template&r attaches a leather-wrapped stick to a tool head at the &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "It is a cheaper, early way to assemble &#00D9FFBetter End&r tools before better handles are available."]
	quest.7A8CAC086FAA7CE5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Leather Handle Attachment Smithing Template"
	quest.7A93861BF8725930.quest_desc: ["For &#00D9FFthe Ultimate Laser Drill&r: It can be dyed! Press &#00D9FFLeft Shift&r + &#00D9FFRight Button&r to swap between &#00D9FFFortune&r/&#00D9FFLooting and Silk Touch&r. Use Alt + &#00D9FFMouse Scroll&r to change mining speed. Press Y while held or &#00D9FFRight Button&r while hovered to toggle 3x3 mining."]
	quest.7A93861BF8725930.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Laser Drill"
	quest.7AA203EE4AC1BDC6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFDrone&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7AA203EE4AC1BDC6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Drone"
	quest.7AA4B0C6C47F4EE6.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFThallasium Boots&r from &#00D9FFThallasium Plating&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "They finish the first full set of &#00D9FFBetter End&r armor."]
	quest.7AA4B0C6C47F4EE6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Boots"
	quest.7AB6C567359CD276.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFHotdog With Nether Salad&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7AB6C567359CD276.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hotdog With Nether Salad"
	quest.7ABBA78E7A372CF3.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFThermodynamic Conductors&r are a way of transporting heat. Insulation: 100,000."]
	quest.7ABBA78E7A372CF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.7ACCA47E786F55A8.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFBoreal Blade&r is a powerful Ice greatsword in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It holds 1 imbued spell and comes with &#00D9FFFrostbite III&r. In the main hand it gives 16 &#00D9FFAttack Damage&r and 0.9 &#00D9FFAttack Speed&r." "&#00D9FFFrostbite III&r deals 8 &#00D9FFShatter Damage&r, lasts &#00D9AA30 seconds&r, costs 100 &#00D9FFMana&r and has a 30-second cooldown. It is crafted from &#00D9FFMithril and Ice Venom&r, so expect it later in the game."]
	quest.7ACCA47E786F55A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Boreal Blade"
	quest.7AD2B13E09B38A37.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPlagued Leggings&r are part of the &#00D9FFPlagued Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+6&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFNature Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Leggings&r with 1 &#00D9FFNature Rune&r and 1 &#00D9FFArcane Essence&r to make them."]
	quest.7AD2B13E09B38A37.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plagued Leggings"
	quest.7ADC323CDD2E4AE9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPulsar Mantle&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7ADC323CDD2E4AE9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pulsar Mantle"
	quest.7AF77CA6AE4007D7.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7AF77CA6AE4007D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Purifying Factory"
	quest.7AF9291C0B6298A8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMachinesettingscopier&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7AF9291C0B6298A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Machinesettingscopier"
	quest.7AFB788840FB6C5E.quest_desc: ["Link 7 furnaces and keep them all smelting at once to generate power. It produces &#00D9AA50,000 RF&r/t while active."]
	quest.7AFB788840FB6C5E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Million Furnace"
	quest.7AFB788840FB6C5E.title: "Rainbow Furnace"
	quest.7AFDBDA8E91A6750.quest_desc: ["Increases attack speed."]
	quest.7AFDBDA8E91A6750.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Feral Claws"
	quest.7B05CE60CD513FB2.quest_desc: ["Upgrade a &#00D9FFSoul&r-&#00D9FFTouched Deepshelf&r with a &#00D9FFWarden Tendril&r, a &#00D9FFSculk Catalyst and Sculk&r." "It gives &#00D9AA+10&r &#00D9FFEterna&r (up to 80), &#00D9AA+15&r &#00D9FFQuanta&r, &#00D9AA+10&r &#00D9FFArcana&r and &#00D9AA+1&r &#00D9FFClue&r."]
	quest.7B05CE60CD513FB2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Touched Sculkshelf"
	quest.7B18E086CE93DFC2.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFLight Gray Chalk&r serves as an improved foundational chalk above &#00D9FFWhite&r, stabilizing pentacles made with it more."]
	quest.7B18E086CE93DFC2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Light Gray Impure"
	quest.7B1ED0C9D4271B85.quest_desc: ["Goggles allow you to see more information about placed &#FFA500Create&r components."]
	quest.7B1ED0C9D4271B85.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Goggles"
	quest.7B2175164FA89265.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Sonorous Staff&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using &#00D9FFSculk Bones&r, &#00D9FFSoul Crystals&r, an &#00D9FFEcho Ingot&r and the &#00D9FFHeart&r of the &#00D9FFDeep&r." "It fires the &#00D9FFWarden's&r sonic boom."]
	quest.7B2175164FA89265.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sonorous Staff"
	quest.7B225E82C291C495.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSour Cherry Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B225E82C291C495.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sour Cherry Sapling"
	quest.7B29A14775280AF9.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: the &#00D9FFEnd Stronghold&r and the &#00D9FFNether Stronghold&r."]
	quest.7B29A14775280AF9.quest_subtitle: "Find both Stronghold variants"
	quest.7B2FDB2133E9252D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFDiamond Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B2FDB2133E9252D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Seeds"
	quest.7B34CEE8E6AE719E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFLimited Gold Barrel&r 2. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B34CEE8E6AE719E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Gold Barrel 2"
	quest.7B395003600EFF43.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBread Loaf&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7B395003600EFF43.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bread Loaf"
	quest.7B486B782E261467.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFQIO Drives&r hold the items in a &#00D9FFQIO System&r. They work similar to AE2 drives where it has a maximum amount of space and types it can hold."]
	quest.7B486B782E261467.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Drive Hyper Dense"
	quest.7B4950940EE127E2.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFRoast Stuffed Hoglin&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B4950940EE127E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Roast Stuffed Hoglin"
	quest.7B53ABE816807459.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Chestplate&r is crafted from &#00D9FFThermal Springstone Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "This armor ignites attackers and offers strong fire protection, making it useful in hazardous hot areas."]
	quest.7B53ABE816807459.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermal Springstone Chestplate"
	quest.7B55A604A781A81D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFThallasium Sword Handle&r is a component for assembling a &#00D9FFThallasium Sword&r at the &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "Combine it with a &#00D9FFThallasium&r tool head using the &#00D9FFTool Assembly Smithing Template&r."]
	quest.7B55A604A781A81D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thallasium Sword Handle"
	quest.7B5F67022FD04EF1.quest_desc: ["Ignis is a &#FFA500Cataclysm&r boss awakened in the &#00D9FFBurning Arena&r who controls the &#00D9FFNether's&r flames." "Expect relentless attacks and plenty of fire. He is one of the mod's toughest bosses."]
	quest.7B5F67022FD04EF1.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Ignis"
	quest.7B5F67022FD04EF1.title: "Ignis"
	quest.7B62B380000F160A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFDistillation Tower&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7B62B380000F160A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Distillation Tower"
	quest.7B62B380000F160A.title: "TOTAL Distillation"
	quest.7B75C398B88D5EC1.quest_desc: ["This is the &#00D9FFCopper Drill&r. This will give you stones and dirts, mostly used as building materials. Check the outputs in EMI and make sure you know that the drill has a chance of breaking, so don't just make one."]
	quest.7B75C398B88D5EC1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Drill"
	quest.7B75C398B88D5EC1.title: "Copper Drill"
	quest.7B793700836BA897.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFWhite Poplar Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7B793700836BA897.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Poplar Sapling"
	quest.7B7E50CCE5104A9D.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFGlacite Shards&r drop from &#00D9FFGlacite&r ore underground in frozen regions. They are mainly used for &#00D9FFGlacite&r equipment and smithing trim colors." "&#00D9FFThioquartz Shards&r come from &#00D9FFThioquartz&r clusters inside crystal geodes and are used for basic armor and trim colors." "Neither is vital for progression, but both are handy early resources."]
	quest.7B7E50CCE5104A9D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thioquartz Shard and Glacite Shard"
	quest.7B7E50CCE5104A9D.title: "Frozen and Sulfur Crystals"
	quest.7B8CBE1F84888E6F.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFTransistor&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7B8CBE1F84888E6F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Transistor"
	quest.7B91CDC8202CB41F.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: &#00D9FFTransform Poison&r."]
	quest.7B91CDC8202CB41F.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Transform Poison"
	quest.7B92826F31BC4FB5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFStuffed Pepper&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B92826F31BC4FB5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stuffed Pepper"
	quest.7B9913E754E714B7.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFElectric Pumps&r are a simple machine that, once put over a pool of liquid, gathers it at the cost of power. One example of early power generation is to put the pump in the &#00D9FFNether&r over lava and you virtually have an infinite lava source for heat generators."]
	quest.7B9913E754E714B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Pump"
	quest.7BAB96EC8F18DE53.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.7BAB96EC8F18DE53.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Summon Steed"
	quest.7BB09D3C9385785C.quest_desc: ["A unique axe dropped by the &#00D9FFMinoshroom&r."]
	quest.7BB09D3C9385785C.quest_subtitle: "Get the Golden Minotaur Axe"
	quest.7BBBA6FAFE679818.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFDiesel Jetpack&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7BBBA6FAFE679818.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diesel Jetpack"
	quest.7BBBA6FAFE679818.title: "Ely... We Meant Jetpack!"
	quest.7BC7CD1E1D7D2A99.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPink Salmon&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7BC7CD1E1D7D2A99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pink Salmon"
	quest.7BD0154228BD107D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFStarlit Diamond Helmet&r is crafted from &#00D9FFStarlit Diamonds&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "&#00D9FFStarlit Diamond&r armor gives protection comparable to &#00D9FFNetherite&r, with higher armor toughness and knockback resistance."]
	quest.7BD0154228BD107D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Starlit Diamond Helmet"
	quest.7BD87511BE7D8DE8.quest_desc: ["Obtain &#00D9FFthe Brown Toolbox&r from &#FFA500Create&r. It is a portable storage block with 8 slots, each holding up to 4 stacks of items." "Once placed, nearby players can open it remotely with the toolbox keybind. Brown is the default toolbox color."]
	quest.7BD87511BE7D8DE8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brown Toolbox"
	quest.7BD9469601DF1EB8.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFYeti&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.7BDE1A49BE2173AC.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFFurnator Spirited&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7BDE1A49BE2173AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Furnator Spirited"
	quest.7BDEB441C166397A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFLimited Netherite Barrel&r 3 into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7BDEB441C166397A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Limited Netherite Barrel 3"
	quest.7BE91B78520F564B.quest_desc: ["This is an advanced version of the &#00D9FFLiquid Compressor&r. It offers a much faster generation rate of 50 mL/tick but also produces heat. As the temperature rises, efficiency decreases. The bottom arrow on the temperature gauge shows where efficiency will begin to decline, while the top arrow indicates the point of &#00D9AA0%&r efficiency. Contrary to expectations, this machine will not explode even if the temperature becomes excessively high."]
	quest.7BE91B78520F564B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Liquid Compressor"
	quest.7BED617A7B733C23.quest_desc: ["Blocks of voidflame coal can be transformed into raw eclipse ember. 3–4 eclipse embers will drop from it. Burns &#00D9AA81x&r more items than coal."]
	quest.7BED617A7B733C23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coal T4"
	quest.7BF5087C34F404B5.quest_desc: ["Captured blazes enjoy eggs, like their distant forbear, &#00D9FFCalcifer&r."]
	quest.7BF5087C34F404B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blaze Burner"
	quest.7BFD40F887AEABA1.quest_desc: ["Increases luck."]
	quest.7BFD40F887AEABA1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Hook"
	quest.7C0184A29B8530EB.quest_desc: ["Used to create &#00D9FFME Storage Cells&r."]
	quest.7C0184A29B8530EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 1k"
	quest.7C032CF2D6A818A5.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDeepsilver Sword&r is crafted from &#00D9FFDeepsilver Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is an early to mid progression weapon for swamp and dark biomes, a step above basic materials like &#00D9FFAmaramber&r."]
	quest.7C032CF2D6A818A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Sword"
	quest.7C07BB3BBB3FDF77.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFSteel Ingot&r can be created by smelting &#00D9FFSteel Dust&r in any type of furnace."]
	quest.7C07BB3BBB3FDF77.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ingot Steel"
	quest.7C07BB3BBB3FDF77.title: "Steel Ingot"
	quest.7C09410A1FD486BD.quest_desc: ["With the help of spirits, it's possible to create a link to another dimension where you can store all of those items you've amassed - truly, your collection is a marvel. You'll need the &#00D9FFStorage Actuator&r to do this. Think of it as a really big chest."]
	quest.7C09410A1FD486BD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Controller"
	quest.7C0A1B83C10124DA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCitron Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7C0A1B83C10124DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Citron Sapling"
	quest.7C23C05B8F70779F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFFluid Valve&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7C23C05B8F70779F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluid Valve"
	quest.7C27AA86443ED0F9.quest_desc: ["Sneak and right-click with the rod to open its screen and equip hooks, bobbers and baits."]
	quest.7C27AA86443ED0F9.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Starcatcher Rod"
	quest.7C341563D8014FB6.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFChemical Tanks&r are &#FFA500Mekanism&r's batteries for storing &#00D9FFGases&r. They can be placed as a block and do interact with &#00D9FFPressurized Tubes&r. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7C341563D8014FB6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Chemical Tank"
	quest.7C3C26679DDAC466.quest_desc: ["This is the base ring to create other magical rings."]
	quest.7C3C26679DDAC466.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Potential"
	quest.7C4787163949EC8E.quest_desc: ["With &#00D9FFBrass Funnels&r, you can even filter a &#00D9FFMechanical Arm's&r targets."]
	quest.7C4787163949EC8E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Arm"
	quest.7C484AA252A54063.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFGlowstone Ingots&r are made by putting &#00D9FFGlowstone&r in a powered &#00D9FFOsmium Compressor&r with &#00D9FFGlowstone&r in the top and &#00D9FFOsmium Ingots&r in the bottom. &#00D9FFGlowstone Ingots&r can be used for making &#00D9FFGlowstone Armor&r, &#00D9FFRefined Glowstone&r blocks and &#00D9FFTeleporter Frames&r."]
	quest.7C484AA252A54063.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ingot Refined Glowstone"
	quest.7C4FC1375920D2AA.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9AA4x&r &#00D9FFWirecoil Copper Ins&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7C4FC1375920D2AA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Wirecoil Copper Ins"
	quest.7C5B17F127E7784B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCocobolo Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7C5B17F127E7784B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cocobolo Sapling"
	quest.7C60BC4F89255E20.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFWarden Carapace&r drops from the &#00D9FFWarden&r and also turns up in &#00D9FFAncient City&r chests." "It is the main ingredient of the &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard&r."]
	quest.7C60BC4F89255E20.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Carapace"
	quest.7C6DF17082075063.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFRoll Table&r from &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r is a mechanical processing machine. Feed it rotational power to roll materials into new forms and widen your factory's manufacturing options."]
	quest.7C6DF17082075063.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Roll Table"
	quest.7C6F64CCAC58F0BF.quest_desc: ["Travel to &#00D9FFOverworld&r."]
	quest.7C6F64CCAC58F0BF.quest_subtitle: "Travel to Overworld"
	quest.7C6F64CCAC58F0BF.title: "New World"
	quest.7C6FF2A1C1753EBB.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFUniversal Cables&r are &#FFA500Mekanism&r's way to transfer power. Capacity: 409.60 kFE/t."]
	quest.7C6FF2A1C1753EBB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Universal Cable"
	quest.7C6FF2A1C1753EBB.title: "Elite Universal Cable"
	quest.7C728225DD7116CB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFStormscale&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7C728225DD7116CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stormscale"
	quest.7C74D653429D7DE9.quest_desc: ["Craft &#00D9FFthe Ignitium Helmet&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r using &#00D9FFIgnitium&r, the metal left by &#00D9FFIgnis&r." "It is one piece of the &#00D9FFIgnitium Armor Set&r."]
	quest.7C74D653429D7DE9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignitium Helmet"
	quest.7C77202B82BD425C.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFReprocssed Fissile Fragments&r can be processed in an &#00D9FFInjection Chamber&r with &#00D9FFHdyrogen Chloride&r to make &#00D9FFFissile Fuel&r."]
	quest.7C77202B82BD425C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reprocessed Fissile Fragment"
	quest.7C7C882001DA2B9F.quest_desc: ["Attracts nearby items."]
	quest.7C7C882001DA2B9F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Universal Attractor"
	quest.7C80C8D1FCBB98AB.quest_desc: ["Emeralds can be found while mining, exploring, or trading with villagers and is used to craft the &#00D9FFEvocation Scrolls&r."]
	quest.7C80C8D1FCBB98AB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emerald"
	quest.7C850BA1B451D57C.quest_desc: ["Simple version: places fluids, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.7C850BA1B451D57C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7C9A1D06EC6F7BD4.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer see in the dark."]
	quest.7C9A1D06EC6F7BD4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Night Vision Goggles"
	quest.7C9FEE11E99162DD.quest_desc: ["Make a &#00D9FFChocolate Milkshake&r with the processing machines of &#FFA500Create: Dreams n' Desires&r. It is a simple, sweet recipe that adds a tasty product to your factory."]
	quest.7C9FEE11E99162DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chocolate Milkshake"
	quest.7CA2C6F551629CE1.quest_desc: ["Bookshelves do more than decorate. They strengthen your &#00D9FFEnchanting Table&r." "Gather enough to surround your enchanting setup and get the best results."]
	quest.7CA2C6F551629CE1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Bookshelf"
	quest.7CA2C6F551629CE1.title: "Knowledge is Power"
	quest.7CAB3134D2EE78C5.quest_desc: ["Used to summon several forms of wilden including the &#00D9FFWilden Chimera&r."]
	quest.7CAB3134D2EE78C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Wilden Summon"
	quest.7CB53630F548B2E8.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFFish Seeds&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7CB53630F548B2E8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fish Seeds"
	quest.7CC01EDFDD7DB9A7.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFFlowglaze Sword&r is a weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r in the &#00D9FFFlowglaze&r equipment tier." "It is crafted from &#00D9FFFlowglaze&r materials and fits mid-to-late game."]
	quest.7CC01EDFDD7DB9A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flowglaze Sword"
	quest.7CD904A99A98F388.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFMagmator Starter&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7CD904A99A98F388.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magmator Starter"
	quest.7CDC197CBB934198.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFHunting Belt&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7CDC197CBB934198.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hunting Belt"
	quest.7CDF5893EB316BD7.quest_desc: ["Find &#00D9FFthe Acropolis&r from &#FFA500Cataclysm&r, a large structure that generates in the deep ocean and is the domain of &#00D9FFScylla&r, the &#00D9FFStorm Empress&r." "Use &#00D9FFthe Eye of Storm&r to locate it."]
	quest.7CDF5893EB316BD7.title: "Acropolis"
	quest.7CE204A61C02366E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFScarecrow Coat&r is part of the &#00D9FFScarecrow Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+8&r &#00D9FFArmor&r and &#00D9AA+75&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r." "It is crafted from &#00D9FFHay Bales and Leather&r."]
	quest.7CE204A61C02366E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pumpkin Chestplate"
	quest.7CE7C25AA40B8412.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFWizard Robes&r belong to the basic &#00D9FFWizard Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They are crafted from &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and boost your mana and spell power."]
	quest.7CE7C25AA40B8412.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wizard Chestplate"
	quest.7CF90701257EA202.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPyromancer Leggings&r are part of the &#00D9FFPyromancer Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. They give &#00D9AA+6&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFFire Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft them from 7 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFFire Rune&r, or upgrade &#00D9FFWizard Leggings&r with 1 &#00D9FFFire Rune&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r."]
	quest.7CF90701257EA202.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pyromancer Leggings"
	quest.7D027650D0554AE8.quest_desc: ["Swaps the item in your hand for the one that works best on the block or entity you left-click."]
	quest.7D027650D0554AE8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tool Swapper Upgrade"
	quest.7D074CDAA4B03FAE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFSupremium Watering Can&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7D074CDAA4B03FAE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Watering Can"
	quest.7D0C5977BAFE0157.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCertus Quartz&r is found as ore underground and inside meteorites. Its crystals are the base of most AE2 materials."]
	quest.7D2B001784338170.quest_desc: ["Insert enchanted books into the &#00D9FFSeashelf of Aquatic Filtration&r to stop those enchantments from appearing in the table." "The more books you insert, the more &#00D9FFEterna and Arcana&r it gives. Craft it from &#00D9FFInfused Seashelves and Prismarine&r."]
	quest.7D2B001784338170.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Filtering Shelf"
	quest.7D313F28BBB47A6F.quest_desc: ["Like &#00D9FFthe Magnet Upgrade&r, with more filtering options."]
	quest.7D313F28BBB47A6F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.7D3F97C5832AF3B7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFBlank Thread&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D3F97C5832AF3B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blank Thread"
	quest.7D5135449D0544A8.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7D5135449D0544A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Infusing Factory"
	quest.7D56164DCB068383.quest_desc: ["Obtain an &#00D9FFEmpty Blaze Burner&r from &#FFA500Create&r. It is the first step toward a working &#00D9FFBlaze Burner&r, a key heat source for advanced machinery." "Right-click a &#00D9FFBlaze&r or &#00D9FFBlaze Spawner&r with it to fill it. Once filled, it provides heat for heated and superheated recipes, including &#00D9FFBrass&r production."]
	quest.7D56164DCB068383.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Empty Blaze Burner"
	quest.7D5AB924D152BDB8.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFEnchanted Gravitite&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7D5AB924D152BDB8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanted Gravitite"
	quest.7D5AB924D152BDB8.title: "Pink is the New Blue"
	quest.7D5BE375773C489E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFMechanical Bearing&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D5BE375773C489E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Bearing"
	quest.7D659D5269823682.quest_desc: ["Breaks blocks without solid colision boxes.. like tracks, levers, buttons, etc."]
	quest.7D659D5269823682.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Plough"
	quest.7D6F8AF3728BEA44.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSource Gem Block&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D6F8AF3728BEA44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Source Gem Block"
	quest.7D72B278D68E7B8C.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer walk on powder snow and makes ice less slippery."]
	quest.7D72B278D68E7B8C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Snowshoes"
	quest.7D73F7A74981606A.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSmart Filter&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7D73F7A74981606A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7D73F7A74981606A.title: "Alchemical Niter"
	quest.7D76213346646EAD.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9AA8x&r &#00D9FFTreated Wood Horizontal&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7D76213346646EAD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Treated Wood Horizontal"
	quest.7D76213346646EAD.title: "Treated Wood Planks"
	quest.7D80ADA71E6B6C65.quest_desc: ["A collection point for feeding bees that holds 3 item blocks. When Lumber or &#00D9FFQuarry&r bees feed from it, it produces a random item. It can be honeylogged, which gives the bees regeneration."]
	quest.7D80ADA71E6B6C65.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Feeder"
	quest.7D891AD3479B3A0D.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFNature Rune&r is a crafting ingredient in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r, used for advanced &#00D9FFNature&r crafting such as &#00D9FFNature Upgrade Orbs&r. The Nature school uses &#00D9FFPoisonous Potato&r as its &#00D9FFFocus&r." "Combine a &#00D9FFBlank Runestone&r with 8 &#00D9FFPoisonous Potatoes&r to make one."]
	quest.7D891AD3479B3A0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nature Rune"
	quest.7D8C5B734E277429.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFDeepsilver Helmet&r is crafted from &#00D9FFDeepsilver Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "Deepsilver armor raises movement speed, attack speed and knockback resistance. The full set also grants immunity to several negative status effects."]
	quest.7D8C5B734E277429.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deepsilver Helmet"
	quest.7D92ED988DF486ED.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFCedar Sapling&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D92ED988DF486ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cedar Sapling"
	quest.7D9C263C62F23F27.quest_desc: ["This Rod is pre-attuned to find &#00D9FFBudding Amethyst&r. Amethyst is used rather a lot in alchemy, and is needed for better &#00D9FFDivining Rods&r."]
	quest.7D9C263C62F23F27.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Divination Rod"
	quest.7D9CEC4EB58A7E23.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFAssembly Program Drill Laser&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7D9CEC4EB58A7E23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembly Program Drill Laser"
	quest.7D9DFEFD0C30F42B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFGlacite Hoe&r is crafted from &#00D9FFGlacite Ingots&r in &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It prepares farmland in cold biomes and lasts longer than earlier materials."]
	quest.7D9DFEFD0C30F42B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glacite Hoe"
	quest.7DA0B06B988E21FA.quest_desc: ["You can find a &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Smithing Template&r in &#00D9FFAncient City&r chests. Every piece of &#00D9FFWarden&r gear needs one." "Duplicate it with diamonds and sculk so you never run short."]
	quest.7DA0B06B988E21FA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Upgrade Smithing Template"
	quest.7DB2F0894066E0B3.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEmblem of Defense&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7DB2F0894066E0B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emblem of Defense"
	quest.7DB66A8913111410.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFWalnut Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7DB66A8913111410.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Walnut Sapling"
	quest.7DBF313D54FA739C.quest_desc: ["The first tier of spawner upgrades. It improves the basic spawning stats of a spawner beyond vanilla limits."]
	quest.7DBF313D54FA739C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Frontier Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.7DBF313D54FA739C.title: "Frontier Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.7DC1316C6B453F2F.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFAutoloader Crossbow&r is a unique ranged weapon in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It automatically loads the next projectile from your inventory, including arrows and fireworks. Crouch-click to cancel the auto-loading." "You can find it as a rare reward in &#00D9FFOminous Vaults&r. It has 465 durability and accepts normal &#00D9FFCrossbow&r enchantments."]
	quest.7DC1316C6B453F2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Autoloader Crossbow"
	quest.7DC30C7C1E0B6563.quest_desc: ["Used to craft upgrades for storage."]
	quest.7DC30C7C1E0B6563.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Base"
	quest.7DCD8D983E05F9E4.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500Spider Overhaul&r adds new spider variants and behaviors. Watch where you travel, especially in dark or enclosed areas, and learn how the variants differ."]
	quest.7DCD8D983E05F9E4.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.7DD43DC45BC21620.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCultist Hood&r is the helmet of the &#00D9FFCultist Armor&r set in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r. It gives &#00D9AA+3&r &#00D9FFArmor&r, &#00D9AA+125&r &#00D9FFMax Mana&r, &#00D9AA+10%&r &#00D9FFBlood Spell Power&r and &#00D9AA+5%&r &#00D9FFSpell Power&r." "Craft it from 5 &#00D9FFArcane Cloth&r and 1 &#00D9FFBlood Rune&r, or upgrade a &#00D9FFWizard Hood&r with a &#00D9FFBlood Rune&r at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r on current versions."]
	quest.7DD43DC45BC21620.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cultist Helmet"
	quest.7DD6256662D787D8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFNether Quartz Seeds&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7DD6256662D787D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Quartz Seeds"
	quest.7DDDD110D976BF09.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFLunaris Cacti&r grow in the desert regions of &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r and are used in crafting and refinement." "Harvest them carefully, since their sharp nature can still hurt unprepared players."]
	quest.7DDDD110D976BF09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lunaris Cactus"
	quest.7DEB14F944374E25.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFAwakened Supremium Essence&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7DEB14F944374E25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Essence"
	quest.7DFA508A9DB05D63.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFGrab Bars&r help you climb aboard and move around your train, and their materials let you match your build." "They come in &#00D9FFAndesite&r, &#00D9FFBrass and Copper&r, so consider collecting all three."]
	quest.7DFA508A9DB05D63.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Andesite Grab Rails, Brass Grab Rails and Copper Grab Rails"
	quest.7E12929804B4E696.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFOrange Chalk&r is perfect for calling upon &#00D9FFAfrit&r, though it does not offer control over them."]
	quest.7E12929804B4E696.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Orange Impure"
	quest.7E16C414F4B39363.quest_desc: ["Used for 1 time teleportation."]
	quest.7E16C414F4B39363.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warp Scroll"
	quest.7E1CC8A6310C2424.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFDisk Drive&r 4k into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7E1CC8A6310C2424.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Disk Drive 4k"
	quest.7E1D10F283E8AF6A.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFMechanical Pistons&r use rotational power to extend and retract &#00D9FFPiston Extension Poles&r and push &#FFA500Create&r contraptions." "The extension distance depends on how many &#00D9FFExtension Poles&r are attached. Adding a &#00D9FFSlimeball&r makes it a &#00D9FFSticky Mechanical Piston&r, which pulls blocks back when retracting."]
	quest.7E1D10F283E8AF6A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sticky Mechanical Piston and Mechanical Piston"
	quest.7E1D10F283E8AF6A.title: "Mechanical Piston and Sticky Mechanical Piston"
	quest.7E2522100BFBA8CB.quest_desc: ["WannaBees can extract mob loot from mobs encased in amber."]
	quest.7E2522100BFBA8CB.quest_subtitle: "Get a WannaBee spawn egg"
	quest.7E2522100BFBA8CB.title: "WannaBee"
	quest.7E2A26EC8946F384.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFCave Dweller Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7E2A26EC8946F384.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cave Dweller Sapling"
	quest.7E40CBEA95B9F0D8.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMechanical Crossbow&r is an advanced ranged weapon from &#FFA500Eternal Starlight&r." "It is crafted from refined dimensional materials and is a stronger alternative to standard ranged weapons for players who have beaten the mod's bosses."]
	quest.7E40CBEA95B9F0D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Crossbow"
	quest.7E40CBEA95B9F0D8.title: "Mechanical Crossbow"
	quest.7E4824F8FCC84D0E.quest_desc: ["The Warden drops the &#00D9FFHeart&r of the &#00D9FFDeep&r. Use it on the portal frame at the center of an &#00D9FFAncient City&r to open the way to the &#00D9FFOtherside&r." "You will also need it for the &#00D9FFSonorous Staff&r."]
	quest.7E4824F8FCC84D0E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Heart of the Deep"
	quest.7E4BC32E8DCAA415.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPlate of Stuffed Hoglin Ham&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7E4BC32E8DCAA415.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Plate of Stuffed Hoglin Ham"
	quest.7E4D92A6BD9831D4.quest_desc: ["Sourceberry bushes grow in taiga and archwood biomes. The berries are used for &#00D9FFSource Berry Rolls and Pies&r and for mana regeneration potions."]
	quest.7E4D92A6BD9831D4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Sourceberry Bush"
	quest.7E4D92A6BD9831D4.title: "Sourceberries"
	quest.7E4EC4681E63F0F9.quest_desc: ["Ah, the humble but reliable &#00D9FFMillstone&r. The &#00D9FFCrushing Wheels&r may be faster, but the millstone fits better in many builds.. and you don't fit in it, so there's that."]
	quest.7E4EC4681E63F0F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Millstone"
	quest.7E5248111AE003B3.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFOven&r gives your kitchen smelting abilities."]
	quest.7E5248111AE003B3.quest_subtitle: "Adds smelting to your kitchen"
	quest.7E578D628F1DEBCB.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFChemical Tanks&r are &#FFA500Mekanism&r's batteries for storing &#00D9FFGases&r. They can be placed as a block and do interact with &#00D9FFPressurized Tubes&r. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7E578D628F1DEBCB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Chemical Tank"
	quest.7E66A8EEB887105F.quest_desc: ["Can run recipes of any single block electric crafting machine provided to it in batches. Batch size is determined by the amount of machines provided to it. Insert electric crafting machines to run in parallel."]
	quest.7E66A8EEB887105F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Processing Array, 16x Clean Stainless Steel Machine Casing, 2x Stainless Steel Machine Casing Pipe and 2x Glass"
	quest.7E74EE5E4399496A.quest_desc: ["Any animal in the &#FFA500Twilight Forest&r counts."]
	quest.7E74EE5E4399496A.quest_subtitle: "Hunt some local wildlife"
	quest.7E7DBC9818076878.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFRing of Elusiveness&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7E7DBC9818076878.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Elusiveness"
	quest.7E812125B36A93F2.quest_desc: ["Make &#00D9FFthe Warden Mage Helmet&r in a &#00D9FFMechanical Crafter&r using a &#00D9FFNetherite Mage Helmet&r from &#00D9FFIron's Spells&r, &#00D9FFEcho Ingots&r, &#00D9FFWarden Carapace&r, a &#00D9FFReinforced Echo Shard&r and a &#00D9FFWarden Upgrade Template&r." "Spell power and upgrades from the netherite piece are not kept."]
	quest.7E812125B36A93F2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warden Mage Helmet"
	quest.7E93E0940C97B0E7.quest_desc: ["Smelts faster and burns fuel more efficiently than the vanilla &#00D9FFFurnace&r."]
	quest.7E93E0940C97B0E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Furnace"
	quest.7E95240CA9FDB47B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPlayer Transmitter Blazing&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7E95240CA9FDB47B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Transmitter Blazing"
	quest.7E995ED1725E1A80.quest_desc: ["Smelts 24 items."]
	quest.7E995ED1725E1A80.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Coal"
	quest.7EC392D4AD679DB5.quest_desc: ["Find a city in the &#00D9FFOverworld&r."]
	quest.7EC392D4AD679DB5.quest_subtitle: "Enter an Overworld City"
	quest.7ED0B67E2B028C18.quest_desc: ["The Grindstone repairs gear and removes enchantments from it. Collect one so your weapons stay ready for any fight."]
	quest.7ED0B67E2B028C18.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Grindstone"
	quest.7ED0B67E2B028C18.title: "Sharpen Your Skills"
	quest.7ED18CACCE793DC9.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFAssemble the Aeternium Sword&r from an &#00D9FFAeternium&r tool head and sword handle at a &#00D9FFSmithing Table&r." "It is &#00D9FFBetter End's&r strongest sword and outclasses &#00D9FFNetherite&r swords."]
	quest.7ED18CACCE793DC9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aeternium Sword"
	quest.7ED1EA0C9E87DD59.quest_desc: ["Allows you to make patterns that need to be inserted specific direction to tell it through the pattern what side of the machine its importing/exporting."]
	quest.7ED1EA0C9E87DD59.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Adv Pattern Encoder"
	quest.7ED6205FC8C28915.quest_desc: ["The leggings of the &#00D9FFYeti&r armor set. Together with the chestplate, they unlock the helmet."]
	quest.7EECE4B9127EB096.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFJuniper Sapling&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7EECE4B9127EB096.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Juniper Sapling"
	quest.7EF6D60AF9198383.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFQuantum Bubble&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7EF6D60AF9198383.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Bubble"
	quest.7EF729C49781FC32.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the shulker box."]
	quest.7EF729C49781FC32.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Netherite Shulker Box"
	quest.7EF7A2E8EEEA8535.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFKnightmetal Seeds&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7EF7A2E8EEEA8535.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Knightmetal Seeds"
	quest.7EF96B9BB78AF4CF.quest_desc: ["Assemble this multiblock with the &#00D9FFEngineer's Hammer&r. It presses ingots into plates, gears and rods using molds."]
	quest.7EF96B9BB78AF4CF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Steel Scaffolding Standard, Rs Engineering, Piston and 2 more items"
	quest.7EF96B9BB78AF4CF.title: "Metal Press Multiblock"
	quest.7EFD9AEF5DA3A64B.quest_desc: ["Enchanter's tools can be given a spell at the &#00D9FFScribe's Table&r. The Mirror casts a self spell on you at a discount with extra duration on its glyphs, and it does not need a &#00D9FFForm&r glyph like the other tools."]
	quest.7EFD9AEF5DA3A64B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wand, Enchanters Sword, Enchanters Shield and 2 more items"
	quest.7EFD9AEF5DA3A64B.title: "Enchanter's Tools"
	quest.7F0187ACE5E5B240.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.7F0187ACE5E5B240.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Explosion"
	quest.7F0399FABD72F56D.quest_desc: ["Many keys from mods are not bound by default. Open Options, then &#00D9FFControls&r, and assign keys for the mods you use. The search bar helps you find an action fast."]
	quest.7F0399FABD72F56D.quest_subtitle: "Many modded keys start unbound."
	quest.7F0399FABD72F56D.title: "Bind Your Keys"
	quest.7F0C39C1BE98DA73.quest_desc: ["This device converts compressed air into &#00D9FFForge Energy&r (compatible with RF and many other mods’ energy). It has a base efficiency of &#00D9AA40%&r, meaning 100 mL of air generates &#00D9AA40 FE&r. &#00D9FFSpeed Upgrades&r will slightly reduce this efficiency. The Dynamo also produces heat, which needs to be managed to prevent a loss in efficiency."]
	quest.7F0C39C1BE98DA73.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pneumatic Dynamo"
	quest.7F167264C32900F9.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFPurple Spiral Sapling&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7F167264C32900F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Purple Spiral Sapling"
	quest.7F17DEB90BDCB5D3.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the &#00D9FFScribe&r\'s &#00D9FFTable&r."]
	quest.7F17DEB90BDCB5D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Self"
	quest.7F2E9B7E0F5AAFC8.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFRotary Condensentrator&r (pronounced \"con-DEN-sen-traitor\") is used for converting substances between liquid and gaseous forms at a rate of 1:1. It has two modes: Decondensentrating, which turns &#00D9FFLiquids&r into &#00D9FFGases&r, and &#00D9FFCondensentrating&r, which turns &#00D9FFGases&r into &#00D9FFLiquids&r."]
	quest.7F2E9B7E0F5AAFC8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rotary Condensentrator"
	quest.7F4F05267ACB5A78.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFSupremium Ingot&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7F4F05267ACB5A78.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Ingot"
	quest.7F50B5CF478E4BEB.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFStrider Egg&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7F50B5CF478E4BEB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Strider Egg"
	quest.7F5FABDF60582A19.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFHoly Rune&r is a crafting ingredient in &#FFA500Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks&r, used for advanced &#00D9FFHoly&r crafting such as &#00D9FFHoly Upgrade Orbs and Holy&r equipment." "Surround a &#00D9FFBlank Runestone&r with 8 &#00D9FFDivine Pearls&r to make one. &#00D9FFDivine Pearl&r is the &#00D9FFHoly Focus&r."]
	quest.7F5FABDF60582A19.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Holy Rune"
	quest.7F6887517E63F6BE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7F6887517E63F6BE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.7F6BEA087FCC880D.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFChemical Dissolution Chamber&r is the first machine in the x5 ore processing setup."]
	quest.7F6BEA087FCC880D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Dissolution Chamber"
	quest.7F80CAF056A68482.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFPowered Crystal Growth Accelerators&r speed up the growth of adjacent budding quartz. Must be powered via the top or bottom, and consumes a steady 8 ae/t while plugged in."]
	quest.7F80CAF056A68482.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Growth Accelerator"
	quest.7F8EC51B1C57FBAA.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7F8EC51B1C57FBAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Purifying Factory"
	quest.7F99FFAD3129599F.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFCapacitor&r from &#FFA500Create Crafts and Additions&r stores &#00D9FFForge Energy&r (FE) for later, which helps steady your factory's electrical network. In version 1.6.0 for &#00D9FFNeoForge&r 1.21.1, it can also be charged directly with FE."]
	quest.7F99FFAD3129599F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor"
	quest.7FA15C398E515DBC.quest_desc: ["Bring &#00D9FFSpringy Boot&r into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7FA15C398E515DBC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Springy Boot"
	quest.7FAC2F1EF914698C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFConfigurable Honeycomb&r. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7FAC2F1EF914698C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.7FB9EE5CFA3688A6.quest_desc: ["Iron gear will not protect you forever. Craft a full set of &#00D9FFDiamond Armor&r." "Diamond is one of the strongest &#00D9FFOverworld&r materials and prepares you for tougher enemies and deeper exploration."]
	quest.7FB9EE5CFA3688A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Helmet, Diamond Chestplate, Diamond Leggings and Diamond Boots"
	quest.7FB9EE5CFA3688A6.title: "Diamond Armor"
	quest.7FCA2AA5096B3346.quest_desc: ["The first piece of the &#00D9FFNano&r armor set. Get the boots to unlock the chestplate and leggings."]
	quest.7FCE81F4EB5DB0C6.quest_desc: ["Defeat &#00D9FFPriest&r."]
	quest.7FCE81F4EB5DB0C6.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Priest"
	quest.7FD2757B52219527.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFPortal Frame&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7FD2757B52219527.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portal Frame"
	quest.7FE51DF3CB943492.quest_desc: ["Get hold of &#00D9FFEnergy Cable Nitro&r. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7FE51DF3CB943492.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cable Nitro"
	quest.7FE84DDB0ADF827F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for &#00D9FFAssembly Platform&r, &#00D9FFAssembly Laser&r, &#00D9FFAssembly Io Unit Import&r and 3 more items. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7FE84DDB0ADF827F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembly Platform, Assembly Laser, Assembly Io Unit Import and 3 more items"
	quest.7FF560F3DCCC23BE.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFEngineering Press&r is used in an &#00D9FFInscriber&r to turn &#00D9FFDiamond&r into a &#00D9FFPrinted Engineering Circuit&r. Presses are found in meteorites, and the &#00D9FFInscriber&r can duplicate one with an &#00D9FFIron Block&r."]
	quest.7FFB1CDFDA24C2EA.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7FFB1CDFDA24C2EA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Smelting Factory"
	quest.811B5DBA9C3B6C69.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFQuantum Ring&r blocks create the frame around a &#00D9FFQuantum Link Chamber&r. Their recipe requires &#00D9FFLogic and Engineering Processors&r, an &#00D9FFEnergy Cell&r, iron, and &#00D9FFSmart Dense Cable&r."]
	quest.811B5DBA9C3B6C69.title: "Craft Quantum Ring Blocks"
	quest.8DE444535D7AD8C7.quest_desc: ["&#FFA500NeoTech Reborn&r is designed to look great while running smoothly. &#00D9FFComplementary Unbound and BSL&r shaders are included, alongside pre-applied resource packs and datapacks for a cohesive experience. 14 GB or more of RAM is recommended; 10–12 GB is the minimum."]
	quest.8DE444535D7AD8C7.quest_subtitle: "Visual polish, shaders, and practical performance guidance."
	quest.8DE444535D7AD8C7.title: "Visuals and Performance"
	quest.8FFFDAD81B77E91B.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFWireless Terminal&r gives wireless access to your ME network when linked to a powered &#00D9FFWireless Access Point&r. It requires a &#00D9FFReceiver&r, &#00D9FFTerminal&r, and &#00D9FFDense Energy Cell&r."]
	quest.8FFFDAD81B77E91B.title: "Access Items from Anywhere Nearby"
	quest.9153ACA88F3D86A4.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFFormation Cores&r are used by export and crafting components. Their recipe combines &#00D9FFCertus Quartz&r, &#00D9FFFluix Dust&r, and a &#00D9FFLogic Processor&r."]
	quest.9153ACA88F3D86A4.title: "Craft Formation Cores"
	quest.916DD681DFE4FCE2.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFQuartz Fiber&r separates power between connected ME networks while still allowing data to pass. It is also used in wireless components."]
	quest.916DD681DFE4FCE2.title: "Make Quartz Fiber"
	quest.94885582FF7946C6.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFFluix Pearl&r is made from &#00D9FFFluix&r, &#00D9FFFluix Dust&r, and an &#00D9FFEnder Pearl&r. It is required for AE2 wireless components and the &#00D9FFQuantum Link Chamber&r."]
	quest.94885582FF7946C6.title: "Create a Fluix Pearl"
	quest.9EAF8522B35926AD.quest_desc: ["Combine &#00D9FFthe Item Cell Housing&r and 1k &#00D9FFCell Component&r to make a 1k &#00D9FFItem Storage Cell&r. Insert it into an &#00D9FFME Drive&r to store items on the network."]
	quest.9EAF8522B35926AD.title: "Assemble a 1k Item Storage Cell"
	quest.A13CE3F55A19E03C.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMatter Condenser&r consumes items from an ME network and turns accumulated matter into &#00D9FFSingularities&r. Connect it to a powered network and give it items to process."]
	quest.A13CE3F55A19E03C.title: "Build a Matter Condenser"
	quest.B6DA5F849F19EF81.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFCrafting Units&r form the foundation of an &#00D9FFME Crafting CPU&r. Add crafting storage and other CPU components to expand the size and speed of crafting jobs."]
	quest.B6DA5F849F19EF81.title: "Build a Crafting Unit"
	quest.C24830A27A12C286.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFPattern Provider&r supplies encoded patterns to adjacent inventories or machines. It is a key part of connecting external processing to ME autocrafting."]
	quest.C24830A27A12C286.title: "Provide Patterns to Machines"
	quest.CA090624224EA826.quest_desc: ["An &#00D9FFExport Bus&r pushes selected items from your network into an attached inventory. Use it to supply machines or keep blocks stocked."]
	quest.CA090624224EA826.title: "Automate Item Output"
	quest.D45DB55E7E3CA223.quest_desc: ["&#00D9FFAnnihilation Cores&r are used by import and crafting components. Their recipe combines &#00D9FFNether Quartz&r, &#00D9FFFluix Dust&r, and a &#00D9FFLogic Processor&r."]
	quest.D45DB55E7E3CA223.title: "Craft Annihilation Cores"
	quest.DC9215C9F5C006B1.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFItem Cell Housing&r combines with a storage component to make an item cell. Keep item storage cells distinct from fluid and spatial cells."]
	quest.DC9215C9F5C006B1.title: "Prepare an Item Cell Housing"
	quest.EAE1FEA40BF08A63.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFPattern Encoding Terminal&r lets you encode patterns for crafting and processing. It is made by upgrading a &#00D9FFCrafting Terminal&r with an &#00D9FFEngineering Processor&r."]
	quest.EAE1FEA40BF08A63.title: "Encode Processing Patterns"
	quest.EBD12705DAA31418.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFME Drive&r holds storage cells and connects them to your ME network. Add storage cells to the drive, then connect it with &#00D9FFFluix Glass Cable&r."]
	quest.EBD12705DAA31418.title: "Build an ME Drive"
	quest.ED18447EBCE105C3.quest_desc: ["A &#00D9FFDense Energy Cell&r stores more power than the standard cell. It is also a component for the &#00D9FFWireless Terminal&r."]
	quest.ED18447EBCE105C3.title: "Upgrade to a Dense Energy Cell"
	quest.EEB89581C16837DA.quest_desc: ["There is no single way to play. Follow a tech or magic system, explore dungeons and dimensions, build, farm, collect gear, or simply discover what the pack has to offer."]
	quest.EEB89581C16837DA.quest_subtitle: "Pick a direction, or follow several."
	quest.EEB89581C16837DA.title: "Choose Your Adventure"
	quest.F330DEDCCD874A5D.quest_desc: ["An autocrafting setup combines an &#00D9FFME Crafting CPU&r, &#00D9FFMolecular Assemblers&r, &#00D9FFPattern Providers&r, and encoded patterns. Connect the components to your network and configure a recipe in the &#00D9FFPattern Encoding Terminal&r."]
	quest.F330DEDCCD874A5D.title: "Set Up ME Autocrafting"
	quest.F94DE7233A4DA87E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFWireless Access Point&r connects wireless terminals to a nearby ME network. Attach it to the network and provide power before using a terminal."]
	quest.F94DE7233A4DA87E.title: "Extend the Network Wirelessly"
	quest.FA862D49ECF37798.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFMolecular Assembler&r crafts recipes automatically when supplied with ingredients by an ME network. It uses both core types and a crafting table."]
	quest.FA862D49ECF37798.title: "Craft with a Molecular Assembler"
	quest.FBEAA2C4C096AA5E.quest_desc: ["The &#00D9FFME Controller&r is the central block of a channel-based ME network. Its recipe uses &#00D9FFFluix&r and an &#00D9FFEngineering Processor&r; connect it to your powered cable network."]
	quest.FBEAA2C4C096AA5E.title: "Build an ME Controller"
